window.EPISODES = [{"ep":1,"title":"The Broken Engagement","summary":"In a prologue, the alchemist Yao Chen is betrayed by his disciple Han Feng, who wanted the Flame Mantra, with Mu Gu at his side. In Wu Tan City, Xiao Yan was once the Xiao Clan's youngest Dou Zhe, but for three years he has been stuck at the third stage of Dou Zhi Qi and the clan calls him trash. Nalan Yanran comes with Elder Ge Ye of the Misty Cloud Sect to call off her betrothal to him, offering a Qi Gathering Pill made by the Pill King Gu He, but Xiao Yan refuses to be pushed. She sets a match at the Misty Cloud Sect in three years, and he hands her a letter of repudiation that throws her out of the Xiao Clan instead. That night a voice speaks from his black ring: Yao Lao, a soul who has been absorbing his Dou Zhi Qi for three years. Yao Lao says he is an alchemist who sees Gu He as nothing, and Xiao Yan becomes his disciple on condition that he is a Dou Zhe within a year. At the Xiao Market, Jia Lie Ao mocks him and boasts of the Jia Lie Clan's new alchemist, and Yao Lao starts him on physical training with Spiritual Liquid.","events":["Prologue: Han Feng, with Mu Gu, betrays his master Yao Chen over the Flame Mantra.","Wu Tan City: the elders tell Xiao Zhan his son has been stuck at the third stage of Dou Zhi Qi for three years.","Nalan Yanran and Ge Ye of the Misty Cloud Sect ask to end the betrothal and offer a Qi Gathering Pill.","Nalan Yanran sets a match at the Misty Cloud Sect in three years; Xiao Yan writes a letter of repudiation.","Yao Lao wakes in the black ring and admits he has been absorbing Xiao Yan's Dou Zhi Qi.","Xiao Yan becomes Yao Lao's disciple; he must become a Dou Zhe within a year and keep Yao Lao secret.","At the Xiao Market, Jia Lie Ao mocks him and boasts of the Jia Lie Clan's new alchemist.","Yao Lao starts Xiao Yan on physical training with Spiritual Liquid."],"introduced":["Xiao Yan","Yao Lao (Yao Chen)","Han Feng","Mu Gu","Xiao Zhan","Xun Er (Xiao Xun Er)","Nalan Yanran","Ge Ye","Liu Ling","Jia Lie Ao","Yun Yun (named only, Misty Cloud Sect leader)","Gu He, the Pill King (named only)","Old Master Nalan and Nalan Su (named only)","Wu Tan City","Xiao Clan","Jia Lie Clan","Misty Cloud Sect","Dou Qi Continent","Xiao Market","Mite'er Auction House","Flame Mantra","Dou Zhi Qi (stages)","Dou Zhe, Dou Shi, Da Dou Shi","Qi Gathering Pill","black ring","Soul Strength / Soul Perception","Spiritual Liquid","Three-year Agreement (match at the Misty Cloud Sect in three years)","letter of repudiation"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan has been stuck at the third stage of Dou Zhi Qi for three years; he had become a Dou Zhe at 11. Yao Lao has been absorbing his Dou Zhi Qi.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":2,"title":"The Alchemist Liu Xi","summary":"Half a year later, Xiao Yan is training hard under Yao Lao, while the Jia Lie Clan's alchemist Liu Xi is ruining the Xiao Market with his pills. Jia Lie Bi and Ao Ba Pa plan to wipe out the Xiao Clan, and Liu Xi demands to meet Xun Er. Yao Lao explains alchemist flames and the Heavenly Flames, and names his own Chilling Bone Flame, eleventh on the Heavenly Flames Ranking. He also promises a technique that can evolve once Xiao Yan becomes a Dou Zhe. Xiao Yan pushes himself too hard and gets hurt, but while Xun Er tends him he reaches the ninth stage of Dou Zhi Qi in his sleep. At the market, Liu Xi orders him crippled and Xun Er taken, and Xiao Yan floors Jia Lie Ao with Vacuum Palm while Yao Lao secretly throws Liu Xi aside. That night Xun Er, boosted to Da Dou Shi strength by a secret technique, attacks Liu Xi in his room, and Yao Lao finishes him with his Heavenly Flame.","events":["Liu Xi demands half the profits from Jia Lie Bi; the Jia Lie Clan plans to destroy the Xiao Clan.","Xiao Yan trains Vacuum Hand and Octane Blast, a Xuan Class high-level Dou Skill.","Yao Lao explains flame colours, Heavenly Flames and his Chilling Bone Flame (11th).","Yao Lao promises a low Huang Class technique that can evolve, once Xiao Yan becomes a Dou Zhe.","Injured from overtraining, Xiao Yan reaches the ninth stage of Dou Zhi Qi while Xun Er watches over him.","At the Xiao Market, Liu Xi orders Xiao Yan crippled; Xiao Yan beats Jia Lie Ao and Yao Lao knocks Liu Xi away.","At night Xun Er attacks Liu Xi with a secret strength-boosting technique; he survives with a Turtle Breath Pill.","Yao Lao kills Liu Xi with his Heavenly Flame, and someone asks why he is hiding in the room."],"introduced":["Liu Xi","Jia Lie Bi","Ao Ba Pa","Jia Lie Market","Vacuum Hand / Vacuum Palm","Octane Blast (Xuan Class high-level Dou Skill)","Dou Qi Flame","Heavenly Flame","Heavenly Flames Ranking","Chilling Bone Flame (11th)","Tian Class and Huang Class techniques","Turtle Breath Pill","Six-Star Dou Zhe (star ranks)"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan reaches the ninth stage of Dou Zhi Qi (497.5). Xun Er briefly reaches about Da Dou Shi strength with a secret technique (Yao Lao's estimate).","confidence":"high"},{"ep":3,"title":"Becoming a Dou Zhe Again","summary":"Xun Er meets Yao Lao over Liu Xi's body and warns him not to deceive Xiao Yan, and asks him to keep the night secret. Jia Lie Bi blames the Xiao Clan for Liu Xi's death and attacks the Xiao Residence while Xiao Yan is taking the Qi Gathering Pill to become a Dou Zhe, and Jia Lie Ao finds him mid-breakthrough. Xiao Yan breaks off to save his father, while Yao Lao, who says he was once betrayed by those close to him, argues against it. Jia Lie Bi turns on his own son for the clan's sake and nearly kills Xiao Zhan and Xiao Yan. Yao Lao holds him back while Xiao Yan completes the breakthrough to Dou Zhe and kills him with Octane Blast. Yao Lao, only a soul who wants a new body, then offers a red Di Class fire scroll or the black scroll of the Flame Mantra, which evolves by devouring Heavenly Flames. Xiao Yan picks the Flame Mantra, takes first place at the Jia Nan Academy enrolment with a year's leave, says goodbye to Xun Er and his father, and leaves Wu Tan City.","events":["Xun Er confronts Yao Lao and warns him not to deceive Xiao Yan.","Jia Lie Bi blames the Xiao Clan for Liu Xi's death and storms the Xiao Residence.","Xiao Yan takes the Qi Gathering Pill to condense his Dou Zhi Qi cyclone; Jia Lie Ao attacks him.","Xiao Yan and Yao Lao argue about family; Yao Lao admits he was betrayed by loved ones.","Jia Lie Bi sacrifices his son for the clan and nearly kills Xiao Zhan and Xiao Yan; Yao Lao blocks him.","Xiao Yan becomes a Dou Zhe and kills Jia Lie Bi with Octane Blast.","Yao Lao explains he is a soul and offers a Di Class fire scroll or the Flame Mantra; Xiao Yan chooses the Flame Mantra.","A month later Xiao Yan takes first place at the Jia Nan Academy enrolment, takes leave, and sets out with Yao Lao."],"introduced":["Jia Nan Academy (subtitles: Jianan Academy)","Black Rock City (named in narration)","Fallen Heart Flame (14th, named in narration)","Xiao Residence","Furious Lion Roar","Dou Zhi Qi cyclone in the dantian","Flame Mantra (named)","Di Class technique (red scroll)","Rock Desert City (named only)","Xiao Ding and Xiao Li (mentioned as Xiao Yan's elder brothers)"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan condenses the cyclone of Dou Zhi Qi and becomes a Dou Zhe again. Xiao Zhan is a 6-star Da Dou Shi; Jia Lie Bi is at peak Da Dou Shi strength.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":4,"title":"The Wolf Head Hunt","summary":"After a time skip, Xiao Yan is in the Magical Beast Mountain Range, hunted by the Wolf Head Mercenary Company for a key to a treasure chest that he and Little Fairy Doctor found. After a month of training in a hidden cave he reaches Six-Star Dou Zhe, with less than a year left before the Three-year Agreement. He picks off the Wolf Head mercenaries one by one with his Heavy Xuan Ruler. A captive tells him the leader Mu She is a Two-Star Dou Shi, Gan Mu a Nine-Star Dou Zhe and He Meng an Eight-Star Dou Zhe. Mu She and his son Mu Li plan to spread rumours that Little Fairy Doctor holds a lost medical scripture, and Mu She calls He Meng a fool for chasing a snow fox for Madam Lan. Xiao Yan finds He Meng at the foot of the mountain and fights him. He Meng's rock defence holds, and the episode ends as He Meng uses Quadruple Great Force Spin.","events":["Opening narration: Mu Li holds Little Fairy Doctor and lures Xiao Yan into the Magical Beast Mountain Range with traps.","After a month in a hidden cave, Xiao Yan reaches Six-Star Dou Zhe.","Wolf Head mercenaries hunt him for an 8,000 gold coin bounty; he kills them with the Heavy Xuan Ruler.","A captive names the Wolf Head leaders and their ranks.","Mu She and Mu Li plan to spread rumours about Little Fairy Doctor's treasure.","Xiao Yan finds Third Captain He Meng with Madam Lan.","He Meng's rock defence technique shrugs off his attacks; He Meng uses Quadruple Great Force Spin."],"introduced":["Magical Beast Mountain Range","Wolf Head Mercenary Company","Mu She","Mu Li","He Meng","Gan Mu (named only)","Madam Lan","Little Fairy Doctor (named in narration)","Thousand Medicine House (named)","Heavy Xuan Ruler","treasure chest key","Quadruple Great Force Spin (Huang Class advanced Dou Skill)"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan reaches 6-star Dou Zhe after a month of cultivation in the mountain range (95.0). Mu Li says he was a 2-star Dou Zhe when they fought earlier.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":5,"title":"Flame Splitting Tsunami","summary":"Xiao Yan breaks He Meng's rock defence and kills him with Octane Blast. Mu She orders every Wolf Head mercenary above Five Stars into the Magical Beast Mountain Range to find him. At the Thousand Medicine House, Mr. Yao asks Little Fairy Doctor about the treasure, and she claims she found none and points him at the Wolf Head Mercenary Company. Yao Lao takes Xiao Yan's Heavy Xuan Ruler and shows him Flame Splitting Tsunami, a low-level Di Class Dou Skill he can use only once. Mu Li and the Wolf Head company trap Xiao Yan and demand the treasure chest's key. He fights through with Vacuum Hand, the ruler and Fire Palm, then uses Flame Splitting Tsunami against Mu She's Soaring Killer Wind. He escapes and swears to repay the ambush.","events":["Xiao Yan kills He Meng with Octane Blast.","Mu She sends everyone above Five Stars into the mountains to hunt Xiao Yan.","Mr. Yao questions Little Fairy Doctor at the Thousand Medicine House; she points him at the Wolf Head company.","Yao Lao shows Xiao Yan Flame Splitting Tsunami with the Heavy Xuan Ruler.","Mu Li and the Wolf Head company ambush Xiao Yan for the treasure chest's key.","Xiao Yan fights with Vacuum Hand and Fire Palm; Mu She uses Soaring Wind Steps.","Xiao Yan's Flame Splitting Tsunami meets Mu She's Soaring Killer Wind; Xiao Yan escapes."],"introduced":["Little Fairy Doctor","Mr. Yao of the Thousand Medicine House","Dou Skill classes: Tian, Di, Xuan, Huang (Heaven, Earth, Black, Yellow)","Flame Splitting Tsunami (low-level Di Class Dou Skill)","Fire Palm","Soaring Wind Steps","Soaring Killer Wind","bamboo whistles"],"confidence":"high"},{"ep":6,"title":"The Purple Crystal Winged Lion King","summary":"Deep in the Magical Beast Mountain Range, Xiao Yan gathers herbs and fights beasts like a Rank Three Rock Primate while Yao Lao watches. A woman asks the Purple Crystal Winged Lion King, a Rank Six beast as strong as a Dou Huang, for its Purple Spirit Crystal. The Lion King wants to devour her instead, and they fight, her Wind's Peak, Killer Meteorite against its Purple Crystal Seal. She is sealed and wounded, and Xiao Yan hides her in his cave and treats the wounds under her vest. She gives her name as Yun Zhi, and on Yao Lao's advice he calls himself Yao Yan. He offers to help her get the crystal because they are friends, and Yao Lao tells him about the Amethyst Essence that sometimes forms when the Lion King has young. When beasts track them because she left the cave to bathe, Xiao Yan goes out alone to lure them away.","events":["Xiao Yan trains and gathers herbs deep in the mountain range; he fights a Rank Three Earth Type Rock Primate.","A woman asks the Purple Crystal Winged Lion King for its Purple Spirit Crystal; it wants to devour her.","They fight: Wind Pushing Force and Wind's Peak, Killer Meteorite against the Purple Crystal Seal.","Yao Lao tells Xiao Yan about the rare Amethyst Essence.","Xiao Yan rescues the wounded woman and treats her wounds in his cave.","She is Yun Zhi; he says he is Yao Yan, and offers to help her as a friend.","Beasts find the cave; Xiao Yan goes out to lure them away."],"introduced":["Yun Yun (as Yun Zhi)","Yao Yan (Xiao Yan's alias)","Purple Crystal Winged Lion King (Rank Six)","Purple Spirit Crystal","Amethyst Essence","Purple Flame","Flame Seed","Body Transformation Pill","Rank Three Earth Type Rock Primate","Magical Beast ranks (Rank Three, Five, Six)","Wind Pushing Force","Purple Crystal Seal","Wind's Peak, Killer Meteorite","Jia Ma Empire (named)","eastern mountain range"],"cultivation":"Yun Zhi is a Dou Huang (said by the Lion King). Rank Six Magical Beasts equal a human Dou Huang; Rank Five equal a Dou Wang. Xiao Yan is 'just a Dou Zhe'.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":7,"title":"Parting with Yun Zhi","summary":"Xiao Yan drives off two low-ranked beasts and comes back hurt, and Yun Zhi apologises and cooks him grilled fish. She seasons it with a powder that turns out to be an aphrodisiac Xiao Yan made by accident. Yao Lao teaches him how to break its effect by massaging her acupuncture points with Dou Qi, and Yun Zhi tells him to forget what happened. When the Purple Crystal Winged Lion King finds her again, Yao Lao sends Xiao Yan to its cave. There he finds the Purple Spirit Crystal and, with a Purple Smoke Fruit and a laxative for the young lion, the Amethyst Essence, which he gathers in a jade bottle. A few drops give him great speed, and he runs back to help Yun Zhi, and they face the Lion King with Flame Splitting Tsunami and Wind's Peak, Killer Meteorite. Afterwards Yun Zhi is gone, leaving him a personal gift, and Xiao Yan finds he is now a Nine-Star Dou Zhe.","events":["Xiao Yan fights off two beasts drawn by Yun Zhi's tracks.","Yun Zhi's grilled fish contains Xiao Yan's accidental aphrodisiac.","Yao Lao shows him how to break the effect with Dou Qi acupuncture massage; Yun Zhi asks him to forget it.","The Lion King finds Yun Zhi; Xiao Yan raids its cave for the Purple Spirit Crystal.","He tricks the young lion with a Purple Smoke Fruit and a laxative and collects the Amethyst Essence.","A few drops of the Essence give him great speed; he rushes to help Yun Zhi.","Xiao Yan uses Flame Splitting Tsunami and Yun Zhi uses Wind's Peak, Killer Meteorite against the Lion King.","Yun Zhi leaves him a gift and goes; Xiao Yan is a Nine-Star Dou Zhe."],"introduced":["Purple Smoke Fruit","juvenile Purple Crystal Winged Lion King (Rank Three)","jade bottle","aphrodisiac (Xiao Yan's accidental mixture)"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan says he has gone up two ranks to 9-star Dou Zhe (1256.2).","confidence":"high"},{"ep":8,"title":"Gan Mu Falls","summary":"Xiao Yan wakes to find Yun Zhi gone, leaving him her Sea's Core Vest and the Xuan Class Dou Skill Exploding Steps. Yao Lao reveals that she risked herself to heal him and to guide the Purple Flame from the Amethyst Essence into his body, which lifted him to Nine-Star Dou Zhe. Yao Lao teaches him Exploding Steps and shows how it combines with Octane Blast. He warns that the Purple Flame can still burst his cyclone, so Xiao Yan must kill more than five Rank 1 Magical Beasts within a month to steady his Dou Qi. Leaving the depths, he meets Ka Gang and Ling Er of the Bloody Battle Mercenary Company fleeing Gan Mu, the Wolf Head Second Captain. Xiao Yan kills Gan Mu with Exploding Steps and Octane Blast. Ka Gang tells him that Mr. Yao of the Thousand Medicine House plans to harm Little Fairy Doctor for her Rainbow Poison Book, and Xiao Yan sets off to save her.","events":["Xiao Yan wakes to find Yun Zhi gone and her Sea's Core Vest left behind.","Yao Lao explains Yun Zhi healed him and guided the Purple Flame, raising him to Nine-Star.","Yao Lao teaches Exploding Steps and its combination with Octane Blast.","To steady the Purple Flame, Xiao Yan must kill five Rank 1 beasts within a month.","Ka Gang and Ling Er of the Bloody Battle Mercenary Company flee Gan Mu.","Xiao Yan fights and kills Gan Mu.","Ka Gang tells him Mr. Yao wants Little Fairy Doctor's Rainbow Poison Book; Xiao Yan heads for the Thousand Medicine House."],"introduced":["Sea's Core Vest","Exploding Steps (Xuan Class Dou Skill)","Ka Gang","Ling Er","Gan Mu","Bloody Battle Mercenary Company","Qing Ye (named only)","Rainbow Poison Book","Tiger Assault"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan is at 9-star Dou Zhe after skipping two levels; Yao Lao warns his foundation is shaky.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":9,"title":"Showdown at the Thousand Medicine House","summary":"After Gan Mu's death, Xiao Yan races to the Thousand Medicine House and finds Little Fairy Doctor, who refuses to flee for fear the Wolf Head Mercenary Company will punish the townspeople. Mr. Yao arrives, guesses who Xiao Yan is and demands her Rainbow Poison Book, then claims he has already poisoned the room. Little Fairy Doctor had put an antidote in the tea and poisoned Mr. Yao's own chair, so he begs for the antidote and lets them go. Mu She brings the Wolf Head company after them. Xiao Yan fights Mu She, who uses his Dou Qi Cloak and a new Raging Lion technique he took from the third stone box in the cave where Xiao Yan and Little Fairy Doctor found the treasure. With Yao Lao's guidance, Xiao Yan answers with Flame Splitting Tsunami and kills Mu She. A last attack is stopped by the Sea's Core Vest, and Little Fairy Doctor asks which girl gave it to him.","events":["Xiao Yan reaches the Thousand Medicine House and finds Little Fairy Doctor.","Mr. Yao demands the Rainbow Poison Book and threatens them with poison.","Little Fairy Doctor turns the poison on Mr. Yao; he begs for the antidote and lets them leave.","Mu She leads the Wolf Head Mercenary Company to the Thousand Medicine House.","Mu She fights with Dou Qi Cloak, Soaring Wind Steps and Soaring Killer Wind.","Mu She uses Raging Lion, learned from the cave's third stone box; Xiao Yan kills him with Flame Splitting Tsunami.","The Sea's Core Vest saves Xiao Yan from a final attack; Little Fairy Doctor asks who gave it to him."],"introduced":["Dou Qi Cloak","Raging Lion","stone boxes in the treasure cave","Lan (Little Fairy Doctor's eagle, called by name)"],"cultivation":"Mu She calls Xiao Yan 'a mere Dou Zhe' (727.8).","confidence":"high"},{"ep":10,"title":"Medicine Valley","summary":"With the Wolf Head Mercenary Company defeated, Little Fairy Doctor's blue eagle Lan carries her and Xiao Yan from Qingshan Town to the hidden Medicine Valley. She gathers herbs from the Rainbow Poison Book while he trains for Dou Shi in the valley's pure energy. Hunting a Rank Two Ice Magical Beast, Xiao Yan saves Ling Er and Qing Ye of the Bloody Battle Mercenary Company. Qing Ye gives him a Rank Two ice Monster Core in thanks, which he needs for the Icy Heart Pill and Path Protecting Pill. Back in the valley, Little Fairy Doctor collapses, and Yao Lao says she has the Woeful Poison Body, which feeds on poison but ends in an agonising death. Xiao Yan promises to cure her and take her travelling. She leaves a note in the night and goes, telling him not to look for her, and he vows to cure her one day.","events":["The blue eagle Lan flies Xiao Yan and Little Fairy Doctor to Medicine Valley.","They live in the valley; she gathers herbs, he cultivates toward Dou Shi.","Xiao Yan saves Ling Er and Qing Ye from a Rank Two Ice Magical Beast.","Qing Ye gives him a Rank Two ice Monster Core.","Little Fairy Doctor faints; Yao Lao names her Woeful Poison Body.","Xiao Yan promises to cure her and take her travelling.","She leaves a note and disappears; Xiao Yan vows to cure her."],"introduced":["Qingshan Town","Medicine Valley","Qing Ye","Lan (blue eagle)","Woeful Poison Body","Rank Two Ice Magical Beast","Monster Core","Icy Heart Pill","Path Protecting Pill"],"confidence":"high"},{"ep":11,"title":"The Alchemist Association","summary":"Little Fairy Doctor is gone, and in a few days Xiao Yan swallows the Purple Flame with the Flame Mantra and becomes a One-Star Dou Shi, though the technique evolves only one level. To reach the Heavenly Flames in the depths of the Tager Desert, he and Yao Lao come to Black Rock City, the only place with Thick Winged Birds. Yao Lao lists what he needs to swallow a Heavenly Flame: a Blood Lotus Essence Pill, an Ice Spirit Cold Fountain and an Acceptance Soul, which Yao Lao already has. Xiao Yan goes to the Alchemist Association, where he gets past the door by showing a condensed solid fire, and in the examination with Lin Fei and Xue Mei, he passes first tier with a top-grade Amassing Strength Pill. For the second-tier test Ao Tuo sets him the hard Energy Recovery Pill, and using his Purple Flame he passes and becomes Black Rock City's youngest second-tier alchemist in over a hundred years. He asks the association for a Rank Three Monster Core and an Ice Spirit Cold Fountain.","events":["Opening narration: Xiao Yan swallows the Purple Flame with the Flame Mantra and becomes a One-Star Dou Shi.","Xiao Yan and Yao Lao arrive in Black Rock City for a Thick Winged Bird to the Tager Desert.","Yao Lao lists the three items needed to swallow a Heavenly Flame.","At the Alchemist Association door, Xiao Yan shows a condensed solid fire and is let in.","He passes the first-tier exam with a top-grade Amassing Strength Pill alongside Xue Mei and Lin Fei.","Ao Tuo sets him the Energy Recovery Pill for the second-tier exam; he uses the Purple Flame and passes.","He becomes the youngest second-tier alchemist in Black Rock City in over a hundred years and asks for a Rank Three Monster Core and Ice Spirit Cold Fountain."],"introduced":["Black Rock City","Tager Desert (named)","Thick Winged Bird","Alchemist Association","Fu Lanke","Ao Tuo","Lin Fei","Xue Mei","Blood Lotus Essence Pill","Ice Spirit Cold Fountain","Acceptance Soul","Rank Three Monster Core","Amassing Strength Pill","Energy Recovery Pill","alchemist tiers (first, second, fourth)","recommendation letter","condensed solid fire"],"cultivation":"Opening narration: Xiao Yan swallows the Purple Flame with the Flame Mantra and becomes a 1-star Dou Shi (21.0); the Flame Mantra evolves one level (68.2). He passes the first- and second-tier alchemist exams.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":12,"title":"The Ice Spirit Cold Fountain","summary":"The Alchemist Association gives Xiao Yan an alchemist robe, but no trading record in the Jia Ma Empire lists an Ice Spirit Cold Fountain. Ao Tuo reluctantly takes him to Gu Te, a reclusive alchemist who deals in shady things, past Bewitching Devil Grass and a reinforced steel door. Gu Te refuses at first and tries to throw him out, so Xiao Yan shows his only bottle of Amethyst Lion Birth Essence and pretends to walk away. At last Gu Te gives in and trades him the Ice Spirit Cold Fountain. At the Flying Transportation Company, Fu Lanke gives him a Rank Three Monster Core and invites him to the Alchemist Conference in the capital in six months. As an alchemist he rides for free, and the men of a three-tier alchemist, who were bullying a man in the queue, mark him.","events":["The association gives Xiao Yan an alchemist robe but finds no Ice Spirit Cold Fountain for sale.","Ao Tuo takes him to Gu Te's lair, past Bewitching Devil Grass.","Gu Te refuses to trade and tries to throw him out.","Xiao Yan shows the Amethyst Lion Birth Essence and makes as if to leave.","Gu Te trades him the Ice Spirit Cold Fountain.","At the Flying Transportation Company, Fu Lanke gives him a Rank Three Monster Core and tells him of the Alchemist Conference.","A three-tier alchemist's men pick out Xiao Yan as he boards for free."],"introduced":["Gu Te","Bewitching Devil Grass","Desire Flower","Blood Clotting Grass","Blue Rock Heartstone","Amethyst Lion Birth Essence (name for the Amethyst Essence)","alchemist robe","Flying Transportation Company","Alchemist Conference (in the capital, in six months)","Empire's eastern border","three-tier alchemist (unnamed)"],"confidence":"high"},{"ep":13,"title":"Blood Lotus Essence Pill","summary":"Two days out from Black Rock City on the flying transport, Yao Lao refines the Blood Lotus Essence Pill, a high-grade fifth-tier pill that perhaps only Gu He could make in the Jia Ma Empire. Using his Heavenly Flame he takes two and a half days instead of ten, and when the pill forms, the anomaly draws the three-tier alchemist's men and other passengers, who demand Xiao Yan hand it over. Xiao Yan fights them, and the Heavenly Flame burns a Da Dou Shi. When one survivor begs to serve him, Yao Lao warns him never to trust such people. At the edge of the Tager Desert, Xiao Yan dreams of Yun Zhi and Nalan Yanran, and Yao Lao tells him to let go of his worries before the Three-year Agreement. At a lonely map shop, Xiao Yan finds a fragment of a map to the Purifying Demonic Lotus Flame. The owner, who Yao Lao believes was once a Dou Huang, will not sell it.","events":["Yao Lao refines the fifth-tier Blood Lotus Essence Pill aboard the flying transport.","The pill's anomaly draws the three-tier alchemist's men, who demand it.","Xiao Yan fights them; the Heavenly Flame burns a Da Dou Shi.","Yao Lao tells Xiao Yan not to spare a follower who would betray him.","At the edge of the Tager Desert, Xiao Yan dreams of Yun Zhi and Nalan Yanran; Yao Lao encourages him.","At the Ancient Map shop Xiao Yan finds a Purifying Demonic Lotus Flame map fragment.","The owner, once a Dou Huang, refuses to sell it."],"introduced":["Purifying Demonic Lotus Flame","map fragment","Ancient Map (shop)","Map of Tager Desert","Snakemen","snake repellents","Demon Lizard","fifth-tier pill","pill anomalies (above fourth tier)"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan is called 'the youngest second-tier alchemist' (226.0). The Blood Lotus Essence Pill is a high-grade fifth-tier pill.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":14,"title":"The Ice Emperor","summary":"The map-shop owner is Hai Bodong, the Ice Emperor, once one of the Top Ten of the Jia Ma Empire. He once fought the former Misty Cloud Sect leader and beat two Dou Huangs at the Convention for the Strong, and Yao Lao sees that his Dou Huang strength is suppressed to Dou Ling. Xiao Yan fights him for the map fragment through Condensed Ice Mirror, an ice cave and Mysterious Ice Killing Vortex, and with Yao Lao's Soul Power and a snow-white flame he traps Hai Bodong in ice. Hai Bodong explains that Queen Medusa of the Snakemen defeated him and sealed him at Dou Ling with her Curse of the Snakes Seal. He offers the other map fragment and a Dou Huang's favour if Xiao Yan refines a six-tier Spiritual Recovery Purple Pill. He also needs Sand's Datura from Snakemen land, which he cannot enter because Medusa would sense him. In return he promises his research on where the Heavenly Flame is in the Tager Desert, and Xiao Yan agrees.","events":["Narration: the Ice Emperor's history as one of the Jia Ma Empire's Top Ten.","Yao Lao sees the man is a Dou Huang suppressed to Dou Ling.","Xiao Yan fights him for the map fragment; ice mist, Condensed Ice Mirror and an ice cave.","Yao Lao lends Soul Power; a snow-white flame traps the old man in ice.","He names himself Hai Bodong, the Ice Emperor, sealed by Queen Medusa's Curse of the Snakes Seal.","He asks for a six-tier Spiritual Recovery Purple Pill and Sand's Datura from Snakemen territory.","In return he offers the second map fragment, a favour and his Heavenly Flame research; Xiao Yan agrees."],"introduced":["Hai Bodong (Ice Emperor)","Top Ten of the Jia Ma Empire","Misty Cloud Mountain","Convention for the Strong","Chu Yun Empire","Queen Medusa (named only)","Curse of the Snakes Seal","Condensed Ice Mirror","Mysterious Ice Killing Vortex","Soul Power","Spiritual Recovery Purple Pill (six-tier)","Sand's Datura","Dou Ling","Dou Huang"],"cultivation":"Hai Bodong is a Dou Huang sealed at the Dou Ling level. Xiao Yan calls himself a two-tier alchemist.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":15,"title":"Brothers in Rock Desert City","summary":"Using Hai Bodong's map, Xiao Yan crosses the Tager Desert, cultivating his Purple Flame Dou Qi with the Burning Blood method, and reaches Two-Star Dou Shi. He saves a Desert Metal Mercenary Company squad from Mo Xing of the Sand Mercenary Company, after learning that its captains are Xiao Ding and Xiao Li. In Rock Desert City he defends Qing Lin, a half-human, half-snakeman girl whom the brothers took in as a maid. Xue Lan brings him to the company, and Xiao Ding and Xiao Li welcome their little brother with a night of drinking. They explain they founded the company as a safe place for him and ask him to stay. Xiao Yan says the Three-year Agreement is close and he is here to find a Heavenly Flame. Xiao Li spars with him using Triple Arc Lightning Dance, loses to Exploding Steps, and orders the whole company to back him.","events":["Xiao Yan crosses the desert using Hai Bodong's map and the Burning Blood method; he reaches Two-Star Dou Shi.","He rescues a Desert Metal squad from Mo Xing of the Sand Mercenary Company.","In Rock Desert City he stands up for Qing Lin, a half-snakeman maid.","Xue Lan brings him to the company; he is reunited with Xiao Ding and Xiao Li.","The brothers drink and talk about the past and the Nalan betrothal.","Xiao Yan shows them the map and says he seeks a Heavenly Flame.","Xiao Li spars with him and loses; the company is ordered to give Xiao Yan full support."],"introduced":["Rock Desert City","Desert Metal Mercenary Company","Sand Mercenary Company","Xiao Ding","Xiao Li","Qing Lin","Xue Lan","Mo Xing","Dan Zi (named only)","Burning Blood","Purple Flame Dou Qi","Triple Arc Lightning Dance","Nalan Clan"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan reaches 2-star Dou Shi in the desert (134.2). Mo Xing is a Dou Shi.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":16,"title":"The Passage Under the Sand","summary":"The flame symbol on Hai Bodong's map points east of Rock Desert City, where the Desert Metal Mercenary Company has seen only sand. Qing Lin says that half a year ago a huge aura like her own snake bloodline flared there and left wounded, which suggests Queen Medusa. She can still sense the spot, on the edge of Sand Mercenary Company land. Mo Xing tells his boss Luo Bu, a Da Dou Shi, that Xiao Yan is only a Dou Shi, and Luo Bu sets out to settle the score. Xiao Ding, Xiao Li and Xiao Yan follow Qing Lin's sense, and Xue Lan's scouts find a cave entrance buried in sand, but Mo Xing and the Sand Mercenary Company arrive and Xiao Li fights Mo Xing. When Luo Bu comes, Xiao Yan shows a power that makes Luo Bu think he is a Dou Wang, and Luo Bu promises not to interfere. Xiao Yan and Qing Lin then lead the way down the passage.","events":["Xiao Ding and Xiao Li find nothing at the map's flame mark east of Rock Desert City.","Qing Lin senses a strange aura there from half a year ago, likely Queen Medusa.","Mo Xing reports to Luo Bu, who decides to deal with the Desert Metal company himself.","The company travels into Sand Mercenary Company territory; Xue Lan's scouts find a buried cave entrance.","Mo Xing's men confront them; Xiao Li fights Mo Xing.","Luo Bu arrives; Xiao Yan's display makes him think Xiao Yan is a Dou Wang, and he backs off.","Xiao Yan and Qing Lin lead the group into the passage."],"introduced":["Luo Bu","City Lord Residence (Rock Desert City)","Mercenary Guild","underground passage east of Rock Desert City"],"cultivation":"Luo Bu, captain of the Sand Mercenary Company, is a Da Dou Shi. Mo Xing says Xiao Yan is only at the Dou Shi level. Luo Bu takes Xiao Yan for a Dou Wang (807.7).","confidence":"high"},{"ep":17,"title":"The Lava World Under Rock Desert City","summary":"Qing Lin leads Xiao Yan and the Desert Metal Mercenary Company down a passage under Rock Desert City into a vast underground magma world. The mercenaries turn back in the heat, and Xiao Yan flies on over the lava on his own. A Two-Headed Flame Spirit Serpent attacks him, then tries to grab Qing Lin, but she forms a contract with it. Yao Lao explains that Qing Lin has the Jade Snake Three Flower Pupils, the natural nemesis of snake-type beasts. The serpent shows that the Heavenly Flame lies below the magma, so Xiao Yan dives in, shielded by Yao Lao's Bone Chilling Flame for less than an hour. They find a thousand-year-old green lotus, but the Green Lotus Core Flame is gone. A scale left behind belongs to the Seven-Colored Heaven Swallowing Python of Queen Medusa, so Xiao Yan decides to go to the depths of the Tager Desert.","events":["The group follows Qing Lin's senses down the passage; most mercenaries turn back in the heat.","Xiao Yan flies over the lava with his wings; Xiao Ding asks if he has become a Dou Wang.","A Two-Headed Flame Spirit Serpent attacks Xiao Yan and then goes for Qing Lin.","Qing Lin forms a contract with the serpent; Yao Lao names her Jade Snake Three Flower Pupils.","The serpent reveals the Heavenly Flame is hidden below the magma.","Xiao Yan dives into the lava inside Yao Lao's Bone Chilling Flame shield, with under an hour to spare.","They find the green lotus, but the Green Lotus Core Flame has been taken.","A Seven-Colored Heaven Swallowing Python scale points to Queen Medusa; they head for the depths of the Tager Desert."],"introduced":["Green Lotus Core Flame (19th on the Heavenly Flame Ranking)","Heavenly Flame Ranking","Bone Chilling Flame (11th on the Heavenly Flame Ranking)","underground magma world beneath Rock Desert City","Two-Headed Flame Spirit Serpent","Jade Snake Three Flower Pupils","Woeful Poison Body (mentioned)","Seven-Colored Heaven Swallowing Python (scale)","Rank Six Magical Beast (comparable to a Dou Huang)"],"confidence":"high"},{"ep":18,"title":"Mirage","summary":"This episode starts Song of Desert, a side story about Hai Bodong in the Tager Desert. Hai Bodong, the Ice Emperor and a Dou Huang, has been hired to bring back a snakewoman who has lost her memory. A masked Snakemen warrior traps him in a mirage and fights him, and he answers with Mysterious Ice Dragon's Soar. He brings the snakewoman to a desert town and hands her over to his employer, but the employer is found dead, so Hai Bodong takes his storage ring as payment and tells her she is free. She begs to stay with him. Queen Medusa then arrives at the town herself, her guards clear it, and her people say the man they hired to catch a traitor is dead.","events":["The snakewoman, who remembers nothing, travels with Hai Bodong and asks his name.","A masked Snakemen warrior traps Hai Bodong in a mirage; he fights back with Mysterious Ice Dragon's Soar.","In a mercenary town, Hai Bodong brings the snakewoman to his employer per the contract (money to the Mite'er family).","The employer is dead; Hai Bodong takes his storage ring and tells the snakewoman she is free.","She begs to go with him as his servant; he refuses.","Queen Medusa arrives, her guards clear the town, and her people say the man they hired to catch the traitor died within a day."],"introduced":["Song of Desert (side story)","snakewoman with no memory (later named Die)","Mysterious Ice Dragon's Soar","mirage (Snakemen illusion)","Mite'er family (mentioned)"],"cultivation":"Hai Bodong is a Dou Huang ('Just because you're a Dou Huang', 451).","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":19,"title":"Raging Sandstorms","summary":"Hai Bodong is poisoned and hunted by the masked Snakemen warrior and the whole Snakemen tribe, and he wants to leave the desert fast. The snakewoman with no memory follows him. At a caravan she talks the traders into giving food, but Hai Bodong finds they are Snakemen traffickers. Three of them reveal themselves as Dou Wang and attack him together with wind, lightning and earth attributes, and he kills them with the Frozen Ice Formation. She stops him from killing the captured people and treats his poisoned wound by sucking out some poison at his hidden supply base. He says they will part in the city the Snakemen dare not enter. The Snakemen find their trail, Medusa vows to bring the traitor back, and the warrior catches them in the desert.","events":["Hai Bodong leaves the snakewoman behind, but she follows him; she asks again for his name.","At a caravan she trades kindness for food while he wants to take it by force.","The traders are Snakemen traffickers; three Dou Wang among them attack Hai Bodong together.","Hai Bodong defeats them with the Frozen Ice Formation.","She begs him to spare the captives; he says killing everyone is his rule.","At his supply base she treats his poisoned wound and asks if he is happy.","Medusa says she will bring the traitor back; the Snakemen and the warrior catch up with them."],"introduced":["Frozen Ice Formation","Snakemen traffickers (caravan)","Snake Spirit (Snakemen belief)"],"cultivation":"The three caravan attackers are Dou Wang ('The three of us at level Dou Wang', 554.8).","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":20,"title":"Song of Desert","summary":"The masked Snakemen warrior attacks again, and Hai Bodong and the snakewoman run. On the run she tells him she wants to be free like a butterfly, and he tells her about his martial sister, whom he loved and who killed herself when the elders found out. They split up near Rock City; he gives her a ring and the name Tengshan in the Jia Ma capital, and she gives him her necklace. He finds the masked warrior and learns it is Medusa. The snakewoman remembers who she is: Medusa's identical twin, who should have fought her sister to the death for the throne and instead fled with a forbidden spatial spell. Medusa was crowned and ordered the traitor brought back. The episode closes with the sisters and Hai Bodong meeting in the desert.","events":["The masked warrior attacks again; Hai Bodong says finishing a job is his rule.","She talks of freedom and the free butterfly; he tells the story of his martial sister.","Medusa's people trace the traitor; the masked warrior kills the trader who hired Hai Bodong.","Hai Bodong and the snakewoman split up; he gives her a ring and tells her to find Tengshan; she gives him her necklace.","Hai Bodong fights the masked warrior and realises it is Medusa.","The snakewoman remembers she is Medusa's twin and that she fled the death duel with a forbidden spatial spell.","Medusa is crowned and vows to bring the traitor back."],"introduced":["Medusa's twin sister","Tengshan (named, in the Jia Ma capital)","forbidden spatial spell","Free Butterfly","Rock City","Snakemen rule: one Medusa per generation, born from an egg"],"cultivation":"Medusa is a Dou Huang ('It's impossible for the Snakemen tribe to have two Dou Huang warriors', 866.5).","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":21,"title":"The Queen in the Holy Pond","summary":"Two months into the Tager Desert, Xiao Yan and Yao Lao near the Snakemen Shrine and rest at an oasis. They find Queen Medusa dancing the Dance of Blessings in the Holy Pond. Yao Lao explains her Art of Evolution: by swallowing a Heavenly Flame she can become a Dou Zong, or burn to nothing. Medusa notices them and leaves Yue Mei to deal with the intruder. With Yao Lao's power Xiao Yan fights at Dou Huang strength, until Yao Lao has to hide from a Dou Huang with strong perception who is coming. Back at Two-Star Dou Shi, Xiao Yan runs, and Yue Mei chases him to take him alive. Gu He and his group are also heading for the shrine.","events":["Medusa spares Hai Bodong and promises freedom for her people (end of EP20, before the card).","Xiao Yan and Yao Lao reach an oasis with Snakemen statues near the shrine.","They watch Medusa dance the Dance of Blessings in the Holy Pond; Yao Lao explains the Art of Evolution.","Medusa senses them and leaves Yue Mei to deal with them.","Yao Lao takes over and fights Yue Mei and her snakes at Dou Huang strength.","Yao Lao withdraws as another Dou Huang comes near; Xiao Yan, a Two-Star Dou Shi again, flees.","Gu He's group nears the shrine; Yue Mei keeps chasing Xiao Yan."],"introduced":["Snakemen Shrine","Holy Pond","Dance of Blessings","Art of Evolution","Yue Mei","Gu He","Art of Energy-Pitching","Art of Snake, Rampage"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan is a Two-Star Dou Shi ('I'm just a Two-Star Dou Shi', 924). With Yao Lao's power he fights as a Dou Huang.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":22,"title":"Ms. Yun and the Pill King","summary":"Xiao Yan fights Yue Mei with Octane Blast and Vacuum Hand and cuts her face, but she beats him, and a masked Dou Huang saves him. The Dou Huang is Ms. Yun, who sends him out of the desert and stops Yue Mei from chasing him. Gu He the Pill King introduces himself and asks to meet Queen Medusa, while Yan Shi the Lion King and Feng Li the Walking Wind, two of the Top Ten of the Jia Ma Empire, fight Yue Mei until she escapes. Xiao Yan sneaks into the shrine disguised as a Snakeman with his Snake Pill, while Hua She Er rehearses the sacrificial ceremony dancers. Yue Mei warns Medusa of Gu He and the masked Dou Huang, and Medusa has four fake Heavenly Flames set in the shrine's corners. Xiao Yan finds only a fake flame, and his Green Colored Lotus Platform tells him the real one is below.","events":["Xiao Yan cuts Yue Mei's face but loses; a masked Dou Huang saves him.","Ms. Yun sends Xiao Yan away and stops Yue Mei; Gu He asks to see Medusa.","Yan Shi and Feng Li fight Yue Mei; she escapes with Art of Snake, Split.","Xiao Yan enters the shrine disguised with his Snake Pill; Hua She Er prepares the ceremony dancers.","Yue Mei reports to Medusa; Medusa orders four fake Heavenly Flames placed and the ceremony moved up.","Xiao Yan chases a fake flame, is spotted, and escapes the guards with Exploding Steps.","The Green Colored Lotus Platform senses the true flame below the shrine as the ceremony starts."],"introduced":["Ms. Yun (masked Dou Huang)","Gu He, the Pill King","Yan Shi, the Lion King","Feng Li, the Walking Wind","Top Ten of the Jia Ma Empire","Hua She Er","Yin Shi","eight tribes / eight leaders of the Snakemen","Snake Pill","Green Colored Lotus Platform","fake Heavenly Flames","Summoning the Snake","Art of Snake, Split","Octane Blast","Vacuum Hand","Enchantment Spell"],"confidence":"high"},{"ep":23,"title":"The Queen Is Only Energy","summary":"Gu He and his group arrive at the shrine during the ceremony and demand to see Queen Medusa. When she appears he offers two Sixth-Tier Fighting Spirit Pills and a Seventh-Tier Body Transformation Pill for the Green Lotus Core Flame. Medusa refuses, and Gu He reveals that the figure before them is only a body of energy holding a touch of her mind. Ms. Yun strikes, the energy body breaks, and the Snakemen think their queen is dead and attack. The Snakemen light the Summoning Order to call the leaders of the Eight Large Tribes. Hua She Er unmasks the disguised Xiao Yan and chases him with Art of Snake, Rampage, at peak Dou Wang strength. He escapes into a trapped hall with rune tiles, where Yao Lao senses the Heavenly Flame right below them.","events":["Snake guards hold the forbidden altar as Gu He's group breaks in.","Medusa appears; Gu He offers two Sixth-Tier Fighting Spirit Pills and a Seventh-Tier Body Transformation Pill.","Medusa refuses; Gu He reveals she is only a body of energy.","Ms. Yun breaks the energy body; the Snakemen attack to avenge their queen.","Ms. Yun says she will never let the Snakemen gain a Dou Zong; the Summoning Order is lit.","Hua She Er exposes Xiao Yan's disguise and chases him at peak Dou Wang strength.","Xiao Yan reaches a hall with rune traps above the hidden Heavenly Flame."],"introduced":["forbidden altar / West Shrine","Sixth-Tier Fighting Spirit Pill","Seventh-Tier Body Transformation Pill","energy body of the Queen","Summoning Order","Eight Large Tribes","rune tile traps"],"cultivation":"Hua She Er reaches peak Dou Wang strength for a moment with Art of Snake, Rampage (946.2).","confidence":"high"},{"ep":24,"title":"The Toxic Lake","summary":"Xiao Yan falls through the floor into a strange space under the altar where flying is banned, and the Sea's Core Vest that Yun Zhi gave him saves him from the fall. Above, Mo Ba Si, leader of the Mo Snake Tribe, arrives with reinforcements and fights Gu He's group. Gu He senses the flame's scent from four places and leads his group toward the weakest. Xiao Yan and Yao Lao cross a highly toxic lake under the Bone Chilling Flame to an island, but the Green Lotus Core Flame there is a fake. Following the real scent, Xiao Yan finds Queen Medusa in her true snake form about to swallow the Heavenly Flame. Yao Lao explains she risks death to become a Dou Zong and lead her people back to their homeland. Xiao Yan sees himself in her, and waits for her weakest moment to strike.","events":["Xiao Yan's Purple Cloud Wings fail under a flight ban; the Sea's Core Vest saves him.","Snake guards attack Gu He's group; Mo Ba Si of the Mo Snake Tribe arrives.","Gu He senses four flame scents and heads for the weakest one with Ms. Yun.","Xiao Yan crosses a toxic lake inside the Bone Chilling Flame; the flame on the island is a fake.","Xiao Yan follows the real scent and finds Medusa, who sees him but lets him be.","Medusa takes her original form and starts to swallow the Heavenly Flame.","Yao Lao explains the Snakemen's exile and Medusa's wish to lead them home; Xiao Yan waits to strike."],"introduced":["flight ban","Sea's Core Vest","Mo Ba Si","Mo Snake Tribe","toxic lake","Snakemen's original form (snake beast soul merged at birth)","Snakemen exile in the desert"],"confidence":"high"},{"ep":25,"title":"The Python Is Born","summary":"Medusa's swallowing of the Green Lotus Core Flame seems to fail, and the Snakemen mourn her. Then the energy of heaven and earth surges, breaking every ban in the space, and Gu He's group retreats. Yao Lao shields Xiao Yan through the storm, and the angered Heavenly Flame explodes and burns Medusa's snake body away. From the flames comes a small creature: Medusa's companion spirit, the Quiet Purple Flame Serpent, which has evolved into a Seven-Colored Heaven Swallowing Python. The python has no memory and no wish to kill. Xiao Yan feeds it Amethyst Lion Birth Essence and decides to keep it. He then collects the Green Lotus Core Flame with the Green Colored Lotus Platform, which hides its scent.","events":["Medusa seems to die while swallowing the flame; the Snakemen mourn.","Heaven-and-earth energy surges; Gu He and Ms. Yun retreat; all bans in the space break.","Yao Lao protects Xiao Yan as he dashes toward the flame.","The angered Heavenly Flame explodes and burns away Medusa's snake body.","A small Seven-Colored Heaven Swallowing Python comes out; Yao Lao explains the evolution of the Quiet Purple Flame Serpent.","Xiao Yan feeds it Amethyst Lion Birth Essence and keeps it.","Xiao Yan collects the Green Lotus Core Flame with the Green Colored Lotus Platform."],"introduced":["Quiet Purple Flame Serpent (Rank Six Magical Beast)","Seven-Colored Heaven Swallowing Python (on par with a Dou Zong)","Amethyst Lion Birth Essence","Energy Barrier","heavens and earth's energy backlash"],"cultivation":"Medusa evolves into the Seven-Colored Heaven Swallowing Python, 'on par with a strong Dou Zong' (745.8), but the creature is newborn and has lost its memory.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":26,"title":"Yun Zhi","summary":"Xiao Yan flies out of the shrine with the Heavenly Flame, but Gu He's group catches up and demands it. Yao Lao takes over, and Ms. Yun intercepts him while Gu He, Yan Shi and Feng Li head for the desert edge. Meanwhile the Snakemen leaders gather, with cards for Yan Ci, Nan She, Hei Du, Kui Xing and King Hua She, and plan to trap the Dou Huang with the Five Snake Poison Breaking Seal. Ms. Yun catches Xiao Yan, then lets him go when she sees who he is. He recognises her as Yun Zhi, and she knows him as Yao Yan. She offers to recommend him to the Misty Cloud Sect, and he refuses angrily. She tries to stop him from swallowing the flame, and he leaves her, promising to repay her someday.","events":["The Snakemen gather; Yan Ci of the Yan Snake Tribe arrives; Yin Shi plans the Five Snake Poison Breaking Seal.","Ms. Yun holds off the Snakemen and sends Gu He after the flame.","Gu He catches Xiao Yan; Yao Lao takes over and outruns them.","Ms. Yun and Gu He split up; the Snakemen split to hunt Gu He and the Dou Huang.","Ms. Yun corners Xiao Yan, then lets him go when she recognises him.","He recognises her as Yun Zhi; she offers to take him to the Misty Cloud Sect, and he refuses.","She asks for the flame so he won't risk his life; he leaves, promising to repay her."],"introduced":["Yan Ci","Yan Snake Tribe","Nan She","Hei Du","Kui Xing","King Hua She","Five Snake Poison Breaking Seal","Earth's Core Island","Wind Returning to the Earth","Wind Whirling Wall","Four-Sided Wind Wall","Tracking Snake","Yao Yan (Xiao Yan's alias)"],"cultivation":"Yun Yun notes Xiao Yan has become a Dou Shi ('You have upgraded to a Dou Shi', 729.7). Gu He is 'the Sixth Ranked Pill King' (562.2).","confidence":"high"},{"ep":27,"title":"The Five Snake Seal","summary":"Five Snakemen leaders, all Dou Wang, catch Ms. Yun and attack her together. When she outfights them, they use the Five Snake Poison Breaking Seal and give up part of their lifespans to summon a Spirit Serpent from a portal. Its body is not flesh and blood, so even Yun Yun's Wind's Peak skills cannot hurt it, and it badly wounds her. Xiao Yan sees the pillar of light and turns back to help. A masked Dou Huang with a Heavenly Flame, Yao Lao in Xiao Yan's place, drives off the serpent and the Snakemen. He tells Yun Yun a kid asked him to help and to apologise, and she guesses it was Yao Yan. One Snakemen elder senses the Queen's scent on the rescuer and believes the Queen will return.","events":["Five Snakemen Dou Wang attack Ms. Yun; she is too strong for them.","They use Five Snake Spirit-Gathering and the Five Snake Poison Breaking Seal, summoning a Spirit Serpent from a portal.","Yun Yun's Wind's Peak, Killer Meteorite and Wind's Peak, Dazzling Sunset cannot hurt it; she is badly wounded.","Xiao Yan and Yao Lao see the light and go back to help her.","A masked Dou Huang with a Heavenly Flame defeats the serpent; the Snakemen retreat with Snake Technique, Split.","He tells Yun Yun a kid sent him to apologise; she wonders if she will see Yao Yan again.","A Snakemen elder senses the Queen's scent and says she will return.","Xiao Yan begins swallowing the Green Lotus Core Flame with Yao Lao's guidance."],"introduced":["Five Snake Spirit-Gathering","Snakemen Fusion Dou Skills","Spirit Serpent (summoned)","Wind's Peak, Killer Meteorite","Wind's Peak, Dazzling Sunset","Snake Technique, Split","Flame Seed","Ice Spirit Cold Fountain","Blood Lotus Essence Pill (blood essence)"],"cultivation":"The five Snakemen leaders are Dou Wang ('five of us Dou Wang', 271.3).","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":28,"title":"The Green Lotus Core Flame Is Refined","summary":"Xiao Yan pulls the Flame Seed out of the Green Lotus Core Flame and swallows it, guided by Yao Lao. He nearly loses himself in the pain until memories of Nalan Yanran's challenge keep him going, and he drives the seed into his Acceptance Soul. The refining works, his injuries heal, and he reaches Four-Star Dou Shi. In Rock Desert City, the Sand Mercenary Company kidnaps Qing Lin and surrounds the Desert Metal Mercenary Company, backed by a new Da Dou Shi. Xiao Yan tries to forge the Green Lotus Core Flame into the Flame Mantra, which he must do for Yao Lao to be reborn. When the flame fights back, Yao Lao admits he first took him as a disciple only to absorb his Dou Qi. Yao Lao holds the flame with his own soul, and the Flame Mantra rises to Xuan Class Medium Rank.","events":["Xiao Yan swallows the Flame Seed and fights the burning pain.","Memories of Nalan Yanran and the Three-year Agreement keep him going; he moves the seed into the Acceptance Soul.","He succeeds and reaches Four-Star Dou Shi.","At Rock Desert City, Qing Lin is kidnapped and the Sand Mercenary Company surrounds the Desert Metal compound.","Xiao Yan forges the Green Lotus Core Flame into the Flame Mantra; the flame resists.","Yao Lao confesses he first wanted only Xiao Yan's Dou Qi, and risks his soul to help.","The Flame Mantra rises from Huang Class to Xuan Class Medium Rank.","Two months remain before the Three-year Agreement; next they go to Hai Bodong with the Sand's Datura."],"introduced":["Acceptance Soul","Tian, Di, Xuan, Huang (technique classes)","Flame Mantra space","Xuan Class Medium Rank","Purifying Demonic Lotus Flame Map","Sand's Datura","Shi Mo City"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan rises to Four-Star Dou Shi after refining the Green Lotus Core Flame (418.9). The Flame Mantra rises to Xuan Class Medium Rank (ep29.en.srt 96).","confidence":"high"},{"ep":29,"title":"The Breaking Adversity Pill","summary":"Xiao Yan returns to Hai Bodong with the Sand's Datura and refines the sixth-tier Breaking Adversity Pill for him in an ice chamber under the desert, with Yao Lao doing the refining and Xiao Yan watching. Yao Lao hides a cube of Bone Chilling Flame ice in the pill to protect them. Hai Bodong takes the pill, his seal breaks, and he is a Dou Huang again. He thinks about turning on Xiao Yan, then decides to stay friends and hands over the fragmented map. In Rock Desert City, Mo Ran, a One-Star Da Dou Shi sent by the Mo Clan of Yan City, beats Xiao Li and Xiao Ding. Xiao Yan arrives and fights Mo Ran himself, without Yao Lao's help.","events":["Xiao Yan gives Hai Bodong the Sand's Datura and agrees to refine the pill first.","In a sealed ice chamber, Yao Lao refines the Breaking Adversity Pill with the cauldron Black Demon while Xiao Yan watches.","Yao Lao hides Bone Chilling Flame ice in the pill as a safeguard.","Hai Bodong takes the pill and breaks his seal, becoming a Dou Huang again.","Hai Bodong gives Xiao Yan the fragmented map.","Mo Ran beats Xiao Li and Xiao Ding at the Desert Metal compound.","Xiao Yan arrives and fights Mo Ran alone, and Mo Ran shows his Dou Qi Armor."],"introduced":["Breaking Adversity Pill (tier six, breaks most seals)","Black Demon (cauldron)","Bone Chilling Flame ice cube (safeguard)","fragmented map","Mo Ran","Mo Clan of Yan City","Dou Qi Armor"],"cultivation":"Hai Bodong breaks his seal: 'I'm now a Dou Huang again!' (743.5). Mo Ran is a One-Star Da Dou Shi (1038.2).","confidence":"high"},{"ep":30,"title":"The Mo Clan of Yan City","summary":"Hai Bodong brings Luo Bu to the Desert Metal Mercenary Company, and Luo Bu admits the Mo Clan of Yan City took Qing Lin. Mo Cheng, called Executioner Mo, leads the clan and is an External Deacon of the Misty Cloud Sect. In his underground laboratory he makes Qing Lin contract a Black Magical Serpent to test her Triple Jade-Green Snake Flower Pupils. Hai Bodong guesses that Xiao Yan's Dou Huang-level power is not his own and says he is now a Two-Star Dou Huang, down from five stars. Xiao Yan offers him a fifth-tier Spiritual Recovery Purple Pill in a year if he serves as his bodyguard until then, and Hai Bodong agrees. The two sneak into the Mo Residence during Mo Cheng's 60th birthday banquet and find a lab full of human and beast experiments, but no Qing Lin. Nalan Yanran arrives at the banquet.","events":["Hai Bodong brings Luo Bu; Luo Bu says the Mo Clan took Qing Lin.","Mo Cheng returns to Yan City for his 60th birthday; Misty Cloud Sect guests are expected.","In the lab, Qing Lin contracts a Black Magical Serpent; Mo Cheng plans an experiment on her.","Hai Bodong says he is a Two-Star Dou Huang, sealed down from Five-Star.","Xiao Yan and Hai Bodong agree: one year as bodyguard for a Spiritual Recovery Purple Pill.","Masked, they search the Mo Residence; twelve guards are already dead, killed by an unknown Dou Huang.","They find the lab of experiments and take a jar as evidence.","Nalan Yanran arrives to congratulate Mo Cheng."],"introduced":["Mo Cheng (Executioner Mo)","Mo Residence","Yan City","Four Large Clans of the north-east","External Deacon (Misty Cloud Sect)","Black Magical Serpent","Triple Jade-Green Snake Flower Pupils","Spiritual Recovery Purple Pill (fifth-tier)","Bo Er, Governor of Yan City","Ye Cong, leader of the Ye Clan","Ye Clan","Mo Clan ancestor's fusion research"],"cultivation":"Hai Bodong is a Two-Star Dou Huang, sealed from Five-Star (704.2, 712.5).","confidence":"high"},{"ep":31,"title":"Executioner Mo Unmasked","summary":"Nalan Yanran and Elder Ge Ye of the Misty Cloud Sect attend Mo Cheng's birthday banquet. Mo Cheng announces the Mo Alliance to unite the north-eastern Jia Ma Empire, and several forces join. A masked Xiao Yan with Yao Lao's power breaks in, uses Vacuum Hand, and demands Qing Lin, calling Yun Yun a blind old woman. Nalan Yanran defends her master and Mo Cheng's good name. Hai Bodong reveals a beast experiment from Mo's laboratory, and the Misty Cloud Sect withdraws its support. Mo Cheng turns himself into a half-human, half-beast monster, eats one of his own men, and flees with Qing Lin. He hides inside an Isolation Shield that even the Heavenly Flame cannot break.","events":["Nalan Yanran and Elder Ge Ye arrive at the Mo Residence.","Mo Cheng announces the Mo Alliance; Tao Homestead, Black Water Ridge and Feilun Castle join.","Xiao Yan, masked and with Dou Huang power, demands Qing Lin and insults Yun Yun.","Nalan Yanran tries to stop him; Mo Cheng claims he is a man of justice.","Xiao Yan and Hai Bodong show a lab experiment; the Misty Cloud Sect leaves.","Mo Cheng becomes a half-beast monster and eats one of his men.","He grabs Qing Lin and hides in an Isolation Shield."],"introduced":["Mo Alliance","Tao Homestead","Black Water Ridge","Feilun Castle","Isolation Shield (blocks attacks below Dou Zong and Heavenly Flames)","Ge Ye"],"confidence":"high"},{"ep":32,"title":"The Angry Buddha Lotus Flame","summary":"Lu Man of the Sky Serpent Mansion slips into the Isolation Shield and takes Qing Lin, whom she calls the Reincarnated Holy Lady. Xiao Yan and Hai Bodong chase and fight her until the monster Mo Cheng attacks, and Lu Man shields Qing Lin. Part of Qing Lin's soul has been drawn out, and Lu Man says only her mansion's Holy Pond can mend it. Xiao Yan lets Lu Man take her and warns that the mansion will pay if she is hurt. Mo Cheng is now growing toward the strength of the strongest Dou Huang, and the Green Lotus Core Flame cannot catch him. Against Yao Lao's warning, Xiao Yan fuses two Heavenly Flames into a new skill he names the Angry Buddha Lotus Flame and blasts Mo Cheng with it. The effort uses up Yao Lao's Soul Power, and Yao Lao falls into a deep sleep, leaving Xiao Yan on his own.","events":["Lu Man takes Qing Lin out of Mo Cheng's Isolation Shield.","Xiao Yan and Hai Bodong fight Lu Man to get Qing Lin back.","Mo Cheng attacks Qing Lin; Lu Man protects her as the Holy Lady of the Sky Serpent Mansion.","Qing Lin has lost part of her soul; Xiao Yan lets Lu Man take her to the Holy Pond.","Xiao Yan and Hai Bodong fight the monster Mo Cheng with ice and the Green Lotus Core Flame.","Xiao Yan fuses two Heavenly Flames into the Angry Buddha Lotus Flame and strikes Mo Cheng.","Yao Lao's Soul Power runs out and he falls asleep; Xiao Yan blames himself."],"introduced":["Lu Man","Sky Serpent Mansion","Reincarnated Holy Lady","Holy Pond (Sky Serpent Mansion)","Soul Shrine (item)","Fusion Technique (Mo Clan)","Angry Buddha Lotus Flame","fusion of two Heavenly Flames"],"confidence":"high"},{"ep":33,"title":"Waking Without Yao Lao","summary":"Five days after the battle with Mo Cheng, Xiao Yan still lies unconscious in Shi Mo City, and Yao Lao has fallen asleep in his ring after spending all his Soul Power. At the Desert Metal Mercenary Company a captured Magical Beast breaks loose and hurts Xiao Li, and the mercenary Luo Bu steps in, then sneers that Xiao Yan will never recover. In a nightmare Xiao Yan fights his own hatred, strikes down a vision of his master, and remembers Yao Lao's lesson about letting go of grudges. He wakes understanding that every time he borrowed Yao Lao's power he was burning his master's Soul Power. His own Soul Power is damaged, so he gives Hai Bodong the Spiritual Recovery Purple Pill recipe, and Hai Bodong tells him herbs that restore Soul Power may be found at the Mite'er Auction House headquarters in the capital of the Jia Ma Empire. Xiao Ding quietly lays a trap for Luo Bu, while Xiao Yan starts refining the Core-Fire Lotus Seed and pushes its excess energy into the little Heaven Swallowing Python to survive it.","events":["Xiao Yan has been unconscious for five days; no physician or alchemist in Shi Mo City can help.","A captured Magical Beast escapes at the training ground and injures Xiao Li; Luo Bu subdues it and mocks Xiao Yan's condition.","In a nightmare Xiao Yan battles his hatred toward Nalan Yanran and dreams he has killed Yao Lao.","He wakes and realises that borrowing Yao Lao's power drained his master's Soul Power.","Xiao Ding asks Hai Bodong to keep the killing of Mo Cheng, External Deacon of the Misty Cloud Sect, secret.","Xiao Yan gives Hai Bodong the Spiritual Recovery Purple Pill recipe; Hai Bodong points him to the Mite'er Auction House headquarters in the capital.","Xiao Ding and Hai Bodong spread word that Hai Bodong is leaving, to bait Luo Bu.","Xiao Yan refines the Core-Fire Lotus Seed and channels its surplus energy into the little python."],"introduced":["Core-Fire Lotus Seed","Mite'er Auction House headquarters (in the capital)","Sand Lizard","Shi Mo City"],"cultivation":"No breakthrough. Xiao Yan says the Angry Buddha Lotus Flame has severely damaged his Soul Power, so he cannot refine the Spiritual Recovery Purple Pill for now. Yao Lao's Soul Power is exhausted and he is asleep.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":34,"title":"Medusa Wakes, Luo Bu Rebels","summary":"At the Misty Cloud Sect, Nalan Yanran and Ge Ye report to Yun Yun that two strangers, one a strong Dou Huang, exposed Mo Cheng's experiments on human bodies before he died. Elder Yun Leng argues the sect should not dig into the affair, and Yun Yun agrees to keep quiet because Nalan Yanran's Three-year Agreement is close, but orders the victims to be found and helped. In Shi Mo City the extra energy of the Core-Fire Lotus Seed wakes Queen Medusa, who bites Xiao Yan's finger and promises to kill him the next time she wakes. Xiao Yan feeds the Heaven Swallowing Python Amethyst Essence, shapes the purple flame it spits into a Purple Flame Pill and tries fusing it with the Green Lotus Core Flame. Meanwhile Luo Bu, sure that Xiao Yan is finished, demands the leadership of the Desert Metal Mercenary Company. Xiao Ding and Xiao Li break his Dou Qi Armor, and when Luo Bu turns on Xiao Ding, Xiao Yan appears and overwhelms him with his Heavenly Flame until Xiao Ding steps in to deal with Luo Bu himself.","events":["Nalan Yanran and Ge Ye tell Yun Yun what happened at Mo Cheng's birthday banquet.","Yun Leng urges the sect not to investigate; Yun Yun agrees but orders help for Mo Cheng's victims.","Medusa wakes in human form, bites Xiao Yan and vows to kill him when she next wakes.","Xiao Yan feeds the python Amethyst Essence and makes a Purple Flame Pill from its flame, then tries fusing it with the Green Lotus Core Flame.","Luo Bu and his followers challenge Xiao Ding for the leadership of the company.","Xiao Ding and Xiao Li break Luo Bu's Dou Qi Armor; Luo Bu attacks Xiao Ding.","Xiao Yan arrives and beats Luo Bu with the Heavenly Flame; Xiao Ding takes over.","That night Xiao Yan tells Hai Bodong they leave for the capital first thing tomorrow."],"introduced":["Yun Leng","Purple Flame Pill","Old Leader of the Misty Cloud Sect (in retreat)"],"cultivation":"Yun Leng says the Misty Cloud Sect has only one Dou Huang left, its leader Yun Yun. Luo Bu calls Xiao Ding and Xiao Li Dou Shi.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":35,"title":"A Toast Before the Capital","summary":"Xiao Ding and Xiao Li find Xiao Yan drinking alone, share their own stories of failure so he stops blaming himself, and swear to make the Misty Cloud Sect pay if he does not come back from the Three-year Agreement; he gives them a Xuan Class Medium Rank Technique with Xuan Class Advanced Dou Skills. At the Misty Cloud Sect, Nalan Yanran trains with the Wind Spirit Fractal Sword, and Yun Yun leaves for a few days after hearing that the Searing Poison in Nalan Yanran's grandfather is getting worse, promising to ask Gu He for help. Xiao Yan and Hai Bodong leave the Desert Metal Mercenary Company, while Xiao Zhan sets out for the capital with his guards. On a Flying Beast, young alchemists tell Xiao Yan about the Alchemist Conference, which Jia Ma Empire alchemists have won seven times running. At Jianan Academy, Xun Er hears that Xiao Yan fused two Heavenly Flames and killed a Dou Huang-level enemy, and that his companion is Hai Bodong, the Ice Emperor. In the capital, Xiao Yan and Hai Bodong reach the Mite'er Auction House headquarters, and Ya Fei steps in when the doorman tries to throw Xiao Yan out.","events":["Xiao Ding and Xiao Li drink with Xiao Yan and lift his spirits.","Xiao Yan gives them a Xuan Class Medium Rank Technique and Xuan Class Advanced Dou Skills.","Nalan Yanran defeats a Cloud Mist Beast with the Wind Spirit Fractal Sword.","Yun Yun leaves the sect and promises to ask Gu He to treat Old Master Nalan's Searing Poison.","Xiao Zhan and the Xiao Clan guards set off for the capital.","Fellow travellers tell Xiao Yan, a second-tier alchemist, about the Alchemist Conference and the Chu Yun Empire's entrants.","Xun Er, at Jianan Academy, is briefed on Xiao Yan, Hai Bodong and Yun Zhi.","At the Mite'er Auction House headquarters a doorman scorns Xiao Yan's 200,000 gold coins, and Ya Fei arrives."],"introduced":["Searing Poison","Wind Spirit Fractal Sword","Cloud Mist Beast","Alchemist Conference","Chu Yun Empire","Butler Xiao","Xuan Class Medium Rank Technique","Flying Beast","technique tiers: Tian, Di, Xuan, Huang","Ya Fei"],"confidence":"high"},{"ep":36,"title":"Ya Fei and the Purple Gold Card","summary":"Ya Fei, now Acting Supervising Elder of the Mite'er Auction House headquarters, takes Xiao Yan and Hai Bodong inside and thanks Xiao Yan for the pill that got her through her family's challenges in Wu Tan City. Lei Lei, the grandson of a Mite'er elder, insults Xiao Yan and Ya Fei, and Xiao Yan knocks him down with Octane Blast. Ya Fei says no item that restores Soul Power has been seen there for years, but promises to watch the family's information channels. Hai Bodong orders four rare herbs with a Purple Gold Card, but Lei Lei's grandfather, Elder Lei Ou, claims they are reserved and threatens to have Ya Fei dismissed. Hai Bodong reveals himself as a strong Dou Huang, crushes Lei Ou and gives the family one joss stick to bring the herbs, and Ya Fei charges him half price under the family's rules. As they get ready to leave, Nalan Yanran arrives to ask Ya Fei for a favour.","events":["Ya Fei vouches for Xiao Yan and Hai Bodong and takes them inside.","Lei Lei mocks Xiao Yan; Xiao Yan beats him with Octane Blast and Ya Fei stops the guards.","Ya Fei explains that Lei Lei's grandfather is a Mite'er elder and that she cannot find a Soul Power item there.","Hai Bodong pays for four herbs with a Purple Gold Card, reserved for Dou Wang and above.","Elder Lei Ou blocks the sale and threatens Ya Fei with dismissal and concubinage.","Hai Bodong asks whether Mite'er Tengshan is still alive, then overpowers Lei Ou with his Dou Qi.","Ya Fei deducts 500,000 gold coins, half price for a Dou Huang, and the herbs are delivered.","Nalan Yanran arrives; Hai Bodong recognises her from Mo Cheng's birthday banquet."],"introduced":["Lei Lei","Lei Ou","Purple Gold Card","Acting Supervising Elder","Mite'er Tengshan (named)","Senate Meeting (Mite'er family)","joss stick deadline"],"cultivation":"Ya Fei says she is a Dou Zhe. Hai Bodong is revealed as a strong Dou Huang.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":37,"title":"The Reward Xiao Yan Needs","summary":"Nalan Yanran asks Ya Fei to find an alchemist with a Heavenly Flame, because Gu He says only such a flame can draw the Searing Poison out of her grandfather Nalan Jie, and the Nalan Clan offers its treasures as a reward. Ya Fei shows Xiao Yan the reward list: it includes the Seven Magical Green Spirit Saliva, which restores Soul Power, so he decides to treat the old man despite his grudge, and she gives him an item that hides his scent. On his way he is ambushed by a Dou Huang who knows he is Xiao Yan of Wu Tan City; Xiao Yan holds him off with Octane Blast until Hai Bodong arrives and the attacker withdraws. Mite'er Tengshan strips Lei Ou of his post as Elder, sends him to a border city for three years and puts Ya Fei in charge of the headquarters auction house. Tengshan asks Hai Bodong to come home, but Hai Bodong says he must stay as Xiao Yan's guard for now. At the Nalan Residence, masked and calling himself Yan Xiao, Xiao Yan meets Nalan Su, who doubts that a second-tier alchemist can succeed where Gu He failed.","events":["Nalan Yanran tells Ya Fei about the Searing Poison and Gu He's verdict that a Heavenly Flame is needed.","Ya Fei shows Xiao Yan the reward: the Seven Magical Green Spirit Saliva.","Ya Fei gives Xiao Yan a scent-hiding item for his visit to the Nalan Residence.","A hidden Dou Huang ambushes Xiao Yan; Hai Bodong arrives and the attacker leaves, calling him Ice Emperor.","Mite'er Tengshan demotes Lei Ou and makes Ya Fei head of the headquarters auction house.","Hai Bodong tells Tengshan he is bound to guard Xiao Yan for now.","Xiao Yan, as Yan Xiao, meets Nalan Su at the Nalan Residence."],"introduced":["Seven Magical Green Spirit Saliva","Nalan Jie","Nalan Residence","Thousands-Year-Old Red Fruit","Searing Iron Poison Weed (Rank Five Magical Beast)","Yan Xiao (Xiao Yan's alias)","Mite'er Tengshan","Nalan Su","the dark Dou Huang who ambushes Xiao Yan","North Region"],"confidence":"high"},{"ep":38,"title":"The Heavenly Flame Cure","summary":"Nalan Su gathers alchemists, but none can remove the Searing Poison from Nalan Jie, and they scorn the masked second-tier alchemist Yan Xiao until he shows them his Heavenly Flame. Xiao Yan warns that the chance of success is below 50 percent and begins guiding the flame into Nalan Jie's body, while the old man, waking, blames Nalan Yanran's broken engagement for the poison flaring up. Meanwhile Hai Bodong meets Mite'er Tengshan, now a Dou Wang, who tells him Yun Shan, the Misty Cloud Sect's former leader, is in seclusion trying to reach Dou Zong and that the Imperial Family knows Hai Bodong is back. Nalan Yanran, thirteen days from the Three-year Agreement, admits she shamed the Xiao Clan but still insists she was not wrong, and remembers the repudiation letter Xiao Yan left her. Xiao Yan says the poison runs too deep to remove at once and will take at least seven days. Nalan Yanran tests his Soul Power as she sees him out, an imperial agent reports Hai Bodong and the Heavenly Flame alchemist to the throne, and Xiao Yan finds that the Searing Poison that slipped into his own body is full of pure energy.","events":["The assembled alchemists give up; Nalan Su's guests mock Yan Xiao until he shows the Heavenly Flame.","Xiao Yan begins detoxification with a success rate below 50 percent.","Hai Bodong and Mite'er Tengshan discuss Yun Shan's seclusion and the Imperial Family.","Nalan Jie scolds Nalan Yanran for calling off the engagement.","Nalan Yanran recalls the repudiation letter that expelled her from the Xiao Clan.","The first session ends; Xiao Yan says he needs at least seven days.","Nalan Yanran probes his Soul Power; an imperial agent reports Hai Bodong's return.","Xiao Yan finds pure Dou Qi energy inside the Searing Poison he absorbed."],"introduced":["Yun Shan (former leader of the Misty Cloud Sect)","Repudiation Letter","Snakemen Clan fortifying the desert","Jia Ma Imperial Family (as a power watching Hai Bodong)"],"cultivation":"Hai Bodong tells Mite'er Tengshan he is a Dou Wang now. Yun Shan is said to be in seclusion trying to reach Dou Zong.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":39,"title":"The Trading Market","summary":"Xiao Yan finds that the Searing Poison in his body carries pure energy built up by a strong Dou Wang, and that refining it could lift him toward Da Dou Shi. The poison has mutated so his Heavenly Flame cannot burn it out, and it has blackened one of his fingers; Hai Bodong recoils when Xiao Yan tests the Black Finger on him. At the Alchemist Association's Free Trading Market, Xiao Yan meets Lin Fei, who tells him Gu He's disciple Liu Ling will enter the Alchemist Conference. He saves Xue Mei from a third-tier alchemist who cheated her over a fourth-tier prescription and the tinder for a Peach Blossom Flame, and his Black Finger forces the man to back down and apologise. Over tea, Ao Tuo and Fu Lan Ke of Black Rock City see that he is now at least a Five-Star Dou Shi. When Ao Tuo says the conference winner gets the prescription for the Thawing Spirit Pill, a sixth-tier pill that heals the soul, Xiao Yan agrees to compete for Black Rock City under the name Yan Xiao.","events":["Xiao Yan absorbs pure energy from the Searing Poison and grows stronger.","Hai Bodong warns that the poison has mutated; Xiao Yan's finger has turned black.","At the Free Trading Market Xiao Yan meets Lin Fei, who talks about Liu Ling.","A rogue third-tier alchemist cheats Xue Mei over a prescription and the Peach Blossom Flame tinder.","Xiao Yan's Black Finger makes the man apologise.","Ao Tuo and Fu Lan Ke meet Xiao Yan for tea and praise his growth.","Ao Tuo explains the conference prize, the Thawing Spirit Pill prescription.","Xiao Yan agrees to enter for Black Rock City as Yan Xiao; the qualifying round is in three days."],"introduced":["Black Finger","Free Trading Market","Alchemist Association Headquarters","Peach Blossom Flame (tinder)","Soul Trace / Soul Memory of a prescription","Thawing Spirit Pill (sixth-tier)","honorary elder of the Alchemist Association","Liu Ling (named)"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan thinks a few more rounds of the poison's energy could make him a Da Dou Shi; Black Rock City's alchemists say he is at least a Five-Star Dou Shi.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":40,"title":"Liu Ling and Princess Yue Er","summary":"At the Nalan Residence, Gu He's disciple Liu Ling brings a pill for Nalan Jie and asks to meet the alchemist with the Heavenly Flame, but Xiao Yan gives him little. Nalan Jie, nearly cured, gives Xiao Yan herbs and promises his help in future. Nalan Yanran tells Liu Ling she sees him only as a friend, and he vows to prove himself by winning the Alchemist Conference. Refining the Searing Poison lifts Xiao Yan to Seven-Star Dou Shi, but the poison grows stronger each time he treats Nalan Jie and brings a nightmare of Nalan Yanran calling him trash. At the Alchemist Association's internal test, Princess Yue Er of the Jia Ma Imperial Family, a third-tier alchemist and disciple of Chairman Fa Ma, demands to see his Heavenly Flame and attacks him when he refuses. Fa Ma and Gu He arrive, Gu He asks to see the flame too, and when Xiao Yan refuses again Gu He wonders whether they have met before.","events":["Liu Ling brings Gu He's pill to the Nalan Residence and meets Yan Xiao.","Nalan Jie rewards Xiao Yan with herbs; one more treatment is needed.","Nalan Yanran turns Liu Ling down; he vows to win the Alchemist Conference.","Xiao Yan breaks through to Seven-Star Dou Shi using the poison's energy.","The poison gives him a nightmare of Nalan Yanran and his father; Hai Bodong urges him to stop.","At the internal test the imperial carriage brings Princess Yue Er, who attacks Yan Xiao.","Fa Ma and Gu He arrive; Gu He asks to see the Heavenly Flame and is refused."],"introduced":["Liu Ling","Princess Yue Er","Fa Ma (chairman of the Alchemist Association)","internal test of the Alchemist Conference","Jia Ma Imperial Family carriage"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan breaks through to Seven-Star Dou Shi by refining the Searing Poison's energy. Princess Yue Er was promoted to third-tier alchemist half a year ago.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":41,"title":"The Qualifying Test","summary":"Gu He tells Yan Xiao that his master understands Heavenly Flames better than he does and asks where to find him, but Xiao Yan says his master meets no outsiders. Chairman Fa Ma explains that candidates recommended by the branches must refine a herb, the Black Iron Spiritual Leaf, into as pure an extract as possible before the timer runs out. Xiao Yan keeps his Green Lotus Core Flame hidden so that Gu He will not recognise it, and works with the Purple Flame instead. Gu He says he returns to the Misty Cloud Sect the next day and hints that such a talent belongs there, while over drinks Hai Bodong asks after the darkness-type Dou Huang and hears that Chu Yun Empire spies are gathering in the capital. Liu Ling and Princess Yue Er finish quickly, but the Searing Poison flares inside Xiao Yan and he falls far behind. He fights the poison down with willpower and finishes the extraction just as the round ends.","events":["Gu He praises Yan Xiao's unseen master and asks to visit him.","Ao Tuo introduces Yan Xiao to Gu He and Fa Ma.","Fa Ma sets the test: extract the herbs to the purest state within the time limit.","Xiao Yan uses the Purple Flame to hide his Heavenly Flame from Gu He.","Fa Ma and Gu He discuss the Chu Yun Empire's three-tier entrants.","Hai Bodong's friend promises a bounty in the North Region for the darkness-type Dou Huang and warns of Chu Yun spies.","The Searing Poison flares; Xiao Yan suppresses it while Liu Ling and Yue Er finish.","Xiao Yan completes the extraction at the last moment."],"introduced":["Black Iron Spiritual Leaf","herb extraction test","darkness-type Dou Qi","Chu Yun Empire Alchemist Association spies"],"confidence":"high"},{"ep":42,"title":"Nine Points","summary":"Xiao Yan finishes his Black Iron Spiritual Leaf extract just in time, to the relief of Ao Tuo. The extracts go into a Purity Meter scored out of ten, with four needed to pass. Liu Ling refined his six times and scores seven, Princess Yue Er's five refinements score 6.5, and the crowd laughs when Yan Xiao says he refined his eight times, until the meter shows nine. Yan Xiao takes first place, Gu He invites him to the Misty Cloud Sect and offers to make his master an honorary elder, and Princess Yue Er invites him to meet her great-grandfather Jia Xing Tian, a Dou Huang of the imperial family. Xiao Yan brushes them off and asks Ao Tuo to keep his identity secret. On the way to the Nalan Residence, Hai Bodong senses someone following them and goes to deal with it alone, and Xiao Yan walks into a banquet where Ya Fei greets Yan Xiao as an old friend in front of Nalan Yanran.","events":["Xiao Yan finishes the extraction at the last second.","The Purity Meter is unveiled; four points are needed to pass.","Liu Ling scores seven with six refinements; Yue Er scores 6.5 with five.","Yan Xiao claims eight refinements and scores nine, taking first place.","Ao Tuo agrees to keep Yan Xiao's identity secret.","Gu He and Princess Yue Er court Yan Xiao; she names Jia Xing Tian as her great-grandfather.","Hai Bodong leaves to confront someone tailing them.","At the Nalan Residence banquet Ya Fei greets Yan Xiao warmly before Nalan Yanran."],"introduced":["Purity Meter","Jia Xing Tian (named)","Top Ten of the Jia Ma Empire (Jia Xing Tian among them)","foreign participants skip the internal test"],"cultivation":"Princess Yue Er says Jia Xing Tian is a strong Dou Huang of the imperial family and one of the Top Ten in the Jia Ma Empire. A third-tier alchemist usually manages five refinements.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":43,"title":"Mu Zhan at the Banquet","summary":"At the Nalan Clan's banquet for Nalan Jie's recovery, Ya Fei acts close to Yan Xiao in front of Nalan Yanran and then takes him to meet the guests. Nalan Su presents Nalan Jie, the Lionheart Commander of the Jia Ma Empire, and Mite'er Tengshan greets Yan Xiao warmly, which annoys Nalan Jie. Mu Zhan of the Mu Clan, back from the border army and obsessed with Ya Fei, attacks Yan Xiao to warn him off her. Xiao Yan holds his own until Mu Zhan summons Dou Qi Armor and Green Wooden Thorn, and Nalan Yanran stops the fight with her Thousand Wind Blade. Nalan Jie and Tengshan both warn Mu Zhan that Yan Xiao is their friend, and Mu Zhan backs off but says he looks forward to fighting again. Tengshan tells Ya Fei to take good care of Yan Xiao, and the two slip away from the banquet.","events":["Ya Fei plays up her closeness to Yan Xiao in front of Nalan Yanran.","Nalan Su introduces Nalan Jie, the Lionheart Commander, to the guests.","Mite'er Tengshan greets Yan Xiao; Nalan Jie grumbles that Tengshan is courting him.","Liu Ling and Princess Yue Er watch, and Yue Er hints trouble is coming.","Mu Zhan attacks Yan Xiao over Ya Fei.","Mu Zhan summons Dou Qi Armor; Nalan Yanran breaks up the fight.","Nalan Jie and Tengshan warn Mu Zhan; Tengshan threatens to have Mu Chen send him back to the border."],"introduced":["Mu Zhan","Mu Clan","Mu Chen (Mu Zhan's father, named)","Lionheart Commander","Dou Qi Armor (exclusive to Da Dou Shi)","Green Wooden Thorn","Thousand Wind Blade"],"cultivation":"Mu Zhan summons Dou Qi Armor, said to be exclusive to a Da Dou Shi. Nalan Yanran is said to have grown much stronger in three years (no rank given).","confidence":"high"},{"ep":44,"title":"The Seven Magical Green Spirit Saliva","summary":"Jia Xing Tian, guardian of the Jia Ma Imperial Family, finds Hai Bodong, and the old rivals trade words and blows, with Hai Bodong raising a Black Ice Shield. Ya Fei admits she used Yan Xiao to keep Mu Zhan away, and Mite'er Tengshan urges her to pursue Yan Xiao, revealing that the family elders have voted for her to marry Mu Zhan. Xiao Yan removes the last of the Searing Poison, and Nalan Jie explains how the Nalan Clan survives between the Imperial Family and the Misty Cloud Sect before handing over the Seven Magical Green Spirit Saliva, the plant he was poisoned while harvesting. Ya Fei resolves to take charge of the Mite'er family herself rather than be married off. Leaving with her, Xiao Yan senses two Dou Huangs clashing, and when Mu Zhan attacks again Xiao Yan takes to the air on Dou Qi wings, a lost Flying Dou Skill that stuns the onlookers.","events":["Jia Xing Tian confronts Hai Bodong about the Tager Desert and the Snakemen Clan; they fight.","Ya Fei apologises to Xiao Yan for using him against Mu Zhan.","Tengshan tells Ya Fei the elders voted for a marriage with Mu Zhan.","Xiao Yan finishes Nalan Jie's detoxification.","Nalan Jie and Nalan Su explain the Nalan Clan's position and Jia Xing Tian's role as imperial guardian.","Nalan Jie gives Xiao Yan the Seven Magical Green Spirit Saliva.","Ya Fei decides to become the one in charge of the Mite'er family.","Mu Zhan attacks; Xiao Yan flies with a lost Flying Dou Skill."],"introduced":["Black Ice Shield","mysterious exotic beast protecting the imperial family","Flying Dou Skill (lost)","diplomatic marriage between the Mite'er family and Mu Clan"],"confidence":"medium"},{"ep":45,"title":"One Chance for Yao Lao","summary":"Jia Xing Tian and Hai Bodong end their fight above the capital as sparring, and Jia Xing Tian welcomes his old friend back as a match for the Misty Cloud Sect. Jia Xing Tian tests Yan Xiao with a light blow and asks who his master is, but Xiao Yan says his master lives hidden in the mountains. Hai Bodong reckons Jia Xing Tian is an Eight-Star or Nine-Star Dou Huang close to Dou Zong, and warns that he watches the Mite'er family, the Nalan Clan and the Mu Clan and will try to recruit Xiao Yan. In his room, Xiao Yan refines the Seven Magical Green Spirit Saliva with the Heavenly Flame and feeds it to Yao Lao; it sets off one surge of his master's Soul Power but does not wake him. Meanwhile Chu Yun Empire agents ready a plot against the Jia Ma Empire's alchemists. On the road to the capital, Xiao Zhan saves a Mite'er family man from Chu Yun Empire killers and asks him to take him to Ya Fei.","events":["Jia Xing Tian and Hai Bodong call off their bout and greet each other as old friends.","Jia Xing Tian tests Yan Xiao and asks about his master.","Hai Bodong rates Jia Xing Tian an Eight- or Nine-Star Dou Huang near Dou Zong.","Xiao Yan refines the Seven Magical Green Spirit Saliva while Hai Bodong stands guard.","Yao Lao's Soul Power surges once, but he does not wake.","Chu Yun Empire men prepare their plan before dawn.","Xiao Zhan rescues a Mite'er family man attacked by Chu Yun Empire killers.","The two head for Ya Fei so Xiao Zhan can look for Xiao Yan."],"introduced":["Ice Dragon (Hai Bodong's skill, mentioned)","Furious Lion Roar","Raging Lion"],"cultivation":"Hai Bodong says Jia Xing Tian is either an Eight-Star or a Nine-Star Dou Huang and could break through to Dou Zong. The Seven Magical Green Spirit Saliva fails to wake Yao Lao.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":46,"title":"The Alchemist Conference Opens","summary":"Ao Tuo leads Yan Xiao and Hai Bodong to the Alchemist Conference, where more than 2,000 alchemists will compete in an elimination round and a final. Chairman Fa Ma recognises Hai Bodong as the Ice Emperor, and Princess Yue Er introduces her elder sister Princess Yao Ye, who commands the soldiers guarding the event. Liu Ling vows to beat Yan Xiao in front of Nalan Yanran, and when Xiao Yan is mocked as a coward he crosses to his seat with a control of air that even Dou Wangs could not match. Mu Chen, head of the Mu Clan, tells his son Mu Zhan to court Ya Fei openly and stop picking on Yan Xiao. Fa Ma opens the conference and sets the first round: refine a pill from the association's prescription before a giant hourglass runs out. A veiled 17-year-old from the Chu Yun Empire shows the Soul Power of at least a fourth-tier alchemist and sees through the sand drift technique used to check her, while other contestants' cauldrons explode because the prescription has a hidden flaw.","events":["Ao Tuo brings Yan Xiao and Hai Bodong to the VIP area.","Fa Ma recognises Hai Bodong, the Ice Emperor once sealed by Medusa.","Jia Xing Tian arrives; Yue Er introduces Princess Yao Ye.","Liu Ling and Yue Er make showy entrances; Xiao Yan answers a taunt with precise air control.","Mu Chen restrains Mu Zhan and praises Yan Xiao.","Soldiers report an enemy intrusion to General Yao Ye.","Fa Ma opens the conference and the first round begins.","The veiled Chu Yun girl draws suspicion; flawed prescriptions make cauldrons explode."],"introduced":["Princess Yao Ye","Mu Chen","elimination round and finals","giant hourglass","sand drift technique","the veiled girl from the Chu Yun Empire (Yan Li)"],"cultivation":"The Chu Yun girl is a 17-year-old wearing a second-tier badge whose Soul Power means she is at least a fourth-tier alchemist.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":47,"title":"Death Paradise","summary":"The Chu Yun Empire backs Poison Masters, and orthodox alchemists despise the Chu Yun alchemists who mix poison arts into pill refining. Yan Li, the veiled girl from the Chu Yun Empire, is first to make a pill and mocks Jia Ma's alchemists as useless, while Hai Bodong and the elders cannot tell whether she is disguised. Yan Xiao finds the flaw in the prescription, the Thick Soil Mushroom, extracts all his herbs at once and pulls his pill out before it fully sets, and he takes the round. Other contestants pass only because he exposed the flaw. Princess Yao Ye invites him to her banquet for young alchemists, but he declines to rest for the final, and Liu Ling notes a strange scent around the Chu Yun girl. That night Yan Li springs a Death Paradise poison trap on Liu Ling and other alchemists, and finds that Xiao Yan is not affected by it.","events":["Narration explains the Chu Yun Empire's Poison Masters and the alchemists' contempt for them.","Cauldrons explode across the arena; the prescription is flawed.","Yan Li makes the first pill and taunts the Jia Ma Empire.","Yan Xiao extracts all the herbs at once and removes his pill early, winning the round.","Contestants credit Yan Xiao for spotting the problem with the Thick Soil Mushroom.","Princess Yao Ye invites Yan Xiao to a banquet; he declines.","Yan Li traps Liu Ling and others in Death Paradise; Xiao Yan arrives unaffected."],"introduced":["Poison Masters","Thick Soil Mushroom","pill fragrance","simultaneous herbal extraction","Death Paradise"],"confidence":"high"},{"ep":48,"title":"Yan Li Unmasked","summary":"On the night after the first round of the Alchemist Conference, an assassin attacks Xiao Yan and Hai Bodong drives him off. Xiao Yan blames the Chu Yun Empire alchemist he beat that day, and he and Hai Bodong go after her. At the Mite'er family's resthouse in the capital, Ya Fei welcomes Xiao Zhan, who has come to see his son, and tells him how far Xiao Yan has come. Xiao Yan realises the enemy plans to strike the royal banquet for the young alchemists and heads there to protect Ya Fei. Hai Bodong, Jia Xing Tian and Fa Ma corner the Chu Yun contestant, who drops the young girl's form and turns out to be Yan Li, deputy chairman of the Chu Yun Empire's Alchemist Association. Yan Li springs a poison prepared for a Dou Huang, and poison smoke fills the royal banquet hall.","events":["Xiao Yan feels the Searing Poison in his body react to the Chu Yun contestant.","An assassin attacks him at night; Hai Bodong saves him.","Ya Fei receives Xiao Zhan at the Mite'er resthouse in the capital and talks about Xiao Yan's three years.","Xiao Yan guesses the real target is the royal banquet and goes to protect Ya Fei, who has not attended it.","Princess Yao Ye's banquet honours the finalists of the Alchemist Conference.","Hai Bodong, Jia Xing Tian and Fa Ma find the Chu Yun contestant, who is really Yan Li disguised as a girl.","Yan Li uses a poison made for a Dou Huang; poison smoke spreads through the banquet."],"introduced":["Yan Li (deputy chairman of the Chu Yun Empire's Alchemist Association)","Searing Poison","Death Paradise","Mite'er family resthouse in the capital"],"cultivation":"Hai Bodong is called a Dou Huang (\"the strong Dou Huang from the Jia Ma Empire\"). No breakthroughs.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":49,"title":"The Poisoned Banquet","summary":"Xiao Yan reaches the royal banquet at Midhill Palace as poison smoke spreads and hands out antidote pills. Chu Yun Empire puppets attack the trapped young alchemists, but Princess Yao Ye arrives with soldiers and, with Xiao Yan and Princess Yue Er, wipes them out. Yao Ye had known the Chu Yun plan in advance and used the banquet as bait. Yan Li admits his own job was to expose himself and lure the strong away. Because he has destroyed the only Appearance Recovery Pill, Fa Ma cannot prove his disguise, so he is let go to face the finals. Fa Ma then asks Xiao Yan to beat Yan Li for the empire's honour and gives him the prescription and herbs for the Three Lines Green Spirit Pill.","events":["Xiao Yan arrives at the banquet and hands out antidotes.","Yan Li tells Hai Bodong, Jia Xing Tian and Fa Ma that his task was only to draw them away.","Chu Yun puppets attack the banquet at Midhill Palace; Yao Ye arrives with troops and Xiao Yan fights beside her.","Yao Ye reveals she had planned to trap the Chu Yun force all at once.","Yan Li says the Appearance Recovery Pill is destroyed, so his young face cannot be proven a disguise; Fa Ma lets him go.","Yue Er asks Xiao Yan for a date if she wins; Jia Xing Tian thanks him.","Fa Ma explains the final round: contestants bring their own prescriptions and herbs.","Fa Ma gives Xiao Yan a copy of the Three Lines Green Spirit Pill prescription and herbs for two attempts."],"introduced":["Midhill Palace","Chu Yun Empire puppets","Appearance Recovery Pill","Three Lines Green Spirit Pill (a Fourth-Tier Pill; One, Two and Three Lines grades)","Green Spirit Pill"],"cultivation":"None stated for Xiao Yan. Fa Ma says Yan Li must hold fourth-tier prescriptions and might try a Fifth-Tier Pill.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":50,"title":"Father in the Rain","summary":"Xiao Zhan visits his son in the capital, and Hai Bodong leaves them alone. Walking in the night rain, Xiao Yan tells his father he will soon reach Da Dou Shi and admits he must win the conference for his mysterious teacher. Xiao Zhan comforts him that his teacher would never blame him, and he leaves at dawn without a word. Next day Yao Ye guards the venue for the finals while Jia Xing Tian and Fa Ma argue over stopping the contest. The final round opens, and Yue Er brings out the imperial Cyan Cauldron while Liu Ling uses Gu He's Volcanic Cauldron. Xiao Yan turns down Yue Er's cauldron and uses his teacher's plain one. Yue Er calls up the Dry Blue Water Flame, and Xiao Yan answers with his Heavenly Flame, and every flame on the square bows to it.","events":["Hai Bodong tells Xiao Zhan how Xiao Yan cured Nalan Jie's poison despite his grudge.","Xiao Zhan meets Xiao Yan in the capital; they walk and shelter from the rain.","Xiao Yan says he is close to Da Dou Shi and confesses his guilt about his teacher; his father reassures him.","Xiao Zhan leaves at dawn after bringing his sleeping son back.","Yao Ye's troops guard the finals; Jia Xing Tian and Fa Ma disagree about the contest.","The final round starts; the Cyan Cauldron (Rank Five) and the Volcanic Cauldron are brought out.","Xiao Yan refuses Yue Er's offer of a cauldron; Yue Er's Dry Blue Water Flame meets Xiao Yan's Heavenly Flame."],"introduced":["Cyan Cauldron (Rank Five Medicinal Cauldron of the imperial family)","Volcanic Cauldron (Gu He's, now Liu Ling's)","Shock-Wave Dragon (Jia Ma imperial guardian beast)","Dry Blue Water Flame","Colored Pill Fragrance (named EP51)"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan: \"I'm about to advance into a Da Dou Shi soon\" (still a Dou Shi). Xiao Zhan replies \"You're about to catch up to me.\"","confidence":"high"},{"ep":51,"title":"The Poison in the Square","summary":"Nalan Yanran watches the finals with her grandfather Nalan Jie, who urges her to apologise to Xiao Yan after the Three-Year Agreement; she refuses. Xiao Yan refines his herbs first with his Heavenly Flame and attempts a Two Lines Green Spirit Pill by switching flames. Black dust from Yan Li's poison-soaked body drifts over the square and ruins other contestants' pills. Fa Ma will not stop the contest, because no rule forbids it. Xiao Yan's pill fails, while Yan Li forms a pill that gives off Colored Pill Fragrance, a strong Fourth-Tier Pill. Shaken, Xiao Yan remembers his father's words and Yao Lao's lessons, lets go of his guilt, and his Soul Power surges.","events":["Nalan Jie tells Nalan Yanran she should apologise to Xiao Yan; she refuses.","Spectators note Xiao Yan became a Dou Zhe within a year of leaving Wu Tan City.","Xiao Yan finishes refining herbs first and tries a Two Lines pill by switching flames.","Poisonous black dust from Yan Li spoils other contestants' refinements.","Fa Ma and Jia Xing Tian decide not to punish Yan Li.","Xiao Yan's pill fails; Yan Li's pill releases Colored Pill Fragrance.","Xiao Yan recalls his father's and Yao Lao's words, and his Soul Power grows stronger."],"introduced":["Poison Master techniques in pill refining","Colored Pill Fragrance (only Fifth-Tier Pills release it)","Two Lines Green Spirit Pill"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan's Soul Power grows stronger (a soul breakthrough under pressure). Yan Li is a fourth-tier alchemist.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":52,"title":"Champion of the Alchemist Conference","summary":"To make a Three Lines Green Spirit Pill, Xiao Yan calls up a third flame: the Bone Chilling Flame Yao Lao left in the ring. The square turns cold, and the crowd is stunned that he holds two Heavenly Flames. His cheap cauldron cannot take three flames and explodes. Remembering Yao Lao's lesson, he shapes the Bone Chilling Flame into a cauldron and refines without one. Yan Li sends his poison servants to disrupt him, but Yue Er, Liu Ling and the other contestants pool their Soul Power to shield him. Yan Li finishes a Purple Heart Barrier Breaking Pill, but Xiao Yan's Three Lines pill rates as a strong Fifth-Tier Pill and Fa Ma names him champion. Xiao Yan collapses, and the fleeing Yan Li is caught; he begs to be made a spy, and Hai Bodong refuses.","events":["Xiao Yan's Soul Power breakthrough steadies his refining.","He summons the Bone Chilling Flame, his second Heavenly Flame.","Yan Li calls his loyal servants to attack; Yao Ye's soldiers stand ready.","Xiao Yan's cauldron explodes; he refines inside the Bone Chilling Flame with no cauldron.","Yue Er, Liu Ling and the other young alchemists release Soul Power to protect him.","Yan Li completes a Purple Heart Barrier Breaking Pill (on par with Fifth-Tier).","Xiao Yan's Three Lines Green Spirit Pill wins; Fa Ma declares 'Yan Xiao' champion.","Xiao Yan faints; Yan Li is caught fleeing and begs to spy for Jia Ma; Hai Bodong refuses."],"introduced":["Bone Chilling Flame (named in EP53)","Refining pills without a cauldron","Purple Heart Barrier Breaking Pill"],"cultivation":"No realm change. Xiao Yan's Soul Power has broken through; Fa Ma: \"something that even some of the elders of our association won't be able to achieve.\"","confidence":"high"},{"ep":53,"title":"The Thawing Spirit Pill Prescription","summary":"Xiao Yan wakes at the Alchemist Association, and an attendant called Xun Er leads him to Fa Ma's study. Fa Ma gives him the prize, the Sixth-Tier prescription for the Thawing Spirit Pill, and the badge of an honorary elder of the association. On the way out, Medusa takes over the Heaven Swallowing Python's body and demands the prescription. Xiao Yan says he is not yet a fourth-tier alchemist, but he promises to refine the pill soon. He finds a farewell letter from Xiao Zhan, who has already left the capital. Nalan Yanran returns to the Misty Cloud Sect, where Elder Yun Leng has invited the empire's great forces to watch her duel with Xiao Yan. The episode then goes back years to the capital, where the child Nalan Yanran fights Mu Zhan's gang and Xiao Zhan brings the young Xiao Yan to visit Nalan Jie.","events":["Xiao Yan wakes; an association attendant named Xun Er guides him to Chairman Fa Ma.","Nalan Jie, recovered, sends Nalan Yanran back to the Misty Cloud Sect.","Fa Ma gives Xiao Yan the Thawing Spirit Pill prescription (Sixth-Tier) and an honorary elder's badge.","Medusa emerges, having subdued the python's soul, and demands the prescription; Xiao Yan asks for time.","Xiao Yan reads Xiao Zhan's farewell letter.","At the Misty Cloud Sect, Yun Leng tells Nalan Yanran he has invited the empire's forces to the duel.","Flashback: young Nalan Yanran fights Mu Zhan's gang; Xiao Zhan and the young Xiao Yan visit Nalan Jie."],"introduced":["Thawing Spirit Pill prescription (Sixth-Tier)","Honorary elder badge of the Alchemist Association","Breaking Adversity Pill (Sixth-Tier, made earlier for Hai Bodong)","Xun Er (association attendant)"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan: \"I'm not even a fourth-tier alchemist.\" Medusa has subdued the Heaven Swallowing Python's soul enough to come out.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":54,"title":"How Nalan Yanran Became a Disciple","summary":"This episode is a flashback to Nalan Yanran's childhood. Years ago Xiao Lin, Xiao Yan's grandfather, saved Nalan Jie in battle, and Nalan Jie betrothed his granddaughter to Xiao Yan, born on the same day. After Xiao Lin died, the Xiao Clan lost its place in the capital and moved to Wu Tan City. Young Nalan Yanran joins the Misty Cloud Sect, where Yun Yun and an instructor, Mr. Han, teach the new disciples the Covering Sun Cloud Formation. When a Cloud Beast breaks loose during the lesson, Nalan Yanran keeps fighting, and Yun Yun takes her as her first direct disciple. Years later she learns that Xiao Yan of Wu Tan City is her fiance. Desperate for the Gate of Life and Death to recognise her, she keeps pushing herself even when Yun Yun warns her it could kill her.","events":["Narration: Xiao Lin and Nalan Jie's bond, the betrothal, Xiao Lin's death and the Xiao Clan's move to Wu Tan City.","Nalan Jie insists the betrothal stands; he gives his granddaughter a portrait before she leaves.","Young Nalan Yanran tells him she beat Mu Zhan for bothering Ya Fei and hears about her betrothal for the first time.","At the Misty Cloud Sect, Yun Yun teaches the Covering Sun Cloud Formation; Mr. Han leads the exercise.","A Cloud Beast goes wild; Nalan Yanran helps hold it off and Yun Yun makes her a direct disciple.","Years later a junior mentions Xiao Yan of the Xiao Clan is Nalan's fiance.","Nalan Yanran forces herself at the Gate of Life and Death against Yun Yun's warning."],"introduced":["Xiao Lin (Xiao Yan's grandfather, mentioned)","Covering Sun Cloud Formation","Cloud Beast","Shield Defense / Cloud Shield","Gate of Life and Death","Young Lady of the Misty Cloud Sect","Mr. Han (Misty Cloud Sect instructor)"],"confidence":"high"},{"ep":55,"title":"The Succession Ceremony","summary":"The flashback goes on: the Gate of Life and Death accepts Nalan Yanran, and she is to become Young Lady of the Misty Cloud Sect. An old sect rule says the Young Lady must never be involved with a man, and Elder Yun Leng reminds her of it. Nalan Jie says she will marry Xiao Yan next year, and Liu Ling learns of the betrothal. Nalan Yanran cries to Yun Yun, who tells her to get to know her fiance first and promises to back her either way. A senior's report that Xiao Yan lost his power to gather Dou Qi three years ago turns her against him. At the ceremony, before Jia Xing Tian, Fa Ma and the sect, a man exposes her betrothal. Nalan Yanran declares that it was her family's choice and that she will not honour it.","events":["Nalan Yanran shows Nalan Jie her ceremony cape; Ge Ye is assigned as her guard.","Nalan Jie mentions her marriage to Xiao Yan; Yun Leng overhears and warns her of the rule against men.","Liu Ling reveals he knows of the betrothal.","Yun Yun comforts Nalan Yanran and promises to stand by her.","A senior calls Xiao Yan 'trash' who lost his Dou Qi three years ago.","At the succession ceremony, someone raises her betrothal before the guests.","Nalan Yanran publicly rejects the betrothal as her family's decision (end, in ep56 file)."],"introduced":["Succession ceremony of the Young Lady","Misty Cloud Sect rule against the Young Lady being involved with men"],"cultivation":"Yun Leng: Yun Yun \"managed to become Dou Huang at such a young age\" (in the past).","confidence":"high"},{"ep":56,"title":"The Repudiation Letter","summary":"Back in the present, Xiao Yan takes the Three Lines Green Spirit Pill after the conference. Its three-flame energy lifts him to Eight-Star Dou Shi and forms the Dou Crystal in his body, but the breakthrough nearly overwhelms him. He remembers the day three years ago when Nalan Yanran and Ge Ye came to the Xiao Clan to break off the engagement and offered Gu He's Qi Gathering Pill as compensation. Xiao Yan refused the pill, accepted her challenge to a duel at the Misty Cloud Sect in three years, and wrote her a Repudiation Letter instead. In the present he breaks through to Da Dou Shi, and his Dou Qi can now leave his body. He tells Hai Bodong he no longer hates Nalan Yanran and only wants to restore his father's dignity. Next morning he arrives at the Misty Cloud Sect.","events":["Xiao Yan takes the Three Lines Green Spirit Pill, reaches Eight-Star Dou Shi and forms a Dou Crystal.","Flashback: Nalan Yanran and Ge Ye visit the Xiao Clan; the elders mock Xiao Yan.","Ge Ye offers a Qi Gathering Pill made by Gu He; Nalan Yanran offers more pills and sect membership.","Xiao Yan refuses; she sets a match at the Misty Cloud Sect in three years.","Xiao Yan writes a Repudiation Letter and vows to come to the Misty Cloud Sect.","In the present he becomes a Da Dou Shi and talks with Hai Bodong about the duel.","He arrives at the Misty Cloud Sect: 'I'm Xiao Yan, from the Xiao Clan.'"],"introduced":["Dou Crystal","Qi Gathering Pill","Repudiation Letter","Nalan Su (Nalan Yanran's father, mentioned)","Second Elder of the Xiao Clan"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan: Three Lines Green Spirit Pill takes him to Eight-Star Dou Shi and forms the Dou Crystal; then he breaks through to Da Dou Shi (\"it seems like you have become a Da Dou Shi\"). A Qi Gathering Pill gives a 9th-stage Dou Qi user a 100% chance to become a Dou Zhe.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":57,"title":"The Three-Year Agreement Begins","summary":"Xiao Yan faces Nalan Yanran at the Misty Cloud Sect, watched by its disciples, the empire's great forces and Nalan Jie. First Elder Yun Leng tells him life and death are up to fate. Nalan Yanran opens with the Wind Spirit Fractal Sword, a Xuan Class Medium Rank Dou Skill, and the Misty Cloud Sect's Wind Afterimages. Xiao Yan drops his heavy black ruler, gains speed and answers with Octane Blast. Gu He, the Pill King, arrives and greets Jia Xing Tian, Fa Ma and Hai Bodong. Nalan Yanran shows that she is now a Da Dou Shi with Dou Qi Armour, and Xiao Yan matches her. They argue over the past, and at the end she uses her trump card while Xiao Yan forms the Angry Buddha Lotus Flame.","events":["Disciples and guests mock or wonder at Xiao Yan; Nalan Jie praises his bearing.","Yun Leng opens the duel: life and death are up to fate.","Nalan Yanran uses the Wind Spirit Fractal Sword.","Xiao Yan drops his black ruler and hits with Octane Blast; she counters with Wind Afterimages.","Gu He arrives and meets Jia Xing Tian, Fa Ma and Hai Bodong.","Nalan Yanran reveals she is a Da Dou Shi; Xiao Yan uses Dou Qi Armour too.","She says he is not qualified to be her man; he says he no longer hates her.","(In ep58 file) the crowd realises Yan Xiao is Xiao Yan; he fuses Heavenly Flame and Dou Qi into the Angry Buddha Lotus Flame."],"introduced":["Wind Spirit Fractal Sword (Xuan Class Medium Rank Dou Skill)","Wind Afterimages","Octane Blast","Dou Qi Armor","Angry Buddha Lotus Flame","First Elder (Yun Leng)"],"cultivation":"Nalan Yanran \"has already advanced to become a Da Dou Shi\". Xiao Yan is also a Da Dou Shi (Dou Qi Armour). A two-star Da Dou Shi is named at 548.8 (see flags).","confidence":"high"},{"ep":58,"title":"Angry Buddha Lotus Flame","summary":"Xiao Yan's Angry Buddha Lotus Flame clashes with Nalan Yanran's Wind's Peak, Dazzling Sunset, and the sect raises shields against the blast. He takes to the air with Dou Qi wings, and a panicking Ge Ye shouts that Xiao Yan must be a Dou Huang. Xiao Yan wins and tells her the agreement is fulfilled and they will never cross paths again. Nalan Yanran tries to take her own life to save the sect's honour, and he stops her and sets them both free. As he leaves, First Elder Yun Leng accuses him of killing the sect's External Deacon Mo Cheng. Ge Ye testifies that the killer was a masked Dou Huang with a white flame. When Xiao Yan refuses to stay, three Dou Wang elders attack him, while Jia Xing Tian and Fa Ma decline to step in.","events":["The Angry Buddha Lotus Flame meets Wind's Peak, Dazzling Sunset; elders raise shields.","Xiao Yan flies on Dou Qi wings; Ge Ye claims he is a Dou Huang and is told to mind his place.","Xiao Yan wins; Nalan Yanran reflects that 'Yan Xiao' charmed her and she still would refuse the marriage.","She tries to kill herself for the sect's honour; Xiao Yan stops her and declares them free.","Yun Leng stops him and accuses him of killing External Deacon Mo Cheng; Ge Ye describes a masked Dou Huang with a white flame.","Xiao Yan refuses to be held; the Enforcer Squad and three Dou Wangs attack.","He uses his Heavenly Flame against Wind's Bind and the Wind-Flame-Wood Barrier.","Jia Xing Tian and Fa Ma choose to wait and watch."],"introduced":["Wind's Peak, Dazzling Sunset","Mo Cheng (External Deacon of the Misty Cloud Sect, murdered)","Enforcer Squad","Wind's Bind","Wind-Flame-Wood Barrier","Flying Dou Skill"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan is a Da Dou Shi (\"He became a Da Dou Shi at such a young age\"). The three elders who attack him are Dou Wangs.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":59,"title":"Hai Bodong Steps In","summary":"Hai Bodong joins the fight to protect Xiao Yan from the Misty Cloud Sect. He meets Yun Leng again for the first time in years, but Yun Leng refuses to let the suspect in Mo Cheng's death go. The sect casts the Misty Cloud Formation, and Yun Lei and two other Dou Wangs hold Hai Bodong back with a fusion Dou Skill. Cornered, Xiao Yan wakes the Heaven Swallowing Python, which the sect takes for a Rank Five Magical Beast as strong as a Dou Wang. Hai Bodong breaks free with Mysterious Ice Dragon's Soar, and Xiao Yan wounds Yun Leng with Flame Splitting Tsunami. Furious, Yun Leng orders the whole sect to cast the Covering Sun Cloud Formation against them.","events":["Hai Bodong blocks an attack on Xiao Yan; onlookers are surprised he is alive.","Hai Bodong and Yun Leng speak of old times; Yun Leng refuses to release Xiao Yan.","Deacons cast the Misty Cloud Formation; Yun Lei and two others pin Hai Bodong.","Xiao Yan releases the Heaven Swallowing Python ('little one') to stop an elder.","Hai Bodong uses Ice Dou Qi and Mysterious Ice Dragon's Soar to break out.","Xiao Yan hits Yun Leng with Flame Splitting Tsunami, wounding him.","Yun Leng orders the Covering Sun Cloud Formation."],"introduced":["Yun Lei (Misty Cloud Sect Dou Wang)","Misty Cloud Formation","Fusion Dou Skill","Wind Shield","Black Rock Shield","Mysterious Ice Dragon's Soar","Flame Splitting Tsunami","Rank Five Magical Beast","Di Class (Dou Skill rank)"],"cultivation":"The Heaven Swallowing Python is called \"a Rank Five Magical Beast that's as strong as a strong Dou Wang\". Onlookers rate Flame Splitting Tsunami \"at least the Di Class\".","confidence":"high"},{"ep":60,"title":"Ling Ying and the Old Leader","summary":"A hidden protector named Ling Ying steps out to shield Xiao Yan from the Covering Sun Cloud Formation. He says he comes from beyond the Jia Ma Empire and has orders to bring Xiao Yan back unharmed, because his Young Lady wishes to protect him. With his Ten Thousand Binding Shadows he breaks the formation, and onlookers judge him at least a Seven-Star Dou Huang. Yun Leng then calls out Yun Shan, the sect's old leader, who has broken through to Dou Zong in seclusion. Yun Shan hears Yun Leng blame Xiao Yan for everything and decides the sect's reputation must be restored. He beats Hai Bodong, Ling Ying and the Heaven Swallowing Python and orders Xiao Yan to stay in the sect for a few years.","events":["Ling Ying appears and shames the Misty Cloud Sect for attacking a youth.","He says he must bring Xiao Yan back unharmed on someone else's orders.","Ten Thousand Binding Shadows; Ling Ying breaks the formation.","Hai Bodong recognises him as someone who once spared him.","Yun Shan, the former leader, comes out of seclusion as a Dou Zong.","Yun Leng blames Xiao Yan for Mo Cheng's death and the damage to the sect.","Yun Shan defeats Hai Bodong, Ling Ying and the python and tells Xiao Yan to stay."],"introduced":["Ling Ying","Ten Thousand Binding Shadows","Yun Shan (former leader, on screen)","Yun Po Tian (founder of the Misty Cloud Sect, named)","Thousand Flower Ice Mirror","Dou Zong","Misty Cloud Mountain"],"cultivation":"Yun Shan \"has broken through the Dou Huang barrier and ascended to Dou Zong\". Ling Ying is \"at least that of a Seven-Star Dou Huang\".","confidence":"high"},{"ep":61,"title":"A Deal with Medusa","summary":"Queen Medusa takes over the python's body and faces Yun Shan, who sees she has also become a Dou Zong. Unwilling to risk the fight, Yun Shan lets Xiao Yan go, warning him never to return. Yun Leng proposes seizing Xiao Yan's father instead. Hai Bodong heads back to the Mite'er family and asks Xiao Yan to deliver the Spiritual Recovery Purple Pill to the capital later. Ling Ying leaves, telling Xiao Yan to grow strong enough to choose the one he loves. Medusa agrees to protect Xiao Yan for one year, only when his life is at stake, in return for the Thawing Spirit Pill. On the road to Wu Tan City she makes him hunt herbs in markets and auctions and her temper frightens the townspeople and shopkeepers.","events":["Medusa appears; Yun Shan notes she has reached Dou Zong.","Yun Shan lets Xiao Yan leave, but only this once.","Yun Leng suggests bringing Xiao Zhan from Wu Tan City; Nalan Yanran weeps to Yun Yun.","Hai Bodong parts ways and warns Xiao Yan to be wary of Medusa.","Ling Ying leaves with advice about strength and love.","Medusa and Xiao Yan make a one-year deal for the Thawing Spirit Pill.","They search towns and auctions for herbs; Medusa causes trouble in a shoe shop."],"introduced":["One-year deal with Medusa","Spiritual Recovery Purple Pill (ingredients still missing)","Seven-Colored Heaven Swallowing Python (named)"],"cultivation":"Medusa: \"You've broken through the barriers of Dou Huang and joined the ranks of Dou Zong.\"","confidence":"high"},{"ep":62,"title":"The Xiao Clan Attacked","summary":"Masked attackers storm the Xiao Clan in Wu Tan City and toy with Xiao Zhan, who keeps standing so his people can escape. In a tavern, Xiao Yan hears that his duel is the talk of the empire and that the Xiao Clan is in trouble. He rushes home, refusing Medusa's demand to stop for herbs. At the Misty Cloud Sect, Yun Yun tells Yun Shan she sensed a presence full of death on her way back. In Wu Tan City, Ao Ba Pa and the alchemist teacher of Liu Xi try to force the weakened Xiao Clan to sell its market. Xiao Yan arrives, and Medusa, given a Tomb Monster Needle Fruit for her help, drives them off. The First Elder of the Xiao Clan then admits that Xiao Zhan is missing.","events":["Masked attackers hunt Xiao Zhan; he holds out for an incense stick of time.","Xiao Yan hears in a tavern that 'Yan Xiao' and Xiao Yan are the same and that the Xiao Clan is in trouble.","He turns down Medusa's herb hunt and heads for Wu Tan City.","Yun Yun reports to Yun Shan about a presence of death; Yun Shan then speaks with a hidden figure.","Ao Ba Pa and Liu Xi's teacher (a Six-Star Da Dou Shi) try to take over the Xiao Clan's market.","Xiao Yan arrives; Medusa's appearance sends the enemies fleeing.","The First Elder apologises; Xiao Zhan is missing."],"introduced":["Tomb Monster Needle Fruit","Snakemen Clan (Medusa's)","Liu Xi's teacher (alchemist)"],"cultivation":"Liu Xi's teacher \"has the power of a Six-Star Da Dou Shi\".","confidence":"high"},{"ep":63,"title":"Xiao Yan Goes After Yun Leng","summary":"Yun Yun asks Yun Leng why he, Yun Lei and Yun Sheng left the Misty Cloud Sect, and he calls it a private affair. In Wu Tan City, Xiao Yan learns that Yun Leng took his father, and the Xiao Clan vows to get Xiao Zhan back. He retakes the clan's stores from the Ao Ba Clan and sends his people east to Rock Desert City, where Xiao Ding and Xiao Li are, leaving the Mite'er family to run the stores. The ancestral jade shows Xiao Zhan's soul light growing weaker, so Xiao Yan flies to the Misty Cloud Sect with Medusa. At the gate he calls out Yun Leng and meets Yun Yun, the sect leader, whom he knew as Yun Zhi while she knew him as Yao Yan. Yun Shan offers money in place of justice, and Yun Leng boasts that he may have killed Xiao Zhan. Xiao Yan begins fusing his two Heavenly Flames, and the sect moves to seize him.","events":["Yun Yun questions Yun Leng about leaving the sect with Yun Lei and Yun Sheng.","The Xiao Clan learns the three attackers were from the Misty Cloud Sect and vows to save Xiao Zhan.","Xiao Yan retakes the clan's workshops and stores from the Ao Ba Clan and sends the clan to Rock Desert City.","Hai Bodong sees Xiao Yan heading for the Misty Cloud Sect and decides to follow.","Yun Shan rebukes Yun Leng for attacking the Xiao Clan without permission.","Xiao Yan arrives with Medusa and demands Yun Leng; Yun Yun turns out to be 'Yun Zhi'.","Yun Shan offers compensation; Xiao Yan refuses and Yun Leng taunts him about his father.","Xiao Yan starts fusing two Heavenly Flames as the sect closes in."],"introduced":["Rock Desert City","Ao Ba Clan","Mite'er Auction House","Shadow Guards (Hai Bodong's)","eastern region of the Empire"],"cultivation":"Xiao Zhan \"is only a Da Dou Shi\"; Yun Leng, Yun Lei and Yun Sheng are called \"three Dou Wangs\" (863).","confidence":"high"},{"ep":64,"title":"Yun Leng Falls","summary":"Medusa faces Yun Shan, who sends Yun Yun to stop Xiao Yan from fusing his two Heavenly Flames. Yun Yun pleads with Xiao Yan, but he says the Xiao Clan's dead were innocent too. He holds back so as not to hurt the sect's disciples, and Yun Leng ambushes him. Xiao Yan throws the Angry Buddha Lotus Flame, which kills Yun Leng and wrecks much of the sect, while watching guests say his strength is close to the sect's own. Yun Shan swears Xiao Yan will die there and shows clones with the power of his true body, one of which keeps Medusa busy. Hai Bodong steps in with a Black Ice Shield but falls to Yun Shan's Large Wind Handprint, and Xiao Yan is left near death. Yao Lao wakes from his sleep, takes over Xiao Yan's body and meets Yun Shan's Wind's Peak, Killer Meteorite with a Flame Splitting Tsunami.","events":["Medusa challenges Yun Shan; Yun Shan orders Yun Yun to stop the flame fusion.","Yun Yun tries to talk Xiao Yan down; he refuses.","Yun Leng attacks from behind; Xiao Yan unleashes the Angry Buddha Lotus Flame.","Yun Leng dies and the sect is badly damaged; Xiao Yan spares the disciples.","Yun Shan vows to keep Xiao Yan; his clones engage Medusa and Hai Bodong.","Hai Bodong is struck down by the Large Wind Handprint.","Yao Lao awakens and takes over Xiao Yan's body.","Yun Shan's Wind's Peak, Killer Meteorite meets the Flame Splitting Tsunami."],"introduced":["Yun Shan's clones","Black Ice Shield (Hai Bodong)","Large Wind Handprint","Wind's Peak, Killer Meteorite"],"cultivation":"No ranks stated for Xiao Yan. With Yao Lao in control his power 'suddenly soared by several classes' (859); Yao Lao says his power is 'hardly even at 20-30% of my peak' (990).","confidence":"high"},{"ep":65,"title":"Yao Lao Against Yun Shan","summary":"Yao Lao, fighting in Xiao Yan's body, trades blows with Yun Shan, and the clash tears the void. Away from the fight, Nalan Yanran tells Yun Yun she regrets breaking off the engagement and asks to enter the Gate of Life and Death. Yun Yun warns that it needs at least the Dou Ling rank but agrees to raise it with Yun Shan. Onlookers note that Xiao Yan now fights at about Dou Zong level and uses only an apricot-white flame. Yun Shan gathers the elders into the Covering Sun Cloud Formation, saying he cannot let a future Dou Zong who hates the sect escape. Yao Lao agrees to retreat, and Xiao Yan vows to return one day to settle his father's disappearance. When Yun Shan catches up, Xiao Yan readies another Lotus Flame.","events":["Recap; the fight resumes with Yao Lao in control.","Nalan Yanran tells Yun Yun she regrets the broken engagement and asks to enter the Gate of Life and Death.","Watchers call it the power of a Dou Zong and note the white flame.","The two Dou Zong-level fighters tear the void.","Yun Shan orders the Covering Sun Cloud Formation.","Xiao Yan and Yao Lao decide to retreat; Xiao Yan vows to come back.","Yun Shan finds him; Xiao Yan prepares another Lotus Flame."],"introduced":["Gate of Life and Death entry needs Dou Ling rank","Grandmaster (Yun Shan's title to Yanran)"],"cultivation":"Onlookers: 'Xiao Yan, in his current state, is probably at the level of a Dou Zong too' (300). Gate of Life and Death: 'you need to be at least of the Dou Ling rank to enter' (197).","confidence":"high"},{"ep":66,"title":"Escape into the Magical Beast Mountain Range","summary":"Xiao Yan's second Angry Buddha Lotus Flame hits Yun Shan, who survives. Yun Yun steps in front of Xiao Yan to protect her master, and Yun Shan uses the moment to strike him. Xiao Yan hands Yun Yun back her gift, says they are nothing to each other now, and flees on his Purple Cloud Wings with a mark from Yun Shan in his body. The sect puts him on its wanted list until he dies, and its elders and disciples give chase. Yao Lao, kept awake by the Seven Magical Green Spirit Saliva, hides the mark's pulses, and the Heaven Swallowing Python leads Xiao Yan deep into the Magical Beast Mountain Range. In the Jia Ma capital, the imperial family calls a meeting because a Dou Zong now leads the sect. Yao Lao brews a medicine with the Bone Chilling Flame to heal Xiao Yan and release the leftover power of the Three Lines Green Spirit Pill, while Yun Lei readies a flight unit.","events":["The second Lotus Flame hits Yun Shan; the sect is shaken.","Yun Yun shields Yun Shan, and Yun Shan wounds Xiao Yan from ambush.","Xiao Yan returns Yun Yun's gift and flees, vowing tenfold revenge.","The sect puts Xiao Yan on its wanted list; Yun Shan has left a mark in his body.","Yao Lao suppresses the mark; the Heaven Swallowing Python guides Xiao Yan into the Magical Beast Mountain Range.","The Jia Ma imperial family meets about Yun Shan becoming a Dou Zong.","The python tames a territory beast; Yao Lao makes healing medicine with the Bone Chilling Flame.","Yun Lei takes command of the flight unit."],"introduced":["wanted list (of the Misty Cloud Sect)","Yun Shan's mark (energy signature)","Flight Unit","Xuan Class advanced techniques (reward for killing Xiao Yan)"],"cultivation":"The Heaven Swallowing Python is 'just as strong as a Dou Wang' (716). Xiao Yan's blood flow is unstable, 'a sign of me becoming stronger' (978).","confidence":"high"},{"ep":67,"title":"Sky Fire Three Mysterious Changes","summary":"In a hidden cave of the Magical Beast Mountain Range, Xiao Yan absorbs Yao Lao's medicine and becomes a Three-Star Da Dou Shi, then stops before the extra power grows out of control. Yun Yun tells Yun Shan that Xiao Zhan vanished in the woods, and Yao Lao guesses a force stronger than the sect took him. The jade shard shows Xiao Zhan out of danger, and Yao Lao suggests asking Xun Er, whose people are powerful. Xiao Yan shows Yao Lao a jade container from the Burning Flame Valley holding the Sky Fire Three Mysterious Changes, a secret technique that boosts power with signature flames. Yao Lao admits he first meant to use Xiao Yan, and says he needs about three Heavenly Flames for a new body, which leaves the Fallen Heart Flame at Jia Nan Academy. Yun Shan scolds Yun Yun for her mercy and plans to raise the sect higher. Xiao Yan learns the first change, and a Misty Cloud Sect elder finds him.","events":["Xiao Yan becomes a Three-Star Da Dou Shi and holds back the rest.","Yao Lao reasons that an outside force took Xiao Zhan; Xun Er may know.","The Burning Flame Valley jade container holds the Sky Fire Three Mysterious Changes.","Yao Lao confesses he first meant to use Xiao Yan; they reaffirm their bond.","Three Heavenly Flames are needed for Yao Lao's body; the Fallen Heart Flame is at Jia Nan Academy.","Yun Shan reproaches Yun Yun and reveals his ambition.","Xiao Yan learns the first change; only it is recorded.","A Misty Cloud Sect elder catches up with him."],"introduced":["Sky Fire Three Mysterious Changes","secret techniques","signature flames","Burning Flame Valley","Yan Huo","Fallen Heart Flame (at Jia Nan Academy)","Dou Zun","first-class factions"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan: 'He became a Three-Star Da Dou Shi in an instant' (131.6). Burning Flame Valley chief: 'only a Five-Star Dou Zong' who beat a Dou Zun with the technique (889). Yao Lao reborn would be 'at least a strong Dou Zun' (759).","confidence":"high"},{"ep":68,"title":"Hunted by the Flight Unit","summary":"In the Jia Ma capital, Jia Xing Tian decides the imperial family will not stand against the Misty Cloud Sect for Xiao Yan, despite Hai Bodong's plea. Three Misty Cloud Sect elders lead the hunt in the Magical Beast Mountain Range, and their disciples shadow Xiao Yan without fighting him. When the disciples stop, Xiao Yan senses a Dou Huang arrive: Yun Yun, who draws Yun Shan's mark out of his body. Chased by a large flight unit, he finds his Purple Cloud Wings slower than true Dou Qi Wings, and Yao Lao spends his soul power to help him. Yun Lei catches him and boasts that he and Yun Sheng broke Xiao Zhan's limbs and that the sect has gone after the rest of the Xiao Clan. Xiao Yan sends the Heaven Swallowing Python ahead and uses the first change, the Green Lotus Change.","events":["The imperial council chooses not to intervene; Hai Bodong objects.","Three sect elders sharpen the search; disciples tail but do not engage.","Yun Yun, a Dou Huang, arrives and draws out the mark.","The flight unit chases Xiao Yan; Yao Lao helps him until his soul power runs low.","Yun Lei taunts Xiao Yan about the attack on the Xiao Clan and his father.","Xiao Yan activates the Green Lotus Change."],"introduced":["Mu Clan (serves the imperial family)","Green Lotus Change (first change)","Dou Qi Wings (true) vs Purple Cloud Wings"],"cultivation":"The arriving aura 'It's a Dou Huang' (359.8), revealed as Yun Yun. EP68 recap: Xiao Yan 'has successfully broken through to the Three-Star Da Dou Shi level' (14).","confidence":"high"},{"ep":69,"title":"Farewell, Yun Zhi","summary":"Using the Green Lotus Change, Xiao Yan jumps a level and fights Yun Lei, but the half-learned technique strains his body. The Heaven Swallowing Python holds off the sect's Cloud Beast unit. Hai Bodong arrives, holds back Yun Sheng and is declared an enemy of the sect along with the Mite'er family. Ya Fei brings Hai Bodong's men and a map of the Magical Beast Mountain Range, and tells Xiao Yan to head south across the border. Yun Yun then catches Xiao Yan but cannot bring herself to kill him, and lets him go on the condition that he never comes back. They part with feelings unspoken, and Xiao Yan sends word that he will repay Yun Shan's strikes. With Yao Lao, he sets out for Jia Nan Academy and Xun Er.","events":["Xiao Yan's Green Lotus Change lifts him a level; he fights Yun Lei.","The technique's backlash hurts him; the python fights the Cloud Beast unit.","Hai Bodong confronts Yun Sheng and becomes the sect's enemy.","Ya Fei gives Xiao Yan a map and sends him south.","Yun Yun lets Xiao Yan go rather than kill him.","Xiao Yan and Yao Lao head for Jia Nan Academy."],"introduced":["Cloud Beast unit","map of the Magical Beast Mountain Range"],"cultivation":"Yun Lei: 'You know I'm a strong Dou Wang' (152.8). Xiao Yan 'managed to instantly surpass a level' with the change (145.5).","confidence":"high"},{"ep":70,"title":"Into the Black-Corner Region","summary":"At Jia Nan Academy, Ling Ying reports to Xun Er that Xiao Yan is on his way, and she says she will wait for him. Ruo Lin, a teacher, tells Xun Er about the Level Advancement Contest, where the top 20 students enter the Inner Academy, and complains that Xiao Yan has been away two years. Bai Shan overhears and wants to see what is special about Xiao Yan. Xiao Yan enters the Black-Corner Region, pays a 500 gold coin offering at a tribe gate, fights off robbers and joins the caravan of the merchant Duo Ma under the name Yao Yan. Duo Ma tells him about Black Mark City, the Eight Gates and its leader Yuan Yi, and the Black Ranking, where the third place belongs to Han Feng, the Medicine Emperor. During a Black Storm a spirit form attacks Yao Lao, and Yao Lao then tells Xiao Yan his real name, Yao Chen, and that the Hall of Souls hunts strong souls like his. They reach Black Mark City as the Blood Sect arrives.","events":["Ling Ying reports to Xun Er; she vows to wait for Xiao Yan.","Ruo Lin tells Xun Er about the Level Advancement Contest; Bai Shan takes notice of Xiao Yan.","Xiao Yan lands in the Black-Corner Region and pays a tribe's offering.","He beats off robbers and joins Duo Ma's caravan as 'Yao Yan'.","Duo Ma explains Black Mark City, the Eight Gates, the Black Ranking and the Medicine Emperor Han Feng.","A spirit form attacks during a Black Storm.","Yao Lao reveals his name, Yao Chen, and the threat of the Hall of Souls.","They arrive at Black Mark City; the Blood Sect rides in."],"introduced":["Bai Shan","Ruo Lin","Duo Ma","Level Advancement Contest","Inner Academy","Great Plains of the Black Region","Black Mark City","Eight Gates","Yuan Yi","Black Ranking","Medicine Emperor","Black Storm","Hall of Souls (called Soul Shrine)","Warm Soul Spirit Ring","Blood Sect"],"cultivation":"The spirit form 'shouldn't be more than a Dou Ling' (769). Han Feng 'became a Dou Huang long ago' (672). Ruo Lin: Xiao Yan once lasted 20 rounds against her 'when he was a mere Dou Zhe' (337).","confidence":"high"},{"ep":71,"title":"The Black Mark City Auction","summary":"In Black Mark City, Xiao Yan refines Green Spirit Pills to sell, and Yao Lao tells him he needs a Sixth-Tier Ground Spirit Pill before he can take the Fallen Heart Flame. On the street he sees Fan Ling, the young Dou Ling master of the Blood Sect, carry off a man who blocked his way. An appraiser of the Eight Gates sees that Xiao Yan's pills include a Three Lines Green Spirit Pill and treats him with respect. At the auction, Mo Er Han of Black Skeleton's Tomb buys his two Two Lines pills for 1.5 million gold coins each, and Sky Serpent Mansion takes the Three Lines pill, which reminds Xiao Yan that Qing Lin is with them. Fan Ling outbids Xiao Yan for a cloth fragment of the Purifying Demonic Lotus Flame map, and Yao Lao tells him to wait until after the auction. Xiao Yan wins the Flame Core Ganoderma, and Mo Er Han pays ten million for the Di Class Three Thousand Lightning Movement.","events":["Xiao Yan learns the Ground Spirit Pill recipe needed for the Fallen Heart Flame.","Fan Ling of the Blood Sect bullies a passer-by.","The appraiser values Xiao Yan's Green Spirit Pills.","Mo Er Han buys the Two Lines pills; Sky Serpent Mansion buys the Three Lines pill.","Fan Ling buys the Purifying Demonic Lotus Flame map fragment.","Xiao Yan wins the Flame Core Ganoderma.","Mo Er Han wins the Three Thousand Lightning Movement for ten million.","The Eight Gates chief guards the final lot."],"introduced":["Fan Ling","Mo Er Han","Elder Qing","Black Skeleton's Tomb","Sky Serpent Mansion (buyer)","Ground Spirit Pill","Flame Core Ganoderma","Asparagus Ice Fire Fruit","Green Wood Celestial Vine","Rank Six Water Type Monster Core","Purifying Demonic Lotus Flame map fragment","Three Thousand Lightning Movement"],"cultivation":"Fan Ling: 'He's a Dou Ling at such a young age' (139). His father is 'the fifth elite in the Black Ranking' (156). A Rank Six Magical Beast is 'as strong as a Dou Huang' (102).","confidence":"high"},{"ep":72,"title":"The Yin-Yang Mysterious Dragon Pill","summary":"The last lot of the auction is the Seventh-Tier Yin-Yang Mysterious Dragon Pill, which once saved Feng Xian, the Feng Zun Zhe, who later became a Dou Zun. Its price is two tasks for the owner, and Yao Lao reacts to the name but says nothing. Xiao Yan collects 930,000 gold coins from Supervisor Hu after paying for the Flame Core Ganoderma and a Bright Square Fire Cauldron, and refuses a meeting with the Eight Gates chief, Yuan Yi. Yuan Yi has him tailed, but Xiao Yan loses the tail and follows Fan Ling to get the map fragment. Outside the city the Blood Sect ambushes Elder Qing of Sky Serpent Mansion, who bought the pill, and Fan Ling's father, the Dou Huang Fan Lao, takes it and gives it to his son. On the way home Fan Ling attacks Black Skeleton's Tomb, kills Mo Er Han's group and takes the Three Thousand Lightning Movement. Then he turns to Xiao Yan, whom he has noticed watching.","events":["The Yin-Yang Mysterious Dragon Pill is shown; its price is two tasks.","Xiao Yan receives 930,000 gold coins and declines Yuan Yi's invitation.","Yuan Yi has him tailed; Xiao Yan slips away and follows Fan Ling.","The Blood Sect ambushes Elder Qing; Fan Lao takes the pill and hands it to Fan Ling.","Fan Ling attacks Black Skeleton's Tomb and takes the Three Thousand Lightning Movement.","Fan Ling confronts Xiao Yan."],"introduced":["Yin-Yang Mysterious Dragon Pill","Feng Xian (Feng Zun Zhe)","Supervisor Hu","Bright Square Fire Cauldron","Yuan Yi (on screen)","Fan Lao","City of Mu","Bone Grave Explosion"],"cultivation":"Fan Lao: 'Dou Huang?' (764). Feng Xian was 'a Five-Star Dou Zong' and later 'ascended to a Dou Zun' (184, 224). Black Skeleton's Tomb party: 'two Dou Lings, one Da Dou Shi, and the rest are Dou Shis' (897).","confidence":"high"},{"ep":73,"title":"Dragon Qi and the Road to Jia Nan","summary":"Fan Ling, a Dou Ling, attacks Xiao Yan with the Bone Transforming Bloody Evil Palm to keep the map fragment. Xiao Yan uses the Green Lotus Change, and his Heavenly Flame overpowers the Blood Sect's cold techniques until he kills Fan Ling. He escapes before Fan Lao arrives to find his son dead. Now holding three map fragments and the pill, he swallows the Yin-Yang Mysterious Dragon Pill and draws out its Dragon Qi, which needs a Sonic Dou Skill to use. Yao Lao reveals he created the pill's formula, and that the student he raised as a son betrayed him and left him as he is now. Xiao Yan vows to surpass and kill that student, then enters Heping Town and is let into Jia Nan Academy as a student of Ruo Lin. At the Inner Academy Qualifying Competition, Xun Er beats Mo Wen, and Xiao Yan arrives just in time for his match with Xue Beng.","events":["Fan Ling fights Xiao Yan with the Bone Transforming Bloody Evil Palm.","Xiao Yan uses the Green Lotus Change and kills Fan Ling.","Fan Lao finds his son's body and swears revenge.","Xiao Yan takes the Yin-Yang Mysterious Dragon Pill and inherits Dragon Qi.","Yao Lao says he created the pill and was betrayed by his student.","Xiao Yan passes Heping Town into Jia Nan Academy.","Xun Er beats Mo Wen; Xiao Yan arrives for his match with Xue Beng."],"introduced":["Bone Transforming Bloody Evil Palm","Dragon Qi","Sonic Dou Skill","Heping Town","Death Spirit Tree","Inner Academy Qualifying Competition","Mo Wen","Xue Beng","Huang Class / Xuan Class (academy classes)","Guard Squad"],"cultivation":"Fan Ling to Xiao Yan: 'A Four-Star Da Dou Shi?' (66.6). Fan Ling is a Dou Ling (103, 136). Fan Lao is a Dou Huang ('My father is a Dou Huang', 244).","confidence":"high"},{"ep":74,"title":"Back at Jia Nan Academy","summary":"Xiao Yan returns after two years and is mocked as ordinary by students who wonder why Xun Er waited for him. Xue Beng, a Nine-Star Dou Shi with the Overlapping Waves Lance Skill, attacks first, and Xiao Yan beats him with one blow. Hu Jia, granddaughter of the vice dean Hu Qian, asks for a match with him, and the vice dean refuses her demand to expel him if she wins. Ruo Lin scolds Xiao Yan for his absence, and Xun Er promises they will both reach the top twenty so Ruo Lin can rise to instructor of the Xuan Class. Academy elders read his record against the Misty Cloud Sect and decide to watch him. That night Bai Shan, who uses lightning-type Dou Qi, tests him, and they agree to settle it at the competition. Xiao Yan tells Xun Er about his father, and she says her family's people have rules with the Xiao Clan, so it was not them, but she orders an investigation.","events":["Students mock Xiao Yan's looks; Xiao Yu and others in Class 2 of the Huang Class back him.","Xiao Yan beats Xue Beng with one blow.","Hu Jia wants to fight Xiao Yan; Hu Qian refuses her terms.","Ruo Lin scolds Xiao Yan; Xun Er promises they will reach the top twenty.","Academy elders review Xiao Yan's record and decide to watch him.","Bai Shan confronts Xiao Yan at night; Xun Er steps in.","Xiao Yan tells Xun Er about his father; she orders an investigation."],"introduced":["Xiao Yu","Hu Jia","Hu Qian","Overlapping Waves Lance Skill","instructor of the Xuan Class","lightning-type Dou Qi"],"cultivation":"Xue Beng 'is a Nine-Star Dou Shi' (76.3). Onlookers: 'Xiao Yan must be Da Dou Shi, at least' (305). Xun Er: Xiao Zhan's rescuer 'must be at least a Dou Huang' (971).","confidence":"high"},{"ep":75,"title":"Alchemist Against Alchemist","summary":"On the second day of the qualifiers, the head of the School of Alchemy, Old Huo, notes Xiao Yan's fiery Dou Qi and says he would welcome him. Ruo Lin warns Xiao Yan about two powers in the Outer Academy, the School of Alchemy and the Enforcer Squad, and says students like Bai Shan and Lu Mu trained in the Black-Corner Region. Luo Fu beats Ge Li with patient defence. Xiao Yan then faces Lu Mu, the top student of the School of Alchemy and Xiao Yu's eager suitor, who fights with his Blue Flame, a beast flame. Xiao Yan splits his own flame in two, guarding with one part while the other traps Lu Mu in a fire chain from below. Lu Mu admits defeat, and onlookers say he has lived up to his name as champion of the Alchemist Conference. Xiao Yan tells Xun Er he will not give up on her despite the power behind her, and the next match pits Yan Cheng against Wu Hao, the Blood Demon of the Enforcer Squad.","events":["Old Huo and the vice dean discuss Xiao Yan.","Ruo Lin explains the School of Alchemy and the Enforcer Squad.","Luo Fu defeats Ge Li.","Xiao Yan fights Lu Mu, who uses his Blue Flame.","Xiao Yan splits his flame and traps Lu Mu in a fire chain; Lu Mu concedes.","Xiao Yan promises Xun Er he won't give up on her.","Wu Hao of the Enforcer Squad is announced against Yan Cheng."],"introduced":["Old Huo","School of Alchemy","Outer Academy vice dean","Enforcer Squad (Jia Nan)","Lu Mu","Blue Flame (beast flame)","Pill Flame Skill","Purple Flame Shield","Spiraling Conical Flame","Luo Fu","Ge Li","Yan Cheng","Wu Hao (Blood Demon)"],"cultivation":"Ruo Lin on Lu Mu: 'Three-Star Da Dou Shi, I guess' (278). The vice dean's 'actual strength is below a strongest Dou Huang' (194).","confidence":"high"},{"ep":76,"title":"The Melee Begins","summary":"Wu Hao, back from killing in the Black-Corner Region, forces Yan Cheng to concede at once and then challenges Xiao Yan, but the referee tells them to wait for the next day. Xiao Mei greets Xiao Yan, and he tells Xun Er that their old trouble no longer matters to him. That night Xiao Yan judges he needs ten more days to reach Six-Star Da Dou Shi and finds a jade piece that resists his Green Lotus Core Flame. Yao Lao cannot sense the Fallen Heart Flame inside the academy, only somewhere within a thousand li, and thinks the Inner Academy is linked to it. On the last day, the vice dean changes the qualifier into a melee of all 20 students, ranked by how long each one lasts. Xiao Yan and Xun Er fight as a pair, and Bai Shan attacks him with the Shaking Lightning Arc Blast. Xiao Yan wraps himself in the Heavenly Flame, drops his heavy ruler and drives Bai Shan back, but then begins to break through in the middle of the fight.","events":["Wu Hao defeats Yan Cheng and challenges Xiao Yan.","Xiao Mei greets Xiao Yan.","Xiao Yan studies a jade piece that resists his flame.","Yao Lao senses the Fallen Heart Flame within a thousand li and points to the Inner Academy.","The final round becomes a 20-student melee.","Bai Shan attacks Xiao Yan with the Shaking Lightning Arc Blast.","Xiao Yan uses his Heavenly Flame and drops his ruler to overwhelm Bai Shan.","Xiao Yan starts to break through mid-fight."],"introduced":["Xiao Mei","Little Witch (Hu Jia's nickname)","melee elimination round","Shaking Lightning Arc Blast"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan: 'I'll need at least another ten days before I become a Six-Star Da Dou Shi' (267). At 971 'He is about to ascend.'","confidence":"high"},{"ep":77,"title":"Three Against One","summary":"The final melee of the Inner Academy Qualifying Competition goes on at Jia Nan Academy. Xiao Yan starts to advance in the middle of the fight, and Xun Er guards him. Bai Shan talks Wu Hao and Hu Jia into a three-against-one attack, and Xun Er is hurt shielding Xiao Yan with her Golden Trigram Palm. Xiao Yan finishes his advancement, uses the Green Lotus Change of the Sky Fire Three Mysterious Changes to fight with a Dou Ling's power, and beats all three with the Angry Buddha Lotus Flame. Vice Dean Hu Qian names the top five: Hu Jia, Bai Shan, Wu Hao, Xun Er and Xiao Yan. Xiao Yan tells his cousin Xiao Mei what happened to the Xiao Clan and forgives her for the past. The top five then enter the Book Collection Hall after two hall elders open its Space Lock.","events":["Xiao Yan begins to advance during the melee; Xun Er stays to protect him.","Bai Shan, Wu Hao and Hu Jia join forces; Xun Er is hurt and swears to leave the academy if Bai Shan walks away unhurt.","Xiao Yan completes his advancement and uses the Green Lotus Change.","He beats the three with the Angry Buddha Lotus Flame, holding back its full power.","The top five are announced: Hu Jia, Bai Shan, Wu Hao, Xun Er and Xiao Yan.","Xiao Yan tells Xiao Mei about the clan and they make peace.","Two elders guard the Book Collection Hall; one silently recognises the Green Lotus Core Flame. Yao Lao cuts his link with Xiao Yan.","The elders open the Space Lock and the five go in."],"introduced":["Golden Trigram Palm","Guardian Trigram Palm","Glorious Thunder","Blood Splitting Chop","Quiet Woods Poisonous Snake Vine","Sky Fire Three Mysterious Changes: First Change, Green Lotus Change","Book Collection Hall","Space Lock (a formation set by a Dou Zun)","Heavenly Flame Ranking (Green Lotus Core Flame ranks 19th)","Sonic Dou Skill (what Xiao Yan wants from the hall)"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan completes an advancement during the melee and is called a Six-Star Da Dou Shi afterwards. The Green Lotus Change gives him a Dou Ling's power for a short time. Bai Shan, Wu Hao and Hu Jia are Five- or Six-Star Da Dou Shis.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":78,"title":"The Book Collection Hall","summary":"Inside the Book Collection Hall, the top five may each take one reward from the energy barriers before the flames on a rune go out. Xiao Yan grabs the Di Class Nine Layer Phoenix Flame Skill and gives it to Xun Er, who needs it for her advancement. He uses Soul Perception to hunt for a Sonic Dou Skill and finds a sonic wave just as time runs out. Xun Er helps him pull it out at the last moment, and it is the Lion Tiger Gold Shattering Roar. A hall elder tells him he has grasped only its first stage, 30 to 40 percent of its power. Vice Dean Hu Qian then leads the five through the dangerous mountains behind the academy to Elder Zhao and Elder Lu of the Inner Academy. Elder Zhao gives each a crystal card and starts the Fire Energy Hunting Competition, where seniors hunt the newcomers for the Fire Energy in their cards.","events":["A voice explains the hall's rules: one item each, taken only from the energy layer, within the time limit.","Rewards appear, including the Xuan Class Purple Lightning Burst and a Rank Six Magical Beast Core.","Xiao Yan takes the Nine Layer Phoenix Flame Skill (Di Class Middle Rank) and gives it to Xun Er.","Xiao Yan senses a sonic wave with Soul Perception; with Xun Er's help he retrieves the Lion Tiger Gold Shattering Roar.","He practises it in the hall and learns its first stage.","Hu Qian advises the five to put aside their quarrels and leads them to the Inner Academy.","Elder Zhao and Elder Lu meet them and announce the Fire Energy Hunting Competition."],"introduced":["Purple Lightning Burst (Xuan Class High Rank)","Nine Layer Phoenix Flame Skill (Di Class Middle Rank)","Rank Six Magical Beast Core","Lion Tiger Gold Shattering Roar (Sonic Dou Skill)","Elder Zhao","Elder Lu","crystal card","Fire Energy","Fire Energy Hunting Competition"],"confidence":"high"},{"ep":79,"title":"The Hunters Become the Hunted","summary":"Xiao Yan's group enters the forest outside the Inner Academy for the Fire Energy Hunting Competition. They watch Sha Tie's Black Demon Group beat a team of new students in one hit, and Xiao Yan judges Sha Tie a Half-Step Dou Ling. Xun Er proposes Xiao Yan as leader, and Hu Jia, Wu Hao and Bai Shan agree for now. Xiao Yan uses Soul Perception to find a weaker senior team, Lin Ge's, and the five beat it and question its members one by one. They learn there are seven senior teams of five, with the Black Demon Group and Luo Hou's White Demon Group the strongest. They also learn that Fire Energy pays for training in the Blazing Sky Qi Refining Tower and that the Strong Ranking is the surest way to earn it. Xiao Yan decides to hunt the seniors for their Fire Energy, but Liu Mu's team then ambushes the group.","events":["The Black Demon Group under Sha Tie defeats a group of new students.","Xun Er names Xiao Yan leader; the other three agree.","Xiao Yan uses Soul Perception to pick a weaker senior team.","They beat Lin Ge's team and question the seniors separately.","They learn about the seven teams, the Blazing Sky Qi Refining Tower, Fire Energies and the Strong Ranking.","Xiao Yan proposes hunting the seniors; Elder Lu approves of his use of the rules.","Liu Mu's team, warned of the newcomers, ambushes them in the woods."],"introduced":["Sha Tie","Black Demon Group","White Demon Group","Luo Hou (named)","Lin Ge","Leng Bai (named)","Liu Mu","Blazing Sky Qi Refining Tower","Strong Ranking (Inner Academy Strong Ranking)","Fire Crystal Card","Half-Step Dou Ling"],"cultivation":"Sha Tie, leader of the Black Demon Group, is a Half-Step Dou Ling.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":80,"title":"Gathering the New Students","summary":"Liu Mu's team, using Wood-Attribute Dou Qi to sense the forest, catches Xiao Yan's group off guard. Xiao Yan holds them off with the Vacuum Hand while Xun Er leads the hurt members away, and he hands out healing medicine. The next day the five split Liu Mu's team apart and beat it, because Xiao Yan had locked onto their energy auras in the first fight. Xiao Yan finishes with the Flame Splitting Tsunami, and news spreads that his group has taken the Fire Energy of three senior teams. Xiao Yan then gathers the other new students, including Tai, and gives them medicine. He has the location leaked so the last two ordinary senior teams, led by Su Xiao and Xiu Yan, walk into a trap. Luo Hou of the White Demon Group watches from a distance.","events":["Liu Mu's team ambushes the group; Xiao Yan covers the retreat with the Vacuum Hand.","Xiao Yan explains why he pulled back and plans a counterattack.","Tai, a new student, defies the seniors; Xiao Yan's group returns and beats Liu Mu's team.","Xiao Yan uses the Flame Splitting Tsunami; three senior teams have now lost their Fire Energy.","Xiao Yan gathers the new students, gives them medicine and asks for their help.","Su Xiao's and Xiu Yan's teams arrive; Luo Hou watches."],"introduced":["Wood-Attribute Dou Qi","Vacuum Hand (used here)","Fire Palm","Tai","disqualification rule (seniors out below ten Fire Energies)","Su Xiao","Xiu Yan","Leng Bai"],"confidence":"high"},{"ep":81,"title":"Bai Shan Walks Away","summary":"The new students fight Su Xiao's and Xiu Yan's teams together in the forest. Xiao Yan beats Su Xiao with the Lion Tiger Gold Shattering Roar and the Octane Blast, and Xiu Yan gives up and hands over his Fire Crystal Card. Two watching elders praise Xiao Yan and plan to have Hu Qian send over his record. Then Sha Tie's Black Demon Group arrives to take all the Fire Energy. Sha Tie knows Bai Shan's cousin Bai Cheng and lets Bai Shan leave, and Bai Shan walks out on the team. Xiao Yan takes on Sha Tie himself, while Xun Er, Wu Hao and Hu Jia hold off the others. Sha Tie's Gold Dou Qi gives him strong attack and defense, and Xiao Yan's first blows do not break him.","events":["Xiao Yan assigns opponents: he, Wu Hao and Bai Shan take the three strongest seniors; Xun Er and Hu Jia help the new students.","Xiao Yan beats Su Xiao with the Lion Tiger Gold Shattering Roar, Dou Qi Armor and Octane Blast.","Xiao Yan stops a new student hitting a senior who has conceded and gives the senior pills.","Xiu Yan concedes and hands over the Fire Crystal Card; watching elders praise Xiao Yan.","Sha Tie's Black Demon Group arrives; Bai Shan leaves the team.","Xiao Yan faces Sha Tie, whose Gold Dou Qi resists his attacks."],"introduced":["Bai Cheng (named; Bai Shan's cousin)","Gold Dou Qi"],"confidence":"high"},{"ep":82,"title":"The White Demon Group","summary":"Xiao Yan keeps Sha Tie busy until Sha Tie has to force his strength up with a secret technique. Then Wu Hao joins him and they beat the Black Demon Group with the new students. Sha Tie warns that Luo Hou, leader of the White Demon Group, is a Dou Ling. On the last day of the Fire Energy Hunting Competition, Xiao Yan, Xun Er, Wu Hao and Hu Jia surround Luo Hou while Tai and the new students hold off his four teammates. Luo Hou, who uses Ice-Attribute Dou Qi, breaks a drawbridge and fights them over the water. When Xun Er is hurt, Xiao Yan fuses his Heavenly Flame with other flames into a small Angry Buddha Lotus Flame and beats Luo Hou. The elders declare the new students the winners of the competition.","events":["Sha Tie uses a secret technique; Wu Hao joins Xiao Yan and Sha Tie concedes.","Sha Tie tells them Luo Hou is a Dou Ling.","On the final day the new students face the White Demon Group.","Xiao Yan, Xun Er, Wu Hao and Hu Jia attack Luo Hou together; Tai's group surrounds the others.","Luo Hou breaks the drawbridge and uses his Ice-Attribute Dou Qi on the water.","Xun Er is hurt; Xiao Yan uses the Angry Buddha Lotus Flame and wins.","The elder declares the new students the victors."],"introduced":["secret technique (Sha Tie's strength boost)","Circular Cold Rod","Ice-Attribute Dou Qi","Quiet Viper Vine"],"cultivation":"Luo Hou is a Dou Ling. Xiao Yan, Xun Er, Wu Hao and Hu Jia are called four Da Dou Shis.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":83,"title":"The Heart Flame Scorching Test","summary":"The new students reach their quarters in the Inner Academy, where an elder explains there are no classes, only training in the Blazing Sky Qi Refining Tower paid with Fire Energy. Yao Lao tells Xiao Yan he feels an unusual aura in the north, and Xiao Yan follows the crowd to the tower, which is buried in magma. Inside, an invisible flame gets past his Green Lotus Core Flame into his body. Yao Lao identifies it as a projected form of the Fallen Heart Flame and has him use it to condense his Dou Qi. Han Yue, leader of the Moon Spirit, sends for Elder Liu, who guards the first level. Xiao Yan wakes from the Heart Flame Scorching Test by himself after almost eighteen minutes, the first to do so in years. Meanwhile Fu Ao of the White Gang, with Bai Shan now on his side, comes to the new students' area to demand tribute.","events":["An elder shows the new students their residence and explains the Inner Academy has no courses.","Yao Lao senses an unusual aura in the north part of the Inner Academy.","Xiao Yan enters the Blazing Sky Qi Refining Tower; an invisible flame enters his body.","Yao Lao names it a projected form of the Fallen Heart Flame; Xiao Yan uses it to purify his Dou Qi.","Han Yue sends for help; Fu Ao and Bai Shan demand tribute for the White Gang from the new students.","Elder Liu arrives; Han Yue says she lasted seventeen minutes in her first test.","Xiao Yan wakes by himself; an unknown force bursts out and Elder Liu clears the room.","Elder Liu introduces Han Yue and explains the tower's cultivation rooms."],"introduced":["Heart Flame Scorching Test","Fallen Heart Flame (projected form)","Han Yue","Moon Spirit","White Gang","Fu Ao","tribute","Elder Liu","tower levels and High-level and Low-level cultivation rooms"],"cultivation":"Six-star Dou Ling is the minimum to go down to the tower's sixth level, where Han Yue plans to train.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":84,"title":"Rock Gate","summary":"Xiao Yan's Green Lotus Core Flame draws out the true form of the Fallen Heart Flame, and Elder Liu tells him to keep quiet about it. Yao Lao explains that the Inner Academy has trapped the flame in a space prison made by a Dou Zun and uses its projected form to temper students. He thinks it will break free within a year or two, and that will be their chance to take it. Back at the new students' area, Fu Ao of the White Gang and Bai Shan try to force Xun Er to join the White Gang. Xiao Yan fights Fu Ao, a Dou Ling, one on one and wins with the Green Lotus Change, the Lion Tiger Gold Shattering Roar and the Octane Blast, which keeps the White Gang away for half a year. The new students then make Xiao Yan their leader, and he names their faction Rock Gate. White Gang leader Bai Cheng scolds Fu Ao and swears to deal with Xiao Yan when the half year is up.","events":["The Fallen Heart Flame's true form appears; Elder Liu sends Xiao Yan away and asks for silence.","Yao Lao explains the space prison and predicts the flame will break out in a year or two.","Fu Ao and Bai Shan pressure Xun Er and the new students for tribute.","Xiao Yan returns and bets with Fu Ao: their Fire Energies and Xun Er against half a year of peace.","Xiao Yan beats Fu Ao with the Green Lotus Change, the Lion Tiger Gold Shattering Roar and the Octane Blast.","Tai and the new students ask Xiao Yan to found a faction; he names it Rock Gate.","Bai Cheng scolds Fu Ao and vows to remove Xiao Yan after half a year."],"introduced":["Fallen Heart Flame (true form)","space prison (set up by a Dou Zun)","Rock Gate","Bai Cheng"],"cultivation":"Fu Ao is a Dou Ling, called three-star; Luo Hou had only just reached Dou Ling.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":85,"title":"The Fourth Level","summary":"At the tower gate, White Gang leader Bai Cheng hurts Xiao Yan in what he calls a friendly spar. Han Yue mocks Bai Cheng in front of everyone, and Xiao Yan promises that the White Gang will be gone in half a year. Inside the Blazing Qi Refining Tower, a guide explains Fire Poison and the rule of a week on each level, and several Rock Gate members advance on their first day. Yao Lao feels the Fallen Heart Flame's aura behind a seal and urges Xiao Yan to reach Dou Ling quickly. Using a green crystal card, Xiao Yan goes down to the fourth level and takes an empty high-level room. Lei Na, a Four-Star Dou Ling who guards Liu Fei, claims the room is hers and attacks. Xiao Yan answers with two flames at once and unleashes a terrifying Dou Skill.","events":["Bai Cheng hurts Xiao Yan at the tower gate and calls it a spar.","Han Yue rebukes Bai Cheng; Xiao Yan vows the White Gang will dissolve in half a year.","A guide explains Fire Poison and the tower's rules; one Fire Energy pays for a day.","Several Rock Gate members advance on their first session.","Yao Lao senses the Fallen Heart Flame through a seal and tells Xiao Yan to reach Dou Ling soon.","Xiao Yan goes to the fourth level with a green crystal card and takes an empty room.","Lei Na and Liu Fei claim the room; Lei Na attacks and Xiao Yan fights back with two flames."],"introduced":["Fire Poison","Lin Xiu Ya (named, top ten of the Strong Ranking)","Yan Hao (named, top ten of the Strong Ranking)","green crystal card (for the fourth level)","Lei Na","Liu Fei","Liu Qing (named, Liu Fei's brother)"],"cultivation":"Lei Na is a Four-Star Dou Ling. Lei Na calls Xiao Yan a Da Dou Shi.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":86,"title":"Elder He's Verdict","summary":"Elder He stops Xiao Yan's Angry Buddha Lotus Flame before it can kill Lei Na. He fines Lei Na thirty days of Fire Energy, Liu Fei ten days and Xiao Yan five days for fighting too hard. First Elder Su Qian warns the elders that the Fallen Heart Flame is growing restless and may break out within a few years and, with the Dean away, wants the forces of the Black-Corner Region watched and the young owner of a Heavenly Flame looked after. After four days in the tower without food or water, Xiao Yan breaks through to Seven-Star Da Dou Shi. He returns to find that Xun Er has given Rock Gate badges, a guard squad and Fire Energy rewards. Xun Er then brings in Mr. Ling, her guard, who says her clan had nothing to do with the disappearance of Xiao Yan's father. Mr. Ling tells Xun Er that a hidden force in the Jia Ma Empire, the Hall of Souls, has secret dealings with the Misty Cloud Sect.","events":["Elder He stops the fight and hears both sides.","He fines Lei Na, Liu Fei and Xiao Yan in Fire Energy; Liu Fei vows revenge.","Su Qian and the elders discuss the restless Fallen Heart Flame and the absent Dean.","Xiao Yan breaks through to Seven-Star Da Dou Shi after four days in the tower.","Rock Gate now has badges, guards and Fire Energy rewards, all set up by Xun Er with Hu Jia.","Xun Er introduces Mr. Ling, who has protected Xiao Yan in secret on her orders.","Mr. Ling says Xun Er's clan did not take Xiao Zhan; Xiao Yan suspects the Misty Cloud Sect.","Mr. Ling tells Xun Er the Misty Cloud Sect is dealing with the Hall of Souls."],"introduced":["Elder He","Su Qian","First Elder","the Dean (away, not named)","Rock Gate badge","Rock Gate guard squad","Mr. Ling (by this name)","Hall of Souls (named in Season 5)"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan breaks through to Seven-Star Da Dou Shi in four days of tower training.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":87,"title":"The Jade of Tuo She Gu Di","summary":"Mr. Ling tells Xun Er that even Yun Yun does not know of the Misty Cloud Sect's ties to the Hall of Souls. Xun Er reveals that her clan sent her to the Xiao Clan to get its part of a key, and she sends Mr. Ling away. Later she sees Xiao Yan holding the jade of Tuo She Gu Di and warns him never to show it to anyone. Yao Lao explains that Tuo She Gu Di was a Dou Di 10,000 years ago, the last on the Dou Qi Continent, and the jade may be a small part of his legacy. Rock Gate is short of Fire Energy after Wu Hao loses it at the arena, so Xiao Yan goes to the trading area and finds Lin Yan, a Seven-Star Dou Ling, selling the Green Wood Celestial Vine needed for the Ground Spirit Pill. Xiao Yan trades a cure for Lin Yan's Fire Poison for the vine and refines 181 pills for Rock Gate to sell. The Medicine Gang, which has held the pill market, plans to fight back, and Bai Cheng of the White Gang comes to see its leader.","events":["Mr. Ling and Xun Er discuss the Hall of Souls, the Xiao Clan's key and the blood oath.","Xun Er recognises the jade of Tuo She Gu Di and warns Xiao Yan.","Yao Lao explains Tuo She Gu Di, the only Dou Di in 10,000 years.","Rock Gate's Fire Energy runs out after Wu Hao's arena losses.","Xiao Yan finds Lin Yan and the Green Wood Celestial Vine in the trading area.","He gives Lin Yan Spirit Cooling Pills and the Marrow Washing Cold Spirit Liquid against his Fire Poison; Lin Yan promises to watch over Rock Gate.","Xiao Yan refines 181 pills for Rock Gate to sell.","The Medicine Gang plans to buy up the herbs; Bai Cheng asks to see its leader."],"introduced":["key held by the Xiao Clan","blood oath between the Xiao ancestors and Xun Er's clan","Tuo She Gu Di","Dou Di","Dou Sheng","arena","trading area","Lin Yan","Green Wood Celestial Vine","Ground Spirit Pill","Spirit Cooling Pill","Marrow Washing Cold Spirit Liquid","Green Ganoderma Fire Spirit Ointment","Swift Wind Spirit Pill","Energy Recovery Pill","Body Recovery Pill","Body Ice Pill","Wolf Fang (Lin Xiu Ya's group)","Tie Mu (named)","Medicine Gang"],"cultivation":"Lin Yan is about a Seven-Star Dou Ling. Tuo She Gu Di was a Dou Di.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":88,"title":"The Medicine Gang","summary":"After a month of seclusion in the tower, Xiao Yan becomes an Eight-Star Da Dou Shi. He worries that Medusa will fully take over the Heaven Swallowing Python within a year, but Yao Lao says she still needs the Thawing Spirit Pill. Back at Rock Gate, Xiao Yan gives Lin Yan more pills against his Fire Poison and gets the Green Wood Celestial Vine. Lin Yan warns him about Liu Fei's brother, Tyrant Spear Liu Qing of the Strong Ranking's top ten, and explains the Inner Academy Competition, held every five years, whose top ten may train on the eighth floor with the origin of the Core Flame. Then the White Gang, led by Bai Cheng and Bai Shan, wrecks Rock Gate's pill stall and claims the pills were fake. Xiao Yan brings his members to fight, and Lin Yan stands with him. The Medicine Gang's chief, Han Xian, turns out to be behind it, and Xiao Yan challenges him to a pill-refining match.","events":["Xiao Yan reaches Eight-Star in the tower.","Xiao Yan and Yao Lao discuss Medusa and the Thawing Spirit Pill.","Xun Er reports on Rock Gate; Lin Yan has called many times.","Xiao Yan gives Lin Yan more pills; Lin Yan warns him of Liu Qing and explains the Inner Academy Competition.","Lin Yan hands over the Green Wood Celestial Vine.","The White Gang wrecks Rock Gate's stall and injures Tai's group.","Xiao Yan confronts Bai Cheng; Lin Yan backs him with his Fire Axe.","Han Xian of the Medicine Gang appears; Xiao Yan proposes a pill-refining match."],"introduced":["Liu Qing (Tyrant Spear)","Mountain Splitting Spear","Green Purple Fire Lotus","Inner Academy Competition (every five years)","eighth floor of the tower and the origin of the Core Flame","Crazy Axe (Lin Yan's nickname)","Fire Axe","Han Xian","pill-refining match"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan breaks through to Eight-Star (Da Dou Shi) and says he will soon be a Dou Ling. Medusa could become a super strong Dou Zong when she fully fuses with the Heaven Swallowing Python.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":89,"title":"The Dragon Strength Pill","summary":"Xiao Yan and Han Xian, chief of the Medicine Gang and a fourth-tier alchemist, hold their pill-refining match before a crowd. Elder Hao sets the Fifth-Tier Dragon Strength Pill, with two sets of herbs each, and Han Xian uses the Illusionary Golden Flame, taken from the shell of a Rank Seven Illusionary Fire Scorpion Dragon Beast. He hands in a half-done pill, betting that Xiao Yan will fail. Xiao Yan's cheap cauldron explodes, but he comes out of the smoke with a finished Dragon Strength Pill. Elder Hao declares him the winner, so Rock Gate takes over the Medicine Gang's five busiest trading spots. Half a month later Han Yue and Lin Xiu Ya set out on a mission, and Xiao Yan goes into the mountains with Yao Lao. There he starts the Three Thousand Lightning Movement by drawing the wind-lightning strength out of its scroll and refining it with the Green Lotus Core Flame.","events":["Han Xian and Xiao Yan take the stage; Xiao Yan stakes three prescriptions against the Medicine Gang's five trading spots.","Elder Hao sets the Fifth-Tier Dragon Strength Pill with two tries each.","Han Xian shows the Illusionary Golden Flame.","Han Xian hands in a half-done pill.","Xiao Yan's cauldron explodes, but his pill is finished; Elder Hao rules him the winner.","First Elder Su Qian watches; an elder admits he lost his bet on the result.","Han Yue and Lin Xiu Ya set off on a mission.","In the mountains Xiao Yan begins refining the wind-lightning strength of the Three Thousand Lightning Movement."],"introduced":["Elder Hao","Dragon Strength Pill (Fifth-Tier)","Illusionary Golden Flame","Rank Seven Illusionary Fire Scorpion Dragon Beast","Three Thousand Lightning Movement","wind-lightning strength","Lin Xiu Ya (on screen)"],"cultivation":"Han Xian is a fourth-tier alchemist. Xiao Yan refines a Fifth-Tier Pill. An alchemist who can do that is called 'almost as valuable as a Dou Wang if not a Dou Huang'.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":90,"title":"The Snow Demon Sky Ape","summary":"Xiao Yan trains alone in the mountains of the Inner Academy under Yao Lao. He subdues the wind-lightning strength with the Green Lotus Core Flame and reaches Lightning Flash, the first of the three levels of the Three Thousand Lightning Movement. During training he also stumbles on a new way of moving his Dou Qi in waves, which Yao Lao says could one day become his own method. Nearby, Han Yue, Lin Xiu Ya and Yan Hao attack the Snow Demon Sky Ape to steal the Core Quenching Body Milk it guards. When the ape's violent blood awakens, Xiao Yan saves Han Yue and talks the group into retreating. That night he feeds the Heaven Swallowing Python Amethyst Essence, warns it not to let Medusa devour its soul, and sends it back to fight the ape.","events":["Xiao Yan refines the wind-lightning strength from the scroll with the Green Lotus Core Flame.","He finds he can hang in the air without his Purple Cloud Wings; Yao Lao explains it is his soul power gathering wind-lightning at his feet.","He reaches Lightning Flash, the first level of the Three Thousand Lightning Movement.","He grasps a wave-like way of moving Dou Qi.","Han Yue, Lin Xiu Ya and Yan Hao fight the Snow Demon Sky Ape for the Core Quenching Body Milk; Lin Xiu Ya fakes Dou Qi Wings.","The ape's violent blood awakens; Xiao Yan rescues Han Yue and persuades the group to leave.","At night Xiao Yan feeds the Heaven Swallowing Python Amethyst Essence and sends it against the ape."],"introduced":["Three Thousand Lightning Movement levels: Lightning Flash, Instant Lightning, Three Thousand Lightning","Snow Demon Sky Ape","Core Quenching Body Milk","violent blood (of the Snow Demon Sky Ape)","Yan Hao","Strong Ranking Competition (in four months)","Green Vortex (Lin Xiu Ya's attack)","Amethyst Essence"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan reaches the first level, Lightning Flash, of the Three Thousand Lightning Movement. Lin Xiu Ya is not a Dou Wang; his wings are a technique, not Dou Qi Wings.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":91,"title":"The Real Core Quenching Body Milk","summary":"Xiao Yan returns to the Snow Demon Sky Ape's valley at night, when the ape is weak after its violent blood has burned out. The Seven-Colored Heaven Swallowing Python holds the ape off while Xiao Yan searches its lair. He finds a pool of Core Quenching Body Milk, but Yao Lao shows him it is only a diluted run-off, and has him cut the true milk, ten times purer, out of a round rock. Yao Lao teaches him the alchemist's rule of leaving a treasure's roots. The python wins its fight and Xiao Yan rewards it with a feast. Then the python's weakness lets Queen Medusa wake inside it; she threatens to kill Xiao Yan for not making the Thawing Spirit Pill, and Yao Lao appears to protect him.","events":["The ape is weaker at night after its violent blood erupted.","The Seven-Colored Heaven Swallowing Python stalls the ape.","Xiao Yan remembers the Purple Crystal Winged Lion King's offer of the Purple Spirit Crystal for a Body Transformation Pill.","He finds the diluted Core Quenching Body Milk in a huge underground space.","Yao Lao shows him the pure milk hidden inside a rock and the rule of keeping a treasure's roots.","The python beats the ape and they escape; Xiao Yan feeds it.","Queen Medusa wakes in the weakened python and attacks Xiao Yan over the Thawing Spirit Pill.","Yao Lao appears in spirit form and faces her."],"introduced":["Seven-Colored Heaven Swallowing Python (full name used)","Body Transformation Pill","the real (pure) Core Quenching Body Milk versus the diluted kind","'keep the roots' rule of alchemists"],"confidence":"high"},{"ep":92,"title":"Two Levels at Once","summary":"Yao Lao and Queen Medusa agree a new deal: Xiao Yan will deliver the Thawing Spirit Pill within a year, and Medusa will keep him safe for that year. Xiao Yan then washes his marrow with the Core Quenching Body Milk and other medicines, enduring the pain by remembering his father and his promises. He breaks through two levels at once and becomes a Dou Ling. Back at the Inner Academy arena, Wu Hao, a Nine-Star Da Dou Shi, is losing a duel against Bai Cheng, a Six-Star Dou Ling, and tries a Forbidden Method. Xun Er steps in for him. Xiao Yan arrives, takes over the duel, and opens with the Green Lotus Change.","events":["Yao Lao and Medusa argue over the broken Misty Cloud Sect deal; the python fights Medusa for its body.","Medusa agrees to protect Xiao Yan for one more year in exchange for the Thawing Spirit Pill.","Xiao Yan washes his marrow with the Core Quenching Body Milk.","He breaks through two levels and becomes a Dou Ling.","Bai Cheng beats Wu Hao at the arena; onlookers say Liu Qing has backed Bai Cheng.","Wu Hao tries a Forbidden Method; Xun Er takes his place.","Xiao Yan arrives as a new Dou Ling and fights Bai Cheng with the Green Lotus Change."],"introduced":["Forbidden Method (Wu Hao)","Green Lotus Change, the First Change of the Sky Fire Three Mysterious Changes"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan breaks through two levels at once and becomes a Dou Ling (from Da Dou Shi). Bai Cheng is a Six-Star Dou Ling; Wu Hao is a Nine-Star Da Dou Shi.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":93,"title":"Xiao Yan Takes Bai Cheng's Place","summary":"Xiao Yan fights Bai Cheng in the arena with the Green Lotus Change. When Bai Cheng knocks away his Heavy Xuan Ruler, Xiao Yan only gets faster. Bai Cheng swallows a pill he got from Han Xian, so Xiao Yan takes one of his own Dragon Strength Pills. He breaks Bai Cheng's Earth Armor by forcing Dark Energy into its cracks and wins, taking Bai Cheng's 34th place on the Strong Ranking. Tyrant Spear Liu Qing of the Mountain Splitting Gang then arrives with his sister Liu Fei. Xun Er slaps Liu Fei for insulting Xiao Yan, and Lin Xiu Ya steps in to calm things down. Liu Qing agrees to settle it at the Strong Ranking Competition in a month.","events":["Xiao Yan fights Bai Cheng with the Green Lotus Change and loses his Heavy Xuan Ruler, but grows faster.","Bai Cheng takes a pill from Han Xian; Xiao Yan answers with a Dragon Strength Pill.","Bai Cheng's Earth Armor and Xuan Earth Condensation hold against Octane Blast.","Xiao Yan breaks the armor from inside with Dark Energy and wins.","He takes Bai Cheng's 34th place on the Strong Ranking.","Liu Qing arrives with Liu Fei; Xun Er names herself Xiao Xun Er and stands against him.","Xun Er slaps Liu Fei; Lin Xiu Ya intervenes.","Liu Qing promises Xiao Yan a match at the Strong Ranking Competition in a month."],"introduced":["Earth Armor (Bai Cheng's Dou Qi Armor)","Xuan Earth Condensation","Dark Energy","Octane Blast","Liu Qing (Tyrant Spear), on screen","Mountain Splitting Gang","Wolf Fang (Lin Xiu Ya's group, named as such)","34th place on the Strong Ranking"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan wins as a new Dou Ling and takes Bai Cheng's 34th place on the Strong Ranking.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":94,"title":"Zi Yan in the Herb Warehouse","summary":"Xiao Yan still needs the Asparagus Ice Fire Fruit and a Rank Six Water Type Monster Core for the Ground Spirit Pill. Elder Hao lets him take one herb from the Medicinal Ingredients Warehouse in exchange for a Dragon Strength Pill. There he finds the fruit, but a small girl snatches it to eat it raw. She is Zi Yan, a Magical Beast who ate a Shape-Shifting Flower and is stuck in human form. Xiao Yan wins the fruit by promising to refine her herbs into tasty pills, and she tells him she is number one on the Strong Ranking. Elder Hao sends him to the stingy Elder Liu for the Monster Core. Elder Liu wants a Sixth-Tier Fighting Spirit Pill, and in the end takes a Core-Fire Lotus Seed and a Dragon Strength Pill instead.","events":["Xiao Yan has the Flame Core Ganoderma and Green Wood Celestial Vine; he still needs two ingredients.","Elder Hao trades one warehouse herb for a Dragon Strength Pill.","Xiao Yan finds the Asparagus Ice Fire Fruit; Zi Yan grabs it.","He promises to refine her herbs into tasty pills; she gives him the fruit.","Zi Yan explains the Shape-Shifting Flower and her lonely life in the mountains.","She tells him she is number one on the Strong Ranking.","Elder Hao points him to Elder Liu, who uses fire-type skills, for the Monster Core.","Elder Liu takes a Core-Fire Lotus Seed and a Dragon Strength Pill for the Rank Six Monster Core."],"introduced":["Zi Yan","Elder Liu","Medicinal Ingredients Warehouse","Asparagus Ice Fire Fruit","Rank Six Water Type Monster Core","Flame Core Ganoderma","Blood Python Branch","Fighting Spirit Pill (Sixth-Tier)","Shape-Shifting Flower","Core-Fire Lotus Seed"],"confidence":"high"},{"ep":95,"title":"The Ground Spirit Pill","summary":"Yao Lao refines the Sixth-Tier Ground Spirit Pill in the mountains with the Black Demon Cauldron while Xiao Yan watches. Meanwhile, Mr. Ling tells Xun Er that her clan will come to take her home in a month and that the elders think Xiao Yan doesn't deserve her. The pill's forming causes a sky phenomenon that draws Han Feng, the Medicine Emperor of the Black-Corner Region, though he turns back. The First Elder also comes looking, and Xiao Yan hides. Zi Yan then finds him, fakes the elder's voice, and drags him back to the Rock Gate to refine more pills. She reveals she told Han Yue about the Core Quenching Body Milk and makes a herb-hunting deal with him. At the end, Xiao Yu calls him to the Outer Academy, where his second brother Xiao Li lies unconscious.","events":["Yao Lao refines the Ground Spirit Pill with the Black Demon Cauldron, herb by herb.","Mr. Ling tells Xun Er the clan will fetch her in a month.","The pill's phenomenon draws Han Feng, who decides not to interfere.","The First Elder searches for the alchemist; Xiao Yan hides.","Zi Yan fakes the elder's voice and takes Xiao Yan back to the Rock Gate.","Zi Yan says she told the gray-haired Han Yue about the milk; she and Xiao Yan agree to hunt herbs together.","Lin Yan attacks Xiao Yan for a spar; Zi Yan scares him off.","Xiao Yu summons Xiao Yan; Xiao Li is unconscious."],"introduced":["Ground Spirit Pill (Sixth-Tier)","Black Demon Cauldron","Han Feng, the Medicine Emperor","Black-Corner Region (named here)","Mr. Ling","the Matriarch (of Xun Er's clan)","'the part of the key'","Old Huo"],"cultivation":"Han Feng: 'Han Feng isn't just a strongest Dou Huang. He is also a Sixth-Tier Alchemist.'","confidence":"high"},{"ep":96,"title":"The Attack on the Xiao Clan","summary":"Xiao Yan treats his brother Xiao Li all night at the Outer Academy with Xun Er, Xiao Yu and Ruo Lin. Xiao Li tells him the Misty Cloud Sect attacked the Xiao Clan at the Desert Metal Mercenary Company during a festival. A silhouette with a black iron chain dragged away clansmen and seemed to be searching for something. The clan's First Elder died, and Xiao Ding stayed behind to stall the attackers. Hai Bodong saved Xiao Ding, and the Mite'er family helped the survivors escape. Xun Er tells Xiao Yan the Hall of Souls, a mysterious Central Plains group that captures souls, is likely after the jade of Tuo She Gu Di, and that the Misty Cloud Sect is working with it. Healed and now a Da Dou Shi, Xiao Li leaves for the Black-Corner Region with pills and a ring holding a small Heavenly Flame.","events":["Xiao Li wakes after Xiao Yan treats him through the night.","Xiao Li tells of the Misty Cloud Sect ambush at the Desert Metal Mercenary Company.","A silhouette with a black iron chain drags clansmen away; the First Elder dies telling them to guard the family jade.","Xiao Ding stays behind; Hai Bodong saves him, and the Mite'er family hides the survivors.","Xiao Yu learns her father lost an arm.","Xun Er explains the Hall of Souls and its link to the jade of Tuo She Gu Di.","Xiao Li breaks through to Da Dou Shi and sets off for the Black-Corner Region with Xiao Yan's ring and Xun Er's lightning skills.","With 25 days left before the Strong Ranking Competition, Xiao Yan starts accepting public duels."],"introduced":["Desert Metal Mercenary Company (as the Xiao Clan's refuge)","the silhouette with the black iron chain (Hall of Souls)","Hall of Souls (explained by Xun Er)","Mite'er family","Xiao Clan First Elder (killed)"],"cultivation":"Xiao Li breaks through and becomes a Da Dou Shi.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":97,"title":"The Tower Quakes","summary":"Xiao Yan, now a Two-Star Dou Ling, trains on the sixth floor of the Blazing Qi Refining Tower. Yao Sheng of the Mountain Splitting Gang, ranked 17th, picks a fight with his Ghost Whale Water Wall until Liu Qing stops it. Zi Yan then arrives and lends Xiao Yan her own training spot. Soon the tower shakes because the Fallen Heart Flame is pushing at its seal, and the elders patch it with a Small Space Seal. The First Elder, Su Qian, knows Xiao Yan has a Heavenly Flame and asks him to help the academy with the seal one day. That night Xiao Yan and Xun Er watch fireflies and a shooting star, and he gives her a gift he puts on her himself.","events":["Students mock Xiao Yan for being a Two-Star Dou Ling on the sixth floor.","Yao Sheng challenges him; Xiao Yan blocks the corrosive Ghost Whale Water Wall.","Liu Qing stops the fight and says it will be settled at the competition.","Zi Yan arrives and lends Xiao Yan her training spot.","The Fallen Heart Flame shakes the tower; the elders repair the seal with a Small Space Seal and close the tower.","Su Qian introduces himself and asks Xiao Yan to help with the Fallen Heart Flame later.","Xun Er remembers Mr. Ling's warning; she and Xiao Yan watch the stars and he gives her a gift."],"introduced":["Yao Sheng","Ghost Whale Water Wall","Small Space Seal","sixth floor of the Blazing Qi Refining Tower","Su Qian (named, introduces himself)"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan is called a Two-Star Dou Ling. Yao Sheng is 'at least a Seven-Star Dou Ling', ranked 17th on the Strong Ranking.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":98,"title":"The Strong Ranking Grand Competition","summary":"The Strong Ranking Grand Competition of the Inner Academy begins, with fifty contestants drawing 25 blue and 25 red lots. Lin Xiu Ya, Liu Qing and Zi Yan are there, and onlookers wonder how Xiao Yan learned the Wind Lightning Pavilion's speed skill. Xiao Yan draws blue 15 and faces Bai Cheng again. In the first match Zi Yan knocks out Bei Ju, ranked 33rd, with one punch, after he had boasted he would beat Xiao Yan. Bai Cheng returns bald and one level stronger after secluded training, using a secret technique and the Blood Earthquake. He only wants to drain Xiao Yan's Dou Qi, so Xiao Yan forms Green Lotus Core Flame armor, then Octane Blast forces Bai Cheng to admit defeat.","events":["Lin Xiu Ya and Han Yue say the Snow Demon Sky Ape drove them off again.","Liu Fei pushes Liu Qing's gang to take revenge on Xun Er.","Su Qian explains the lot draw and warns against killing.","Xiao Yan draws blue 15 against Bai Cheng.","Zi Yan beats Bei Ju, ranked 33rd, with one punch.","Bai Cheng, bald and stronger, uses a secret technique and the Blood Earthquake.","Xiao Yan defends with Green Lotus Core Flame armor and wins with Octane Blast; Bai Cheng surrenders."],"introduced":["Strong Ranking Grand Competition rules (50 lots, blue and red, 1-25)","Bei Ju","Blood Earthquake (part of Blood Ground Eight Split)","Green Lotus Core Flame armor (Heavenly Flame Armor)","Wind Lightning Pavilion (the speed skill's owner, named by onlookers)"],"cultivation":"Bai Cheng 'broke through a level' after secluded training.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":99,"title":"Xiao Yan versus Yao Sheng","summary":"After beating Bai Cheng, Xiao Yan recovers his Dou Qi quickly, since he is a fifth-tier alchemist. Xun Er tells him Bai Cheng used Blood Ground Eight Split, a Xuan Class Dou Skill, and that Bai Cheng's family is a second-rate Central Plains clan. Liu Qing easily wins his match with the Great Rift Coffin Splitting Claw, and Lin Xiu Ya wins his with the Pestering Snake Hand. Mr. Ling reminds Xun Er that a month has passed; she will leave once Xiao Yan makes the top ten. In round two, Zi Yan gets the bye. Xiao Yan draws Yao Sheng, who bribed his way into the match to avenge Liu Fei. The two are even until Yao Sheng traps him in the Black Water Border, and Xiao Yan escapes with the Purple Cloud Wings, beating Yao Sheng with Octane Blast.","events":["Xiao Yan is declared the winner over Bai Cheng.","Xun Er explains Blood Ground Eight Split and Bai Cheng's Central Plains family.","Liu Qing wins with the Great Rift Coffin Splitting Claw.","Mr. Ling presses Xun Er to leave; she waits for the top-ten result.","Zi Yan gets the round-two bye; Lin Xiu Ya wins with the Pestering Snake Hand.","Xiao Yan faces Yao Sheng and uses the Green Lotus Change.","Yao Sheng traps him in the Black Water Border.","Xiao Yan flies out on the Purple Cloud Wings and wins with Octane Blast."],"introduced":["Blood Ground Eight Split (Xuan Class Dou Skill)","Great Rift Coffin Splitting Claw","Three Sharks Thorns (Liu Qing's opponent's attack)","Pestering Snake Hand","Black Water Border","Annihilation Phantom Thorn","Lion Tiger Gold Shattering Roar","Brute Force Queen (Zi Yan's nickname)"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan is called a fifth-tier alchemist. No realm changes.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":100,"title":"Xun Er's Scroll","summary":"Xiao Yan's win over Yao Sheng puts him close to the top ten. Liu Qing then crushes the 11th-ranked student, an Eight-Star Dou Ling, with raw strength alone. Xiao Yan tells Xun Er he knows she hides her strength around him and wants to see her shine. That night she gives him a sealed Dou Skill scroll that he may only open once he is a Dou Wang, and warns him to keep the jade of Tuo She Gu Di secret. She then tells her guardian not to let anyone, not even her father, know about the gift. The next day 13 contestants remain and three random matches decide the last places. Yan Hao, with his Black Metal Hammer, beats Qian Mo and his Golden Sawtooth Disc. Zi Yan wins when Qin Zhen pretends to have an upset stomach, and Liu Qing is drawn against Xiao Yan.","events":["Friends congratulate Xiao Yan; someone invites him back to the mountains for the Core Quenching Body Milk after the competition.","Liu Qing beats an Eight-Star Dou Ling without his spear.","Xiao Yan asks Xun Er to stop holding back her strength.","Xun Er gives Xiao Yan a sealed Dou Skill scroll for when he becomes a Dou Wang.","Zi Yan says she fought a Dou Huang class Magical Beast over a magical medicine.","Thirteen remain; three random matches decide the top ten.","Yan Hao beats Qian Mo.","Zi Yan wins by forfeit from Qin Zhen; Liu Qing is drawn against Xiao Yan."],"introduced":["Qian Mo","Golden Sawtooth Disc","Black Metal Hammer (Yan Hao)","Wind-Attribute Dou Qi","Qin Zhen (named; does not appear)","the sealed Dou Skill scroll from Xun Er","Flying Dou Skill (what onlookers call the Purple Cloud Wings)"],"cultivation":"Liu Qing is 'almost a Dou Wang'. The 11th-ranked student is an Eight-Star Dou Ling; Qin Zhen is an Eight-Star Dou Ling.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":101,"title":"Xiao Yan versus Liu Qing","summary":"Xiao Yan faces Tyrant Spear Liu Qing, third on the Strong Ranking, for a top-ten place. He opens with the Green Lotus Change, and his heavy ruler and Dark Energy push Liu Qing back despite the Great Rift Coffin Splitting Claw. Liu Qing then brings out his Mountain Splitting Spear and its Great Rift Rock. Xiao Yan answers with the Flame Splitting Tsunami, which onlookers call at least a Di Class skill. Su Qian has to use Space Lock to shield the crowd, and both fighters fall unconscious, so the match is a tie and both enter the top ten in tenth place. Xun Er then challenges Lin Xiu Ya, second on the Strong Ranking, and beats him easily. Meanwhile, Ling Quan and his men reach the edge of the Black-Corner Region.","events":["Liu Qing is drawn against Xiao Yan; Zi Yan offers to beat Liu Qing up first.","Xiao Yan uses the Green Lotus Change, his heavy ruler and Dark Energy against the Great Rift Coffin Splitting Claw.","A flame-lotus explosion hurts Liu Qing.","Liu Qing uses the Mountain Splitting Spear, a Xuan Class Advanced skill.","Xiao Yan's Flame Splitting Tsunami meets Liu Qing's Great Rift Rock.","Su Qian casts Space Lock to protect the crowd; both fighters pass out.","The match is a tie; both tie for tenth in the top ten.","Xun Er challenges Lin Xiu Ya and wins.","Ling Quan's group arrives near the Black-Corner Region."],"introduced":["Mountain Splitting Spear (Xuan Class Advanced Dou Skill), on screen","Great Rift Rock","Flame Splitting Tsunami","Space Lock","Green Smoke Sword Blade","Di Class (Dou Skill grade, named)","Ling Quan (seen arriving near the Black-Corner Region)"],"cultivation":"No breakthroughs. Xiao Yan and Liu Qing tie for tenth place on the Strong Ranking.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":102,"title":"Xun Er Goes Home","summary":"Xiao Yan cultivates unconscious for three days while Xun Er and Zi Yan watch over him, and Xun Er politely receives Lin Xiu Ya, who brings medicine and clearly has a crush on her. Xiao Yan wakes as a Five-Star Dou Ling, though the Searing Poison he took in while curing Nalan Jie is still in his body, and finds that Lin Yan has joined the Rock Gate. On a walk, Ling Quan, the new deputy commander of the Black Submerged Army, arrives to take Xun Er home on her clan leader's orders and asks Xiao Yan where the Xiao Clan keeps its key. Xun Er tells Xiao Yan to hide the jade of Tuo She Gu Di and not to come for her until he is strong enough, and he swears he will become a Dou Zun, Dou Sheng or even Dou Di to bring her back. After she leaves, Ling Quan stays to tell Xiao Yan he doesn't deserve her and threatens him, until Su Qian arrives and orders him out of the Inner Academy. Yao Lao cheers Xiao Yan up and reminds him that tomorrow he enters the Blazing Qi Refining Tower for the Heart Flame's body forging.","events":["Xiao Yan cultivates unconscious for three days after the tie.","Lin Xiu Ya brings medicine; Xun Er receives him politely.","Xiao Yan wakes a Five-Star Dou Ling; the Searing Poison remains.","Lin Yan has joined the Rock Gate and tells Xiao Yan how Xun Er beat Lin Xiu Ya.","Ling Quan of the Black Submerged Army comes for Xun Er and asks about the Xiao Clan's key.","Xun Er agrees to go home and warns Xiao Yan about the jade of Tuo She Gu Di; Xiao Yan vows to come for her.","Ling Quan stays behind to warn Xiao Yan off Xun Er; Su Qian orders him out.","Yao Lao reminds Xiao Yan of the Heart Flame's body forging the next day."],"introduced":["Black Submerged Army","Ling Quan (introduces himself)","Searing Poison","Nalan Jie (named)","the Xiao Clan's key","the agreement between the Xiao Clan and Xun Er's clan","Dou Zun, Dou Sheng, Dou Di (named as goals)","Heart Flame's body forging (named)"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan breaks through to Five-Star Dou Ling.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":103,"title":"The Essence Heart Flame","summary":"Xiao Yan joins the rest of the top ten, Lin Yan, Liu Qing and Zi Yan among them, at the Blazing Qi Refining Tower, and Liu Qing now calls him his rival. Su Qian leads them past guards and seals to the lowest level, where they forge their bodies with the Essence Heart Flame, which helps students below Dou Wang on the hard road to breaking through. About half usually fail, and this year four give up while seven, including Xiao Yan, hold on. Su Qian goes to check the Fallen Heart Flame, which has been oddly quiet since the elders spent five days repairing its seal, and finds it much stronger and attacking the seal. He orders all students out and calls every elder to the tower, but the seal breaks. Elsewhere, Han Feng, the Medicine Emperor, tells Ban Lao, Chief Yuan and Chief Fan that he has sensed a Heavenly Flame in the Jia Nan Academy and promises each of them two favours for their help. The Blood Sect, the Eight Gates and the Ground Flame Sect join him, and Han Feng says he has his own way to find the hidden Inner Academy.","events":["Xiao Yan meets the top ten at the tower; Liu Qing calls him his rival.","Su Qian leads them past guards and seals to the lowest level.","The students forge their bodies in the Essence Heart Flame; four fail, seven continue.","Su Qian learns the Fallen Heart Flame has been quiet since the elders repaired the seal, and goes to look.","The flame attacks the seal; students are ordered out, the elders are called, and the seal breaks.","Han Feng meets Ban Lao, Chief Yuan and Chief Fan and asks for help taking the academy's Heavenly Flame.","The Blood Sect, the Eight Gates and the Ground Flame Sect pledge themselves to the Medicine Emperor."],"introduced":["Essence Heart Flame","Gu Clan (named in the recap)","the dean's seal on the Blazing Qi Refining Tower","Ban Lao","Chief Yuan","Blood Sect","Eight Gates","Ground Flame Sect","Dean Mang (named, away for years)","the Medicine Emperor's two promises"],"cultivation":"No breakthroughs; the recap repeats that Xiao Yan became a Five-Star Dou Ling. One of Han Feng's allies says Su Qian is a Dou Zong, Hu Qian, vice dean of the Outer Academy, is a Dou Huang, and the other academy elders are Dou Wangs.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":104,"title":"The Fallen Heart Flame Breaks Free","summary":"The Fallen Heart Flame rises from the Blazing Qi Refining Tower in the shape of a huge fire python, and Zi Yan says it has no Magical Beast aura. Yao Lao tells Xiao Yan he can't capture it in his current state, so they hide and watch. Su Qian and the Inner Academy elders cast the Thousand Layers Formation and an energy net to hold the flame. Han Feng enters the academy with the Black-Corner Region leaders, and his men take on the academy's Enforcer Squad. The Outer Academy's vice dean and elders arrive to hold the net, and while the flame rests, Su Qian leads the Inner Academy elders in a sealing formation that forces it back. Yao Lao senses another force coming, and Han Feng appears at the tower and greets Su Qian.","events":["Students flee the tower as the flame bursts out.","The Fallen Heart Flame takes a python-like beast form; Zi Yan says it has no Magical Beast aura.","Yao Lao keeps Xiao Yan back to watch.","The elders cast the Thousand Layers Formation; Rock Gate members head to the tower.","Han Feng's group enters the academy and meets the Enforcer Squad.","The Outer Academy's vice dean and elders arrive and join the energy net.","Su Qian's elders seal the flame back in while it rests.","Han Feng appears at the tower and greets Su Qian."],"introduced":["Thousand Layers Formation","Enforcer Squad of the Jia Nan Academy","the Fallen Heart Flame's fire-python form"],"cultivation":"Su Qian is a Dou Zong (onlooker: 'He is a strong Dou Zong').","confidence":"high"},{"ep":105,"title":"The Medicine Emperor Comes for the Flame","summary":"Su Qian and the Inner Academy elders force the Fallen Heart Flame back into its seal inside the Blazing Qi Refining Tower. Han Feng, the Medicine Emperor of the Black-Corner Region, then arrives with the leaders of the Blood Sect and the Eight Gates and demands the Heavenly Flame. Su Qian refuses, saying he would only have listened if the request came from Han Feng's master, Yao Zun Zhe. Han Feng hires the twin brothers Mr. Jin and Mr. Yin, who fight Su Qian together, while Fan Lao and other Black-Corner fighters hold off the elders. Yao Lao tells Xiao Yan that Han Feng is his former disciple, who stole part of the Flame Mantra and so wants a second Heavenly Flame. Xiao Yan swears to kill Han Feng, but Yao Lao tells him he is not strong enough yet. Mr. Jin and Mr. Yin merge with their Conjoining Skill and push Su Qian back.","events":["Su Qian and the elders reseal the Fallen Heart Flame in the tower","Han Feng arrives with Black-Corner Region leaders and reveals he owns a Heavenly Flame","Su Qian refuses to hand over the flame and names Han Feng's master, Yao Zun Zhe","Mr. Jin and Mr. Yin step in to fight Su Qian; Fan Lao and others fight the elders","Han Feng goes to break the seal and Elder Fan Lao is held off by Inner Academy elders","Yao Lao reveals Han Feng was his disciple who stole the incomplete Flame Mantra","Mr. Jin and Mr. Yin use the Conjoining Skill and the Gold and Silver Sky-Capturing Skill on Su Qian"],"introduced":["Mr. Jin","Mr. Yin","Yao Zun Zhe (Yao Lao's title)","Incomplete Flame Mantra","Conjoining Skill","Gold and Silver Sky-Capturing Skill","Bone Transforming Bloody Evil Palm","Green Wooden Shield","Blood Sect","Eight Gates"],"confidence":"high"},{"ep":106,"title":"Fan Lao's Revenge","summary":"While Su Qian fights Mr. Jin and Mr. Yin, Xiao Yan shows himself near the tower and Fan Lao, chief of the Blood Sect, recognises him as the boy who killed his son Fan Ling. Fan Lao, a Dou Huang, chases Xiao Yan, a Dou Ling. Zi Yan, Liu Qing, Lin Xiu Ya and other students step in and hold Fan Lao off for three minutes. In that time Xiao Yan borrows Yao Lao's power and jumps two levels to fight as a Dou Huang. Han Feng sees Xiao Yan's Heavenly Flame and recognises it as the Green Lotus Core Flame, 19th on the Heavenly Flames Ranking, and decides he wants it too. Fan Lao answers with his Blood Transforming Skill and the two Dou Huangs clash.","events":["Fan Lao spots Xiao Yan and attacks him to avenge his son Fan Ling","Zi Yan, Liu Qing and the other students step in to protect Xiao Yan","Xiao Yan asks them to stall Fan Lao for three minutes","The students fight Fan Lao's Blood Sect skills; Zi Yan is hurt","Xiao Yan returns at Dou Huang strength and sends his friends back","Han Feng recognises the Green Lotus Core Flame and wants both flames","Fan Lao uses the Blood Transforming Skill against Xiao Yan"],"introduced":["Blood Consuming Armor","Blood Demon Palm","Blood Devouring Seal","Blood Transforming Skill","Sky Splitting Mountain","Green Smoke Sword Blade","Brute Force Queen (nickname for Zi Yan)"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan, a Dou Ling, borrows Yao Lao's power and fights at Dou Huang strength (a temporary jump of two levels).","confidence":"high"},{"ep":107,"title":"The Fallen Heart Flame Wakes","summary":"Xiao Yan meets Fan Lao's Great Blood Bodhisattva Devourer with his own Di Class Flame Splitting Tsunami and wins, though Fan Lao escapes by cutting himself with a blood technique. The Fallen Heart Flame, 14th on the Heavenly Flames Ranking, breaks the seal again and takes a body with its own mind. Han Feng waits for the elders and the flame to wear each other out, and plans to take Xiao Yan's flame later. Yao Lao warns Xiao Yan not to face Han Feng until he is a Dou Wang. The Fallen Heart Flame goes after Han Feng to eat his Heavenly Flame, and Han Feng fights back with Sky Cold Air. The flame then hides among ordinary flames and turns on Xiao Yan.","events":["Flame Splitting Tsunami beats Fan Lao's Great Blood Bodhisattva Devourer","Fan Lao flees using a self-wounding blood escape technique","The Fallen Heart Flame breaks the seal and forms a body with intelligence","Han Feng holds back and plans to take Xiao Yan's Heavenly Flame later","The flame targets Han Feng to devour his Heavenly Flame; his allies pull back","Han Feng uses Sky Cold Air to suppress the flame","The flame disguises itself and turns on Xiao Yan"],"introduced":["Great Blood Bodhisattva Devourer","Flame Splitting Tsunami","Di Class Dou Skill","Fallen Heart Flame (14th on the Heavenly Flames Ranking)","Sky Cold Air"],"cultivation":"Han Feng judges Xiao Yan to be as strong as a Five-Star Dou Huang with borrowed power. Yao Lao says Xiao Yan should avoid Han Feng until he reaches Dou Wang; Xiao Yan sees the Fallen Heart Flame as his fast route to Dou Wang.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":108,"title":"Teacher and Traitor","summary":"Guided by Yao Lao, Xiao Yan strikes the hidden core of the Fallen Heart Flame and forces it into its true form. Han Feng fights him for it with his Sea Heart Flame. When Xiao Yan reveals he practises the complete Flame Mantra, Yao Lao shows himself, and Han Feng learns his old master is still alive inside Xiao Yan. Han Feng uses his Sea Flame Trident, but Xiao Yan's Angry Buddha Lotus Flame blasts him into a coma, and his allies carry him off. The Fallen Heart Flame then feeds on the blast and turns on Xiao Yan. Su Qian orders the Eight-Way Dragon Binding Formation, and Xiao Yan stays inside as bait until the flame swallows him and the elders seal it. Su Qian closes the tower's lowest floor for good and honours Xiao Yan as the academy's finest student.","events":["Xiao Yan hits the flame's core and it shows its original form","Han Feng offers a sixth-tier prescription for the flame, then attacks with the Sea Heart Flame","Xiao Yan reveals the complete Flame Mantra; Yao Lao confronts Han Feng","Xiao Yan's Angry Buddha Lotus Flame defeats Han Feng's Sea Flame Trident","Han Feng survives in a coma and his Black-Corner allies withdraw","The Fallen Heart Flame absorbs the blast energy and attacks Xiao Yan","The elders cast the Eight-Way Dragon Binding Formation while Xiao Yan acts as bait","The flame swallows Xiao Yan and is sealed; the lowest floor is closed"],"introduced":["Sea Heart Flame","Sea Flame Trident","Angry Buddha Lotus Flame","Bone Chilling Flame (named by Han Feng)","Eight-Way Dragon Binding Formation","Sixth-Tier Prescription"],"confidence":"high"},{"ep":109,"title":"Inside the Fallen Heart Flame","summary":"In the Jia Ma Empire's capital, Hai Bodong and Ya Fei of the Mite'er family shelter Xiao Ding and the surviving Xiao Clan. Deep underground, Xiao Yan wakes inside the Fallen Heart Flame after about half a month. Yao Lao has been shielding him with the Bone Chilling Flame. He says it will last three more days, after which he will pour his remaining Soul Power into Xiao Yan and fall into a deep sleep. At the academy, Zi Yan takes charge of the Rock Gate, and Su Qian seals the lowest floor and plans revenge on the Black-Corner Region. He also sends someone to guard Xiao Yan's brother Xiao Li. Yao Lao goes to sleep, and Medusa wakes inside the lava world and attacks the flame, which only makes its heat worse, and Xiao Yan loses consciousness.","events":["Hai Bodong and Ya Fei shelter Xiao Ding and the Xiao Clan in the capital","Xiao Yan wakes inside the Fallen Heart Flame's lava world","Yao Lao gives him three days, the Lotus Platform and the Ground Spirit Pill","Zi Yan takes over the Rock Gate in Xiao Yan's name","Su Qian seals the lowest floor and plans revenge on the Black-Corner Region; Xiao Li is to be protected","Yao Lao gives his last Soul Power and falls asleep","Medusa wakes, attacks the flame, and the heat overwhelms them both"],"introduced":["Mite'er family","Lotus Platform","Ground Spirit Pill","Fire Energies","Birthplace of the Fallen Heart Flame (lava world)"],"confidence":"high"},{"ep":110,"title":"Two Heavenly Flames","summary":"Xiao Yan survives the Fallen Heart Flame's refining. His meridians are tougher, his Dou Crystal is gone, and Dou Qi now flows from his whole body, enough to form Dou Qi Wings. His storage ring burned away, and he believes the pills and herbs inside kept him alive. He finds the flame's core and, using the Flame Mantra, merges the Fallen Heart Flame with his Green Lotus Core Flame. The merge sets off an evil fire inside him that he has to fight off. In the capital, Hai Bodong tells Ya Fei the Misty Cloud Sect is after something the Xiao Clan owns, now that Yun Shan has removed Yun Yun as leader. Xiao Li fights the Black Alliance in the Black-Corner Region, while underground Xiao Yan talks Medusa into a truce to break out together.","events":["Xiao Yan wakes alive with stronger meridians and no Dou Crystal","He grows Dou Qi Wings and loses his storage ring","He hunts down the Fallen Heart Flame's core","Hai Bodong and Ya Fei discuss the Misty Cloud Sect under Yun Shan","Xiao Yan merges the Fallen Heart Flame with the Green Lotus Core Flame","An evil fire rises from the merge and he fights to control it","Xiao Li fights Black Alliance members in the Black-Corner Region","Xiao Yan and Medusa agree to work together to break the seal"],"introduced":["Dou Qi Wings","Black Alliance","Seven-Colored Dou Qi","evil flame (side effect of merging Heavenly Flames)"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan's Dou Crystal disappears and Dou Qi flows straight from his body; his meridians are strengthened. Medusa is close to full control of her body and becoming a Dou Zong. (Ep111's recap says he broke through to Dou Wang during the two years underground.)","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":111,"title":"Xiao Yan Returns","summary":"Two years after the disaster, Zi Yan and Xiao Yu are at the Inner Academy when the Blazing Qi Refining Tower opens again. The Fallen Heart Flame bursts out, and Xiao Yan comes out with it, now a Dou Wang. To welcome him back, Lin Xiu Ya, now a Five-Star Dou Wang and an elder, spars with him in front of the academy and loses to one move. Medusa then turns up as a Dou Zong to kill him, but agrees to wait until he has finished his tasks. Xiao Yan tells Su Qian he refined the Fallen Heart Flame and agrees to bring part of it back every year or two. He asks for herbs to restore Soul Power, and Su Qian warns that Han Feng now leads the Black Alliance, and that Fan Lao is about to attack Xiao Yan's brother Xiao Li. Xiao Yan leads the Rock Gate into the Black-Corner Region to save him.","events":["The tower is opened again and the Fallen Heart Flame bursts out","Xiao Yan comes out after two years as a Dou Wang","He beats Lin Xiu Ya, a Five-Star Dou Wang, in one move","Medusa appears to kill him but lets him go for now","He promises Su Qian part of the refined Fallen Heart Flame and asks for soul-restoring herbs","Su Qian tells him about the Black Alliance and Xiao Li's danger","The Rock Gate sets out for the Black-Corner Region; Xiao Yan promises Zi Yan the Body Transformation Pill"],"introduced":["Blade Net","Wolf Fang (Lin Xiu Ya's group)","Body Transformation Pill","secret organization founded by Xiao Li"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan has broken through to Dou Wang. Lin Xiu Ya is a Five-Star Dou Wang and now an elder. Medusa is a Dou Zong.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":112,"title":"Fan Lao's End","summary":"Fan Lao of the Blood Sect leads the Black Alliance against Xiao Li's nameless organization in the Black-Corner Region and storms its fortress. As Fan Lao is about to make Xiao Li a Blood Slave, Xiao Yan arrives. Xiao Li learns his brother is alive, and Medusa turns up too. Fan Lao offers to team up with her, but she says Xiao Yan's life is hers and leaves. Zi Yan and Lin Yan take on two of Fan Lao's men while Xiao Yan fights Fan Lao and burns him to death with his Heavenly Flame. The rest of the attackers break when Xiao Yan shows his power. Xiao Yan sends word that he will soon come for Han Feng.","events":["The Black Alliance under Fan Lao destroys Xiao Li's sentries and attacks his fortress","Fan Lao beats Xiao Li and threatens to make him a Blood Slave","Xiao Yan arrives and Xiao Li learns he is alive","Medusa refuses Fan Lao's offer to join forces and leaves","Zi Yan and Lin Yan take two Dou Wangs; Xiao Yan fights Fan Lao","Xiao Yan kills Fan Lao and sends a warning to Han Feng","The remaining attackers flee and the fortress is saved"],"introduced":["Blood Slave"],"confidence":"high"},{"ep":113,"title":"Storming Feng City","summary":"Xiao Li tells Xiao Yan that he took a Life Devouring Pill, which raised him from Da Dou Shi to Dou Wang but leaves him only three years to live. Xiao Yan takes its sealed prescription and promises to find an antidote. Su Qian leads the Jia Nan Academy, with Xiao Li's men, against Han Feng's Black Alliance at its headquarters, Feng City. Han Feng, a sixth-tier alchemist, had planned to strike first, and wants the complete Flame Mantra from Xiao Yan. On the way Su Qian says he knows Xiao Yan is linked to Yao Zun Zhe, and he keeps the secret. At Feng City, Su Qian takes Mr. Jin and Mr. Yin while Xiao Yan fights Han Feng. Xiao Yan's merged flames break down the Sea Heart Flame, but Han Feng shows he is close to Dou Zong.","events":["Xiao Li reveals he took the Life Devouring Pill and has three years to live","Xiao Yan takes the pill's prescription to make an antidote","Su Qian leads the academy and Xiao Li's men against the Black Alliance","Han Feng's alliance discusses Xiao Yan's return","Su Qian guesses Xiao Yan's link to Yao Zun Zhe and keeps it secret","Xiao Yan gives Xiao Li a bottle of Angry Buddha Lotus Flame for protection","At Feng City, Xiao Yan fights Han Feng while Su Qian takes Mr. Jin and Mr. Yin","Xiao Yan's merged flames break down the Sea Heart Flame"],"introduced":["Life Devouring Pill","Feng City","Xiao Gate (named in the recap)"],"cultivation":"Xiao Li went from Da Dou Shi to Dou Wang with the Life Devouring Pill. Han Feng is a sixth-tier alchemist and close to Dou Zong.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":114,"title":"Han Feng Falls","summary":"Xiao Yan, now strong on his own, fights Han Feng, a Half-Step Dou Zong, with a new Fire Lotus. Han Feng survives the blast and tries to kill Xiao Yan, but Medusa steps in and kicks him to death. A Soul Envoy of the Hall of Souls takes Han Feng's soul and his Sea Heart Flame. The envoy confirms that Yao Chen's spirit lives inside Xiao Yan and warns that stronger men will come. Medusa warns Xiao Yan she won't spare him next time. Su Qian gives him Han Feng's Serene Sea Storage Ring, and the Black Alliance falls. Xiao Yan names his fused flame the Glaze Lotus Core Flame and opens the Dou Skill scroll, the God Seal Technique.","events":["Xiao Yan and Han Feng trade their strongest flame attacks","Xiao Yan's Fire Lotus beats Han Feng's Sea Heart Magical Beast","Medusa saves Xiao Yan and kills Han Feng with a kick","A Soul Envoy of the Hall of Souls takes Han Feng's soul and the Sea Heart Flame","Su Qian gives Xiao Yan the Serene Sea Storage Ring; the Black Alliance falls","Xiao Yan names his fused flame the Glaze Lotus Core Flame","He opens the God Seal Technique scroll"],"introduced":["Hall of Souls","Soul Envoy","Sea Heart Magical Beast","Brilliance Seal","Serene Sea Storage Ring","Searing Poison","Glaze Lotus Core Flame","God Seal Technique","Open Mountain Seal","Sea Flipping Seal","Overturning Land Seal","Sky Burying Seal","Ancient God Seal","Di Class High Rank","Tian Class Dou Skill"],"cultivation":"Han Feng is a Half-Step Dou Zong. Xiao Yan has purged the Searing Poison during his two years underground and has fused two Heavenly Flames. The God Seal Technique needs at least Dou Wang.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":115,"title":"A Deal with Medusa","summary":"A message from Xun Er in the God Seal Technique scroll says she can only give Xiao Yan its first two seals, and that her clan guards it closely. Xiao Yu visits Xiao Yan at the academy, and he tells her he will return to the Jia Ma Empire to settle things with the Misty Cloud Sect. Su Qian lets Xiao Li build a force in the Black-Corner Region that is friendly to the academy. Xiao Yan finds Medusa, who still cannot kill him because of the Heaven Swallowing Python inside her. He offers to refine the sixth-tier Soul Recovery Pill to free her, if she guards him and helps him for a year, and he names her Cai Lin. In the capital, Hai Bodong beats back two Misty Cloud Sect Dou Huangs, and Yun Shan absorbs them after they fail. Xiao Yan practises the Open Mountain Seal.","events":["Xun Er's image in the scroll gives Xiao Yan the first two seals and a warning","Hai Bodong fights two Misty Cloud Sect Dou Huangs in the capital","Xiao Yu visits; Xiao Yan says he will go back to the Jia Ma Empire","Su Qian agrees to Xiao Li building a force in the Black-Corner Region","Xiao Yan tells Su Qian the female Dou Zong is Queen Medusa","He makes a one-year deal with Medusa for the Soul Recovery Pill and names her Cai Lin","Yun Shan absorbs the two failed elders","Xiao Yan practises the Open Mountain Seal"],"introduced":["Soul Recovery Pill","Cai Lin (Medusa's new name)","Wind Spirit Fractal Sword","Xiao Mei"],"cultivation":"The Open Mountain Seal needs Dou Wang and the Sea Flipping Seal is best learned at Dou Huang. Yun Shan's elders reach Dou Huang combat level by absorbing others.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":116,"title":"The Xiao Gate in Feng City","summary":"The Crazy Lion Sect, Dark Sky Sect and Luo Sha Gate decide to take Feng City from Xiao Li's new Xiao Gate. Xiao Yan masters the first God Seal, the Open Mountain Seal, and drags Medusa along to the city. He arrives as the three leaders threaten Xiao Li, and Medusa's Dou Zong power scares them off. Instead of punishing them, Xiao Yan offers a deal: help him fight the Misty Cloud Sect for 30% of Feng City's rule and a Mighty Huang Pill. Medusa refuses to help fight Yun Shan. Xiao Li agrees to find the last two herbs for a pill. With the treasures from Han Feng's ring, Xiao Yan gets the herbs for the Spiritual Recovery Purple Pill and refines one for Hai Bodong.","events":["Three Black-Corner sects plan to take Feng City from the Xiao Gate","Xiao Yan masters the Open Mountain Seal","Xiao Yan and Medusa arrive as the three leaders threaten Xiao Li","Medusa's Dou Zong power cows the three leaders","Xiao Yan offers 30% of Feng City and a Mighty Huang Pill for their help against the Misty Cloud Sect","Medusa refuses to fight Yun Shan","Xiao Li agrees to find the Yin Shen Flower and Huo Yang Spiritual Leave","Xiao Yan refines the Spiritual Recovery Purple Pill for Hai Bodong"],"introduced":["Su Mei","Yin Gu","Tie Niao","Crazy Lion Sect","Dark Sky Sect","Luo Sha Gate","Xiao Gate","Mighty Huang Pill","Yin Shen Flower","Huo Yang Spiritual Leave","Spiritual Recovery Purple Pill","Snakemen Clan"],"cultivation":"The Mighty Huang Pill raises a Dou Huang by one or two stars at once. Xiao Yan says he is a sixth-tier alchemist. The Misty Cloud Sect has one Dou Huang besides Yun Shan, a Dou Zong.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":117,"title":"Waking Yao Lao","summary":"Xiao Yan refines a sixth-tier pill in a cauldron that hides the pill's signs, and Xiao Li holds a pill auction in Feng City. Black Alliance remnants interrupt it and claim the city. Mr. Jin and Mr. Yin, who had been backing them, see Medusa and quickly side with Xiao Yan. Medusa tells Xiao Yan she knows he feeds the Heaven Swallowing Python Amethyst Lion Birth Essence, and she presses him for her Soul Recovery Pill. With the herbs from the auction, Xiao Yan spends two months in the mountains refining medicine for Yao Lao's soul. He pours all his Dou Qi into waking his master, passes out and falls from the cliff. Medusa, who swore to kill him herself, catches him.","events":["Xiao Yan refines a sixth-tier pill in a rare cauldron","Xiao Li opens the Xiao Gate's first pill auction in Feng City","Black Alliance remnants challenge Xiao Yan's claim to the city","Mr. Jin and Mr. Yin back down when they see Medusa","Medusa presses Xiao Yan for her Soul Recovery Pill","Xiao Yan spends two months refining for Yao Lao's soul","He exhausts his Dou Qi waking Yao Lao, falls, and Medusa catches him"],"introduced":["Cauldron Ranking","Black Cauldron (Yao Lao's)","Amethyst Lion Birth Essence","Three Lines Green Spirit Pill (in a flashback)"],"confidence":"high"},{"ep":118,"title":"Master and Disciple Again","summary":"Yao Lao wakes after two years and faces Medusa, who has fully merged with the Heaven Swallowing Python's soul. He finds that Xiao Yan has refined the Fallen Heart Flame and killed Han Feng. He warns that the Hall of Souls took Han Feng's soul and will hunt Xiao Yan, and Xiao Yan says they are tied to his father's disappearance. Han Feng's soul begs a Soul Envoy for mercy, says he knows the Hall's Dou Zun Old Mu Gu, and offers what Mu Gu wants. Yao Lao names three ingredients for a new body: the Bone Growing Blood Fusing Pill, the blood essence of a Rank Seven Magical Beast, and a Dou Zong's skeleton. He agrees to study the Life Devouring Pill to save Xiao Li. Three months later, Xiao Yan returns to Feng City, sets the march on the Jia Ma Empire for two months away, and heads to the Inner Academy with Medusa.","events":["Yao Lao wakes and faces Medusa","Xiao Yan tells Yao Lao about the Fallen Heart Flame, Han Feng and the Hall of Souls","Han Feng's soul offers a deal to a Soul Envoy, naming Old Mu Gu","Yao Lao lists three ingredients needed to refine him a body","Xiao Yan asks Yao Lao to find an antidote to the Life Devouring Pill","After months of training, Xiao Yan returns to Feng City and sets the departure in two months","Xiao Yan visits the Inner Academy with Medusa"],"introduced":["Old Mu Gu (Hall of Souls Dou Zun, named only)","Ten Thousand Beast Cauldron","Bone Growing Blood Fusing Pill","blood essence of a Rank Seven Magical Beast","skeleton of a strong Dou Zong","Super Magical Beast","Dou Zun","Dou Sheng"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan is 'a 20-year-old strong Dou Wang'. Yao Lao's Soul Power has grown during his sleep. Xiao Li has one year left to live. Old Mu Gu is called the Hall's Dou Zun.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":119,"title":"Ten Moves at the Rock Gate","summary":"Xiao Yan asks Su Qian to watch over the Xiao Gate while he returns to the Jia Ma Empire. Su Qian agrees, but warns that the academy can't openly help against the Misty Cloud Sect and Yun Shan, a Dou Zong. At the Rock Gate, Xiao Yan tells Wu Hao and Hu Jia he is leaving. Zi Yan insists on coming, and he agrees. He refines pills for the members and asks Wu Hao to send Rock Gate graduates to the Xiao Gate. Lin Yan brings Lin Xiu Ya and Liu Qing, who will follow him to the Misty Cloud Sect if he beats them both, and Xiao Yan wins within ten moves. Yao Lao urges him to fuse three Heavenly Flames into the Angry Buddha Lotus Flame, and Xiao Yan starts to practise.","events":["Xiao Yan asks Su Qian to look after the Xiao Gate","Su Qian warns about Yun Shan and the Misty Cloud Sect","Xiao Yan tells the Rock Gate he is leaving; Zi Yan insists on coming","He refines pills for the Rock Gate and links it to the Xiao Gate","Lin Yan brings Lin Xiu Ya and Liu Qing to test him","Xiao Yan beats both within ten moves; they agree to come","Yao Lao has Xiao Yan practise fusing three Heavenly Flames"],"introduced":["Great Coffin Splitting Claw"],"cultivation":"Lin Xiu Ya and Liu Qing are Dou Wang elders. Yun Shan is a strong Dou Zong. Xiao Yan can only start the second seal after reaching Dou Huang.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":120,"title":"The Flight Home","summary":"Xiao Li brings the Black-Corner sect leaders who have agreed to fight the Misty Cloud Sect, and Xiao Yan promises them their reward. The group boards a flying ship and leaves the Black-Corner Region for the Jia Ma Empire. In the Misty Cloud Sect's Forbidden Hall, Yun Shan tells Yun Yun he will wipe out the Xiao Clan and the Mite'er family who shelter them. In the capital, Ya Fei warns Hai Bodong and the Mite'er family that the Misty Cloud Sect is planning an attack. A month into the journey, in the small country of Wanyan, Zi Yan and Cai Lin raid the treasure cave of a greedy Dou Zong sect leader. Zi Yan lures away its guard, a Rank Six Magical Beast, while Cai Lin takes the herbs, then Cai Lin frees the beast from its master's seal. Back on the ship Xiao Yan scolds them for the risk and forbids them to leave again.","events":["Xiao Li presents the Black-Corner sect leaders joining the trip","The flying ship leaves for the Jia Ma Empire","Yun Shan tells Yun Yun he will destroy the Xiao Clan and attack the Mite'er family","Ya Fei warns the Mite'er family and Hai Bodong of the coming attack","In Wanyan, Zi Yan baits a Rank Six Magical Beast guarding a Dou Zong's treasure cave","Cai Lin takes the herbs and breaks the seal binding the beast","Xiao Yan scolds the pair and forbids them to wander off"],"introduced":["Forbidden Hall (Misty Cloud Sect)","Wanyan (small country on the route)","Rank Six Magical Beast guarding the treasure cave","Jade Dragon Saliva","Extreme Cold Ganoderma"],"confidence":"high"},{"ep":121,"title":"Ghost Town","summary":"After two months of flying, Xiao Yan reaches Ghost Town on the Jia Ma Empire's border. There Meng Li, backed by the Misty Cloud elder Yun Fan, is trying to seize military command from the commander Mu Tie. Xiao Yan steps in, his followers crush the Misty Cloud force, and he runs down a fleeing Misty Cloud man until he surrenders. Mu Tie, who once let Xiao Yan escape, explains how the Misty Cloud Sect grew, attacked the Xiao Clan, and pushed Yun Yun out as leader. He adds that Ya Fei now heads the Mite'er family and that Yun Shan will strike them first. In the Misty Cloud Sect, Yun Shan orders Ghost Town taken within five days and readies his men against the Mite'er family. Xiao Yan hurries to the capital.","events":["Xiao Yan's group arrives at Ghost Town","Meng Li and Misty Cloud elder Yun Fan try to take power from Mu Tie","Xiao Yan intervenes and Mu Tie recognises him","Xiao Yan's followers and Xiao Li rout the Misty Cloud force","Xiao Yan catches a fleeing Misty Cloud man, who surrenders","Yun Shan orders Ghost Town taken and prepares to attack the Mite'er family","Mu Tie tells Xiao Yan about the past three years","Xiao Yan sets off for the capital"],"introduced":["Meng Li","Yun Fan (Misty Cloud Sect elder)","City Lord Residence (Ghost Town)"],"confidence":"high"},{"ep":122,"title":"The Siege of the Mite'er Family","summary":"Inside the Misty Cloud Sect, a Hall of Souls envoy has used secret techniques to raise the elders Yun Du and Yun Cha to Dou Huang. Yun Shan sends them to attack the Mite'er family and hunt down the Xiao Clan. Hai Bodong fights both Dou Huangs, Tengshan takes on the elders Yun Fu and Yun Xu, and Ya Fei and Xiao Ding guard the inner courtyard. The imperial family and the Nalan Clan refuse to help, and Jia Xing Tian holds Yao Ye back from intervening. Hai Bodong is about to fall when a figure of flame saves him. It is Xiao Yan, who announces that he has come to collect the Xiao Clan's debt from the Misty Cloud Sect.","events":["The Hall of Souls envoy boosts Yun Du and Yun Cha to Dou Huang","Yun Shan sends them against the Mite'er family","Xiao Ding offers to hand over part of the Xiao Clan; Hai Bodong refuses","Hai Bodong fights Yun Du and Yun Cha; Tengshan faces Yun Fu and Yun Xu","Jia Xing Tian and the Nalan Clan choose to wait","Ya Fei and Xiao Ding hold the inner courtyard","A flame figure saves Hai Bodong: Xiao Yan has returned"],"introduced":["Yun Du","Yun Cha","Yun Fu","Yun Xu","Soul Shrine (name used here for the Hall of Souls)","Qi Breaking Arrows","Wind's Peak, Killer Meteorite","Thousand Flower Ice Mirror","Mysterious Ice Dragon's Soar"],"cultivation":"Yun Du and Yun Cha have reached Dou Huang through Hall of Souls secret techniques; Hai Bodong finds their aura unstable. Yun Shan is a Dou Zong.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":123,"title":"Xiao Yan Comes Back","summary":"Xiao Yan's Black-Corner allies, a crowd of Dou Wangs, join the fight at the Mite'er Manor and he orders that no attacker be spared. He meets Ya Fei, his eldest brother Xiao Ding, whose legs were paralysed by poison, and Xiao Li, now a Dou Wang. Jia Xing Tian sends Yao Ye with imperial troops to arrest the Misty Cloud disciples. Xiao Yan and Hai Bodong kill Yun Du and Yun Cha, and Elder Yun Fu and seven other elders die. On Misty Cloud Mountain, Yun Shan learns from the broken soul tokens that Xiao Yan has returned and puts the mountain on alert. The Hall of Souls envoy tells him to capture Xiao Yan alive and leave Yao Chen's soul to him. After the battle, Xiao Yan gives Hai Bodong the Spiritual Recovery Purple Pill and plans to rally the capital's powers against the Misty Cloud Sect.","events":["Jia Xing Tian decides to back Xiao Yan and sends troops","Xiao Yan's Dou Wang allies attack the Misty Cloud force","Xiao Yan reunites with Ya Fei, Xiao Ding and Xiao Li","Yao Ye arrives and the imperial army arrests the attackers","Xiao Yan and Hai Bodong kill Yun Du and Yun Cha","Yun Shan learns of Xiao Yan's return and seals off Misty Cloud Mountain","The Hall of Souls envoy demands Xiao Yan alive","Xiao Yan gives Hai Bodong the Spiritual Recovery Purple Pill"],"introduced":["Mite'er Manor","soul tokens","Spiritual Recovery Purple Pill (handed over)"],"cultivation":"Xiao Li became a Dou Wang within two years. Yun Shan judges Xiao Yan to be at least a Dou Huang from his aura.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":124,"title":"The Alliance at the Alchemist Association","summary":"The capital's powers agree to meet at the neutral Alchemist Association, and Hai Bodong warns that the Pill King Gu He could bring many strong men to the Misty Cloud Sect. On the way, Xiao Yan backs Xue Mei against Elder Fu Yan over a Snake Scale Ice Fire Fruit and stops Fu Yan's attack until Chairman Fa Ma steps in. At the meeting Xiao Yan asks every power to choose a side. Yao Lao shows himself as his master, and Fa Ma recognises him as the man who once guided him. The Alchemist Association, the Mu Clan, the imperial family and the Nalan Clan all join him. Ya Fei then reports that Yun Shan will marry Yun Yun to Gu He in two days, and Gu He visits the sealed Yun Yun, who refuses him. The alliance sets the attack for the wedding day.","events":["Hai Bodong names Gu He as the key threat","Xiao Yan outbids Elder Fu Yan for Xue Mei and blocks his attack","Fa Ma ends the quarrel","Xiao Yan asks the capital's powers to take a side","Yao Lao appears and Fa Ma recognises him","The Alchemist Association, Mu Clan, imperial family and Nalan Clan join","News of Yun Yun's forced wedding to Gu He; Gu He visits Yun Yun","The attack is set for the wedding in two days"],"introduced":["Fu Yan (Alchemist Association elder)","Fu Lan Ke (named)","Snake Scale Ice Fire Fruit","Pill King (Gu He's title)"],"cultivation":"Fu Yan is a strong Dou Huang and a fifth-tier alchemist. Gu He is called a Sixth Ranked Pill King. Yun Yun's Dou Qi is sealed by Yun Shan.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":125,"title":"Ten Moves at the Wedding","summary":"On the wedding day, Yun Shan promises Gu He the sect's future, while privately telling Protector Wu of the Hall of Souls he may take Gu He's soul afterwards. Protector Wu reminds Yun Shan that the Hall of Souls saved his life and gave him Dou Zong strength. As Yun Yun and Gu He bow, Xiao Yan stops the ceremony, backed by Jia Xing Tian and the capital's powers. To keep Gu He out of the fight, Xiao Yan challenges him to ten moves. Gu He uses the Purple Flame and his Thousand Flame Sword Blades, and Yun Shan thinks Xiao Yan is bluffing. On the tenth move Gu He loses, calls off the wedding and leaves. Yun Shan says Xiao Yan's father is with the Hall of Souls and orders his disciples to kill the intruders.","events":["Yun Shan courts Gu He and promises his soul to Protector Wu","The wedding of Yun Yun and Gu He begins","Xiao Yan stops it with Jia Xing Tian and the capital's powers","Xiao Yan and Gu He agree to a ten-move duel","Gu He fights with the Purple Flame and Thousand Flame Sword Blades","Gu He loses on the tenth move, calls off the wedding and leaves","Yun Shan confirms the Hall of Souls holds Xiao Zhan and the battle begins"],"introduced":["Protector Wu (named)","Purple Flame","Thousand Flame Sword Blades","Lion Tiger Gold Shattering Roar","Sky Fire Three Mysterious Changes","Luminous Jadeite Change"],"cultivation":"Yun Shan is a Dou Zong, made so by the Hall of Souls. Gu He is a sixth-tier alchemist. Xiao Yan fights at Dou Huang strength but has not broken through.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":126,"title":"Yun Shan and Protector Wu","summary":"Xiao Yan boosts himself with the Luminous Jadeite Change and fights Yun Shan with Superimposed Wings and the Octane Blast, landing the first hit Yun Shan has taken since becoming a Dou Zong. Yun Shan still overpowers him, until Yao Lao appears and turns the fight. Yun Shan calls out Protector Wu of the Hall of Souls, who has been hidden in the sect and who once helped Han Feng against Yao Lao. Protector Wu fights Yao Lao with a Triple Soul Lock and says the Hall of Souls wants something from the Xiao Clan alive. Xiao Yan guesses they want the jade of Tuo She Gu Di. Alone against Yun Shan, Xiao Yan uses the Open Mountain Seal and his Glaze Lotus Core Flame, and Yao Lao passes him the Bone Chilling Flame hidden in his ring. Xiao Yan then unleashes the Angry Buddha Lotus Flame.","events":["Xiao Yan fights Yun Shan with the Luminous Jadeite Change and Octane Blast","Yun Shan overpowers him and Yao Lao appears","Yun Shan summons Protector Wu, hidden in the sect","Protector Wu fights Yao Lao with the Triple Soul Lock","Xiao Yan suspects the Hall of Souls wants the jade of Tuo She Gu Di","Xiao Yan uses the Open Mountain Seal against Yun Shan's Submerged Wind Braking Blades","Yao Lao gives him the Bone Chilling Flame from the ring","Xiao Yan releases the Angry Buddha Lotus Flame"],"introduced":["Superimposed Wings","Triple Soul Lock","Submerged Wind Braking Blades","Mountain Opening Handprint (the Open Mountain Seal)","jade of Tuo She Gu Di"],"cultivation":"Yun Shan is a Dou Zong. Yao Lao is thought to be a Dou Zun. Xiao Yan cannot yet use the Open Mountain Seal at full power.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":127,"title":"The Fall of Yun Shan","summary":"The Angry Buddha Lotus Flame explodes over Misty Cloud Mountain and both sides fall back. Xiao Yan and Yun Shan survive, and Xiao Yan beats Yun Shan down for his father, his clan and his brothers, then kills him. Protector Wu attacks Yao Lao, then uses the Nine-Darkness Hundred-Devour Soul to swallow Yun Shan's soul and the souls of many Misty Cloud elders. Nalan Yanran comes out of seclusion after passing the Gate of Life and Death. Yun Yun tells her the Hall of Souls is the true enemy and leads the sect's Covering Sun Cloud Formation against Protector Wu, but he seals the space and breaks it. Yao Lao sends Xiao Yan to Hai Bodong and faces Protector Wu alone. Xiao Yan prepares one more Angry Buddha Lotus Flame to save him.","events":["The Angry Buddha Lotus Flame explodes","Xiao Yan beats and kills Yun Shan","Protector Wu attacks Yao Lao","Protector Wu devours Yun Shan's soul and the elders' souls","Nalan Yanran leaves seclusion and Yun Yun explains","Yun Yun leads the Covering Sun Cloud Formation; Protector Wu breaks it","Yao Lao sends Xiao Yan away and faces Protector Wu","Protector Wu turns on Xiao Yan and Medusa steps in"],"introduced":["Nine-Darkness Hundred-Devour Soul","Gate of Life and Death","Covering Sun Cloud Formation"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan is at the peak of Dou Wang (recap). Protector Wu's power soars after devouring souls.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":128,"title":"Yao Lao Is Taken","summary":"Medusa, who has broken through a bottleneck, stops Protector Wu from killing Xiao Yan, and Xiao Yan begs her to save Yao Lao instead. Medusa and Yao Lao fight Protector Wu together until he detonates Yun Shan's soul in a darkness called the Funeral of Spirits. Protector Wu captures Yao Lao's soul. Before he goes, Yao Lao leaves Xiao Yan the origin of the Bone Chilling Flame and tells him to show his ring to his old friend Feng Zun Zhe. Protector Wu tells Xiao Yan to come to the Hall of Souls for his master and leaves, and Medusa stops him from chasing. Mad with grief, Xiao Yan turns on the Misty Cloud Sect, and its new leader Yun Yun stands in his way with Nalan Yanran. Yun Yun says she will die rather than see the sect wiped out, and Xiao Yan orders it disbanded within a month.","events":["Medusa blocks Protector Wu; Xiao Yan asks her to save Yao Lao","Medusa and Yao Lao fight Protector Wu","Protector Wu detonates Yun Shan's soul: Funeral of Spirits","Yao Lao is captured after leaving Xiao Yan the Bone Chilling Flame's origin and a message for Feng Zun Zhe","Protector Wu leaves, telling Xiao Yan to come to the Hall of Souls","Medusa stops Xiao Yan from chasing","Yun Yun, now sect leader, and Nalan Yanran face Xiao Yan","Xiao Yan orders the Misty Cloud Sect disbanded within a month"],"introduced":["All of Nature, Funeral of Spirits","Soul Fluctuation","origin of the Bone Chilling Flame","fire seal on Xiao Yan's forehead","Feng Zun Zhe (named)"],"cultivation":"Medusa has broken through a bottleneck.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":129,"title":"Yun Yun Leaves","summary":"While the Misty Cloud Sect disbands, Xiao Yan recovers from his wounds. Hai Bodong notes that the injuries let him touch the barrier to Dou Huang, and he and Xiao Ding urge Xiao Yan to build a force strong enough to face the Hall of Souls. Jia Xing Tian decides the imperial family should support Xiao Yan rather than oppose him, and sends scouts after the rising Poison Sect of the Chu Yun Empire, led by someone called the Poison Woman. From Yao Lao's notes Xiao Yan finds the Deep Green Longevity Pill to extend Xiao Li's life, and the fire seal tells him his master is alive. Yao Ye brings herbs and the imperial family's backing. Nalan Yanran then takes Xiao Yan to Yun Yun, who is leaving the Jia Ma Empire. Yun Yun gives him an old collection from the Misty Cloud Sect, and they say goodbye.","events":["Xiao Ding and Xiao Li visit the recovering Xiao Yan","Hai Bodong says Xiao Yan has touched the Dou Huang barrier","Xiao Yan decides to build a force against the Hall of Souls","Jia Xing Tian and Yao Ye choose to back Xiao Yan and watch the Poison Sect","Xiao Yan studies the Deep Green Longevity Pill for Xiao Li","Yao Ye brings herbs and imperial support","Nalan Yanran takes Xiao Yan to Yun Yun","Yun Yun gives him a Misty Cloud collection and says goodbye"],"introduced":["Poison Sect (Chu Yun Empire)","Poison Woman","Great Meeting of Factions","Deep Green Longevity Pill","Deep Green Fruit","King Longevity Starch","Ten Thousand Years Vine"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan has touched the barrier to Dou Huang. Yun Yun calls herself a strong Dou Huang.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":130,"title":"The Yan Alliance","summary":"Xiao Yan gives Xiao Li the Deep Green Longevity Pill, which holds back the Life Devouring Pill, and tells him to reach Dou Huang within ten years. He then gathers the capital's powers and proposes an alliance in which members serve it first and an Elder's Council decides. Hai Bodong takes the first seat for the Mite'er family, and the Mu Clan, the Nalan Clan and the imperial family join. Fa Ma agrees to bring in the Alchemist Association in return for ten fifth-tier alchemists within a decade. Xiao Yan names it the Yan Alliance and rewards his allies with Fighting Spirit Pills and Mighty Huang Pills, and Medusa reminds him their one-year deal ends in two months. Feeling close to breaking through, Xiao Yan takes Zi Yan and Medusa to the Magical Beast Mountain Range by way of Qingshan Town. There he saves Ka Gang and Ling Er of the Bloody Battle Mercenary Company from the Snake Nest Mercenary Company.","events":["Xiao Yan gives Xiao Li the Deep Green Longevity Pill","He proposes the alliance and its Elder's Council","Hai Bodong, the Mu Clan, the Nalan Clan and the imperial family join","Fa Ma joins in return for ten fifth-tier alchemists in a decade","The alliance is named the Yan Alliance","Xiao Yan hands out Fighting Spirit Pills and promises Mighty Huang Pills","Medusa reminds him the one-year deal ends in two months","At Qingshan Town he rescues Ka Gang and Ling Er"],"introduced":["Yan Alliance","Elder's Council","Fighting Spirit Pill","Qingshan Town","Bloody Battle Mercenary Company","Snake Nest Mercenary Company","He family (He Clan)"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan can feel the Dou Huang barrier. Lin Xiu Ya, Liu Qing and Lin Yan each rose by at least one star. Xiao Li must reach Dou Huang within ten years.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":131,"title":"The Sky Poison Woman in the Valley","summary":"At Qingshan Town, Ka Gang tells Xiao Yan that the Snake Nest Mercenary Company, led by a Six-Star Dou Ling and backed by the He family, is crushing the Bloody Battle Mercenary Company. Xiao Yan gives him Fire Lotus Vials and a jade shard to call for help, then heads into the Magical Beast Mountain Range. He takes Zi Yan and Medusa to the valley of his first seclusion, now guarded by poison and roaming Rank Four Wind Leopard Beasts. A grey-robed poison master fights Medusa, and her poison eats into Medusa's Dou Qi and sickens Zi Yan. She gives them an antidote, and Xiao Yan recognises her as Little Fairy Doctor. She flees, asking him to remember her as she was and not as the Sky Poison Woman. Xiao Yan suspects her Woeful Poison Body has taken hold, and her antidote saves Zi Yan.","events":["Ka Gang explains the Snake Nest Mercenary Company and the He family","Xiao Yan gives him Fire Lotus Vials and a soul-marked jade shard","Xiao Yan, Zi Yan and Medusa reach his old valley","A poison master fights Medusa; Zi Yan is poisoned","She leaves an antidote and Xiao Yan recognises Little Fairy Doctor","She flees, calling herself the Sky Poison Woman","The antidote cures Zi Yan, who starts her breakthrough"],"introduced":["Fire Lotus Vials","Wind Leopard Beast (Rank Four Magical Beast)","Sky Poison Woman","Woeful Poison Body"],"cultivation":"The Snake Nest Mercenary Company's leader is a Six-Star Dou Ling. Zi Yan starts to advance.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":132,"title":"The He Clan Bows","summary":"In the valley, Xiao Yan refines Mighty Huang Pills and causes a small explosion by being greedy with his last ingredients, while Zi Yan sleeps in a cocoon. Medusa tells him the step from Dou Wang to Dou Huang can take half a year or more. Taking the pills to Qingshan Town, Xiao Yan finds that He Qian, head of the He Clan, has seized Ka Gang over the Fire Lotus Vial. Xiao Yan slaps He Qian down with Dou Huang force, and He Qian recognises him as leader of the Yan Alliance and begs for mercy. Xiao Yan accepts the He Clan into the alliance but warns them off the Bloody Battle Mercenary Company. Back in the valley he enters seclusion, and Medusa seals the valley before her clan summons her away. Xiao Yan breaks through to Dou Huang and glimpses Yao Lao in the Hall of Souls.","events":["Xiao Yan refines Mighty Huang Pills; Zi Yan is in a cocoon","He Qian of the He Clan seizes Ka Gang over a Fire Lotus Vial","Xiao Yan defeats He Qian's men and slaps He Qian","He Qian recognises the Yan Alliance leader and submits","The He Clan joins the Yan Alliance","Xiao Yan goes into seclusion","Medusa seals the valley and leaves for the Snakemen Clan","Xiao Yan becomes a Dou Huang and sees the Hall of Souls"],"introduced":["He Qian","Space Lock"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan breaks through from Dou Wang to Dou Huang at the end of his seclusion. Medusa says the step takes at least half a year.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":133,"title":"War Comes to Jia Ma","summary":"Xiao Yan's vision shows Yao Lao imprisoned in the Hall of Souls by a soul stronger than Protector Wu, but it proves his master is alive. Now a Dou Huang, he trains the Sea Flipping Seal against Medusa's barrier. Zi Yan wakes as a Rank Six Magical Beast but is stuck in a small body, because she has not fully absorbed the Shape-Shifting Flower. Leaving the valley, they find Qingshan Town choking on Poison Sect poison, and Xiao Yan drives off the poisoners and cures the townsfolk. Ka Gang tells him the Poison Sect, the Gold Geese Sect and the Mulan Valley have invaded the empire and besieged the Black Mountain Fortress. Xiao Yan saves Yue Mei of the Snakemen Clan from Gold Geese pursuers with a Fire Ring Explosion. Yue Mei tells him that Medusa is wounded and that the Gold Geese Sect leader Yan Luo Tian and three Mulan Valley elders are pressing her, and Xiao Yan and Zi Yan fly to the fortress.","events":["Xiao Yan sees Yao Lao imprisoned and knows he is alive","He practises the Sea Flipping Seal","Zi Yan wakes at Rank Six, stuck in a small form","Xiao Yan saves Qingshan Town from the Poison Sect's poisoners","Ka Gang tells him of the three-sect war and the Black Mountain Fortress","Xiao Yan rescues Yue Mei from the Gold Geese Sect","Yue Mei reports Medusa is wounded; they head for the fortress"],"introduced":["Sea Flipping Seal (first used)","Shape-Shifting Flower","Poison Masters","Gold Geese Sect","Mulan Valley","Black Mountain Fortress","Lingyan City","Yue Mei","Fire Ring Explosion","Yan Luo Tian","Elder Hutou, Elder Shitou, Elder Xiongtou (Three Elders of Mulan)","Three Beast Savage Skill (as a 'combined Qi Method')"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan has just ascended to Dou Huang. Zi Yan is now Rank Six. Yan Luo Tian is a Dou Zong; the three Mulan elders are peak Dou Huangs whose combined power matches a Dou Zong.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":134,"title":"Three Elders of Mulan","summary":"After a year of seclusion, Xiao Yan learns that the Chu Yun, Luo Yan and Mulan Empires have attacked the Jia Ma Empire, held back only by Medusa and the Snakemen Clan. At the Black Mountain Fortress, the Gold Geese Sect leader Yan Luo Tian and the Three Elders of Mulan gang up on the wounded Medusa. Xiao Yan arrives as a Dou Huang, gives Medusa a pill and takes on the three elders himself. They attack with the Three Beast Savage Skill, which lets one elder at a time wield a Dou Zong's power. Xiao Yan boosts himself with the Luminous Jadeite Change and his Heavenly Flame. He sees the skill's weak point and decoys it with clones from the Three Thousand Lightning Movement. He then takes Elder Hutou out with an Octane Blast and faces the last two elders.","events":["The three empires' war on Jia Ma is explained","Yan Luo Tian and the Three Elders of Mulan corner Medusa","Xiao Yan arrives with Zi Yan and gives Medusa a pill","Medusa takes Yan Luo Tian; Xiao Yan takes the three elders","Xiao Yan uses the Luminous Jadeite Change and finds the skill's weakness","His Three Thousand Lightning clones draw out their power","An Octane Blast takes out Elder Hutou"],"introduced":["Chu Yun Empire, Luo Yan Empire, Mulan Empire","Golden Geese Sect (variant spelling)","Three Beast Savage Skill","Three Thousand Lightning (clones)"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan and Zi Yan advanced during the year of seclusion; Xiao Yan has a Dou Huang aura. Yan Luo Tian is a Two-Star Dou Zong. With the Luminous Jadeite Change Xiao Yan briefly fights at Dou Zong strength.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":135,"title":"The Sky Poison Woman","summary":"At the Black Mountain Fortress, the leader of the Poison Sect arrives and takes over the attack on the Jia Ma Empire. She sends the beaten Three Elders of Mulan back to base, recognises Xiao Yan as the man the Hall of Souls wants, and orders Yan Luo Tian to bring him in alive while she fights Medusa. Xiao Yan fights Yan Luo Tian, dodges his Open Mountain Seal with clones, and maims him with the Angry Buddha Lotus Flame. Xiao Yan then recognises the Poison Sect leader as his old friend Little Fairy Doctor, who now calls herself the Sky Poison Woman. She says the Woeful Poison Body has killed everyone she cared about, and she lets it loose as a cloud of poison gas. Xiao Yan refuses to leave her.","events":["The Poison Sect leader arrives at the Black Mountain Fortress and dismisses the Three Elders of Mulan","She tells Yan Luo Tian to capture Xiao Yan alive and fights Medusa herself","Xiao Yan and Yan Luo Tian fight; Yan Luo Tian uses the Open Mountain Seal","Xiao Yan tricks him with clones and hits him with the Angry Buddha Lotus Flame","Xiao Yan recognises the Poison Sect leader as Little Fairy Doctor","She names herself the Sky Poison Woman and blames the Woeful Poison Body for her losses","She releases poison gas; Xiao Yan says he will never abandon her"],"introduced":["Sky Poison Woman (Little Fairy Doctor's title as Poison Sect leader)","Open Mountain Seal","Gliding Geese Technique (Gold Geese Sect)"],"confidence":"high"},{"ep":136,"title":"The Poison Pill Method","summary":"Xiao Yan holds Little Fairy Doctor through the poison and uses his Heavenly Flame to stop the Woeful Poison Body from spreading. She agrees to trust him and orders all three sects out of the Jia Ma Empire. At a later meeting Xiao Yan learns the Hall of Souls set her on him, and she agrees to look away while he kills Yan Luo Tian and the Three Elders of Mulan. He describes the Poison Pill Method, which needs the core of a Rank Seven Sky Poison Dragon Scorpion Beast, three Heavenly Flames and Bodhisattva Body Transformation Saliva, and she gives him a jade piece to crush when the attack starts. At the Snakemen Clan, the First Elder tells him Medusa has under two years to live unless the soul of the Heaven Swallowing Python and the leftover Fallen Heart Flame energy are balanced. Xiao Yan promises a Heaven Soul Blood Fusing Pill within two years, and the Snakemen Clan joins the Yan Alliance.","events":["Xiao Yan embraces Little Fairy Doctor and holds back the Woeful Poison Body with his Heavenly Flame","Medusa is touched by the poison; Little Fairy Doctor orders the allied forces out of the Jia Ma Empire","Little Fairy Doctor meets Xiao Yan and Medusa and agrees to let him kill Yan Luo Tian and the Three Elders of Mulan","Xiao Yan explains the Poison Pill Method and its ingredients; she gives him a jade signal","Medusa invites Xiao Yan to meet the Snakemen elders; Mo Ba Si is rebuked","The First Elder explains the two energies in Medusa's body and the Secret Technique levels","Xiao Yan promises a Heaven Soul Blood Fusing Pill within two years and receives its recipe","The Snakemen Clan joins the Yan Alliance"],"introduced":["Poison Pill Method","Sky Poison Dragon Scorpion Beast (Rank Seven)","Bodhisattva Body Transformation Saliva","Mo Ba Si","First Elder of the Snakemen Clan","Heaven Swallowing Python (soul in Medusa)","Secret Technique (Snakemen; three levels)","Snake Marrow Sloughing Bone Pill (sixth-tier)","Heaven Soul Blood Fusing Pill","Soul Recovery Pill"],"confidence":"high"},{"ep":137,"title":"Night Raid on Mulan Valley","summary":"Medusa tells Xiao Yan the leftover Fallen Heart Flame energy cannot hurt her yet, and he studies the seventh-tier Heaven Soul Blood Fusing Pill, which may bring on a pill calamity. Using an encampment map from Little Fairy Doctor, Xiao Yan crushes her jade signal and splits the attack: Medusa takes Yan Luo Tian in the north and he takes the Three Elders of Mulan in the west. Hai Bodong commands the Snakemen and Yan Alliance fighters waiting in ambush as backup. At night Xiao Yan slips into the Mulan camp, grabs Elder Hutou with the Sky Fire Three Mysterious Changes and kills him despite the other elders' threats. Mulan Valley Dou Huangs chase him with guerrilla tactics until he burns them with the Angry Buddha Lotus Flame. Medusa, already done with Yan Luo Tian, arrives to cover his escape from the last two elders.","events":["Medusa reassures Xiao Yan about the Fallen Heart Flame residue","Xiao Yan reads the Heaven Soul Blood Fusing Pill recipe and fears a pill calamity","He asks Hai Bodong and Mr. Jia to stand by as backup","Xiao Yan crushes Little Fairy Doctor's jade; the map shows Yan Luo Tian in the north and the elders in the west","Xiao Yan seizes and kills Elder Hutou in the Mulan camp","Mulan Valley Dou Huangs chase him; he hits them with the Angry Buddha Lotus Flame","Medusa returns from Yan Luo Tian and covers Xiao Yan"],"introduced":["pill calamity (seventh-tier pills)","Fierce Bear Ground Splitting Fist","Lion Inch Force"],"confidence":"high"},{"ep":138,"title":"Pill King Gu He Joins","summary":"Medusa rescues Xiao Yan from the two remaining Mulan elders and they hide until the search passes. He gives her the Three Beast Savage Skill and the other Mulan techniques for the Snakemen Clan, and she offers him Yan Luo Tian's secret Gold Geese Sect method for a Flying Dou Skill with giant wings. Elsewhere, Xun Er learns that the Hall of Souls took Yao Lao, sends Mr. Ling to look for the Hall, and hears her clan will search the Xiao Clan in the Jia Ma Empire for a key. Fa Ma suggests winning Pill King Gu He for the Yan Alliance's Pill Hall with a Pill Tower recommendation. Gu He demands a pill-refining contest, loses to Xiao Yan, and joins the Pill Hall. A message from Little Fairy Doctor about Hall of Souls members sends Xiao Yan toward the Chu Yun Empire. Zi Yan wants to come along, and the Snakemen Grand Commander blames Xiao Yan for endangering Medusa and attacks him.","events":["Medusa saves Xiao Yan and they shake off the Mulan pursuers","Xiao Yan gives Medusa the Mulan techniques; she offers him Yan Luo Tian's flying-wing method","Medusa leaves to resettle the Snakemen Clan","Xun Er learns of Yao Lao's capture and sends Mr. Ling after the Hall of Souls","Xiao Yan and Fa Ma discuss the slow refining of Life Devouring Pills and the Pill Tower","Gu He loses a pill-refining contest to Xiao Yan and joins the Pill Hall","Little Fairy Doctor reports Hall of Souls members in the Chu Yun Empire","Grand Commander of the Snakemen confronts Xiao Yan"],"introduced":["Gold Geese Sect Flying Dou Skill method","Life Devouring Pill","Pill Tower","Pill Hall (Yan Alliance)","Tuo She Gu Di jade","Snakemen Grand Commander (Kui Xing)"],"confidence":"high"},{"ep":139,"title":"Into the Chu Yun Empire","summary":"Grand Commander Kui Xing fights Zi Yan, and Medusa stops it and sends him to the snake cave for a month. Medusa insists on coming, so Xiao Yan, Medusa and Zi Yan travel to Sky Poison City, the Poison Sect's headquarters. Little Fairy Doctor tells them a Hall of Souls member pressed her to capture Xiao Yan, and she traced him to the Ten Thousand Scorpion Gate. At the Sky Scorpion Mountain Range, Elder Wu doubts the three Dou Huang guests, and the elders suspect a spy because the enemy always knows their moves. Little Fairy Doctor closes the camp and attacks anyway, but walks into an ambush and Xie Shan's Poison Cloud Formation. She breaks it, and the Gate's old master Xie Biyan, a peak four-star Dou Zong, comes out to fight her.","events":["Kui Xing attacks; Zi Yan says she survived only because she reached Dou Huang","Medusa punishes Kui Xing and decides to go to the Chu Yun Empire","Xiao Yan, Medusa and Zi Yan reach Sky Poison City; Medusa and Little Fairy Doctor clash","Little Fairy Doctor recounts the Hall of Souls envoy's threats and the Ten Thousand Scorpion Gate","At the Sky Scorpion Mountain Range, Elder Wu questions her and the elders suspect a spy","The Poison Sect attacks and is caught in Xie Shan's Poison Cloud Formation","Little Fairy Doctor uses the Thousand Mirage Poison Spring; Xie Biyan appears"],"introduced":["Kui Xing (Snakemen Grand Commander)","Sky Poison City","Ten Thousand Scorpion Gate","Sky Scorpion Mountain Range","Elder Wu (Poison Sect)","Xie Shan","Xie Biyan","Poison Cloud Formation","Thousand Mirage Poison Spring"],"cultivation":"Zi Yan has reached Dou Huang. Xie Biyan is a peak four-star Dou Zong.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":140,"title":"The Traitors and the Four-Wing Scorpion","summary":"At the Sky Scorpion Mountain Range, Wu Ya and two other Poison Sect elders turn on Little Fairy Doctor and reveal they have always served the Ten Thousand Scorpion Gate. That leaves the Poison Sect with four Dou Huangs against eight. Xiao Yan, calling himself Yan Xiao, uses the Sky Fire Three Mysterious Changes and beats two enemy Dou Huangs. Gate chief Xie Shan sends in the Four-Wing Scorpion, a Rank Six Magical Beast, and Zi Yan takes it on. Xie Shan then calls in Protector Tie of the Hall of Souls, a Dou Zong, who goes after Xiao Yan's soul. Medusa steps in to fight Protector Tie. Xie Biyan unleashes the Blood Soul Art of his Blood Demon Scorpion Emperor against Little Fairy Doctor.","events":["Wu Ya and two other elders betray the Poison Sect for the Ten Thousand Scorpion Gate","Xiao Yan and Zi Yan join the fight while Medusa holds back","Xiao Yan uses the Sky Fire Three Mysterious Changes and Octane Blast to beat two Dou Huangs","Xie Shan sends in the Four-Wing Scorpion; Zi Yan takes it on","Xie Shan summons Protector Tie of the Hall of Souls","Protector Tie attacks Xiao Yan and Medusa steps in to fight him","Xie Biyan unleashes the Blood Soul Art against Little Fairy Doctor"],"introduced":["Wu Ya (Poison Sect elder, traitor)","Four-Wing Scorpion (Rank Six Magical Beast of the Ten Thousand Scorpion Gate)","Mountain Opening Handprint","Blood Demon Scorpion Emperor","Blood Soul Art"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan is called a One-Star Dou Huang by the enemy. Protector Tie is a Dou Zong.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":141,"title":"The Sea Flipping Seal","summary":"Xie Biyan's Blood Soul Art forces Little Fairy Doctor to unseal her Woeful Poison Body, and she traps him in a Sky Poison Prison. Xiao Yan fights Xie Shan and his Four-Wing Scorpion. Zi Yan sets a trap, and Xiao Yan kills Xie Shan with an Octane Blast, which scatters the Ten Thousand Scorpion Gate's men. Protector Tie devours spirit forms from his soul lamp to grow stronger against Medusa. Xiao Yan, covered by Zi Yan, condenses the Sea Flipping Seal once and smashes him. Protector Tie wonders if Xiao Yan is from the Gu Clan and tries to flee. Medusa corners him, and he threatens them with the Hall of Souls.","events":["Little Fairy Doctor unseals the Woeful Poison Body and traps Xie Biyan in the Sky Poison Prison","Xiao Yan fights Xie Shan with the Flame Splitting Tsunami","Zi Yan baits Xie Shan and Xiao Yan kills him with an Octane Blast","The Ten Thousand Scorpion Gate's men flee","Protector Tie devours spirit forms freed from his broken soul lamp","Xiao Yan uses the Sea Flipping Seal on Protector Tie","Protector Tie flees and Medusa corners him"],"introduced":["Sky Poison Prison","Thunderquake Staff","soul lamp (Hall of Souls; holds trapped spirit forms)","Sea Flipping Seal","Jade Crystal Seal","God Seal Technique"],"confidence":"high"},{"ep":142,"title":"The Demon Poison Spot","summary":"Medusa and Xiao Yan capture Protector Tie, and Little Fairy Doctor beats Xie Biyan with the blood of her Woeful Poison Body. Dying, Xie Biyan uses his life force to plant the Demon Poison Spot in Xiao Yan, which kills in half a year and can only be cured by a Dou Zun. Medusa kills Xie Biyan and vows to wipe out the Ten Thousand Scorpion Gate. Little Fairy Doctor uses a poison pool and her own meridians to suppress the spot for two years. Xiao Yan refines one poison vein and reaches the peak of Two-Star Dou Huang. Protector Tie says the Hall of Souls has Man, Earth and Sky Protectors and a branch at Burial Stream in the Sky Heart Empire. Xiao Yan decides to seek the Dou Zun dean of Jia Nan Academy, with Little Fairy Doctor and Zi Yan.","events":["Protector Tie is captured and locked away","Little Fairy Doctor beats Xie Biyan, who self-destructs and plants the Demon Poison Spot in Xiao Yan","Medusa kills Xie Biyan and vows to wipe out the Ten Thousand Scorpion Gate","Little Fairy Doctor suppresses the poison for two years with her poison pool","Xiao Yan refines a poison vein and reaches peak Two-Star Dou Huang","Protector Tie describes the Hall of Souls' ranks and the Burial Stream branch","Xiao Yan plans to go to Jia Nan Academy; Little Fairy Doctor and Zi Yan go with him"],"introduced":["Demon Poison Spot","Man, Earth and Sky Protectors (Hall of Souls)","Honorable Elders (Hall of Souls)","Burial Stream","Sky Heart Empire"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan reaches the peak of Two-Star Dou Huang by refining a poison vein of the Demon Poison Spot. Protector Tie is a Man Protector; Wu Ying is an Earth Protector.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":143,"title":"Back to the Black-Corner Region","summary":"Medusa leaves Xiao Yan, Little Fairy Doctor and Zi Yan at the border of the Magical Beast Mountain Range, and Xiao Yan promises her the Heaven Soul Blood Fusing Pill within two years. Xiao Yan heads for Jia Nan Academy to find a Dou Zun, with a detour to an auction in Black Emperor City. On the way he saves Instructor Mai Di and her student Mo Ling from Demon Flame Valley killers. They tell him Elder Wu Hao and Xiao Yu are trapped in a valley with academy students. Wu Hao, the Bloody Sword, now a Dou Wang, holds off two Demon Flame Valley Dou Wangs and then their Fourth Elder, a Dou Huang. Xiao Yan arrives with the Heavy Xuan Ruler, saves Wu Hao and names himself Xiao Yan of the Xiao Gate. The Fourth Elder grabs students as hostages and runs.","events":["Medusa says goodbye at the edge of the Magical Beast Mountain Range","Demon Flame Valley men trap Wu Hao and academy students in a valley","Xiao Yan, Little Fairy Doctor and Zi Yan walk toward Black Emperor City for an auction","Zi Yan beats the killers chasing Mai Di and Mo Ling","The Fourth Elder of Demon Flame Valley arrives and beats Wu Hao","Xiao Yan arrives and fights the Fourth Elder","The Fourth Elder takes hostages and flees"],"introduced":["Demon Flame Valley","Fourth Elder of Demon Flame Valley","Mai Di (Jia Nan Academy instructor)","Mo Ling (Mai Di's student)","Bloody Sword (Wu Hao's nickname)","Black Emperor City auction","Blood Spiritual Grass","Xiao Gate"],"cultivation":"Wu Hao has reached Dou Wang. The Fourth Elder of Demon Flame Valley is a Dou Huang.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":144,"title":"Black Emperor City","summary":"Xiao Yan frees the hostages, and the Fourth Elder of Demon Flame Valley dies in Little Fairy Doctor's poison gas. After seeing the students to safety, Xiao Yan, Little Fairy Doctor and Zi Yan enter Black Emperor City under the name Yan Xiao. A Black Emperor Sect guard sends them to the Black Emperor Pavilion and warns them about the Kui Wolf Gang. At the Thousand Medicinal House, Xiao Yan buys herbs and wants three rare ones in exchange for a Fifth-Tier Pill. Qi Shan, chief alchemist of the Black Emperor Sect, wants the same herbs, and both offer a Fighting Spirit Pill. Xiao Yan's pill is better, and he wins the herbs and makes an enemy of Qi Shan. The shop's alchemist tells him the Bodhisattva Body Transformation Saliva will be sold at the auction.","events":["The Fourth Elder dies of poison gas while fleeing","Xiao Yan's group enters Black Emperor City and ignores Kui Wolf Gang thugs","A guard gives 'Yan Xiao' a badge for the Black Emperor Pavilion","At the Thousand Medicinal House, Xiao Yan asks for eight herbs","Qi Shan and Xiao Yan compete with Fighting Spirit Pills; Xiao Yan wins","The shop alchemist explains the Bodhisattva Heart and its saliva","At the Pavilion, Xiao Yan sees Fang Yan of Demon Flame Valley and a strange gray-robed man"],"introduced":["Black Emperor City","Black Mirror Rock","Black Emperor Sect","Black Emperor Pavilion","Kui Wolf Gang","Thousand Medicinal House","Qi Shan (chief alchemist of the Black Emperor Sect)","Blue Orchid Grass","Flaming Phoenix Phosphorus Fruit","Thousand Spiritual Ginseng","Demon Spiritual Valley Grass","Jade Bone Fruit","Fighting Spirit Pill (Fifth-Tier)","Bodhisattva Heart","Bodhisattva Ancient Tree","Fang Yan (Demon Flame Valley)","the gray-robed man"],"confidence":"high"},{"ep":145,"title":"The Zong Breaking Pill","summary":"At the Black Emperor Pavilion, Kui Cha, leader of the Kui Wolf Gang, confronts Xiao Yan over his men. Xiao Yan shows he is a Dou Huang, and Kui Cha backs down. When Kui Cha attacks Zi Yan, Mo Ya, Young Master of the Black Emperor Sect, steps in, and Little Fairy Doctor lets it go. She thinks Mo Ya set up the fight, and she quietly poisons him with the Soul Swallowing Flower. That night Demon Flame Valley men ask the gray-robed man to kill the Xiao Gate and Jia Nan Academy people in the city. Xiao Yan shuts himself away to refine the Zong Breaking Pill, a Sixth-Tier Pill, while Little Fairy Doctor and Zi Yan guard his room. After two days the pill is close to forming.","events":["Xiao Yan is put in the Earth area of the Black Emperor Pavilion","Kui Cha confronts Xiao Yan and backs down","Mo Ya stops Kui Cha's attack on Zi Yan and offers to settle things","Little Fairy Doctor poisons Mo Ya and explains the Soul Swallowing Flower","Demon Flame Valley plots with the gray-robed man","Zi Yan punches Mo Ya when he comes back","Xiao Yan refines the Zong Breaking Pill for two days"],"introduced":["Kui Cha (leader of the Kui Wolf Gang)","Mo Ya (Young Master of the Black Emperor Sect)","Soul Swallowing Flower","Zong Breaking Pill (Sixth-Tier)"],"cultivation":"Mo Ya is judged a Six-Star Dou Huang by Little Fairy Doctor.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":146,"title":"The Black Emperor Sect Auction","summary":"Xiao Yan's Zong Breaking Pill draws a crowd to the Black Emperor Pavilion. Little Fairy Doctor reveals she is a Dou Zong and drives them back, and Xiao Li, chief of the Xiao Gate, pulls his people away. Xiao Yan finishes the pill and holds off the strong souls that probe his room. Mo Tian Xing, head of the Black Emperor Sect, opens the auction the next day. Xiao Li outbids the mysterious alchemist for the Six Joint Body Flowing Ruler scroll, not knowing the alchemist is his brother. Xiao Yan trades three Fighting Spirit Pills and two Mighty Huang Pills for a Magical Beast carcass that once neared Rank Eight. The Bodhisattva Body Transformation Saliva is the last item, and bidders must make their offers alone in a sealed space.","events":["The pill's aroma brings a crowd; Little Fairy Doctor shows she is a Dou Zong","Xiao Li of the Xiao Gate backs off, with Su Qian beside him","Xiao Yan finishes the Zong Breaking Pill and fends off spying souls","Little Fairy Doctor names Mo Tian Xing and Fang Yan's strength","Xiao Li buys the Six Joint Body Flowing Ruler for 3.1 million","Xiao Yan trades pills for the Magical Beast carcass; Zi Yan feels uneasy","The Bodhisattva Body Transformation Saliva goes up for sealed bids"],"introduced":["Xiao Li (chief of the Xiao Gate)","Mo Tian Xing (head of the Black Emperor Sect)","Six Joint Body Flowing Ruler (Di Class Middle Rank Ruler Dou Skill)","Six Joint Zun Zhe","Magical Beast carcass (near Rank Eight)","Monster Core","Jade Bone Wings","Sky Bird Nine Flying Wings","Flame Creation Skill (Di Class Middle Rank, Demon Flame Valley)","Mighty Huang Pill"],"cultivation":"Little Fairy Doctor is a Dou Zong. Mo Tian Xing is about a Four-Star Dou Zong. Fang Yan is a Half-Step Dou Zong.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":147,"title":"Old Ying Shan","summary":"The Black Emperor Sect picks Xiao Yan's Zong Breaking Pill over the other bids, and Xiao Yan wins the Bodhisattva Body Transformation Saliva. Old Ying Shan, an old Dou Zong, snatches it and flees the city, and every faction chases him. Fang Yan, First Elder of Demon Flame Valley, offers Xiao Yan help, and Xiao Yan turns him down. Xiao Yan meets Su Qian and Xiao Li, drops his disguise, and they agree to help him get the saliva back for Little Fairy Doctor. Old Ying Shan's decoys turn out to be clones, and Xiao Yan tracks down the real one, who is facing Mo Tian Xing. Fang Yan arrives, reveals that Yan Xiao is Xiao Yan, chief of the Xiao Gate, and brings in the gray-robed man.","events":["The Black Emperor Sect accepts Xiao Yan's Zong Breaking Pill","Old Ying Shan snatches the saliva and flees","Fang Yan offers Demon Flame Valley's help; Xiao Yan refuses","Xiao Yan reunites with Su Qian and Xiao Li and explains the Woeful Poison Body","The group beats four of Old Ying Shan's clones","Mo Tian Xing corners the real Old Ying Shan","Fang Yan reveals Xiao Yan's identity and the gray-robed man shows his face"],"introduced":["Old Ying Shan","Life Returning Pill","Amber Honey Pill","Shape-Shifting Flower (Su Qian's)"],"cultivation":"Old Ying Shan is a Dou Zong. Xiao Yan tells Xiao Li he trained in seclusion for a year to become a Dou Huang.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":148,"title":"The Life Transforming Flame","summary":"The gray-robed man is Han Feng, Yao Lao's traitor disciple, who survived and is now a Dou Zong working for the Hall of Souls. He mocks Xiao Yan for losing Yao Lao to the Hall of Souls, and Xiao Yan swears to kill him. Old Ying Shan, facing four Dou Zongs, throws the Bodhisattva Body Transformation Saliva into the crowd, and it ends up with Xiao Yan. Xiao Yan offers Mo Tian Xing the Zong Breaking Pill to stay out, but Han Feng wins him over instead. Su Qian takes on Han Feng, and Little Fairy Doctor and Zi Yan face the others. Fang Yan and his two brothers use the Flame Creation Skill to form the Life Transforming Flame and then the Star Fire Phoenix. Xiao Yan breaks it with his Heavenly Flame and moves to take the flame for himself.","events":["Han Feng shows his face and taunts Xiao Yan about Yao Lao","Old Ying Shan throws the Bodhisattva Body Transformation Saliva away","Xiao Yan offers Mo Tian Xing the Zong Breaking Pill; Mo Tian Xing sides with Han Feng","Su Qian fights Han Feng","Fang Yan and his brothers attack Xiao Yan with the Life Transforming Flame","They merge it into the Star Fire Phoenix","Xiao Yan answers with the Sacrificial Flame and captures the Life Transforming Flame"],"introduced":["Life Transforming Flame (Demon Flame Valley, made with the Flame Creation Skill)","Star Fire Phoenix","Sacrificial Flame","King of Alchemy (Han Feng's old title in the Black-Corner Region)"],"cultivation":"Han Feng has broken through to Dou Zong.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":149,"title":"A Heart Flame for Xiao Li","summary":"Xiao Yan swallows the Life Transforming Flame and kills Fang Yan and his two brothers. Mo Ya and Qi Shan try to take Zi Yan hostage, and she beats them. Xiao Yan forms the Three-Colored Angry Buddha Lotus Flame, Mo Tian Xing pulls the Black Emperor Sect out, and Han Feng flees with a threat about the Old Ground Demon Ghost. Su Qian says the Old Ground Demon Ghost founded Demon Flame Valley and is a Five-Star or Six-Star Dou Zong. Xiao Li gives Xiao Yan the Six Joint Body Flowing Ruler, and Xiao Yan plants a seed of Heart Flame in Xiao Li with the Fallen Heart Flame. Old Ying Shan had hidden his soul in the saliva, and Su Qian traps his clone. He gives up the Bodhisattva Body Transformation Saliva.","events":["Xiao Yan swallows the Life Transforming Flame and kills Fang Yan and his brothers","Zi Yan fights off Mo Ya and Qi Shan","The Angry Buddha Lotus Flame drives off Mo Tian Xing and Han Feng","Su Qian explains who the Old Ground Demon Ghost is","Xiao Li gives Xiao Yan the Six Joint Body Flowing Ruler","Xiao Yan plants a seed of Heart Flame in Xiao Li","Su Qian corners Old Ying Shan's soul clone and he gives up the saliva"],"introduced":["Old Ground Demon Ghost (founder of Demon Flame Valley; named only)","Sea Heart Flame (Han Feng's lost flame)","Three-Colored Angry Buddha Lotus Flame","seed of Heart Flame"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan is called a Four-Star Dou Huang. Xiao Li is 'the strongest Dou Wang'. The Old Ground Demon Ghost is said to be a Five-Star or Six-Star Dou Zong.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":150,"title":"Return to the Rock Gate","summary":"Xiao Yan, Little Fairy Doctor and Zi Yan return to the Inner Academy of Jia Nan Academy with Su Qian. At the Rock Gate, Ye Xin Lan refines a Fourth-Tier Sky Qi Pill. Members stop Xiao Yan until he is recognised as the Rock Gate's founder, and he spars with an old friend. Su Qian learns of the Demon Poison Spot and says the dean, the only Dou Zun, is away, while Qian Mu and Bai Lie rarely show themselves. Xin Lan, who came from the Central Plains, says the Three Thousand Burning Flame, ninth on the Heavenly Flames Ranking, is held by the Pill Tower. A top-ten place at the Pill Tower's Pill Gathering, two years away, earns a chance to subdue it, and Xiao Yan promises to help her family win the Elder's Seat. That night he takes the Bone Wings from the Demon Corpse and burns away the Heaven Demon Phoenix Tribe beast's leftover spirit, which strengthens his Spiritual Strength.","events":["The group arrives at the Inner Academy","Xin Lan refines a Fourth-Tier Sky Qi Pill at the Rock Gate","Rock Gate members challenge Xiao Yan until he is recognised","Xiao Yan tells Su Qian about the Demon Poison Spot","Xin Lan tells him about the Three Thousand Burning Flame and the Pill Gathering","Xiao Yan takes the Bone Wings; Zi Yan keeps the bone tips as gloves","The beast's leftover spirit fights back; the Fallen Heart Flame consumes it"],"introduced":["Ye Xin Lan (Xin Lan)","Sky Qi Pill (Fourth-Tier)","Strong Ranking (Inner Academy)","Blood Splitting Chop","Quiet Woods Poisonous Snake Vine","Qian Mu and Bai Lie (named only)","Pill Tower Elder's Seat","Seventh-Tier Alchemist (needed to enter the Pill Tower)","Three Thousand Burning Flame (rank 9; 'Undying Body')","Heavenly Flames Ranking","Pill Gathering","Demon Corpse","Bone Wings","Heaven Demon Phoenix Tribe","Spiritual Space"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan's Spiritual Strength grows after the Fallen Heart Flame consumes the Demon Corpse's leftover aura.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":151,"title":"The Old Ground Demon Ghost","summary":"Xiao Yan's new Bone Wings push the Purple Cloud Wings out of his body. Han Feng tells the Old Ground Demon Ghost that Xiao Yan killed Fang Yan and two other elders of Demon Flame Valley. The Old Ground Demon Ghost breaks into the Inner Academy of Jia Nan Academy and demands Xiao Yan from Su Qian, now a Dou Zong. Su Qian accuses him of really wanting the Bodhisattva Body Transformation Saliva and says Dean Mang Tian Chi would stop him. Han Feng takes on Su Qian, and the students are sent to safety. Xiao Yan and Little Fairy Doctor fight the Old Ground Demon Ghost, a Seven-Star Dou Zong, with fire, poison and the Sea Flipping Seal. Little Fairy Doctor unleashes the Woeful Poison Body and rises to Five-Star Dou Zong strength to buy Xiao Yan time. The Old Ground Demon Ghost shrugs off her poisoned blood and keeps coming.","events":["The Bone Wings drive the Purple Cloud Wings out of Xiao Yan","Han Feng tells the Old Ground Demon Ghost about Fang Yan's death","The Old Ground Demon Ghost breaks through the Inner Academy barrier","He demands Xiao Yan from Su Qian and mocks Dean Mang Tian Chi","Han Feng takes Su Qian; the students are evacuated","Xiao Yan and Little Fairy Doctor fight him with poison, fire and the Sea Flipping Seal","Little Fairy Doctor unleashes the Woeful Poison Body to buy time","The Old Ground Demon Ghost shrugs off the Little Fairy Doctor's poisoned blood"],"introduced":["Old Ground Demon Ghost","Mang Tian Chi (dean of Jia Nan Academy, named only)","Thousand Illusionary Ice Spikes","Ice Condensate Sword Skill","Eroding Poison Demon Hand"],"cultivation":"Su Qian has advanced from peak Dou Huang to Dou Zong. The Old Ground Demon Ghost is a Seven-Star Dou Zong. Little Fairy Doctor is called a Four-Star Dou Zong, and at most Five-Star after unleashing the Woeful Poison Body.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":152,"title":"The Extermination Fire Lotus","summary":"The Little Fairy Doctor uses her Woeful Poison Body to hold off the Old Ground Demon Ghost while Xiao Yan fuses his flames, with Yao Lao's Bone Chilling Flame and the Life Transforming Flame, into the Extermination Fire Lotus. The lotus hits the Old Ground Demon Ghost, then slips out of Xiao Yan's control and threatens to wipe out the Inner Academy. Xiao Yan flies toward it to hold it back until two old men tear open space and throw it away. First Elder Su Qian introduces them as Elder Qian and Elder Bai, retired guardians of Jia Nan Academy, who praise Xiao Yan for holding several Heavenly Flames and warn that the Woeful Poison Body brings a hard fate. The Old Ground Demon Ghost turns out to be alive and tries to flee with his Spatial Blood Escape, but Bai Lie kills him, and Qian Mu says the two of them are Nine-Star Dou Zongs, not Dou Zuns. Xiao Yan takes the corpse and asks the elders to look at the Demon Poison Spot in his body, which they say only a Dou Zun could remove.","events":["The Little Fairy Doctor holds the Old Ground Demon Ghost off at great cost to herself.","Xiao Yan forms the Extermination Fire Lotus and strikes the Old Ground Demon Ghost.","The lotus slips out of Xiao Yan's control and he flies toward it to stop it.","Elder Qian and Elder Bai tear through space and expel the lotus.","Su Qian introduces the two guardians; they praise Xiao Yan and remark on the Woeful Poison Body.","The Old Ground Demon Ghost tries the Spatial Blood Escape and is killed by Bai Lie.","Qian Mu says he and Bai Lie are Nine-Star Dou Zongs, one star short of Dou Zun.","Xiao Yan takes the corpse and the elders examine his Demon Poison Spot."],"introduced":["Elder Qian (Qian Mu)","Elder Bai (Bai Lie)","Extermination Fire Lotus","Life Transforming Flame","Winter Cold Blood","Spatial Blood Escape","Demon Poison Spot"],"cultivation":"The Old Ground Demon Ghost is a Seven-Star Dou Zong. Qian Mu and Bai Lie are at most Nine-Star Dou Zongs. The elders recall Xiao Yan as a Da Dou Shi when they last saw him.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":153,"title":"Into the Lava World","summary":"Xiao Yan knows the Extermination Fire Lotus is too risky to rely on and decides to grow stronger fast before he goes to the Central Plains. He studies the Six Joint Body Flowing Ruler, a Di Class Middle Ranked Dou Skill that still carries its creator's soul signature. Su Qian gives him the Flame Gathering Pot so he can split off Fallen Heart Flame essence and restart the Blazing Qi Refining Tower, and warns him that the lava world is not peaceful. In the lava world below the Inner Academy he feels a strange summons and trains the first level of the ruler, Splitting Fire. Following the pull of the Fallen Heart Flame, he dives deep and finds fire crystals guarded by Fire Lizard People. He fights the swarm with Octane Blast, hides from them, and finds himself looking at a Fallen Heart Flame.","events":["Xiao Yan decides to raise his strength before the Central Plains.","He studies the Six Joint Body Flowing Ruler scroll.","Su Qian gives him the Flame Gathering Pot and walks him to the bottom of the Blazing Qi Refining Tower.","In the lava world Xiao Yan practices Splitting Fire and feels a summons from below.","He dives deep and finds fire crystals.","Fire Lizard People swarm him; he fights them with Octane Blast.","He hides and sees a Fallen Heart Flame."],"introduced":["Six Joint Body Flowing Ruler","Splitting Fire","Body Flowing Fire","Six Joint Fire","Flame Gathering Pot","lava world","Fire Lizard People","Octane Blast"],"confidence":"high"},{"ep":154,"title":"Tian Huo Zun Zhe","summary":"Inside a ball of light deep in the lava world, Xiao Yan finds the seed of a Fallen Heart Flame and the soul of its old owner, Yao Tian Huo, called Tian Huo Zun Zhe. He was a Dou Zun who died when two Heavenly Flames clashed in his body and the Fire Lizard People ambushed him. His soul is fading, so he offers Xiao Yan the seed and the Five Ring Flame Expelling Technique, a Tian Class Dou Skill, if Xiao Yan will repair his soul, and Xiao Yan also makes him serve as bodyguard for a year. Above ground, Han Feng promises a powerful backer that he will gather allies from the Black-Corner Region to crush Jia Nan Academy and kill Xiao Yan. Xiao Yan comes back up as a Six-Star Dou Huang and gives the seed to Su Qian, which gets the Blazing Qi Refining Tower making Heart Flame again. When news comes that Han Feng is gathering Black-Corner experts at Demon Flame Valley, Xiao Yan orders Xiao Li to mobilize the Xiao Gate and march on the valley the next day.","events":["Xiao Yan finds a Fallen Heart Flame seed and meets the soul of Yao Tian Huo.","Yao Tian Huo tells how he died and offers the seed and the Five Ring Flame Expelling Technique for soul repair.","Xiao Yan accepts and asks him to be his bodyguard for a year.","The jade of Tuo She Gu Di stirs, but Yao Tian Huo warns of something terrifying deeper in the lava.","Han Feng tells his backer he will ally with Black-Corner Region experts to attack the academy.","Xiao Yan trains the Five Ring Flame Expelling Technique and makes its Wolf form.","He returns as a Six-Star Dou Huang and the seed rekindles the Blazing Qi Refining Tower.","News of Han Feng arrives; Xiao Yan orders Xiao Li to mobilize the Xiao Gate against Demon Flame Valley."],"introduced":["Yao Tian Huo","Tian Huo Zun Zhe","Fallen Heart Flame seed","Five Ring Flame Expelling Technique","Wolf form","Tuo She Gu Di"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan breaks through to Six-Star Dou Huang in the lava world. Yao Tian Huo was a Dou Zun; his weakened soul is at Eight-Star Dou Zong.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":155,"title":"The Black-Corner Alliance","summary":"At Demon Flame Valley, Han Feng urges the Black-Corner Region guests, led by Chief Mo and Old Ying Shan, to form an alliance against Jia Nan Academy and the Xiao Gate. Xiao Yan arrives, defeats Mr. Jin and Mr. Yin, and wins Chief Mo over by holding the antidote for his poisoned son, Mo Ya, and the other guests leave. Han Feng calls in Protector Xuan of the Hall of Souls, who raises the Ten Thousand Soul Swallowing Formation and builds a fierce spirit with Blood Feed. Tian Huo Zun Zhe tells Xiao Yan to use the Fallen Heart Flame against souls and then absorbs the fierce spirit through Xiao Yan's ring, using Xiao Yan's Soul Power. Worn out, Tian Huo Zun Zhe falls asleep and asks Xiao Yan to nourish his soul for ten days. When Xiao Yan refuses to give the spirit back, Protector Xuan calls on Han Feng to help him, but Han Feng stabs him from behind and takes his soul.","events":["Han Feng pitches an alliance to Chief Mo, Old Ying Shan and the other guests.","Xiao Yan arrives, defeats Mr. Jin and Mr. Yin, and tells outsiders to leave.","Chief Mo backs out in exchange for an antidote for his son Mo Ya; the other guests leave.","Han Feng calls on Protector Xuan of the Hall of Souls, who knows of Protector Wu and Yao Lao's capture.","Protector Xuan uses the Ten Thousand Soul Swallowing Formation and Blood Feed to build a fierce spirit.","Xiao Yan fights back with the Fallen Heart Flame; Tian Huo Zun Zhe absorbs the fierce spirit with Xiao Yan's Soul Power.","Tian Huo Zun Zhe falls into a ten-day slumber.","Han Feng kills Protector Xuan from behind and takes his soul."],"introduced":["Chief Mo","Old Ying Shan","Mo Ya","Mr. Jin","Mr. Yin","Protector Xuan","Protector Wu","Ten Thousand Soul Swallowing Formation","Blood Feed","fierce spirit"],"cultivation":"Old Ground Demon Ghost is recalled as a Seven-Star Dou Zong. Xiao Yan is described as being at the Dou Huang level.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":156,"title":"The End of Han Feng","summary":"Having taken Protector Xuan's power, Han Feng is now about a Five-Star Dou Zong. The Little Fairy Doctor insists on holding him off with her poison, though her Woeful Poison Body is close to breaking out, so Xiao Yan can merge his Lotus Flame. Xiao Yan then drives Han Feng back with it, and the Little Fairy Doctor tells him she is happier at his side than alone in the Chu Yun Empire. Han Feng gives up most of his soul to flee, but he is poisoned with Blood Corrosion and Xiao Yan catches what is left, and Han Feng begs his martial brother for mercy. Old Ying Shan apologizes, and Xiao Yan gives Chief Mo the cure for his son. Zi Yan sniffs out the Old Ground Demon Ghost's hidden vault, which holds the Flame Creation Skill, the Sky Demon Puppet method and a Rank Seven Fire-Attribute monster core. Tian Huo Zun Zhe thanks Xiao Yan, and Xiao Li rushes in to say something has happened to the Little Fairy Doctor.","events":["Han Feng reaches about Five-Star Dou Zong with Protector Xuan's power.","The Little Fairy Doctor fights Han Feng to buy time despite the risk to her poison body.","Xiao Yan strikes Han Feng with his merged Lotus Flame.","Han Feng flees with a fragment of his soul, is poisoned, and Xiao Yan catches it; Han Feng begs for mercy.","Old Ying Shan apologizes and Chief Mo receives the cure for Mo Ya.","Zi Yan finds the Old Ground Demon Ghost's vault behind a spatial barrier.","Xiao Yan obtains the Flame Creation Skill, the Sky Demon Puppet and a Rank Seven monster core.","Tian Huo Zun Zhe thanks Xiao Yan; Xiao Li warns that the Little Fairy Doctor is in trouble."],"introduced":["Sky Sinister Poison Hand","Spiritual Chant","Space Lock","Blood Corrosion","Flame Creation Skill","Sky Demon Puppet","Rank Seven Fire-Attribute monster core","Chu Yun Empire"],"cultivation":"Han Feng reaches about Five-Star Dou Zong after absorbing Protector Xuan's power. Xiao Yan is called a Six-Star Dou Huang.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":157,"title":"The All Day Fire Seal","summary":"The Little Fairy Doctor's Woeful Poison Body is about to break out, and Su Qian cannot get through the poison gas, so Xiao Yan goes in protected by his Heavenly Flame. Tian Huo Zun Zhe teaches him a seal he once made for a friend with the same body, and Xiao Yan draws the All Day Fire Seal on her. It should hold for two to three years, enough time to look for the core of a Sky Poison Dragon Scorpion Beast, and the Little Fairy Doctor comes out of it as a Five-Star Dou Zong. Xiao Yan then refines a Seventh-Tier Pill, the Heaven Soul Blood Fusing Pill, and when a remnant of the Heaven Demon Phoenix presses on it, Zi Yan gives her own blood to drive it back. He enters the Pill Spirit Realm and meets the Pill Lightning with the Six Joint Body Flowing Ruler and the Open Mountain Seal. His new Earth Demon Puppet, made from the Old Ground Demon Ghost's body, Protector Tie's soul and a Rank Seven core, absorbs the rest of the lightning. With the pill finished, Xiao Yan tells Cai Lin in his thoughts that he has kept his promise and will head for the Central Plains.","events":["Su Qian cannot get through the poison gas; Xiao Yan goes in under his Heavenly Flame.","Tian Huo Zun Zhe teaches Xiao Yan a sealing technique for the Woeful Poison Body.","Xiao Yan casts the All Day Fire Seal; it should last two to three years.","The Little Fairy Doctor reaches Five-Star Dou Zong.","Xiao Yan refines the Heaven Soul Blood Fusing Pill; Zi Yan's blood drives back the Heaven Demon Phoenix's pressure.","He enters the Pill Spirit Realm and takes the Pill Lightning head-on.","The Earth Demon Puppet absorbs the lightning and the pill is finished.","Xiao Yan thinks of his promise to Cai Lin and the trip to the Central Plains."],"introduced":["All Day Fire Seal","Sky Poison Dragon Scorpion Beast","Heaven Soul Blood Fusing Pill","Seventh-Tier Pill","Pill Spirit Realm","Pill Lightning","Open Mountain Seal","Earth Demon Puppet","Protector Tie"],"cultivation":"The Little Fairy Doctor advances to Five-Star Dou Zong by absorbing the gas from her Woeful Poison Body.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":158,"title":"Horizon City","summary":"Xiao Yan sets out for the Central Plains with Zi Yan, Xin Lan and the Little Fairy Doctor, and on the way Xin Lan lists the great factions: one hall, one tower, two sects, three valleys and four pavilions. At Horizon City in the Tianqing Mountain Range, the Wormhole is shut for repairs by the Luo family. The Little Fairy Doctor humbles the spoiled Xiao Yao, and her grandfather, City Lord Luo Cheng, backs down and hires the group to help fix the Wormhole for a Rank Six Sky Poison Dragon Scorpion Beast core. During the repair the Two Han Elders cut their power to save themselves, and the array goes out of control. The Wormhole is saved, and Luo Cheng thanks the Little Fairy Doctor. He gives Xiao Yan the promised payment and a space ship stocked with herbs, and the group sets off for the Central Plains.","events":["On the way to Horizon City, Xin Lan explains the factions of the Central Plains.","The Wormhole is closed; the Luo family is repairing it.","The Little Fairy Doctor humbles Xiao Yao, granddaughter of City Lord Luo Cheng.","Luo Cheng offers a Rank Six Sky Poison Dragon Scorpion Beast core for help repairing the Wormhole.","The Two Han Elders reduce their output and the array goes out of control.","The Wormhole is saved and Luo Cheng thanks the Little Fairy Doctor.","Luo Cheng gives the group a space ship loaded with herbs and they set off."],"introduced":["Wormhole","Horizon City","Tianqing Mountain Range","Luo family","Luo Cheng","Xiao Yao","Two Han Elders","Profound Sky Sect","Flower Sect","Ice River Valley","Sound Valley","Falling Star Pavilion","Ten Thousand Sword Pavilion","Yellow Spring Pavilion","Sky Fire Three Mysterious Changes","Three Thousand Lightning Movement","space ship"],"cultivation":"Luo Cheng is about Five-Star Dou Zong. Xiao Yan is called a Dou Huang; the Little Fairy Doctor is recognized as a Dou Zong.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":159,"title":"The Spatial Storm","summary":"On the sixteenth day in the Wormhole, a spatial storm tears the route apart. The Little Fairy Doctor shields the ship and Zi Yan uses a spatial technique, then Xiao Yan goes outside and pushes the ship to the exit with the Three Thousand Lightning Movement. His companions come out safe and read a flickering spatial rune as a sign he survived, but he is pulled away by the storm. He wakes in the north of the Central Plains, rescued by Han Xue, the Second Young Lady of the Han family convoy from Tian Bei City, and her guard Han Chong. In the Ten Thousand Snake Gorge, the demon snake Xia Mang takes the convoy's toll and then tries to seize Han Xue. Still injured, Xiao Yan drives him off with Soul Power without showing his face, and Han Xue wonders whether the hidden rescuer was him.","events":["Sixteen days into the Wormhole, a spatial storm hits.","The Little Fairy Doctor shields the ship and Zi Yan uses a spatial technique.","Xiao Yan pushes the ship out with the Three Thousand Lightning Movement and is swallowed by the storm.","The others find a flickering spatial rune and hope he survived.","Han Xue's convoy finds Xiao Yan; Han Chong tends to him.","Han Chong explains the Ten Thousand Snake Gorge and the demon snake Xia Mang.","Xia Mang takes the toll, then turns on Han Xue.","A hidden Xiao Yan scares Xia Mang off with Soul Power."],"introduced":["spatial storm","spatial rune","Han Xue","Han Chong","Han family","Tian Bei City","Ten Thousand Snake Gorge","Xia Mang","transformation pill"],"cultivation":"Han Xue is a Three-Star Dou Wang. Xia Mang has just become a Dou Huang.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":160,"title":"The Han Family of Tian Bei City","summary":"At the Han Manor in Tian Bei City, Hong Chen of the Hong Clan, now a disciple of the Wind Lightning Pavilion, demands to marry both Han daughters, and the family head Han Chi refuses. Hong Lie and Hong Mu, two Four-Star Dou Huangs, ambush the convoy to take Han Xue, and Xiao Yan captures both in three moves, which tells Han Xue he was her hidden rescuer. At the manor, Xiao Yan finds that Han Xue's sister is Han Yue, his senior from Jia Nan Academy. Hong Chen offers a duel at Sky Stone Stage: if a Han of his generation beats him, the Hong Clan will leave the family alone for ten years, and if not, he marries both sisters. Xiao Yan offers to fight for the Han family, and their uncle Han Tian, an Eight-Star Dou Huang, tests him with the Nine Turning Wind Steps. Xiao Yan beats him with a trace of Spatial Strength, Han Tian admits defeat, and Han Chi promises to repay him at any price.","events":["Hong Chen, a new Wind Lightning Pavilion disciple, demands both Han daughters; Han Chi refuses.","Hong Lie and Hong Mu ambush the convoy; Xiao Yan captures them.","Han Xue realizes Xiao Yan was her mysterious rescuer.","At the Han Manor, Xiao Yan meets Han Yue, his senior from the Inner Academy.","Hong Chen sets a duel at Sky Stone Stage in three days.","Xiao Yan volunteers to fight for the Han family.","Han Tian tests Xiao Yan with the Nine Turning Wind Steps.","Xiao Yan wins with Spatial Strength; Han Chi pledges his gratitude."],"introduced":["Han Manor","Han Chi","Hong Chen","Hong Clan","Han Tian","Hong Lie","Hong Mu","Mysterious Fire Move","Wood Aura Rise","Dou Qi Fusion Technique","Sky Stone Stage","Nine Turning Wind Steps","Spatial Strength"],"cultivation":"Hong Lie and Hong Mu are Four-Star Dou Huangs. Han Tian is an Eight-Star Dou Huang, on par with Hong Chen.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":161,"title":"The Duel at Sky Stone Stage","summary":"Xiao Yan makes Han Feng's captured soul tell him where Yao Lao is held. The answer is a Hall of Souls branch hall in Ming City, in the Western Region of the Central Plains, run by an elder of Dou Zun rank. Three days later, Han Yue warns her sister Han Xue that Xiao Yan already loves another girl. At Sky Stone Stage, Xiao Yan faces Hong Chen in front of his father Hong Li and Elder Shen Yun of the Wind Lightning Pavilion. Hong Chen uses Thunder God Descent and the Mighty Lightning Hammer, but Xiao Yan matches his speed with the Three Thousand Lightning Movement and floors him with the Luminous Jadeite Change of the Sky Fire Three Mysterious Changes. Hong Chen gets up and tries the Exterminating Lightning Hammer, and Xiao Yan's Splitting Fire makes him admit defeat. Hong Chen then attacks Xiao Yan from behind, and Xiao Yan's Three Thousand Lightning Movement draws a sharp cry of recognition.","events":["Han Feng's soul tells Xiao Yan that Yao Lao is held in the Hall of Souls branch in Ming City.","Han Yue tells Han Xue that Xiao Yan already has a girl he likes.","At Sky Stone Stage, Hong Li and Elder Shen Yun watch Hong Chen face Xiao Yan.","Xiao Yan is revealed as a Seven-Star Dou Huang.","Hong Chen uses Thunder God Descent to near Nine-Star Dou Huang strength.","Xiao Yan counters with the Three Thousand Lightning Movement and the Luminous Jadeite Change.","Splitting Fire beats the Exterminating Lightning Hammer and Hong Chen admits defeat.","Hong Chen attacks Xiao Yan from behind."],"introduced":["Ming City","Western Region","Hong Li","Shen Yun","Wind Lightning Claw","Thunder God Descent","Mighty Lightning Hammer","Flame Splitting Tsunami","Luminous Jadeite Change","Exterminating Lightning Hammer","Feng Qing Er"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan is called a Seven-Star Dou Huang. Hong Chen's Thunder God Descent lifts him to nearly Nine-Star Dou Huang. The Ming City branch hall is run by a Dou Zun elder.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":162,"title":"The Stolen Lightning Movement","summary":"Hong Chen's sneak attack ends with all of his meridians snapped, leaving him crippled. Elder Shen Yun of the Wind Lightning Pavilion recognizes Xiao Yan's Three Thousand Lightning Movement as a technique once stolen from the pavilion. He demands that Xiao Yan come with him or be crippled. Han Chi stands by Xiao Yan, but Xiao Yan refuses to drag the Han family in. Shen Yun, a Four-Star Dou Zong, is held off by Xiao Yan's Dou Zong-level puppet, while Xiao Yan fights Hong Li, a Half-Step Dou Zong, and then the whole Hong family, wrecking half of Sky Stone Stage. Hong Li sends for the clan elder Hong Tian Xiao, said to be a Five-Star Dou Zong. When Hong Tian Xiao arrives, Xiao Yan already has Hong Li in his grip and threatens to kill him.","events":["Hong Chen is crippled after his sneak attack; Hong Li vows to kill Xiao Yan.","Han Chi invokes the rules of Sky Stone Stage.","Shen Yun says the Three Thousand Lightning Movement was stolen from the Wind Lightning Pavilion.","Xiao Yan refuses to go to the pavilion and keeps the Han family out of it.","Xiao Yan's Dou Zong-level puppet holds off Shen Yun.","Xiao Yan fights Hong Li and then the whole Hong family.","Hong Li sends for Hong Tian Xiao, a Five-Star Dou Zong.","Hong Tian Xiao arrives to find Xiao Yan holding Hong Li hostage."],"introduced":["Three Thousand Lightning Illusionary Body","Hong Tian Xiao","Half-Step Dou Zong"],"cultivation":"Shen Yun is a Four-Star Dou Zong. Hong Li is a Half-Step Dou Zong. Hong Tian Xiao is said to be a Five-Star Dou Zong. Xiao Yan is still a Dou Huang.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":163,"title":"The Three Thousand Lightning Illusionary Body","summary":"Xiao Yan holds Hong Li hostage against the Hong Clan elder Hong Tian Xiao, then lets him go with a Dark Energy hidden in his body, which keeps Hong Tian Xiao busy. He escapes with Shen Yun's storage ring, breaks its Spiritual Seal, and finds part of the Three Thousand Lightning Illusionary Body, the Wind Lightning Pavilion's treasure technique for making a lightning clone. Shen Yun tracks him through a Blood Lightning Seal and corners him in the mountains with Hong Tian Xiao and Hong Clan men. The Earth Demon Puppet takes Hong Tian Xiao, and Tian Huo Zun Zhe wakes and lends Xiao Yan his power, so his aura reads as at least Eight-Star Dou Zong. Watching in secret, the Han family's grandfather Han Fei refuses Han Xue's plea to help openly, because the Han family cannot afford to anger the Wind Lightning Pavilion. Shen Yun and the Hong Clan flee, but Xiao Yan runs Shen Yun down, and the cornered elder blows himself up. Xiao Yan escapes the blast with Spatial Strength.","events":["Xiao Yan holds Hong Li hostage against Hong Tian Xiao.","He lets Hong Li go with a Dark Energy planted inside him and flees with Shen Yun's storage ring.","Xiao Yan breaks the ring's Spiritual Seal and finds part of the Three Thousand Lightning Illusionary Body.","Shen Yun follows the Blood Lightning Seal and corners Xiao Yan with Hong Tian Xiao.","The Earth Demon Puppet takes on Hong Tian Xiao.","Tian Huo Zun Zhe lends Xiao Yan his power and Xiao Yan overwhelms Shen Yun.","Han Fei watches with his granddaughters but will help only in secret.","Shen Yun flees, is caught and self-destructs; Xiao Yan escapes with Spatial Strength."],"introduced":["Dark Energy","Spiritual Seal","Blood Lightning Seal","lightning pond","Han Fei"],"cultivation":"With Tian Huo Zun Zhe's power, Xiao Yan's aura reads as at least Eight-Star Dou Zong. He is otherwise still a Dou Huang.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":164,"title":"The Northern Pavilion Elders","summary":"After Shen Yun's self-destruction, Han Fei, watching with his granddaughters, decides he will help Xiao Yan if needed. Xiao Yan catches the trace of soul Shen Yun let slip away and destroys it. Han Fei comes out to meet him, thanks him for helping the Han family, and warns him to leave the Central Plains. Xiao Yan promises Tian Huo Zun Zhe that he will take the Mighty Huang Pill to reach Dou Zong and refine a new body for him. At the Wind Lightning Pavilion's Northern Pavilion, Shen Yun's Spiritual Lightning Tablet shatters, and Elder Dian, Elder Lei and Elder Feng surround the Han Manor to draw out his killer. Xiao Yan comes back in a black robe on his Bone Wings, and the three elders and Hong Tian Xiao trap him inside the Nine Heavenly Lightning Prison Formation. He vows to fight until the Han Clan is free, and the elders open with Wind Blade and Lightning Slash.","events":["Han Fei resolves to help Xiao Yan after Shen Yun's death.","Xiao Yan destroys the trace of soul Shen Yun tried to save.","Han Fei introduces himself and warns Xiao Yan about the Wind Lightning Pavilion.","Xiao Yan promises Tian Huo Zun Zhe a new body and plans to take the Mighty Huang Pill.","Shen Yun's Spiritual Lightning Tablet shatters at the Northern Pavilion.","Elder Dian, Elder Lei and Elder Feng besiege the Han Manor.","Xiao Yan arrives to free the Han family and faces the three elders.","The Heaven Hall disciples form the Nine Heavenly Lightning Prison Formation and the fight begins."],"introduced":["Mighty Huang Pill","Spiritual Lightning Tablet","Elder Dian","Elder Lei","Elder Feng","Northern Pavilion","Northern Region","Northern Lightning Tower","Heaven Hall","Nine Heavenly Lightning Prison Formation","Wind Blade","Lightning Slash"],"cultivation":"The Earth Demon Puppet is called a Five-Star Dou Zong puppet. Elder Dian, Elder Lei and Elder Feng are called senior Dou Zongs.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":165,"title":"Fei Tian of the Northern Pavilion","summary":"Inside the Nine Heavenly Lightning Prison Formation, Xiao Yan fights Elder Dian, Elder Lei and Elder Feng of the Wind Lightning Northern Pavilion. He uses the Five Ring Flame Expelling Technique, shows three Heavenly Flames and the Angry Buddha Lotus Flame, and breaks the formation. The elders flee, and he takes their remaining scrolls of the Three Thousand Lightning Illusionary Body. He refuses Hong Tian Xiao's offer of compensation and kills him, which frees the Han Clan, and then leaves the Han family. Tian Huo Zun Zhe warns that borrowing his Soul Power leaves a spiritual imprint in Xiao Yan's body, and Xiao Yan finds Yao Lao's recipe for the Soul Cleansing Pill to clear it. In Bone Transforming City he buys maps and hears of the Heavenly Mountain Blood Pool in the Heaven Eye Mountain Range, which may help a peak Dou Huang reach Dou Zong. At an inn, Fei Tian, head of the Wind Lightning Northern Pavilion, sits down at his table, sees his flame is a Heavenly Flame, and tells him he will not get away.","events":["Xiao Yan fights the three Northern Pavilion elders inside their formation.","He breaks the formation with the Five Ring Flame Expelling Technique and Lotus Flame.","The elders flee and Xiao Yan takes the remaining Illusionary Body scrolls.","Xiao Yan kills Hong Tian Xiao and frees the Han Clan, then says goodbye.","Tian Huo Zun Zhe warns of a spiritual imprint; Xiao Yan finds the Soul Cleansing Pill recipe.","In Bone Transforming City he buys maps and learns of the Heavenly Mountain Blood Pool.","He hears that Miss Feng of the Eastern Pavilion and Tang Ying of the Ten Thousand Sword Pavilion are going there.","Fei Tian, head of the Northern Pavilion, finds Xiao Yan at an inn."],"introduced":["Wind Shield","Lightning Prison","Thunder God's Fury","Wind Lightning Northern Pavilion","Wind Lightning Eastern Pavilion","spiritual imprint","Soul Cleansing Pill","Bone Transforming City","Heavenly Mountain Blood Pool","Heaven Eye Mountain Range","Miss Feng","Tang Ying","Fei Tian","Heavenly Flames Ranking"],"confidence":"high"},{"ep":166,"title":"The Illusionary Body","summary":"Fei Tian, an Eight-Star Dou Zong at least, demands the four scrolls of the Three Thousand Lightning Illusionary Body and the method of merging Heavenly Flames. Tian Huo Zun Zhe stalls him while Xiao Yan runs. Xiao Yan drops the scrolls as a decoy, but Fei Tian sends an avatar after him, and Xiao Yan and Tian Huo Zun Zhe destroy it with the Fallen Heart Flame. Its aura helps Xiao Yan decipher the technique, and he trains until he can make his own lightning avatar, noting that his remaining Life Transforming Flame allows only one more Extermination Fire Lotus. When the Gray Wolf King chases him over a Starchless Fruit, the wolf recognizes his Bone Wings as Heaven Demon Phoenix wings and explains that the tribe rivals the Nine Serene Deep Ground Pythons and the Void Ancient Dragons. Xiao Yan begins to suspect that Zi Yan is a Void Ancient Dragon. He spares the wolf in return for its silence, and decides he can no longer show the wings in front of others.","events":["Fei Tian demands the scrolls and the flame-merging method.","Tian Huo Zun Zhe holds Fei Tian off while Xiao Yan escapes.","Xiao Yan drops the four scrolls; Fei Tian's lightning avatar chases him anyway.","Xiao Yan and Tian Huo Zun Zhe destroy the avatar with the Fallen Heart Flame.","The avatar's aura lets Xiao Yan decipher the Three Thousand Lightning Illusionary Body.","Xiao Yan trains in the forest until he forms an avatar.","The Gray Wolf King chases him over a Starchless Fruit and recognizes his Heaven Demon Phoenix wings.","The wolf explains the great beast tribes and swears to keep the wings secret; Xiao Yan wonders if Zi Yan is a Void Ancient Dragon."],"introduced":["Gray Wolf King","Starchless Fruit","Heaven Demon Phoenix Tribe","Nine Serene Deep Ground Pythons","Void Ancient Dragons"],"cultivation":"Fei Tian is at least an Eight-Star Dou Zong; his avatar is at most Six-Star Dou Zong and at the intermediate level of the Illusionary Body.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":167,"title":"Feng Qing Er","summary":"Xiao Yan's first lightning avatar is only at Dou Ling, so on Tian Huo Zun Zhe's advice he tempers it with the Fallen Heart Flame, and in two months he matches the avatar Fei Tian took five years to temper. At the Heaven Eye Mountain Range, an Energy Tide shuts out strong outside experts, so only young contenders can enter. Feng Qing Er of the Wind Lightning Pavilion arrives on a Seven-Colored Soul Crane with Elder Mu and Elder Huo, who name the other pavilions' entrants: Tang Ying of the Ten Thousand Sword Pavilion, Wang Chen of the Yellow Spring Pavilion and Mu Qing Luan of the Falling Star Pavilion. When the range opens, Feng Qing Er races Xiao Yan with the Three Thousand Lightning Movement, names him in front of the crowd, and leaves their score for the Blood Pool. Lost in the foggy maze, Xiao Yan meets Tang Ying, who hopes to see him at the Heaven Mountain Stage. He then finds Nalan Yanran fighting off Wang Chen and Huang Tian of the Ground Spirit Gate, who want her Psychic White Fox, and steps in, and she recognizes him.","events":["Xiao Yan's avatar is only at Dou Ling; he tempers it with the Fallen Heart Flame.","In two months he reaches the level of Fei Tian's avatar.","Crowds gather at the Heaven Eye Mountain Range; the Energy Tide keeps strong experts out.","Feng Qing Er arrives on the Seven-Colored Soul Crane with Elder Mu and Elder Huo.","Elder Mu lists Tang Ying, Wang Chen and Mu Qing Luan as rivals.","Feng Qing Er chases Xiao Yan with the Three Thousand Lightning Movement and exposes his name.","Lost in the fog, Xiao Yan meets Tang Ying.","He steps in when Wang Chen and Huang Tian attack Nalan Yanran for her Psychic White Fox."],"introduced":["Seven-Colored Soul Crane","Feng Qing Er","Elder Mu","Elder Huo","Energy Tide","Wang Chen","Mu Qing Luan","Sky Fountain Sword","Tang Ying","Heaven Mountain Stage","Wind Spirit Fractal Sword","Psychic White Fox","Huang Tian","Ground Spirit Gate","Ground Drawing Prison","Earth Melting Skill"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan's new lightning avatar is at Dou Ling level.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":168,"title":"The Gold Swallowing Mouse Tribe","summary":"Xiao Yan drives off the Ground Spirit Gate men, and his Heavenly Flame suppresses Wang Chen's darkness-type Corpse Eroding Hand, so Wang Chen withdraws and promises to meet him at the Heaven Mountain Stage. Nalan Yanran tells Xiao Yan she now trains alone, and the two travel on together with her Psychic White Fox. At the maze, Wang Chen tells a band of Dou Huangs about the fox, and when they attack, Xiao Yan kills them all with the Flame Splitting Tsunami. Jin Gu, a Dou Zong of the Gold Swallowing Mouse Tribe, lets him pass after Xiao Yan gives him Qi Mending Pills. With the fox leading, the pair cross the maze and reach the Heaven Mountain Stage just in time. The tribe's leader Jin Shi sets the first test: climb to the summit within an hour under the mice's sonic waves. Hu Ya and Hu Cheng of the Bone Transforming Gate try first and fail.","events":["Xiao Yan drives off the Ground Spirit Gate men.","Wang Chen withdraws after Xiao Yan's Heavenly Flame beats his Corpse Eroding Hand.","Nalan Yanran explains the Psychic White Fox and the Gold Swallowing Mouse Tribe, and the two travel together.","Wang Chen sets a group of Dou Huangs on them; Xiao Yan kills them.","Jin Gu of the Gold Swallowing Mouse Tribe lets Xiao Yan through for some pills.","Xiao Yan and Nalan Yanran cross the maze with the fox and reach the Heaven Mountain Stage.","Jin Shi announces the sonic-wave climbing test.","Hu Ya and Hu Cheng of the Bone Transforming Gate fail the test."],"introduced":["Corpse Eroding Hand","Gold Swallowing Mouse Tribe","Jin Gu","Qi Mending Pill","Jin Shi","Hu Ya","Hu Cheng","Bone Transforming Gate","Lion Tiger Gold Shattering Roar"],"cultivation":"Wang Chen is said to be at the peak of Dou Huang. Jin Gu is a Dou Zong. The leader of the Gold Swallowing Mouse Tribe is as strong as a Six-Star Dou Zong.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":169,"title":"The Sonic Wave Trial","summary":"At the Heaven Mountain Stage, the young contenders climb one by one through the Gold Swallowing Mouse Tribe's sonic wave formation. Feng Qing Er, Tang Ying, Wang Chen and Mu Qing Luan all pass, and Jin Shi reveals that Mu Qing Luan is a disciple of Feng Zun Zhe. Xiao Yan takes Nalan Yanran up with him, and when she falls behind he weakens the formation with the Lion Tiger Gold Shattering Roar, which sounds like a dragon's roar. In private, Mu Qing Luan tells him that Feng Zun Zhe will attend the Four Pavilions Meeting at the Wind Lightning Eastern Pavilion in three months. Jin Shi then asks Xiao Yan to remove the Heaven Mountain Fire Poison deep in his bones. In return he gives Xiao Yan a token that opens the Space Seal at the bottom of the Blood Pool, where the purest energy can lift him to Dou Zong.","events":["Feng Qing Er, Tang Ying and Wang Chen pass the sonic wave trial.","Jin Shi greets Mu Qing Luan as Feng Zun Zhe's disciple; the sonic waves barely affect her.","Xiao Yan climbs with Nalan Yanran while the others mock him.","His Lion Tiger Gold Shattering Roar breaks much of the formation, and both pass.","Mu Qing Luan and Feng Qing Er trade jabs about the Four Pavilions Meeting in three months.","Mu Qing Luan tells Xiao Yan that Feng Zun Zhe will be at the Wind Lightning Eastern Pavilion for the meeting.","Jin Shi shows his Fire Poison and offers Xiao Yan the Blood Pool's secret depths in exchange for a cure."],"introduced":["Elder Lei (Feng Qing Er's master, named)","Green Mythical Bird Tribe","Four Pavilions Meeting","Heaven Mountain Fire Poison","Fire Poison","Space Seal"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan is a Nine-Star Dou Huang. Jin Shi says the Blood Pool's depths took him quickly to Seven-Star Dou Zong.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":170,"title":"Dou Zong at the Bottom of the Blood Pool","summary":"Only eight people may enter the Heavenly Mountain Blood Pool, and the group is cut down to eight while Nalan Yanran keeps her place. Inside, Mu Qing Luan steals energy crystals from Feng Qing Er, and Xiao Yan dives alone past the spatial barrier, where his Heavenly Flame shields him from the Fire Poison. He sends out his Three Thousand Lightning Illusionary Body avatar to gather crystals faster. After two and a half months, when everyone else has left, he breaks through to Dou Zong. The breakthrough sends his Soul Power to the Spiritual Handprint Yao Lao left, and he sees his master in a Hall of Souls prison before Qin Tian drives him out. Afterward Jin Shi makes him a lifelong friend of the Gold Swallowing Mouse Tribe, and Jin Gu begins to tell him about the Gu Clan and its Dou Di bloodline.","events":["The contenders argue that one of the nine must drop out; Nalan Yanran refuses to give up her place.","Feng Qing Er and Xiao Yan trade threats before the pool opens.","Mu Qing Luan robs Feng Qing Er of energy crystals with a Wind Lightning Slash and flees.","Xiao Yan passes the spatial barrier and uses his avatar to gather crystals amid the Fire Poison.","After two and a half months Xiao Yan breaks through to Dou Zong.","Through Yao Lao's Spiritual Handprint he sees Yao Lao imprisoned; Qin Tian of the Hall of Souls attacks his soul.","Qin Tian presses Yao Lao to join the Hall of Souls; Yao Lao waits for his disciple.","Jin Shi thanks Xiao Yan, and Jin Gu starts explaining the Gu Clan."],"introduced":["Heavenly Mountain Blood Pool (entered)","energy crystals","Wind Lightning Slash","spatial barrier","Spiritual Handprint","Qin Tian","Soul Fluctuation","Dou Di bloodline","three great ancient families of the Magical Beast World"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan breaks through from Nine-Star Dou Huang to Dou Zong at the bottom of the Blood Pool, the first person to do so there.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":171,"title":"The Four Pavilion Grand Meeting","summary":"Jin Gu explains that the Gu Clan carries a Dou Di bloodline and lives in the Gu Realm, a space in the eastern Central Plains built by its Dou Shengs. Xiao Yan now understands why Xun Er asked him to become a Dou Zong before looking for her. He cures Jin Shi's Fire Poison and flies to Lightning Mountain, home of the Wind Lightning Pavilion, for the Four Pavilion Grand Meeting. He hides among the spectators while Lei Zun Zhe, Jian Zun Zhe, Huang Quan Zun Zhe and Feng Zun Zhe arrive. Fifty-three contestants fight until four remain, and Feng Qing Er, now a Dou Zong, stands out. Xiao Yan sees his old friend Lin Yan, now a Dou Huang, surrender, and he steps in when Wang Chen tries to kill him anyway. Huang Quan Zun Zhe demands punishment, so Xiao Yan agrees to a duel with Wang Chen.","events":["Jin Gu tells Xiao Yan about the Gu Clan's Dou Di bloodline and the Gu Realm.","Xiao Yan removes Jin Shi's Fire Poison and learns Feng Qing Er became a Dou Zong in the Blood Pool.","At Lightning Mountain he avoids Elder Mu and Elder Huo and takes the spectators' path.","Fei Tian and the four Zun Zhes of the pavilions arrive.","Fifty-three contestants start a melee to decide the last four.","Lin Yan surrenders, but Wang Chen keeps attacking him; Xiao Yan saves him.","Lei Zun Zhe orders the intruder punished; Feng Zun Zhe objects.","Huang Quan Zun Zhe offers a duel with Wang Chen, and Xiao Yan accepts."],"introduced":["Gu Realm","Dou Sheng","Lightning Mountain","Four Pavilion Grand Meeting","Lei Zun Zhe","Jian Zun Zhe","Huang Quan Zun Zhe","Feng Zun Zhe (on screen)","Thunder Rod","Heaven Demon Phoenix Bloodline"],"cultivation":"Feng Qing Er has become a Dou Zong through the Blood Pool. Lin Yan has broken through to Dou Huang.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":172,"title":"Feng Xian","summary":"On Lightning Mountain, Xiao Yan fights Wang Chen of the Yellow Spring Pavilion, who is close to Dou Zong. Wang Chen uses the Yellow Spring Blood Skill, but Xiao Yan reveals that he is a Dou Zong and beats him with the Six Joint Body Flowing Ruler and his Heavenly Flames. Wang Chen exposes his name, and Fei Tian attacks him in front of the crowd. Feng Zun Zhe steps in after he recognizes Yao Lao's storage ring and the Bone Chilling Flame's fire seal. Xiao Yan tells him that Yao Lao is held by the Hall of Souls. Feng Zun Zhe gives his real name, Feng Xian, and threatens war between the Falling Star Pavilion and the Wind Lightning Pavilion if Xiao Yan is harmed. Lei Zun Zhe accuses Xiao Yan of stealing the Three Thousand Lightning Movement, and Feng Qing Er challenges him to a duel to settle the matter.","events":["Huang Quan Zun Zhe orders Wang Chen to make Xiao Yan pay.","Xiao Yan reveals Dou Zong strength and beats Wang Chen's Yellow Spring Rotten Corpse Arm.","Wang Chen names Xiao Yan, the man the Wind Lightning Pavilion wants.","Fei Tian attacks; Xiao Yan dares Lei Zun Zhe to act himself.","Feng Zun Zhe saves Xiao Yan and confirms he is Yao Lao's disciple through the Bone Chilling Flame.","Feng Zun Zhe reveals his real name, Feng Xian, and says the Falling Star Pavilion will protect Xiao Yan.","Xiao Yan says he bought the Three Thousand Lightning Movement at an auction outside the Central Plains.","Feng Qing Er challenges Xiao Yan; her Wind Killing Finger closes the episode."],"introduced":["Six Joint Body Flowing Ruler (ruler weapon)","Bone Corroding Round Dagger Dance","Yellow Spring Blood Skill","Yellow Spring Rotten Corpse Arm","Feng Xian","fire seal","Wind Lightning Dou Qi","Colorful Phoenix Domination","Wind Lightning Sacrifice","Wind Killing Finger"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan shows that he is a Dou Zong. Wang Chen is nearly a Dou Zong. Lei Zun Zhe is a Dou Zun.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":173,"title":"The Heaven Demon Phoenix Bell","summary":"Xiao Yan's Fire Lotus holds against Feng Qing Er's Wind Killing Finger, and he shows two Heavenly Flames. Feng Qing Er reveals that she belongs to the Heaven Demon Phoenix Tribe and uses the tribe's secret technique to rise to Three-Star Dou Zong. Xiao Yan answers with the Sky Fire Three Mysterious Changes and merges three Heavenly Flames into the Angry Buddha Lotus Flame. She traps him in the Holy Icon Demon Phoenix Bell, made by a Dou Sheng ancestor of her tribe, but he breaks out and defeats her. After her loss, she senses her tribe's Ancient Phoenix Essence Blood on Xiao Yan and accuses him of stealing it. Feng Zun Zhe and the Falling Star Pavilion refuse to let her search his storage ring, but Xiao Yan agrees to her tribe's art of search to settle it.","events":["The Fire Lotus beats the Wind Killing Finger.","Feng Qing Er reveals her Heaven Demon Phoenix wings and uses Bloodline Devouring Soul.","Her secret technique lifts her to Three-Star Dou Zong; Xiao Yan uses the Sky Fire Three Mysterious Changes.","Feng Zun Zhe learns why Lei Zun Zhe hid her aura.","Xiao Yan merges three Heavenly Flames into the Angry Buddha Lotus Flame.","He escapes the Holy Icon Demon Phoenix Bell and wins the duel.","Feng Qing Er accuses him of holding the Ancient Phoenix Essence Blood.","Xiao Yan agrees to let her use her tribe's art of search on him."],"introduced":["Fire Lotus","Bloodline Devouring Soul","Holy Demon Phoenix Icon","Holy Icon Demon Phoenix Bell","Ancient Phoenix Essence Blood","art of search"],"cultivation":"Feng Qing Er rises to Three-Star Dou Zong for the fight with her tribe's secret technique.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":174,"title":"The Ancient Phoenix Essence Blood","summary":"Feng Qing Er's search finds nothing, because Xiao Yan has hidden the Ancient Phoenix Essence Blood in his Heavenly Flame. She apologizes, and Lei Zun Zhe ends the feud but warns Xiao Yan never to teach the Three Thousand Lightning Movement. The heat has spread the rest of the essence blood through his body, so Xiao Yan tries to absorb it and nearly bursts. His Bone Wings, which are Heaven Demon Phoenix wings, take in the excess and grow stronger, and he lets out a phoenix cry with his dragon roar. Xiao Yan then brings out Han Feng's soul, who says Yao Lao is held in Ming City in the Western Region of the Central Plains. Feng Zun Zhe reveals that he and Yao Lao founded the Falling Star Pavilion, and he gives Xiao Yan a star jade to call for help. Xiao Yan sets off with Lin Yan for the Pill Tower's Pill Gathering, hoping to win the Three Thousand Burning Flame.","events":["The art of search fails, and Feng Qing Er apologizes to Xiao Yan.","Lei Zun Zhe ends the feud, and Feng Qing Er tells her tribe about the essence blood.","Xiao Yan collapses; the essence blood has spread through his body.","His Bone Wings absorb the excess energy and grow stronger.","Han Feng's soul names Ming City as Yao Lao's prison and claims only one Honorable Elder guards it.","Feng Zun Zhe says he and Yao Lao founded the Falling Star Pavilion and gives Xiao Yan a star jade.","Xiao Yan and Lin Yan leave for the Pill City."],"introduced":["Heaven Demon Phoenix Wings","Yin-Yang Mysterious Dragon Pill","Yao Zun Zhe","star jade","Pill City"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan fully absorbs the Ancient Phoenix Essence Blood; his Bone Wings grow stronger. No new realm is stated.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":175,"title":"Tianhuang City","summary":"Xiao Yan and Lin Yan reach Tianhuang City, where Liu Qing's Liu Clan runs a Wormhole to the Pill Region. The region is ruled by the Burning Flame Valley, which holds the Nine Dragon Lightning Flame and the Sky Fire Three Mysterious Changes. Valley Chief Tang wants a high-tier alchemist, and Elder Chi Huo says whichever clan provides one will run the Wormhole for three years. The Cheng Clan brings Zeng Xiu, a sixth-tier alchemist of the Pill Tower, but Xiao Yan, going by Yan Xiao, beats him in a contest of Spiritual Strength. Elder Chi Huo takes him to the Burning Flame Valley, where Tang Zhen wants a Seventh-Tier High-Grade Pill refined. Only Master Huan, with his Sky Cold Flame, and Xiao Yan, with a Heavenly Flame no one can place, withstand the Nine Dragon Lightning Flame. As his reward, Xiao Yan asks for the Sky Fire Three Mysterious Changes.","events":["Xiao Yan and Lin Yan arrive in Tianhuang City.","Lin Yan explains the Burning Flame Valley and warns against using the Sky Fire Three Mysterious Changes.","Elder Chi Huo sets a contest between the Liu Clan and the Cheng Clan for the Wormhole.","Xiao Yan meets Liu Qing and Liu Fei again.","Xiao Yan beats Zeng Xiu and wins the Wormhole for the Liu Clan.","At the Burning Flame Valley, Tang Huo Er doubts him and Tang Zhen explains the pill.","Master Huan and Xiao Yan pass the Nine Dragon Lightning Flame test.","Xiao Yan names the Sky Fire Three Mysterious Changes as his price."],"introduced":["Tianhuang City","Pill Region","Liu Clan (Wormhole)","Cheng Clan","Three Valleys","Nine Dragon Lightning Flame","Elder Chi Huo","Zeng Xiu","Tang Huo Er","Master Mo","Tang Zhen","Seventh-Tier High-Grade Pill","Master Huan","Sky Cold Flame","Sky Bone Python","Flame Creation Skill (used, recap)","Flame Seed of Life Transforming Flame"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan is called a Dou Zong and a sixth-tier alchemist.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":176,"title":"The Flame Bodhi Pill","summary":"Tang Zhen explains that his daughter Tang Huo Er failed to absorb the Nine Dragon Lightning Flame and will die within a year. The seventh-tier Flame Bodhi Pill is his last chance to save her. He, Master Huan and Xiao Yan refine it for ten days in the Mountain Melting Cauldron. Master Huan runs out of Spiritual Strength at the last step, and Xiao Yan finishes the pill alone. His Earth Demon Puppet takes the Pill Lightning. Three days later, the valley's elders object to giving away the Sky Fire Three Mysterious Changes, and one reveals that Yan Xiao is Xiao Yan, the man who defeated Feng Qing Er. Xiao Yan unmasks and agrees to survive ten blows from Second Elder Wu Chen, an Eight-Star Dou Zong, and he meets the last blow with the Angry Buddha Lotus Flame.","events":["Tang Zhen tells of Tang Huo Er's year left to live.","The three refine the Flame Bodhi Pill in the Mountain Melting Cauldron.","Master Huan fails at the last step; Xiao Yan asks to go on alone.","Xiao Yan completes the pill, and the Earth Demon Puppet takes the Pill Lightning.","The elders object, and Xiao Yan's identity is exposed.","Second Elder Wu Chen tests him with ten blows.","Xiao Yan matches the Celestial Astral Stone Crushing Steps with the Three Thousand Lightning Movement.","Wu Chen's Taiyi Infernal Luo Talisman meets the Angry Buddha Lotus Flame."],"introduced":["Flame Bodhi Pill","Mountain Melting Cauldron","Cauldron Ranking","Glaze Lotus Core Flame (name)","Wu Chen","Pure Yang Palm","Celestial Astral Stone Crushing Steps","Almighty Fire Luo Flame","Taiyi Infernal Luo Talisman"],"cultivation":"Wu Chen is an Eight-Star Dou Zong.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":177,"title":"Ye City","summary":"Xiao Yan survives Wu Chen's ten blows, and Tang Zhen lets him inherit the Sky Fire Three Mysterious Changes. Tang Zhen tells Tang Huo Er that the technique was made by Xiao Xuan of the Xiao Clan, one of five experts a step from Dou Di. In the Jia Ma Empire, Xiao Ding and Medusa receive a Profound Lion Sect envoy for the Yan Alliance, and Xiao Yan's letter brings Medusa the Heaven Soul Blood Fusing Pill. Xiao Yan then learns that Xin Lan is Ye Xin Lan of the Ye Clan, one of the Pill Region's five great clans. The Ice River Valley has put out a wanted notice for the Little Fairy Doctor and her Woeful Poison Body. In Ye City, First Elder Ye Chong is forcing Xin Lan to marry Cao Dan of the Cao Clan. Xiao Yan breaks in, beats the Ye Clan's Fourth Elder, a One-Star Dou Zong, holds off the rest with his puppet, and leaves with Xin Lan.","events":["Wu Chen loses the ten-blow trial, and Xiao Yan gets the Sky Fire Three Mysterious Changes.","In the Jia Ma Empire, Xiao Ding and Medusa deal with the Profound Lion Sect.","Medusa reads Xiao Yan's letter and receives the Heaven Soul Blood Fusing Pill.","Tang Zhen tells Tang Huo Er about Xiao Xuan, the technique's creator.","Xin Lan and the Little Fairy Doctor are attacked by the Ice River Valley, and Xin Lan goes for help.","Liu Qing explains the Ye Clan and opens the Wormhole to the Pill Region.","Ye Chong refuses to help the Little Fairy Doctor and orders Xin Lan to marry Cao Dan.","Xiao Yan defeats the Ye Clan's elders and takes Xin Lan away."],"introduced":["Profound Lion Sect","Yan Alliance (envoy)","inheritance crystal ball","Burning Flame Ancestor","Xiao Xuan","Xiao Clan (Dou Di bloodline)","Ye Clan","Ye Xin Lan","Ye City","five large clans of the Pill Region","Woeful Poison Lady","Ye Chong","Cao Clan","Cao Dan"],"cultivation":"A Ye Clan elder, the Fourth Elder, is a One-Star Dou Zong.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":178,"title":"The Fallen God Stream","summary":"Xin Lan tells Xiao Yan that the Little Fairy Doctor's Woeful Poison Body broke out on the way to the Pill Region, and the Ice River Valley has hunted her ever since. Zi Yan went home after sensing something, and the Little Fairy Doctor drew the hunters away to the Fallen God Stream. Following a Poison Seeking Mouse, Xiao Yan and Xin Lan find her fighting Ice River Valley men, who hit her with the Ice Zun Force and trap her in the Ice Seal Formation. Xiao Yan arrives as a One-Star Dou Zong and sends in his Earth Demon Puppet. Tian Huo Zun Zhe takes on the Ice River leader, who names himself Bing Fu. Xiao Yan fights an Ice River Two-Star Dou Zong with the Three Thousand Lightning Illusionary Body, Heavenly Flame and Octane Blast, and beats him.","events":["Xin Lan tells how the group lost Xiao Yan and Zi Yan, and why the Ice River Valley wants the Little Fairy Doctor.","A Poison Seeking Mouse leads them through the Fallen God Stream.","An Ice River Valley leader strikes the Little Fairy Doctor with the Ice Zun Force.","Ice River disciples set the Ice Seal Formation around her.","Xiao Yan arrives and his puppet joins the fight.","Tian Huo Zun Zhe faces Bing Fu.","Xiao Yan defeats an Ice River Two-Star Dou Zong."],"introduced":["Fallen God Stream","Poison Seeking Mouse","Ice Zun Force","Mysterious Ice Qi","Ice Seal Formation","Bing Fu","Bing He (Ice River Two-Star Dou Zong)","Ice Python Arm"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan is a One-Star Dou Zong. An Ice River Valley fighter is a Two-Star Dou Zong.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":179,"title":"The Ice Zun Force","summary":"An Ice River Valley elder offers Tian Huo Zun Zhe a new body if he kills Xiao Yan and hands over the Little Fairy Doctor, and Tian Huo Zun Zhe kills him instead. The Ice Zun Force is eating into the Little Fairy Doctor's blood, so Xiao Yan spends days burning it out with his Heavenly Flame and medicine. While doing so he absorbs some of the Demon Poison Spot and becomes a Two-Star Dou Zong. The Little Fairy Doctor says she has two or three months before her poison takes over, and that a Rank Seven Sky Poison Dragon Scorpion Beast rules the Fallen God Stream. Xiao Yan plans to kill it for its core, which can control her Woeful Poison Body, and for blood and essence for the Yin Yang Life Soul Pill, which can give Tian Huo Zun Zhe a body. Xin Lan returns with the herbs and warns that the Ice River Valley has declared them wanted and sent its strongest Dou Zong. The three go to the beast's stone castle, and it comes out for the Little Fairy Doctor.","events":["Tian Huo Zun Zhe kills the Ice River elder who tries to bargain.","Xiao Yan begins burning out the Ice Zun Force with his Heavenly Flame.","Xin Lan leaves with the Earth Demon Puppet to gather herbs.","Elder Bing Xian leaves to report to the Ice River Valley master.","Xiao Yan reaches Two-Star Dou Zong.","Xiao Yan proposes the Yin Yang Life Soul Pill and teases Tian Huo Zun Zhe into hunting the beast.","Xin Lan reports that the Ice River Valley's strongest Dou Zong is coming.","The group reaches the Sky Poison Dragon Scorpion Beast's den."],"introduced":["Elder Bing Xian","Bing Yuan (three elders)","Tian She","Sky Poison Dragon Scorpion Beast (in the Fallen God Stream)","Bone Growing Blood Fusing Pill","Yin Yang Life Soul Pill"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan goes from One-Star to Two-Star Dou Zong by absorbing part of the Demon Poison Spot while healing the Little Fairy Doctor.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":180,"title":"The Sky Poison Dragon Scorpion Beast","summary":"In the Sky Scorpion Region of the Fallen God Stream, the Rank Seven Sky Poison Dragon Scorpion Beast demands that the Little Fairy Doctor become his woman. She demands his Demon Core instead, and the fight begins. The beast, of the Scorpion Dragon Tribe with Void Ancient Dragon blood, sends a swarm of poison beasts at them and uses Scorpion Dragon Swallowing The Heaven. Tian Huo Zun Zhe holds it while Xiao Yan prepares, and the Little Fairy Doctor breaks one of its horns. Xiao Yan kills it with the Angry Buddha Lotus Flame. On the Little Fairy Doctor's advice, he first refines the Yin Yang Life Soul Pill to give Tian Huo Zun Zhe a body, hoping a Dou Zun can face the Ice River Valley. The seventh-tier pill's Pill Lightning fades in the poison fog, but Tian She and the Ice River pursuers notice it.","events":["The beast courts the Little Fairy Doctor and attacks Tian Huo Zun Zhe.","Poison beasts of the Fallen God Stream swarm the group.","The Little Fairy Doctor's Eroding Poison Demon Hand breaks the beast's horn.","The beast uses Scorpion Dragon Swallowing The Heaven.","Xiao Yan kills it with the Angry Buddha Lotus Flame.","The group decides to rebuild Tian Huo Zun Zhe's body first.","Xiao Yan refines the Yin Yang Life Soul Pill; its Pill Lightning vanishes.","Tian She's party closes in."],"introduced":["Sky Scorpion Region","Scorpion Dragon Tribe","Scorpion Dragon Swallowing The Heaven"],"confidence":"high"},{"ep":181,"title":"Tian Huo Zun Zhe Reborn","summary":"Tian Huo Zun Zhe swallows the Yin Yang Life Soul Pill and enters the new body while Xiao Yan refines it with his Heavenly Flame. Tian She, the Ice River Valley's peak Dou Zong, arrives first and overpowers the Little Fairy Doctor with the Ice Zun Force. Tian Huo Zun Zhe then comes out as a Dou Zun and smashes the Ice River men's summoned dragon with Spatial Strangling. Tian She sacrifices his own comrades, tears open space and escapes. The group takes the Little Fairy Doctor to the Ye Clan's Sun Fire Ancient Altar in Ye City to bring her poison under control. There, Zhao Hei of the Black Fire Sect, a Six-Star Dou Zong, is threatening Ye Chong over the altar, and Tian Huo Zun Zhe frightens him away. Ye Chong apologizes for the last visit and opens the forbidden altar to Xiao Yan.","events":["Tian Huo Zun Zhe enters the body and endures the Heavenly Flame.","Tian She arrives and beats the Little Fairy Doctor.","Tian Huo Zun Zhe awakens as a Dou Zun.","The Ice River men use Blood Offering Summons the Profound Dragon; Spatial Strangling breaks it.","Tian She abandons his men and escapes through space.","Zhao Hei of the Black Fire Sect threatens the Ye Clan.","Tian Huo Zun Zhe drives Zhao Hei off.","Ye Chong opens the Sun Fire Ancient Altar to Xiao Yan."],"introduced":["Strong Dragon Mysterious Profound Formation","Blood Offering Summons the Profound Dragon","Spatial Strangling","Sun Fire Ancient Altar","Black Fire Sect","Zhao Hei"],"cultivation":"Tian Huo Zun Zhe regains a body and is a Dou Zun again. Tian She is a peak Dou Zong. Zhao Hei is a Six-Star Dou Zong.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":182,"title":"The Sun Fire Ancient Altar","summary":"Xun Er learns that Xiao Yan is in Ye City and sets out with Elder Lin and Elder Yuan. At the Sun Fire Ancient Altar, Xiao Yan uses the Bodhisattva Body Transformation Saliva and his Heavenly Flame to draw the Little Fairy Doctor's poison into a Poison Pill. The saliva leaves a Bodhisattva Seed, and Xiao Yan also takes the Core Bead that had swallowed the altar's core heart fire seedlings. Meanwhile, the Hall of Souls offers an alliance to Bing Zun Zhe, master of the Ice River Valley. Tian Shuang Zi and Tian She lead Ice River men to the Ye Clan and demand the Woeful Poison Lady. Tian Huo Zun Zhe faces Tian Shuang Zi, Dou Zun against Dou Zun, and Protector Wu of the Hall of Souls attacks Xiao Yan. Xiao Yan uses all three changes of the Sky Fire Three Mysterious Changes against him.","events":["Xun Er's men report Xiao Yan's location, and she leaves for Ye City.","Ye Chong shows the group the Sun Fire Ancient Altar.","Tian She reports to the Ice River Valley master; the Hall of Souls proposes an alliance.","Xiao Yan compresses the Little Fairy Doctor's poison into a Poison Pill with the Bodhisattva saliva.","He finds the Bodhisattva Seed and the Core Bead.","Tian Shuang Zi and Tian She threaten the Ye Clan.","Protector Wu attacks Xiao Yan; Tian Huo Zun Zhe faces Tian Shuang Zi.","Xiao Yan uses the Green Lotus Change, the Luminous Jadeite Change and the Third Change."],"introduced":["Elder Lin","Elder Yuan","Sun Flame","core heart fire seedlings","Tian Shuang Zi","Bing Zun Zhe","Poison Pill","Bodhisattva Seed","Core Bead","Green Lotus Change"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan is a Two-Star Dou Zong. Tian Shuang Zi is a Dou Zun. The Sky Fire Three Mysterious Changes can raise him by nearly three stars.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":183,"title":"Revenge on Protector Wu","summary":"With the third change of the Sky Fire Three Mysterious Changes, Xiao Yan forces his power up to Seven-Star Dou Zong. He breaks Protector Wu's Hundred Souls Locking Sky Python and beats him with the Flame Splitting Tsunami, the Six Joint Fire, the Open Mountain Seal and the Sea Flipping Seal. Protector Wu calls for Hall of Souls help, and Tian She attacks Xiao Yan with Bing Xuan and Bing Hua. Xiao Yan sets the Five Ring Flame Expelling Technique against their Ice River Array and Ice God Bow, and brings down all three before his technique runs out. He holds Protector Wu and tells him his pain is nothing next to Yao Lao's. Qing Hai Zun Zhe of the Hall of Souls, a Two-Star Dou Zun, arrives and orders Xiao Yan taken. As Qing Hai Zun Zhe moves on Xiao Yan, the Little Fairy Doctor warns him that if he hurts Xiao Yan he will die.","events":["The third change lifts Xiao Yan to Seven-Star Dou Zong.","Xiao Yan defeats Protector Wu with a chain of Advanced Dou Skills.","Protector Wu sends a signal to the Hall of Souls.","Tian She, Bing Xuan and Bing Hua attack Xiao Yan.","The Five Ring Flame Expelling Technique beats the Ice River Array and the Ice God Bow.","Xiao Yan captures Protector Wu.","Qing Hai Zun Zhe arrives and goes after Xiao Yan.","The Little Fairy Doctor steps in."],"introduced":["Hundred Souls Locking Sky Python","Bing Xuan","Bing Hua","Ice River Array","Sky Incinerating Expelling Flames","Ice God Bow","Qing Hai Zun Zhe"],"cultivation":"The third change raises Xiao Yan from Two-Star to Seven-Star Dou Zong for a limited time. Protector Wu is an Eight-Star Dou Zong. Qing Hai Zun Zhe is a Two-Star Dou Zun.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":184,"title":"Xun Er Arrives","summary":"The Little Fairy Doctor has condensed her Poison Pill and holds off Qing Hai Zun Zhe with her new poison. Then the Ice River Valley master Bing He arrives, said to be as strong as Tang Zhen, wanting her innate Woeful Poison Body to perfect his own flawed, acquired one. He nearly kills Xiao Yan before Xun Er arrives and warns that the Ice River Valley will cease to exist if he hurts him. Her Heavenly Flame awes even Xiao Yan's Glaze Lotus Core Flame. Her guard Elder Lin hits Bing He with the Sky Burying Seal, a God Seal Technique, which marks her as Gu Clan. Bing He apologizes and swears that the Ice River Valley will leave the Woeful Poison Body alone. Xun Er hands the captured Protector Wu to Xiao Yan and thanks the Little Fairy Doctor for looking after him.","events":["The Little Fairy Doctor fights Qing Hai Zun Zhe with her poison.","Ice River Valley master Bing He arrives.","Bing He reveals his acquired Woeful Poison Body and attacks.","Xun Er arrives and saves Xiao Yan.","Xun Er's side breaks the Cold Air Array.","Elder Lin uses the Sky Burying Seal on Bing He, showing they are Gu Clan.","Bing He gives up the Woeful Poison Body.","Xun Er gives Protector Wu to Xiao Yan and meets the Little Fairy Doctor."],"introduced":["acquired Woeful Poison Body","Cold Air Array","Gan Da","Icy Cold Palm","Sky Burying Seal"],"cultivation":"None stated for Xiao Yan. Bing He is said to be as strong as Tang Zhen.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":185,"title":"Xun Er's Farewell","summary":"In Ye City after the battle with Ice River Valley, Xiao Yan tells Xun Er he wants to rescue Yao Lao from the Hall of Souls, and she promises to use the Gu Clan to search for his father. That night she gives him the last three seals of the God Seal Technique and explains the jade of Emperor Flame: it is the key to the mansion of Emperor Flame, the last Dou Di, and the Gu Clan and the Hall of Souls both want it. She tells him the Xiao Clan's ancestor, Xiao Xuan, once stood at the peak of the Central Plains and made a pact with the Gu Clan. After Xiao Yan fully refines the Demon Poison Spot, Ling Quan of the Gu Clan arrives with orders to bring Xun Er home and to take Xiao Yan to the Gu Clan. Xiao Yan, now a Four-Star Dou Zong, beats Ling Quan even after Ling Quan uses the Transforming Blood Skill. Xun Er leaves for the Gu Clan, and Xiao Yan promises to find her there after the Pill Gathering and rescuing his master.","events":["Ye Chong leaves Xiao Yan, Xun Er and the others to rest after the battle.","Xun Er offers the Gu Clan's help to find Xiao Zhan; Xiao Yan resolves to obtain the Three Thousand Burning Flame.","Ling Quan is ordered to bring Xun Er back to the Gu Realm.","Xun Er gives Xiao Yan the last three seals of the God Seal Technique and explains the jade of Emperor Flame and Xiao Xuan.","Xiao Yan fully refines the Demon Poison Spot.","Ling Quan arrives with a Gu Jade Token and orders to bring Xiao Clan members to the Gu Clan.","Xiao Yan defeats Ling Quan with the Sky Fire Three Mysterious Changes and the Sea Flipping Seal.","Xun Er leaves for the Gu Clan with Elder Lin and Elder Yuan."],"introduced":["Xiao Xuan","Emperor Flame","jade of Emperor Flame","Emperor Flame's mansion","Gu Realm","Elders Council","Gu Jade Token","Elder Yuan","Lightning Snake Dance","Transforming Blood Skill"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan fully refines the Demon Poison Spot and is called a Four-Star Dou Zong by Ling Quan (597s), up from Two-Star Dou Zong in EP183. Someone (taken as Elder Yuan) is called a Five-Star Dou Zong (514s).","confidence":"high"},{"ep":186,"title":"The Ye Clan's Son-in-Law","summary":"To qualify for the Pill Gathering, Xiao Yan must win a top-three place in the Pill Tower's assessment of the five major clans, so Ye Chong asks him to pose as Xin Lan's husband for the Ye Clan. Cao Dan of the Cao Clan, a seven-tier alchemist, comes to force a marriage with Xin Lan and challenges Xiao Yan to a flame duel. Cao Dan uses the Sky Sinister Demon Flame and then four flames, but Xiao Yan beats him by controlling ten kinds of flame. Ye Chong warns that Cao Ying, the Cao Clan's Pill Tower core disciple, will be Xiao Yan's biggest rival. After twenty days of seclusion, Xiao Yan's Spiritual Strength grows, and Yao Tian Huo explains the Soul Realms. In the Pill Region, the Bai Clan mocks the Ye Clan at the rank-badge test run by Han Li. Xiao Yan passes the seven-tier middle rank, the highest level offered there, and is sent to the base of the Pill Tower for a higher test.","events":["Ye Chong asks Xiao Yan to become the Ye Clan's son-in-law in name only, and Xin Lan agrees.","Cao Dan arrives to propose to Xin Lan and threatens the Ye Clan.","Xiao Yan beats Cao Dan's Sky Sinister Demon Flame in a flame duel.","Ye Chong warns of Cao Ying, a peak seven-tier alchemist at least.","Xiao Yan comes out of twenty days of seclusion with greater Spiritual Strength; Yao Tian Huo explains the Soul Realms.","The group reaches the Pill Region, and the Bai Clan taunts Ye Chong.","Han Li runs the rank-badge assessment, and Xiao Yan passes seven-tier middle rank.","Xiao Yan turns on the Bai Clan woman who mocked the Ye Clan."],"introduced":["Pill Gathering","five major clans","Elder's Seat","Cao Clan","Cao Dan","Sky Sinister Demon Flame","Sky Sinister Three-head Lion","Cao Ying","Spiritual Realm","Soul Realms (Mortal, Spiritual, Heavenly, Emperor)","Soul Skill","Pill Region","Outer Region","Inner Region","Holy Pill City","Alchemist Rank Badge","Bai Clan","Qiu Clan","Han Li"],"cultivation":"Cao Dan is a seven-tier alchemist. Cao Ying is said to be at least a peak seven-tier alchemist. Xiao Yan passes the seven-tier middle-rank alchemist assessment (he picks it at 909-915s and is called seven-tier middle rank at 1033s). His Spiritual Strength may have reached the Spiritual Realm (744s).","confidence":"high"},{"ep":187,"title":"The Copper Plate","summary":"In Holy Pill City, Xiao Yan looks for the herbs for the Bone Growing Blood Fusing Pill, which will remake Yao Lao's body: Ten Thousand Year Old Green Spiritual Vine, Blood Essence Demon Fruit and Snow Bone Ginseng. The Dan Clan's Dan Chen and Dan Xuan arrive in a carriage pulled by a Void Heavenly Horse Beast. At the Alchemist Trade Fair, a man trades his Snow Bone Ginseng for Xiao Yan's Elemental Heart Pill, and on Yao Tian Huo's advice Xiao Yan also takes an old copper plate. Chen Xian, the young master of the Profound Xuan Sect, demands the plate, and Xiao Yan threatens him off. At the Ye Residence, Xiao Yan refines the plate's rust with Heavenly Flame and gets Spirit Nourishment Powder, which strengthens the soul. While training his soul, he senses the Three Thousand Burning Flame in the Star Region of the city, and a strong Pill Tower expert drives his soul back. Pill Tower elders then speak of Yao Chen's disciple and want to meet him.","events":["People in Holy Pill City notice Xiao Yan, the Ye Clan's young seven-tier middle-rank alchemist.","The Dan Clan's Dan Chen and Dan Xuan arrive for the test and the Pill Gathering.","Xiao Yan trades an Elemental Heart Pill for a Snow Bone Ginseng and an old copper plate.","Chen Xian of the Profound Xuan Sect tries to take the plate and is threatened off.","A companion finds a Blood Essence Demon Fruit; only the Green Spiritual Vine is still missing.","Xiao Yan refines the plate's rust into Spirit Nourishment Powder.","His soul senses the Three Thousand Burning Flame in the Star Region and is driven back.","Pill Tower elders discuss the spy and Yao Chen's disciple."],"introduced":["Holy Pill City Trade Fair","Alchemist Trade Fair","Void Heavenly Horse Beast","Dan Clan","Dan Chen","Dan Xuan","Ten Thousand Year Old Green Spiritual Vine","Blood Essence Demon Fruit","Snow Bone Ginseng","Elemental Heart Pill","copper plate","Chen Xian","Profound Xuan Sect","Bone Growing Blood Fusing Pill","Ye Residence","Spirit Nourishment Powder","Soul State","Star Region"],"confidence":"high"},{"ep":188,"title":"The Five Clans' Assessment","summary":"The Ye Clan came fifth in the last assessment and will lose its place among the five major clans if that happens again. Xiao Yan represents the Ye Clan against Dan Xuan of the Dan Clan, Bai Ying of the Bai Clan, Qiu Ji of the Qiu Clan and Cao Xiu of the Cao Clan, under Elder Sheng. In the soul-testing stone test, Xiao Yan breaks the stone, and Elder Sheng judges his soul at about the 14th level, beating Cao Ying's record of nine. In the soul-controlling test, he catches 93 soul measuring orbs, beating Cao Ying's record of 89. For the last test, the Cao Clan swaps in Cao Ying herself, and the others drop out. Xiao Yan takes all three of her Soul Palms and copies the Soul Skill as he watches. Cao Ying concedes, and the Ye Clan passes the assessment in first place.","events":["Ye Chong brings Xiao Yan to the assessment ground of the five major clans.","The representatives are named: Dan Xuan, Bai Ying, Qiu Ji, Cao Xiu, with Cao Ying watching.","Elder Sheng opens the three-part assessment.","Soul testing: Xiao Yan breaks the stone and is judged at about the 14th level.","Soul controlling: Xiao Yan catches 93 orbs, a new record.","Cao Ying swaps in for the final test, and the others quit.","Xiao Yan withstands Cao Ying's three Soul Palms and learns the technique.","The Ye Clan is declared first."],"introduced":["Bai Ying","Qiu Ji","Cao Xiu","Cao Ying","Elder Sheng","soul testing stone","Soul Value","soul measuring orbs","soul steel","Soul Palm","Soul Perception","Spiritual Barrier"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan's Spiritual Strength is judged at 'more or less of 14th level' Soul Value (447s). Others: Qiu Ji 7th level, Bai Ying 8th, Cao Xiu middle of the 8th, Dan Xuan 9th; Cao Ying's record was 9th.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":189,"title":"Mu Gu and the Chairman","summary":"While Xiao Yan trains his Soul Skill, Mu Gu, an Honorable Elder of the Hall of Souls, traps him inside a Spiritual Barrier and demands the Flame Mantra and the Bone Chilling Flame. Mu Gu fights with the Sea Heart Flame and nearly takes Xiao Yan's three Heavenly Flames, until Xuan Kong Zi of the Pill Tower sends a split soul to drive him off. Under questioning, Han Feng's soul admits he gave his Sea Heart Flame to Mu Gu, a Dou Zun and eight-tier alchemist who was expelled from Yao Chen's sect and helped plot against Yao Chen. Elder Sheng takes Xiao Yan into the Pill Tower and promises to warn the Profound Xuan Sect, which likely told the Hall of Souls about him. Xuan Kong Zi, the Pill Tower's Chairman and an old friend of Yao Chen, asks to be called Uncle Xuan and gives Xiao Yan the Ten Thousand Year Old Green Spiritual Vine, the Blood Essence Demon Fruit and the Soul Palms scroll. He then asks Xiao Yan, Song Qing and Cao Ying to keep the Hall of Souls out of the Pill Gathering's top ten, because it wants the sealed Three Thousand Burning Flame.","events":["Mu Gu traps Xiao Yan in a Spiritual Barrier and demands the Flame Mantra.","Mu Gu overpowers Xiao Yan with the Sea Heart Flame.","Xuan Kong Zi's split soul drives Mu Gu away.","Han Feng's soul reveals Mu Gu's identity and his part in betraying Yao Chen.","Elder Sheng brings Xiao Yan into the Pill Tower and promises to warn the Profound Xuan Sect.","Xuan Kong Zi gives Xiao Yan the two missing herbs and the Soul Palms scroll.","Xiao Yan meets Song Qing, the First Elder's disciple and youngest Pill Tower elder.","Xuan Kong Zi warns that the Hall of Souls is after the Three Thousand Burning Flame."],"introduced":["Mu Gu","Honorable Elder","Sea Heart Flame","Xuan Kong Zi","Chairman of the Pill Tower","Six Joint Body Flowing Ruler","Song Qing","First Elder of the Pill Tower"],"cultivation":"Mu Gu is said to be a Dou Zun and an eight-tier alchemist (Han Feng, 527s). Song Qing is the youngest elder of the Pill Tower.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":190,"title":"The Soul Illusionary Realm","summary":"The Pill Gathering opens at the Pill Tower, where Xuan Kong Zi and Xuan Yi appear among the Pill Tower's three most powerful figures. Xuan Kong Zi explains the three rounds: the Soul Illusionary Realm, the Pill Realm and a final pill-refining contest. The champion becomes a candidate for the Pill Tower's leaders and wins an ancient soul cultivation scroll. In the illusion, Xiao Yan relives a happy day fishing with Xiao Zhan and Yao Lao, then loses them and hears that he deserves to die, but he breaks free, resolved to save them. In the Pill Realm he finds a Thousand-Year Rehmannia Essence and an Earth Core Jade Essence in the Myriad Herbs Mountain Range. A hidden alchemist tries to take the jade, and Xiao Yan sends his Earth Demon Puppet, now at Eight-Star Dou Zong, until the man retreats. Song Qing then forms an alliance against a nearly Rank Eight beast whose master is Xiong Zhan, and the Profound Xuan Sect finds Xiao Yan.","events":["The five major clans and the Pill Tower's three leaders arrive at the Pill Gathering.","Xuan Kong Zi explains the three rounds and the champion's rewards.","Pill Tower leaders talk about Yao Chen and want to meet Xiao Yan.","Xiao Yan passes the Soul Illusionary Realm after a vision of Xiao Zhan and Yao Lao.","In the Pill Realm he finds an Earth Core Jade Essence.","He drives off a hidden rival with the Earth Demon Puppet.","Xiong Zhan's beasts capture alchemists, and Song Qing proposes an alliance.","Profound Xuan Sect members confront Xiao Yan."],"introduced":["Xuan Yi","Soul Illusionary Realm","Pill Realm","space stone","Myriad Herbs Mountain Range","Thousand-Year Rehmannia Essence","Earth Core Jade Essence","Earth Core Soul Essence","Supreme Cauldron","Xiong Zhan"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan's Earth Demon Puppet is now an Eight-Star Dou Zong puppet (843s); EP162 called it Five-Star. The hidden rival is called 'a mere Two-Star Dou Zong' (827s). The beast in the mountains is nearly Rank Eight, 'equivalent to a strong Dou Zun'.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":191,"title":"The Hidden Dou Zun","summary":"In the Pill Realm, Chen Xian and two Profound Xuan Sect Dou Zongs attack Xiao Yan. He holds them off with his Earth Demon Puppet and the Green Lotus Change, then breaks Chen Xian's meridians with the Mysterious Fire Blades. Cao Ying invites Xiao Yan to join her group, but he chooses to work alone. Zi Yan is now the boss of Xiong Zhan and his beasts, and she complains that their herbs are inedible. Xiao Yan puts the Mystic Water Tiger Dragon to sleep with Water Cloud Fruit syrup and takes the Spiritual Pill Starch. A man hiding among the alchemists reveals himself as a Hall of Souls Dou Zun and traps Cao Ying, Song Qing and other Pill Tower geniuses in a Spiritual Barrier. Xiao Yan comes to help and holds the Dou Zun off with the Luminous Jadeite Change, the Flame Splitting Tsunami and his seals, giving Cao Ying time to break the barrier, and everyone flees as the Dou Zun gives chase.","events":["Chen Xian orders his men to kill Xiao Yan.","Xiao Yan cripples Chen Xian, and the Profound Xuan Sect vows revenge.","Xiao Yan turns down Cao Ying's offer of an alliance.","Zi Yan bosses Xiong Zhan's beasts around and mentions Dragon Island.","Xiao Yan drugs the Mystic Water Tiger Dragon and takes the Spiritual Pill Starch.","A hidden Hall of Souls Dou Zun traps the Pill Tower geniuses in a Spiritual Barrier.","Xiao Yan stalls the Dou Zun while Cao Ying breaks the barrier.","The alchemists flee, chased by the Dou Zun."],"introduced":["Green Lotus Change","Mysterious Fire Blades","Dragon Island","Spiritual Pill Starch","Mystic Water Tiger Dragon","Water Cloud Fruit","Luminous Jadeite Change"],"cultivation":"Chen Xian's two guards are called strong Dou Zongs (116s). The hidden enemy is called 'a strong Dou Zun' (889s).","confidence":"high"},{"ep":192,"title":"Zi Yan and the Dragon Bear","summary":"The hidden Dou Zun chases the alchemists through the Pill Realm, and they split up. He corners Xiao Yan near the beasts' territory, and Xiao Yan recognises him as Mu Gu, who calls himself Xiao Yan's martial uncle. Xiao Yan uses all three changes of the Sky Fire Three Mysterious Changes and the Sea Flipping Seal, but Mu Gu is still too strong. Xiong Zhan, an Ancient Dragon Bear and a Dou Zun, steps in on Zi Yan's orders, and Mu Gu withdraws to save his strength. Zi Yan says she has been waiting in the Pill Realm for Xiao Yan, and Xiao Yan tells her about the Heaven Demon Phoenix Wings he refined. Xiong Zhan opens his hoard of herbs, and Xiao Yan takes what the mission needs and the Heavenly Hemp Jade Stone Essence. In seclusion he refines the Earth Core Soul Essence and becomes an eight-tier alchemist, tests the Soul Palms on Xiong Zhan, and leaves the Pill Realm just before it closes.","events":["The alchemists run toward the beasts' territory and split up.","Mu Gu corners Xiao Yan and reveals himself.","Xiao Yan fights Mu Gu with all three changes of the Sky Fire Three Mysterious Changes.","Zi Yan's Xiong Zhan fights Mu Gu, who withdraws.","Zi Yan explains she was waiting for Xiao Yan.","Xiong Zhan gives Xiao Yan herbs from his hoard.","Xiao Yan refines the Earth Core Soul Essence and becomes an eight-tier alchemist.","Xiao Yan tests the Soul Palms and leaves the Pill Realm in time."],"introduced":["Spectral Demonic Flame Arm","Ancient Dragon Bear","Supreme Magical Bear","Heaven Demon Phoenix Wings","Rising Dragon Flower Core","Scarlet Flame Fruit","Sulfur Flame Spirit Saliva","Heavenly Hemp Jade Stone Essence","Soul Attack"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan becomes an eight-tier alchemist by refining the Earth Core Soul Essence (1005s). Xiong Zhan is a Dou Zun ('he became a Dou Zun several years ago', 467-470s).","confidence":"high"},{"ep":193,"title":"The Pill Refinement Challenge","summary":"Song Qing apologises to Cao Ying for leaving her in the Myriad Herbs Mountain Range, and the finalists take the stage for the Pill Refinement Challenge. Xiao Yan refines the Bone Growing Blood Fusing Pill, which he wants to push to the eighth tier to restore Yao Lao's body. Cao Ying uses the man-made Blood Demon Flame, and Mu Gu reveals the Sea Heart Flame, ranked 15th on the Heavenly Flames Ranking. After half a month, the pills start to form: Song Qing makes a peak seventh-tier pill, and Dan Chen makes an Eighth-Tier Pill with a two-colored thundercloud. Cao Ying and Xiao Yan both raise three-colored thunderclouds, and Mu Gu raises a four-colored one. The Pill Tower elders do not dare stop Mu Gu, because that could start a war with the Hall of Souls. Xiao Yan remembers how Yao Lao taught him the Spiritual Enhancement Technique for improving a pill that is already formed.","events":["Song Qing apologises to Cao Ying.","Onlookers name Dan Chen, Cao Ying and Xiao Yan as favourites.","Mu Gu greets Xiao Yan at the final stage.","Cao Ying uses the Blood Demon Flame, and Mu Gu the Sea Heart Flame.","Song Qing, Dan Chen and Cao Ying finish their pills over half a month.","Xiao Yan and Mu Gu make Eighth-Tier Pills; Mu Gu's thundercloud has four colors.","Xiao Yan remembers Yao Lao's Spiritual Enhancement Technique."],"introduced":["Pill Refinement Challenge","Blood Demon Flame","Heavenly Flames Ranking","Pill Lightning","lightning conductor","thundercloud colors","Spiritual Enhancement Technique"],"cultivation":"Pill grades: Song Qing a peak seventh-tier pill; Dan Chen an Eighth-Tier Pill (two-colored thundercloud); Cao Ying and Xiao Yan three-colored thunderclouds; Mu Gu a four-colored thundercloud. Dan Chen is said to have once reached the Soul State. The Bone Growing Blood Fusing Pill is a peak seventh-tier pill that works best raised to the eighth tier.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":194,"title":"Champion of the Pill Gathering","summary":"Xiao Yan brings out the Bone Chilling Flame, and the Pill Tower elders are amazed that he holds three Heavenly Flames. He uses Spirit Nourishment Powder and Yao Lao's Spiritual Enhancement Technique, and his three-colored thundercloud grows to four colors, then five. The fused Pill Lightning breaks the lightning conductor, so Xiao Yan sends out his Earth Demon Puppet, which absorbs the lightning. Xuan Kong Zi declares Xiao Yan the champion and gives him the Taiyi Soul Technique, and the top ten will enter the Star Region in two days to try to subdue the Three Thousand Burning Flame. Xuan Kong Zi introduces Chairwoman Xuan Yi and Chairman Tian Lei Zi, who ask the finalists to stop Mu Gu from breaking the seal. Zi Yan tells Xiao Yan that her clan raised the Three Thousand Burning Flame and left a dragon seal in it. She plants a dragon seal in him with Ancient Dragon Blood and warns that if he fails, the seal could control him.","events":["Xiao Yan brings out the Bone Chilling Flame.","He uses the Spiritual Enhancement Technique, and his thundercloud reaches five colors.","The Pill Lightning breaks the lightning conductor, and the Earth Demon Puppet absorbs it.","Xiao Yan is declared champion and receives the Taiyi Soul Technique.","Xuan Kong Zi introduces Xuan Yi and Tian Lei Zi and explains the Star Region plan.","Zi Yan explains her clan's link to the Three Thousand Burning Flame.","Zi Yan plants a dragon seal in Xiao Yan with Ancient Dragon Blood."],"introduced":["Blood Offering, Spiritual Return","five-colored thundercloud","Taiyi Soul Technique","Undying Heavenly Flame","Tian Lei Zi","dragon seal","Ancient Dragon Blood"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan's Eighth-Tier Pill raises a five-colored thundercloud. 528s 'Have I advanced?' is said after the puppet absorbs the lightning; whose advance is not clear.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":195,"title":"The Three Thousand Burning Flame Awakens","summary":"Qiu Ling, the Pill Tower's First Elder, leads the top ten into the Star Region while Xuan Kong Zi, Xuan Yi and Tian Lei Zi hold the seal. Xiao Yan goes first and finds that the Three Thousand Burning Flame has intelligence and a dragon's form. It says it was raised by a master from the Void Ancient Dragons who promised to take it home to Dragon Island and then abandoned it. Xiao Yan offers to take it there for an answer, but it no longer trusts humans and throws him out. The next candidates also fail, and then Mu Gu blows open the seal. Hall of Souls attacks throw Holy Pill City into chaos, so the Pill Tower's strong men cannot come. Qiu Ling, Xiao Yan and the others fight Mu Gu, but the awakened flame breaks free and vows revenge on the Pill Tower.","events":["Qiu Ling is named leader of the Star Region party.","The three chairpersons open the Star Region.","Xiao Yan tries first and speaks with the Three Thousand Burning Flame.","The flame remembers its Void Ancient Dragon master and refuses Xiao Yan.","Other candidates fail, then Mu Gu blows the seal.","The Hall of Souls attacks Holy Pill City and cuts off help.","Qiu Ling, Xiao Yan and the elders fight Mu Gu as the flame breaks out."],"introduced":["Qiu Ling","Void Ancient Dragons"],"confidence":"high"},{"ep":196,"title":"Soul Battle with the Flame","summary":"The Three Thousand Burning Flame breaks the seal, and Xuan Yi calls for help from outside the city. Mu Gu had promised it freedom in exchange for joining the Hall of Souls, but the flame now refuses. Mu Gu summons three more Honorable Elders with a Spatial Jade Plate, and the four Dou Zun trap it with the Ten Thousand Ghost Devouring Spiritual Formation and their Life Soul Locks, then try to seize its newly formed essence flame. Xiao Yan asks Qiu Ling to hold off Mu Gu, and he grabs the flame himself and activates the dragon seal. The flame pulls him into its Spiritual Space, and they fight a soul battle. Xuan Kong Zi arrives and drives the Hall of Souls out. The chairpersons send everyone else out of the Star Region and try to stabilise it, as Xiao Yan cannot be pulled out safely during the soul battle.","events":["The seal fails, and Xuan Yi calls for help.","The flame breaks its deal with Mu Gu.","Mu Gu summons three Honorable Elders with a Spatial Jade Plate.","The four Dou Zun trap the flame with formations and Life Soul Locks.","The flame releases its essence flame and fights back.","Xiao Yan activates the dragon seal and starts a soul battle with the flame.","Xuan Kong Zi arrives and the Hall of Souls retreats.","The chairpersons stabilise the Star Region while Xiao Yan stays inside."],"introduced":["Spatial Jade Plate","Ten Thousand Ghost Devouring Spiritual Formation","Ten Thousand Soul Heavenly Lock","Life Soul Lock","essence flame","Spiritual Space","soul battle"],"cultivation":"The four Hall of Souls Honorable Elders are called 'the four Dou Zun' (206s).","confidence":"high"},{"ep":197,"title":"The Three Thousand Lotus Heart Flame","summary":"The chairpersons restore the seal, and Little Fairy Doctor and Xiao Yan's friends rush to the Pill Tower demanding to know where he is. Xuan Kong Zi stops her from forcing her way into the Star Region, which could doom Holy Pill City. Someone senses that Xiao Yan's dragon seal is shining gold, which means he is winning. Inside, Xiao Yan finds that the flame's core is feeding him power through the dragon seal, so every wound heals at once. He fights back with the Sky Demon Puppet and makes the flame submit, promising to take it to Dragon Island and find its old master. He refines it, rises from Four-Star to Nine-Star Dou Zong, and fuses it with his other Heavenly Flames into the Three Thousand Lotus Heart Flame. As the Star Region collapses and Holy Pill City shakes, Little Fairy Doctor and others prepare to go in through a spatial tunnel opened by Zi Yan.","events":["The seal is restored, and Little Fairy Doctor demands to go in after Xiao Yan.","Xuan Kong Zi says forcing the Star Region open would doom the city.","Xiao Yan's dragon seal shows he is still safe.","In the Star Region, the dragon seal turns the flame's attacks into healing for Xiao Yan.","Xiao Yan makes the Three Thousand Burning Flame submit.","He refines it and rises to Nine-Star Dou Zong.","He fuses his flames into the Three Thousand Lotus Heart Flame.","The Star Region begins to collapse, and a rescue through a spatial tunnel begins."],"introduced":["Three Thousand Lotus Heart Flame","spatial tunnel"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan rises through Four-Star to Eight-Star cards and states 'I've become a Nine-Star Dou Zong' (759-772s). The Three Thousand Burning Flame is 'the No. 9 flame on the ranking' (723s).","confidence":"high"},{"ep":198,"title":"Devil Yi of the Profound Sky Sect","summary":"Xiao Yan breaks out of the collapsing Star Region and returns to his friends and the Pill Tower's chairpersons, keeping the Three Thousand Burning Flame. Xuan Kong Zi tells him the Hall of Souls has moved Yao Lao out of Ming City. Chen Tian Nan, chief of the Profound Xuan Sect, blames Xiao Yan for his son Chen Xian's death in the Pill Realm. Yi Chen of the Profound Sky Sect, which is allied with the Hall of Souls, offers to help him take revenge. Xiao Yan gives Yao Tian Huo a Green Fungus Pill to recover his strength, and a letter from the Jia Ma Empire tells him the Yan Alliance is thriving under Medusa. Chen Tian Nan and Yi Chen come to the Ye Residence, and Yi Chen challenges Xiao Yan to a duel. Xiao Yan beats him with the God Seal Technique, and Xuan Yi stops Chen Tian Nan's sneak attack, then tells Xiao Yan that they have found where Yao Lao is held.","events":["Xiao Yan comes out of the Star Region with the flame.","Xuan Kong Zi reports that Yao Lao was moved out of Ming City.","Chen Tian Nan and Yi Chen plan revenge for Chen Xian.","Xiao Yan trains with Yao Tian Huo and gives him a Green Fungus Pill.","A letter from the Jia Ma Empire reports on the Yan Alliance; Xiao Yan sends two letters back.","Yi Chen challenges Xiao Yan at the Ye Residence.","Xiao Yan defeats Yi Chen, and Xuan Yi stops Chen Tian Nan.","Xuan Yi says Yao Lao has been found."],"introduced":["Chen Tian Nan","Yi Chen","Profound Sky Sect","Overturning Land Seal","Green Fungus Pill","Blood Explosion","Seven Killing Spear","Profound Sky Devil's Hand"],"cultivation":"Yao Tian Huo has stabilised at the peak of One-Star Dou Zun within a year; the Green Fungus Pill can bring him to Three-Star Dou Zun. Little Fairy Doctor is 'now at the peak of Three-Star Dou Zun'. The letter says Mr. Hai (Hai Bodong) has advanced to Dou Zong.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":199,"title":"Into the Death Soul Mountain Range","summary":"The Pill Tower has found a Hall of Souls branch in the Death Soul Mountain Range in the northwest of the Central Plains, where Yao Lao is likely held. At least five Dou Zuns guard it, and the Pill Tower cannot join in openly without starting a war. Xiao Yan sends for Elder Feng and trains for days to master the fourth seal of the God Seal Technique, the Sky Burying Seal. Ten days later Elder Feng, called Feng Zun Zhe, arrives at the Pill Tower with Tie Jian Zun Zhe, who owes Yao Lao a debt. Elder Feng is surprised that Xiao Yan is already a Nine-Star Dou Zong. With Zi Yan, Little Fairy Doctor, Yao Tian Huo and a Dou Zun-level puppet, Xiao Yan has five Dou Zun-level fighters. In the misty mountains a swarm of Stone Swallowing Demon Ants surrounds them, but Zi Yan tames their Ant Queen and has it lead them toward the Hall of Souls.","events":["Xuan Kong Zi reveals the branch in the Death Soul Mountain Range and its five Dou Zuns.","Xiao Yan sends for Elder Feng.","Xiao Yan trains on the Sky Burying Seal for days.","Elder Feng arrives with Tie Jian Zun Zhe.","Xiao Yan introduces Zi Yan, Little Fairy Doctor and Tian Huo Zun Zhe and shows his puppet.","The group enters the Death Soul Mountain Range on foot.","Stone Swallowing Demon Ants surround them, and Zi Yan tames the Ant Queen.","The Ant Queen leads them toward the Hall of Souls branch."],"introduced":["Death Soul Mountain Range","Tianzun","Tie Jian","Demon Sword Sect","Stone Swallowing Demon Ants","Stone Swallowing Ant Queen"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan is a Nine-Star Dou Zong (500s, 516-518s). Tianzuns, the Hall of Souls' highest elders, are at least Five-Star Dou Zuns. Xiao Yan's puppet is Dou Zun-level (634s).","confidence":"high"},{"ep":200,"title":"Into the Soul-locking Hall","summary":"Zi Yan's Stone Swallowing Demon Ants clear away the Hall of Souls' spies, and the group reaches the Hall of Souls branch in the Death Soul Mountain Range. Elder Feng senses five Dou Zuns inside, so he, Tie Jian, Little Fairy Doctor and Yao Tian Huo hold them off with the Sky Demon Puppet while Xiao Yan goes after Yao Lao. Mu Gu, the Hall of Souls elder who once captured Yao Lao, is among the guards. Xiao Yan breaks through four Dou Zong Protectors and forces a guard to tell him that Yao Lao's soul is in the deepest part of the Soul-locking Hall. There he smashes the prison and frees Yao Lao, and the two are reunited after years apart. As they try to leave, a sixth Dou Zun, Zhai Xing, steps out to stop them.","events":["Zi Yan's Demon Ants remove the Hall of Souls' spies around the branch.","Elder Feng senses five Dou Zuns and many Dou Zongs inside.","The Dou Zuns of Xiao Yan's group and the Sky Demon Puppet hold off the Hall of Souls Dou Zuns, including Mu Gu.","Xiao Yan defeats four Dou Zong Protectors and learns where Yao Lao's soul is held.","He fights through the Soul-locking Hall with Octane Blast.","He breaks the soul prison and frees Yao Lao.","Mu Gu warns that there are more than five Dou Zuns here.","Zhai Xing appears in front of Xiao Yan and Yao Lao."],"introduced":["Soul-locking Hall","Zhai Xing"],"cultivation":"No breakthroughs. The four Protectors who block Xiao Yan are called Dou Zong Protectors.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":201,"title":"Zhai Xing and the fall of the branch","summary":"Zhai Xing, a Tianzun of the Hall of Souls, has been guarding Yao Lao in secret. He wants the Xiao Clan's key and lets slip that the Hall of Souls is holding Xiao Yan's father. Xiao Yan puts Yao Lao into his ring and tricks Zhai Xing with a clone, then needs time to fuse four Heavenly Flames into the Extermination Fire Lotus. Zi Yan holds Zhai Xing off with her Spatial Strength and the Void Fist, and Xiong Zhan arrives to help her. Xiao Yan hits Zhai Xing with the fire lotus, which wrecks the branch and leaves Xiao Yan near death. Black Tianzun and White Tianzun arrive, and Zi Yan works to open a Space Gate for the escape. Tie Jian blows himself up to hold back the Hall of Souls while the others get away.","events":["Zhai Xing names himself and demands the Xiao Clan's key.","Xiao Yan learns the Hall of Souls holds his father, and takes Yao Lao into his ring.","Xiao Yan fools Zhai Xing with a clone and the Flame Splitting Tsunami.","Zi Yan stalls Zhai Xing with Spatial Strength while Xiao Yan fuses four Heavenly Flames.","Xiong Zhan arrives and joins the fight.","Xiao Yan's fire lotus hits Zhai Xing and destroys the branch.","Black Tianzun and White Tianzun arrive and scold Zhai Xing.","Tie Jian sacrifices himself so the group can escape through Zi Yan's Space Gate."],"introduced":["Tianzun (rank title) as a guard here","Xiao Clan's key","Zhai Xing Palm","Spatial Barrier","Space Lock","Void Fist","Nine Serene Soul Palm","Black Tianzun","White Tianzun","Spatial Jade Plate","Space Gate"],"cultivation":"Zhai Xing calls Xiao Yan a Nine-Star Dou Zong. Zhai Xing is a Tianzun (EP199: Tianzuns are at least Five-Star Dou Zuns). Xiong Zhan is called another Dou Zun.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":202,"title":"A year in the stone tower","summary":"Xiao Yan's meridians are shattered and most of his bones are broken after the clash with Zhai Xing. Yao Lao finds that the Three Thousand Burning Flame keeps him alive, and that the Yin-Yang Mysterious Dragon Pill in his body can rebuild him. The group takes him to the Falling Star Pavilion, hidden by the Great Falling Star Formation, where the meteorite's star power feeds the flame. Yao Lao turns out to be the Pavilion's Chief, and Elder Feng is his deputy. A year later Xiao Yan wakes in the stone tower as a Dou Zun. Yao Lao explains that the Hall of Souls drained his essence spiritual Qi, which only the Soul Baby Fruit can restore. The fruit is in ancient ruins in the Beast Region, and the Hall of Souls is heading there too.","events":["Yao Lao examines Xiao Yan's wounds and sees the Three Thousand Burning Flame keeping him alive.","The group travels to the Falling Star Pavilion.","Yao Lao is greeted as the Chief of the Falling Star Pavilion.","Xiao Yan heals in the stone tower using star power from the meteorite.","After a year, news comes of the Soul Baby Fruit in ruins in the Beast Region.","Far away, a young lady still searching for Xiao Yan worries about him.","Xiao Yan wakes up as a Dou Zun and is reunited with Yao Lao.","The Hall of Souls also sets out for the ancient ruins."],"introduced":["Great Falling Star Formation","Falling Star Pavilion headquarters (built on a meteorite)","Four Pavilions","Undying Fire (name for the Three Thousand Burning Flame)","Yin-Yang Mysterious Dragon Pill","essence spiritual Qi","Soul Baby Fruit","Beast Region"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan breaks through to Dou Zun after a year of healing in the stone tower ('It's a Dou Zun!'). Zhai Xing is called a Five-Star Dou Zun.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":203,"title":"Young Pavilion Chief","summary":"Xiao Yan, now the Young Pavilion Chief of the Falling Star Pavilion, sets out for the ancient ruins in the Skeleton Mountain Range of the Beast Region. Mu Qing Luan of the Green Mythical Bird Tribe joins him, and on the way she explains the three great beast clans: the Nine Serene Deep Ground Pythons, the Heaven Demon Phoenix Tribe and the Void Ancient Dragons. At the ruins they find Falling Star Pavilion men driven from their camp by Lei Zun Zhe of the Wind Lightning Pavilion. Xiao Yan beats Fei Tian, and Lei Zun Zhe and his beast-clan allies back down when four Dou Zuns stand behind Xiao Yan. Elder Hu tells him the ruins hold traps and corpse puppets, and that strong Nine Serene Deep Ground Pythons have been going missing. That night a mysterious woman in green attacks Zi Yan and escapes.","events":["Xiao Yan leaves for the ruins with a map, and Mu Qing Luan joins him.","Mu Qing Luan describes the Beast Region and its three great clans.","Zi Yan says the Void Ancient Dragons do have sub-clans, and argues with Mu Qing Luan.","Xiao Yan saves Falling Star Pavilion men from Wind Lightning Pavilion attackers.","Xiao Yan beats Fei Tian in the Wind Lightning Pavilion camp.","Lei Zun Zhe, the Silver Moon Wolf Clan Leader and the Earth Tiger Clan Leader retreat.","Elder Hu explains the ruins' spatial seal, traps and puppets.","A woman in green attacks Zi Yan and gets away."],"introduced":["Young Pavilion Chief (Xiao Yan's title)","Skeleton Mountain Range","Nine Serene Deep Ground Pythons","Heaven Demon Phoenix Tribe","Void Ancient Dragons","Green Mythical Bird Tribe","Tian Class Dou Skill (said to be in the ruins)","Elder Hu","Silver Moon Wolf Clan Leader","Earth Tiger Clan Leader","ancient corpse puppets","spatial seal of the ruins"],"cultivation":"Lei Zun Zhe calls Xiao Yan 'a newly advanced Dou Zun'. Xiao Yan's side shows four Dou Zuns.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":204,"title":"The Dou Sheng ruins open","summary":"As the seal on the ruins weakens, Xiao Yan takes a small group in and leaves Elder Hu to guard the camp. Outside the entrance he meets Huang Xuan and Feng Qing Er of the Heaven Demon Phoenix Tribe, who want him for hiding their clan's Essence Blood. Tang Zhen of the Burning Flame Valley and Tang Huo Er arrive, and Tang Zhen says he will fight anyone who touches Xiao Yan, so the phoenixes back off. Inside, puppets as strong as peak Dou Zongs test the intruders, and Xiao Yan subdues several of them. His group escapes a looping fire path by diving into the magma below, which is the real way in. Zi Yan sniffs out the Soul Baby Demon Tree, guarded by a Heaven Piercing Flood Dragon. Xiao Yan takes the Soul Baby Fruit and gives the dragon a Shape-Shifting Flower in return.","events":["The seal on the ruins is about to open; Elder Hu stays at the camp.","Huang Xuan and Feng Qing Er of the Heaven Demon Phoenix Tribe threaten Xiao Yan.","Tang Zhen and Tang Huo Er of the Burning Flame Valley back Xiao Yan.","The crowd rushes in; a Space Lock and Dou Zong-level puppets block the way.","Xiao Yan subdues several puppets while an elder holds them.","The group finds the real passage under the magma of the fire path.","Zi Yan leads them to the Soul Baby Demon Tree and its Heaven Piercing Flood Dragon guard.","Xiao Yan takes the Soul Baby Fruit, pays the dragon with a Shape-Shifting Flower, and Zi Yan feels something calling her."],"introduced":["Huang Xuan","Ice River Valley","Dou Sheng ruins","Heaven Demon Puppet","Soul Baby Demon Tree","Heaven Piercing Flood Dragon","Shape-Shifting Flower","Myriad Herbs Mountain Range (mentioned)"],"cultivation":"Feng Qing Er calls Xiao Yan 'a mere two-star Dou Zun'. The ruins' puppets are each as strong as a peak Dou Zong; the puppet leader, after evolving, is at least a two-star Dou Zun.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":205,"title":"The Dragon-Phoenix Origin Fruit","summary":"Zi Yan follows the call to a Beast Spiritual Barrier in the centre of the ancient forest and breaks into it. Inside lie the remains of a Void Ancient Dragon and an Ancient Phoenix that died fighting, and a Dragon-Phoenix Origin Fruit. Huang Xuan and Feng Qing Er of the Heaven Demon Phoenix Tribe arrive to take it, and Xiong Zhan, an Ancient Dragon Bear, fights them alongside Xiao Yan's group. Feng Qing Er awakens the Ancient Phoenix's ancestral spirit, but Zi Yan awakens the Void Ancient Dragon's and crushes it. The phoenixes retreat to wait outside the barrier, and Zi Yan keeps the fruit for Dragon Island. Searching for the Tian Class Dou Skill, the group finds a ruined Pill Hall and a Pill Beast, a near Ninth-Tier pill that has come alive. Xiao Yan lures it with Sixth-Tier pills and catches it.","events":["Zi Yan finds a Beast Spiritual Barrier and breaks in.","Inside are the remains of a Void Ancient Dragon and an Ancient Phoenix, and a Dragon-Phoenix Origin Fruit.","Huang Xuan and Feng Qing Er come for the fruit and fight Xiao Yan's group.","Xiong Zhan, an Ancient Dragon Bear, takes on the phoenixes.","Feng Qing Er and Zi Yan each awaken an ancestral spirit; Zi Yan's wins.","The phoenixes retreat; Zi Yan keeps the fruit.","The group finds a Pill Hall in a poisonous mist.","Xiao Yan catches a Pill Beast by feeding it pills."],"introduced":["Beast Spiritual Barrier","Ancient Phoenix","Dragon-Phoenix Origin Fruit","Dragon-Phoenix Bloodline","Dragon Island","Ancient Dragon Bear","ancestral spirit","Pill Hall (in the ruins)","Pill Beast","Ninth-Tier Pill"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan calls himself an Eighth-Tier alchemist. No realm changes.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":206,"title":"Qing Lin returns","summary":"The woman in green comes back for the Pill Beast with two controlled Nine Serene Deep Ground Python Dou Zuns. Xiao Yan chases her, and she tries Demon Eye Body Control and then the Triple Jade-Green Snake Flower Pupils on him. He recognises her as Qing Lin, the snake girl he once helped in the Tager Desert, and she remembers him when he shows her his ruler. The Sky Serpent Mansion had raised her as its next leader, but she fled when they wanted her to marry. In the Beast Region she was struck with the Emperor Python Heart Eroding Poison and hunted by the Nine Serene Deep Ground Pythons. Little Fairy Doctor says the poison can be cured, and Qing Lin joins the group. In the main hall, Tang Zhen, Zhai Xing and Chen Tian Nan arrive as ten scrolls wait to unseal, and the scramble for the Tian Class Dou Skill begins.","events":["The woman in green attacks again to take the Pill Beast.","Her controlled Nine Serene Deep Ground Pythons include two Dou Zuns.","Xiao Yan resists her Demon Eye Body Control and her pupil technique.","He recognises Qing Lin, and she remembers him.","Qing Lin tells of the Sky Serpent Mansion and the Emperor Python Heart Eroding Poison.","Little Fairy Doctor agrees to cure her, and she joins the group.","At the main hall, Tang Zhen and Tang Huo Er wait as ten scrolls unseal.","Zhai Xing of the Hall of Souls arrives; Chen Tian Nan attacks Xiao Yan over his son."],"introduced":["Demon Eye Body Control","Six Joint Fire","Sky Serpent Mansion","Emperor Python Heart Eroding Poison","Main hall with ten scrolls"],"cultivation":"No realm changes. Two of Qing Lin's controlled Nine Serene Deep Ground Pythons are Dou Zuns.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":207,"title":"The Dou Sheng skeleton wakes","summary":"Chen Tian Nan of the Profound Xuan Sect attacks Xiao Yan to avenge his son, but Xiao Yan grabs a scroll and then kills him in a fight alone. The scrolls turn out to hold ordinary Dou Skills, not the Tian Class Dou Skill. Zhai Xing gets blood on the Dou Sheng skeleton in the hall, and the remnant spiritual imprint inside wakes it. Its sonic waves kill many, and it drinks the blood mist and grows stronger. Zhai Xing gets the Burning Flame Valley, the Ice River Valley and the Falling Star Pavilion to fight it with him, and Xiao Yan agrees to go first. Xiao Yan notices characters on the skeleton and realises it is the real treasure. The skeleton rises again and unleashes the Great Heavenly Creation Palm.","events":["Chen Tian Nan attacks Xiao Yan; Yao Tian Huo and the puppet stall him.","Xiao Yan takes a scroll, then kills Chen Tian Nan.","Qing Lin reports three scrolls left; Xiao Yan sees the scrolls are not the Tian Class Dou Skill.","Zhai Xing's blood wakes the Dou Sheng skeleton, whose sonic wave kills many.","The factions blame Zhai Xing but agree to join forces.","Xiao Yan leads the attack and sees characters written on the bones.","The skeleton revives and uses the Great Heavenly Creation Palm.","Xiao Yan answers with the Flame Splitting Tsunami."],"introduced":["Dou Sheng skeleton","remnant spiritual imprint","Great Heavenly Creation Palm","Three Thousand Lightning Illusionary Body"],"cultivation":"Chen Tian Nan calls Xiao Yan 'a One-Star Dou Zun'.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":208,"title":"Four Seals As One","summary":"The Great Heavenly Creation Palm kills many, and the factions then fight over the shattered Dou Sheng skeleton. Xiao Yan grabs four fragments that hold the Dou Sheng's essence. Zhai Xing makes a deal: the Wind Lightning Pavilion gets Xiao Yan, the Ice River Valley gets Little Fairy Doctor's Woeful Poison Body, and he gets the bone shards. Tang Zhen sides with Xiao Yan and takes on Huang Xuan. Xiao Yan fights Zhai Xing with the Four Seals As One and a Four-Colored Fire Lotus. Huang Xuan's reinforcements arrive and threaten to strip Xiao Yan's Bone Wings, so Zi Yan lures them away with the Dragon-Phoenix Origin Fruit. When they close in on her, Hei Qing of the Void Ancient Dragons appears.","events":["The factions fight over the Dou Sheng skeleton.","The skeleton shatters; Xiao Yan takes four fragments holding Dou Sheng essence.","Zhai Xing agrees a deal with the Wind Lightning Pavilion and Ice River Valley.","Tang Zhen sides with Xiao Yan against Huang Xuan.","Xiao Yan fights Zhai Xing with the Four Seals As One and a Fire Lotus.","Heaven Demon Phoenix reinforcements accuse Xiao Yan of hiding their Essence Blood and taking their Bone Wings.","Zi Yan draws them off with the Dragon-Phoenix Origin Fruit.","Hei Qing of the Void Ancient Dragons appears."],"introduced":["Dou Sheng essence","Woeful Poison Body (named)","She Ya","Huo Yan","Soul Chain","Phantom Soul Movement Technique","Four Seals As One","Sky Burying Seal (fourth seal used)","All of Nature Palm","Demon Phoenix Bell","Demon Phoenix Essence Blood","Hei Qing"],"cultivation":"Zhai Xing thinks Xiao Yan 'has just become a Dou Zun'. No breakthroughs.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":209,"title":"Zi Yan goes home","summary":"Hei Qing, an elder of the Void Ancient Dragons, crushes Huang Xuan's group and slaps away Zhai Xing. The phoenixes leave without the Dragon-Phoenix Origin Fruit, and Feng Qing Er later tells the Nine Serene Deep Ground Pythons that their missing Dou Zuns' captor is with Xiao Yan. Back at the camp Zi Yan introduces her uncle Hei Qing, who calls the Xiao Clan one of the Eight Ancient Clans and mentions Xiao Xuan. Zi Yan goes back to Dragon Island to finish her inheritance, and Xiong Zhan goes with her. At the Falling Star Pavilion the Soul Baby Fruit proves to be high-grade. Yao Lao tells Xiao Yan that his father is not in the Central Plains, and that the Hun Clan is likely behind the Hall of Souls. Then Qing Lin's poison flares, and Xiao Yan starts to purge it with the Pill Beast's blood.","events":["Hei Qing beats Huang Xuan's group and strikes Zhai Xing.","Huang Xuan leaves, and Feng Qing Er fetches the Heaven Phoenix's remains.","Feng Qing Er tells the Nine Serene Deep Ground Pythons about Xiao Yan's group.","Zi Yan introduces her uncle Hei Qing, and Tang Zhen leaves for the Burning Flame Valley.","Hei Qing mentions the Eight Ancient Clans and Xiao Xuan.","Zi Yan and Xiong Zhan leave for Dragon Island.","Xiao Yan brings the Soul Baby Fruit to Yao Lao.","Yao Lao names the Hun Clan; Xiao Yan treats Qing Lin's poison."],"introduced":["Heaven Phoenix's remains","Pavilion Chief Lei","Northern Pavilion Chief (Wind Lightning Pavilion)","Eight Ancient Clans","Xiao Xuan","Spirit Nourishment Pill","high-grade Soul Baby Fruit","Hun Clan"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan thinks Hei Qing is at the Seven- to Eight-Star Dou Zun level. Feng Qing Er is said to be still below the Dou Zun level.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":210,"title":"The Creation Saint's palm","summary":"While Xiao Yan purges Qing Lin's poison, a nine-headed Ancient Sky Serpent soul bursts out of her and attacks him. It also clears the last of the poison, and Qing Lin explains that she summoned it from an ancient skeleton with her pupil technique. Elder Feng watches over Yao Lao as he absorbs the Soul Baby Fruit. Xiao Yan studies the Dou Sheng bone fragments and enters a memory space, where the Creation Saint teaches him the three strikes of the Great Heavenly Creation Palm. Xiao Yan then brings out the Heaven Demon Phoenix Essence Blood, an Eighth-Tier Bone Growing Blood Fusing Pill and a Dou Sheng arm, and Elder Feng adds the skeleton of a Four-Star Dou Zun. In the Stone Tower, Xiao Yan refines a new body for Yao Lao, who relives his past as they fuse it. Meanwhile the Ninth Tianzun orders the Hall of Souls to destroy the Falling Star Pavilion.","events":["A nine-headed serpent soul comes out of Qing Lin and attacks Xiao Yan.","Qing Lin's poison is gone; she explains the Ancient Sky Serpent.","Yao Lao absorbs the Soul Baby Fruit under Elder Feng's guard.","Xiao Yan learns the Great Heavenly Creation Palm from the Creation Saint's memory.","Xiao Yan and Elder Feng gather the materials for Yao Lao's body.","In the Stone Tower, Xiao Yan refines the body while Yao Lao relives his memories.","Yao Lao begins the final fusing himself.","The Ninth Tianzun orders an attack on the Falling Star Pavilion."],"introduced":["Ancient Sky Serpent","Memory Space","Creation Saint","First, Second and Third Strike of the Great Heavenly Creation Palm","Heaven Demon Phoenix Essence Blood","Bone Growing Blood Fusing Pill","Dou Sheng arm","Medicine Realm","Ninth Tianzun"],"cultivation":"No breakthroughs. The body Elder Feng provides is the skeleton of a Four-Star Dou Zun.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":211,"title":"The Hall of Souls attacks","summary":"The Hall of Souls sends Zhai Xing, Black Tianzun and White Tianzun against the Falling Star Pavilion, and Elder Feng readies the Great Falling Star Formation. Before they arrive, Xiao Yan uses energy from the Dou Sheng skeleton to reach Two-Star Dou Zun. Elder Feng takes on Black Tianzun and White Tianzun, Qing Lin faces another Tianzun, and Xiao Yan goes after Zhai Xing. Zhai Xing shows his full power as a Five-Star Dou Zun, but Xiao Yan beats him with the Great Heavenly Creation Palm. The Ninth Tianzun arrives, mocks Zhai Xing, and calls Xiao Yan a descendant of Xiao Xuan with an abandoned bloodline. She nearly captures Xiao Yan before a voice asks who dares take his disciple.","events":["Scouts report the Hall of Souls is three days away.","Xiao Yan reaches Two-Star Dou Zun with the Dou Sheng skeleton's energy.","The Hall of Souls breaks the Great Falling Star Formation.","Elder Feng takes on Black Tianzun and White Tianzun.","Qing Lin and the Sky Demon Puppet face the other Tianzuns.","Xiao Yan beats Zhai Xing with the Great Heavenly Creation Palm.","The Ninth Tianzun arrives and overpowers Xiao Yan.","Yao Lao's voice stops her."],"introduced":["Star-Shattering Sickle","abandoned bloodline (of the Xiao Clan)"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan reaches Two-Star Dou Zun with energy from the Dou Sheng skeleton. Qing Lin is a One-Star Dou Zun. Zhai Xing is a Five-Star Dou Zun. The Sky Demon Puppet is on a par with a Four-Star Dou Zun.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":212,"title":"Yao Lao the Ban Sheng","summary":"Yao Lao steps out in his new body and defeats the Ninth Tianzun with ease. She uses the Spatial Jade Plate to call the Eighth Tianzun, Qiu Di, and the two attack together. Yao Lao stops their joint strike and reveals he is no longer a Nine-Star Dou Zun but a Ban Sheng. Both Tianzuns retreat badly wounded, and the Falling Star Pavilion grows in standing. Yao Lao gives Xiao Yan the Bone Chilling Flame after erasing his own soul mark from it, and promises to look for the Purifying Demonic Lotus Flame. Nalan Yanran then asks Xiao Yan to help Yun Yun, who inherited the Dou Qi of Granny Hua, the late leader of the Flower Sect. The acting leader Hua Jin and her lover Yaohua Xiejun have challenged Yun Yun to a duel in two weeks, and Xiao Yan leaves for the Flower Sect with Qing Lin.","events":["Yao Lao returns in his new body and beats the Ninth Tianzun.","The Ninth Tianzun calls in the Eighth Tianzun, Qiu Di.","Yao Lao stops their joint attack and reveals he is a Ban Sheng.","The Tianzuns flee; the Falling Star Pavilion is saved but badly hurt.","Yao Lao gives Xiao Yan the Bone Chilling Flame.","They talk about the Purifying Demonic Lotus Flame's map fragments.","Nalan Yanran tells Xiao Yan about Yun Yun, Granny Hua and the duel.","Xiao Yan sets out for the Flower Sect with Qing Lin and a Spatial Jade Plate from Yao Lao."],"introduced":["Ban Sheng","Nine Turns","Eighth Tianzun","Qiu Di","Flower Sect","Granny Hua","Hua Jin","Yaohua Xiejun","sect challenge"],"cultivation":"Yao Lao is a Ban Sheng. Before this the Ninth Tianzun calls him 'at best a Nine-Star Dou Zun'. Hua Jin is a Four-Star Dou Zun; Yaohua Xiejun is a Six-Star Dou Zun.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":213,"title":"The Flower Sect duel","summary":"Qing Lin guides Xiao Yan through the Flower Sect's Bewildering Array in time for the duel. Hua Jin accuses Yun Yun of plotting for the leader's seat and attacks, and Xiao Yan steps in. He names himself the Young Pavilion Chief of the Falling Star Pavilion, sends Yao Lao's greetings to the Grand Elder, Qing Xianzi, and sets terms: if Hua Jin loses, the seat goes to Yun Yun. Yun Yun fights Hua Jin, and Xiao Yan fights Yaohua Xiejun with the Sky Demon Puppet and the Sky Fire Three Mysterious Changes. Yaohua Xiejun's Qi Transformation Heaven and Earth meets Xiao Yan's Extermination Fire Lotus, and Qing Xianzi steps in to save the sect. Yaohua Xiejun loses and abandons Hua Jin, and Qing Xianzi names Yun Yun the new sect leader.","events":["Qing Lin leads Xiao Yan through the Bewildering Array.","Hua Jin confronts Yun Yun at the duel.","Xiao Yan steps in and introduces himself as Yao Chen's disciple.","Hua Jin accepts his terms.","Xiao Yan uses the Third Change to fight at Four-Star Dou Zun strength.","His Extermination Fire Lotus beats Yaohua Xiejun's Qi Transformation Heaven and Earth.","Qing Xianzi chooses the Falling Star Pavilion over the Profound Sky Sect.","Yaohua Xiejun abandons Hua Jin; Yun Yun becomes sect leader."],"introduced":["Bewildering Array","Qing Xianzi","Grand Elder (Flower Sect)","Third Change (of the Sky Fire Three Mysterious Changes)","Qi Transformation Heaven and Earth"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan is a Two-Star Dou Zun; the Third Change lifts him to Four-Star strength for the fight. Hua Jin is a Four-Star Dou Zun and Yaohua Xiejun a Six-Star Dou Zun.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":214,"title":"The Bone Chilling Flame and Dragon Island","summary":"Granny Hua's sealed Dou Qi is crashing through Yun Yun's meridians and could kill her, so Xiao Yan soothes it with the Bone Chilling Flame and gives her a Fiery Pill to help refine it. With the flame's resistance gone, he goes into seclusion in the Flower Sect and fuses the Bone Chilling Flame with his own. The Flame Mantra does not reach Tian Class, but he reaches Four-Star Dou Zun. On his way home Hei Qing finds him through a dragon seal Zi Yan left on him and takes him to Dragon Island. Elder Zhu Li explains that Zi Yan's father is the missing Dragon Emperor and that the clan has split into four warring islands. Zi Yan is sealed in a crystal of Dragon-Phoenix energy, and only a top-ten Heavenly Flame can melt it. Meanwhile three dragon islands gather to attack East Dragon Island.","events":["Xiao Yan calms Granny Hua's Dou Qi inside Yun Yun with the Bone Chilling Flame.","He gives Yun Yun a Fiery Pill.","He goes into seclusion and fuses the Bone Chilling Flame.","Thunderclouds form, and he reaches Four-Star Dou Zun.","Xiao Yan leaves the Flower Sect, and Hei Qing finds him.","On Dragon Island, Zhu Li explains Zi Yan's royal blood and the clan's split.","Xiao Yan sees Zi Yan sealed in crystal and agrees to help.","Man Yan, Xia Ao and Qing Yan plan a joint attack on East Dragon Island."],"introduced":["Fiery Pill","Dragon Island (seen)","dragon seal","Zhu Li","Third Elder (Void Ancient Dragons)","Dragon Emperor","Heavenly Flames Ranking (top ten)","East Dragon Island","North Dragon Island","Man Yan","Xia Ao","Qing Yan"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan reaches Four-Star Dou Zun after fusing the Bone Chilling Flame. The Flame Mantra does not evolve to Tian Class.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":215,"title":"Melting the Crystal on East Dragon Island","summary":"On East Dragon Island, Elder Zhu Li lets Qing Lin cultivate in the Ancient Dragon Tomb so she can refine the serpent soul inside her. Xiao Yan finds Tie Jian alive: Zhu Li saved him and had quietly helped during the rescue of Yao Lao from the Hall of Souls. Zhu Li gives Xiao Yan five drops of Ancient Dragon Essence Blood, and Xiao Yan spends a month melting the crystal around Zi Yan with his Heavenly Flame. Xia Ao of West Dragon Island then attacks with the Dragon Armored Troops, and Zhu Li fights another Ban Sheng-level dragon. Hei Qing holds off Man Yan, but Qing Yan of North Dragon Island slips past to seize Zi Yan's royal bloodline. Xiao Yan stalls him with a clone, and Zi Yan's royal bloodline finally awakens in full.","events":["Zhu Li grants Qing Lin access to the Ancient Dragon Tomb.","Tie Jian reappears; Zhu Li saved him and secretly helped at the Hall of Souls.","Zhu Li gives Xiao Yan five drops of Ancient Dragon Essence Blood.","Xiao Yan melts the Dragon-Phoenix crystal around Zi Yan for a month.","Xia Ao leads West Dragon Island's Dragon Armored Troops against East Dragon Island.","Zhu Li fights a Ban Sheng; Hei Qing fights Man Yan.","Qing Yan reaches the altar; Xiao Yan tricks him with a clone.","Zi Yan's royal bloodline awakens."],"introduced":["Ancient Dragon Tomb","Ancient Dragon Essence Blood","Qi You","Xia Cha","West Dragon King","South Dragon King","Dragon Armored Troops","Dragon-Phoenix Crystal Layer"],"cultivation":"Recap: Xiao Yan is a 4-star Dou Zun and his Flame Mantra is now Di Class. Zhu Li's opponent says she is a Ban Sheng. Hei Qing says his strength equals Man Yan's.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":216,"title":"The Dragon Emperor Awakens","summary":"Zi Yan wakes as the Dragon Emperor, and the attackers from the other Dragon Islands bow and retreat. She tells them there are no Dragon Kings, only one Dragon Emperor, then goes into seclusion to absorb the rest of the Dragon-Phoenix Origin Fruit. Her Dragon-Phoenix power heals Xiao Yan and gives him the Dragon-Phoenix Ancient Armor, an advanced Dragon Scale Cloak. Xiao Yan brings the Three Thousand Burning Flame to Dragon Island, and then tempers his Sky Demon Puppets in a lightning pool for half a month. In the Void Lightning Pool an old man who calls himself Mr. Mang drags him into the path of a black-lightning creature. Qing Lin comes out of the Ancient Dragon Tomb as a 6-star Dou Zun, and Zhu Li gives Xiao Yan a Spatial Jade Plate. Back at Falling Star Pavilion, Xiao Yan tells Yao Lao he is now a 5-star Dou Zun, and Yao Lao has news of the Purifying Demonic Lotus Flame.","events":["Zi Yan awakens as Dragon Emperor; the three-island coalition retreats.","Zi Yan sends word that only one Dragon Emperor exists, then enters seclusion.","Xiao Yan wakes wearing the Dragon-Phoenix Ancient Armor.","The Three Thousand Burning Flame returns to Dragon Island and accepts Xiao Yan as master.","Xiao Yan repairs and levels up his Sky Demon Puppets with lightning.","Mr. Mang lures a black-lightning creature onto Xiao Yan in the Void Lightning Pool.","Qing Lin reaches 6-star Dou Zun; Zhu Li gives Xiao Yan a Spatial Jade Plate.","Xiao Yan returns to Falling Star Pavilion."],"introduced":["Dragon Emperor (Zi Yan's title)","Dragon Scale Cloak","Dragon-Phoenix Ancient Armor","Spatial Strength","Void Lightning Pool","black lightning","Mang Tian Chi (as Mr. Mang)","Spatial Jade Plate","Purifying Demonic Lotus Flame"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan rises from 4-star to 5-star Dou Zun ('I now have the strength / of a Five-Star Dou Zun'). Qing Lin is a 6-star Dou Zun after refining the serpent soul. Xiao Yan's Sky Demon Puppets are repaired and leveled up.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":217,"title":"The Road to Ancient Holy City","summary":"At Falling Star Pavilion, Yao Lao says the last map fragment of the Purifying Demonic Lotus Flame will appear at a spatial trade fair within a year. Until then he sends Xiao Yan to represent the pavilion at the Gu Clan's coming-of-age ceremony. Yao Lao explains the Eight Ancient Clans, which once produced Dou Dis, and reveals he was cast out of the Yao Clan. Little Fairy Doctor returns from an ancient tomb as a 7-star Dou Zun, and the two set out. In the Gu Clan, Xun Er defends Xiao Yan against elders who call the Xiao Clan a dried-up bloodline. At the barrier of Ancient Holy City, Ling Quan of the Black Submerged Army attacks Xiao Yan, who beats him with a Soul Attack until the Fifth Commander stops it. In the city, Yang Hao, third commander of the Black Submerged Army, publicly challenges Xiao Yan.","events":["Yao Lao reports the last Purifying Demonic Lotus Flame map fragment will be at a spatial trade fair.","Yao Lao sends Xiao Yan to the Gu Clan's coming-of-age ceremony.","Yao Lao explains the Eight Ancient Clans and says he is a cast-out Yao Clan member.","Little Fairy Doctor returns as a 7-star Dou Zun.","Xun Er rejects the Gu elders' objections to Xiao Yan.","Ling Quan attacks Xiao Yan at Ancient Holy City and loses to a Soul Attack.","The Fifth Commander lets Xiao Yan in as a guest.","Yang Hao challenges Xiao Yan in public."],"introduced":["spatial trade fair","Eight Ancient Clans","Gu Clan","Yao Clan","Yan Clan","Shi Clan","Ling Clan","Lei Clan","Xiao Xuan","Woeful Poison Body","Gu Realm","Ancient Holy City","Gu Qian","Black Submerged Army","Black Submerged King","Fifth Commander","Yang Hao","coming-of-age ceremony"],"cultivation":"Little Fairy Doctor breaks through to 7-star Dou Zun with a technique from an ancient tomb. The Black Submerged Army's commanders, marshals and kings are all young Dou Zun-level geniuses.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":218,"title":"Duels Before the Gu Realm","summary":"In Ancient Holy City, Xiao Yan accepts Yang Hao's challenge and beats him with a Soul Attack and the new Earth Flame Hurricane. Lin Xiu tries to start another fight until Elder Gu Xun stops it and says the Gu Realm opens in three days. Hun Ya of the Hun Clan comes to taunt Xiao Yan, saying his ancestor killed Xiao Xuan, and Xiao Yan vows revenge. Huo Xuan and Huo Zhi of the Yan Clan tell him about the Heavenly Tomb, where ancient powerhouses are buried, and point out Yao Xing Ji of the Yao Clan. Gu Zhen, chief commander of the Black Submerged Army, tells Xiao Yan only a Dou Sheng can make the clan ignore bloodline purity, and Xiao Yan says he will become one. In the Gu Realm, Xun Er welcomes him and drives off elders who test him with an attack. Mr. Ling warns that anyone at the coming-of-age ceremony may challenge him.","events":["Xiao Yan defeats Yang Hao with a Soul Attack and the Earth Flame Hurricane.","Elder Gu Xun stops Lin Xiu from fighting Xiao Yan.","Hun Ya taunts Xiao Yan about Xiao Xuan's death.","Huo Xuan and Huo Zhi of the Yan Clan explain the Heavenly Tomb.","Gu Zhen tells Xiao Yan he must become a Dou Sheng.","Xiao Yan enters the Gu Realm and meets Xun Er.","Xun Er scolds Gu elders who attack Xiao Yan.","Mr. Ling warns about challenges at the ceremony."],"introduced":["Dragon Serpent Footwork","Heaven Shatter Claw","God Seal Technique","Overturning Land Seal","Earth Flame Hurricane","Huo Xuan","Huo Zhi","Red Lotus Flame","Lin Xiu","Gu Xun","Space Gate","Ancient Holy Mountains","Hun Ya","Heavenly Tomb","Yao Xing Ji","Ren Yao Zi","Gu Zhen","Seven Ancient Clans"],"cultivation":"Narration: Ling Quan is a 1-star Dou Zun, ranked seventh of the eight commanders; a Black Submerged King must be Ban Sheng level. Huo Xuan calls Xiao Yan 'just a Five-Star Dou Zun'. Yao Xing Ji is an eight-tier middle rank alchemist.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":219,"title":"The Coming-of-Age Ceremony","summary":"Gu Clan guards block Xiao Yan's friends at the ceremony until Mang Tian Chi appears; he is the old man from the Void Lightning Pool and the dean of Jia Nan Academy's Inner Academy. He makes Elder Gu Shan let them pass and says the Xiao Clan's slot in the Heavenly Tomb, long held by the Gu Clan, should be returned. At the ceremony, a star chart measures bloodline from first to tenth rank, and clan marks are granted in silver, gold, purple-gold and rainbow-gold. Ling Quan tests at sixth rank and Gu Yao, a marshal of the Black Submerged Army and an 8-star Dou Zun, at eighth rank. Gu Yao then challenges Xiao Yan, and Mang Tian Chi says surviving a hundred rounds will win back the slot. Xiao Yan's Dragon-Phoenix Ancient Armor takes Gu Yao's blows, and he answers Gu Yao's Ancient Holy Codex with the Five Ring Flame Expelling Formation. When Gu Yao's Great Annihilation Finger breaks through, Xiao Yan strikes back, and Elder Tong Xuan steps in to end the fight.","events":["Gu guards bar Xiao Yan's friends from the ceremony.","Mang Tian Chi reveals himself as Dean Mang and makes Gu Shan let them through.","Dean Mang promises help getting the Xiao Clan's Heavenly Tomb slot back.","The bloodline test: Ling Quan sixth rank, Gu Yao eighth rank.","Gu Yao challenges Xiao Yan, who accepts.","The Dragon-Phoenix Ancient Armor withstands Gu Yao's spear.","Gu Yao's Ancient Holy Codex and Great Annihilation Finger against the Five Ring Flame Expelling Formation.","Xiao Yan strikes back and Elder Tong Xuan intervenes."],"introduced":["Gu Shan","Gu Xu","Gu Yao","Marshal Demon (Gu Yao's title)","bloodline ranks","divine-grade bloodline","clan mark (Silver, Gold, Purple-Gold, Rainbow-Gold)","Mountain Opening Handprint","Ten Thousand Beasts Spear Technique","Beast King's Roar","Ancient Holy Codex","Devour Heaven, Swallow Earth","Five Ring Flame Expelling Technique","Five Ring Flame Expelling Formation","Great Annihilation Finger","Tong Xuan"],"cultivation":"Ling Quan: 'Seventh Commander of the Black Submerged Army, / One-Star Dou Zun, sixth-rank bloodline'. Gu Yao: 'Eight-Star Dou Zun, eighth-rank bloodline'. Xun Er's last test, long ago, was eighth rank.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":220,"title":"Xun Er's Divine-Grade Bloodline","summary":"Elder Tong Xuan ends the duel, and Dean Mang says the Gu Clan can no longer withhold the Xiao Clan's slot in the Heavenly Tomb. Xun Er's test passes ninth rank and reaches ten stars, a divine-grade bloodline the Gu Clan hasn't seen in a thousand years. Tong Xuan draws her the Rainbow Clan Mark with the Rainbow Divine Brush, and Hun Li of the Hun Clan decides she must be killed. That night Xun Er uses the Rainbow Clan Mark's authority to make the elders return the Xiao Clan's slot. Her father, Clan Leader Gu Yuan, asks Xiao Yan to give him the jade of Tuo She Gu Di, a key to a Dou Di ruin, but Xiao Yan refuses because it holds his father's soul signature. At the opening, Gu Qing Yang points out the other clans' heirs, including Hun Ya. The Heavenly Tomb gate appears, and each clan sends two people in for up to three years.","events":["Tong Xuan stops the fight; Dean Mang secures the Xiao Clan's slot.","Xun Er tests at ten stars, a divine-grade bloodline.","Tong Xuan draws Xun Er the Rainbow Clan Mark.","Hun Li plots to kill Xun Er.","Xun Er makes the elders return the Xiao Clan's quota.","Gu Yuan asks for the jade of Tuo She Gu Di; Xiao Yan refuses.","Gu Qing Yang introduces the Ancient Clans' heirs.","The Heavenly Tomb opens."],"introduced":["Rainbow Clan Mark","Rainbow Divine Brush","Hun Li","Gu Yuan","Dou Di ruin","Gu Qing Yang","Lei Xue","Lei Luo","Shi Ping","Shi Chui"],"cultivation":"Xun Er's bloodline is tenth rank (divine-grade). Ninth-rank bloodline gives a chance at Dou Sheng (EP219). Tong Xuan says even he wouldn't have a fifty percent chance against Xiao Xuan.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":221,"title":"Hunting in the Heavenly Tomb","summary":"Inside the Heavenly Tomb, Xun Er shows Xiao Yan how to absorb the energy cores of the energy bodies formed from the dead buried there. She gives him a six-star core, and he breaks through to 6-star Dou Zun. Hun Ya and Hun Li, both 8-star Dou Zuns, ambush them to kill Xun Er. Xun Er fights them off with the Great Heavenly Creation Palm, and Hun Li loses an arm. On the second layer, the two Hun Clan men lure a crowd of Dou Zun energy bodies onto them, then flee toward the third layer. After ten days of chasing, Xiao Yan and Xun Er kill a nine-star energy body and leave its core as bait. Hun Ya and Hun Li take the bait, and Xiao Yan's clone springs the trap on them.","events":["Xun Er explains energy bodies and energy cores.","Xiao Yan absorbs a six-star core and reaches 6-star Dou Zun.","Hun Ya and Hun Li ambush Xun Er.","Xun Er's Great Heavenly Creation Palm costs Hun Li an arm.","On the second layer, the Hun pair lure energy bodies onto them.","Xiao Yan and Xun Er kill a nine-star energy body.","They use its core as bait and turn the trap on the Hun pair."],"introduced":["energy body","energy core","first, second and third layers of the Heavenly Tomb","Soul Explosion","Great Heavenly Creation Palm","Axe Splitting the Heavens"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan breaks through from 5-star to 6-star Dou Zun by absorbing a six-star energy core ('If I hadn't broken through to Six-star Dou Zun'). Hun Ya and Hun Li are 8-star Dou Zuns.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":222,"title":"The Energy Storm","summary":"Hun Ya and Hun Li come out to fight Xiao Yan and Xun Er, and Hun Li, who lost an arm, goes after Xiao Yan. Hun Li uses the Hun Clan's clan mark to jump to 9-star Dou Zun power with no backlash. Xiao Yan answers with the Sky Fire Three Mysterious Changes, and the Hun pair are shocked to see the Xiao Clan's clan mark on him. His fully tempered Sky Demon Puppet holds off Hun Li. Before Xiao Yan can finish him, a great energy storm sweeps the second layer and everyone runs for the third layer. Xiao Yan and Xun Er team up with Huo Xuan of the Yan Clan and join Gu Qing Yang and the other clans at the barrier, now turned solid. The heirs cut a tunnel together, but its walls begin to close and turn out to be the nest of the Ancient Devouring Insects.","events":["Hun Ya fights Xun Er; Hun Li fights Xiao Yan.","Hun Li activates the Hun Clan's clan mark.","The Xiao Clan's clan mark appears on Xiao Yan.","A Sky Demon Puppet takes on Hun Li.","An energy storm hits the second layer; the fight breaks off.","Xiao Yan teams up with Huo Xuan.","The clans break the solid barrier together.","The tunnel closes; it is an Ancient Devouring Insect nest."],"introduced":["Hun Clan clan mark","Xiao Clan clan mark","Open Mountain Seal","Soul Shattering Dark Palm","energy storm","Ancient Devouring Insects"],"cultivation":"Hun Li calls Xiao Yan a 6-star Dou Zun. Hun Li's clan mark lifts him to 9-star Dou Zun level. The fully tempered Sky Demon Puppet can take on a 9-star Dou Zun. Huo Xuan has advanced.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":223,"title":"Through the Insect Nest","summary":"Trapped in the nest of the Ancient Devouring Insects, the clan heirs find that the insects eat Dou Qi but cannot devour a Heavenly Flame. Xiao Yan burns a tunnel with Huo Xuan's Red Lotus Flame, ranked eighth, and the Nine Serene Wind Flame, ranked tenth, adding his own fused Heavenly Flames. He takes energy cores from the Gu and Yan Clans freely and makes the Hun pair pay their share, including a nine-star core. They break out into the third layer, and the Hun pair slip away. Xun Er, Gu Qing Yang and another Gu Clan heir head for the deepest part of the tomb with Xiao Yan. There they are attacked by Saint Xue Dao, a sentient Ban Sheng energy body. When the Xiao Clan's clan mark shows on Xiao Yan's face during his Great Heavenly Creation Palm, Xue Dao stops and cries that he is from the Xiao Clan.","events":["The heirs are trapped among the Ancient Devouring Insects.","Heavenly Flames prove the only thing the insects can't eat.","Xiao Yan burns a tunnel with the Red Lotus Flame and Nine Serene Wind Flame.","He makes the Hun pair hand over energy cores, including a nine-star core.","The group reaches the third layer; the Hun pair run off.","Gu Clan heirs join Xiao Yan and Xun Er toward the depths.","Saint Xue Dao, a Ban Sheng energy body, attacks.","Xue Dao recognizes the Xiao Clan's clan mark."],"introduced":["Nine Serene Wind Flame","Xue Dao","Blood Blade Chaotic Wind Tear","Lock (Spatial Strength move)"],"cultivation":"Xue Dao is a Ban Sheng energy body ('A sentient Ban Sheng energy body'). Red Lotus Flame is ranked 8th and Nine Serene Wind Flame 10th among Heavenly Flames; Xiao Yan's fused flame is thought to be on par with the top six.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":224,"title":"Xiao Xuan","summary":"Saint Xue Dao lets Xiao Yan's group go once he sees the Xiao Clan's clan mark, fearing someone more powerful in the tomb. Xun Er tells Xiao Yan the mark appears on his face when his aura surges. On the way to Xiao Xuan's tomb, the Hun pair pull them into a separate space made by two Hun Clan Dou Sheng energy bodies, one of them Hun Diao. Xue Dao steps in to help, and then an image of Xiao Xuan appears and wipes out the two 1-star Dou Shengs. Xiao Xuan greets Xiao Yan and lets the Gu youths train at the richest spot in the tomb. He tells Xiao Yan and Xun Er that he drew the whole clan's bloodline into himself to become a Dou Di, failed, and was then struck down by the Hun Clan. He also says he created the Sky Fire Three Mysterious Changes, and that he sealed part of his power in the last of the bloodline for Xiao Yan.","events":["Xue Dao spares the group and points them west.","Xun Er explains the Xiao Clan's clan mark.","Hun Diao and another Hun Clan Dou Sheng energy body trap them in a separate space.","Xue Dao helps fight the Hun energy bodies.","An image of Xiao Xuan appears and destroys them.","Xiao Xuan welcomes Xiao Yan and Xun Er.","Xiao Xuan tells how he failed to become a Dou Di and the clan fell.","He reveals he created the Sky Fire Three Mysterious Changes."],"introduced":["Hun Diao","Xiao Xuan (on screen)"],"cultivation":"Xiao Xuan calls the two Hun Clan energy bodies 'Two One-Star Dou Shengs'. Xiao Xuan's image is a projection; the tomb lets his real form out only once every ten years.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":225,"title":"The Xiao Clan's Bloodline","summary":"At the blood pool in his tomb, Xiao Xuan drains Xiao Yan's old blood and pours in the last of the Xiao Clan's bloodline. The Dragon-Phoenix bloodline Zi Yan gave him rejects it, so Xun Er gives some of the Gu Clan's bloodline to bind them. A year later Xiao Yan breaks through and settles at peak 8-star Dou Zun, with the seed of a new bloodline planted in his heart. Over the next months he completes the last step of the Sky Fire Three Mysterious Changes and learns to call up the full Xiao Clan clan mark. Xiao Xuan sends him to kill the Ban Sheng queen of the Ancient Devouring Insects for armor material. Xiao Yan then hunts down Hun Ya and Hun Li, who use their clan mark too, and kills them both. Xiao Xuan gives him the Ancient Insect Emperor Cloth, and Xiao Yan promises to return as a Dou Sheng.","events":["Xiao Xuan performs the blood transfusion on Xiao Yan.","The Dragon-Phoenix bloodline rejects the Xiao bloodline.","Xun Er gives part of her Gu bloodline to fuse them.","A year later Xiao Yan reaches peak 8-star Dou Zun.","He completes the Sky Fire Three Mysterious Changes and the clan mark.","He kills the Ancient Devouring Insect queen.","He kills Hun Li and Hun Ya.","Xiao Xuan gives him the Ancient Insect Emperor Cloth; they part."],"introduced":["blood transfusion","Dragon-Phoenix Bloodline","seed of a new bloodline","Ancient Devouring Insect queen","Ancient Insect Emperor Cloth"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan rises from 6-star to peak 8-star Dou Zun after inheriting the Xiao bloodline ('Peak Eight-Star Dou Zun.'). He completes the ninth stroke of the clan mark. The insect queen is on par with a Ban Sheng. Hun Ya and Hun Li call him an Eight-Star Dou Zun.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":226,"title":"Back to the Yan Alliance","summary":"The heirs come out of the Heavenly Tomb, and the bodies of Hun Ya and Hun Li are thrown out after them. Hun Lin of the Hun Clan accuses Xiao Yan, but Xun Er says the two attacked her, and Tong Xuan sends the Hun Clan off. Xiao Yan learns his friends were called back to Falling Star Pavilion, and that the Ling Clan has sealed off the Ling Realm, so Xun Er must stay. Gu Yuan tells him only a Dou Di could free Xiao Xuan from the tomb. Back in the Xing Realm, Yao Lao says Xiao Yan went from 5-star to peak 8-star Dou Zun in six months, then warns that the Profound Lion Sect and Hall of Souls experts are attacking the Yan Alliance. Yao Lao recruits twenty 3-star Dou Zun allies with Eighth-Tier pills while the Wormhole is finished. At the Mystic Yellow Fortress, Hai Bodong, now at the peak of Dou Zong, kills Profound Lion Sect raiders.","events":["The heirs leave the tomb; Hun Ya and Hun Li's bodies are ejected.","Hun Lin accuses Xiao Yan; Xun Er and Tong Xuan face him down.","News: Xiao Yan's friends left; the Ling Realm is sealed.","Gu Yuan says only a Dou Di can free Xiao Xuan.","Xiao Yan receives an invitation to the Yao Clan's ancestral code.","Yao Lao reports the Profound Lion Sect's war on the Yan Alliance.","Yao Lao gathers twenty 3-star Dou Zun allies.","Hai Bodong kills Profound Lion Sect Dou Zongs near the Mystic Yellow Fortress."],"introduced":["Hun Lin","Ling Realm","Yao Clan ancestral code","Xing Realm","Profound Lion Sect","North-Western Region","Mystic Yellow Fortress"],"cultivation":"Yao Lao: 'you went from a Five-Star Dou Zun / to an Eight-Star Peak' in six months (Tong Xuan: 'His strength increased by three stars!'). Hai Bodong is at the peak of Dou Zong. Yao Lao calls himself an eight-tier alchemist.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":227,"title":"The Siege of the Mystic Yellow Fortress","summary":"The Mystic Yellow Fortress stands in the Mystic Yellow Rift on the Jia Ma Empire border, the Yan Alliance's main bastion and a busy trade city. The Profound Lion Sect's warships bombard it, and its leader Shi Tian tells Medusa to hand over the Xiao Clan in exchange for sparing the alliance. Medusa refuses, the city barrier goes up, and Hai Bodong destroys a warship with the Mysterious Ice Dragon's Soar. Shi Tian waits for the barrier to run out, but an ally from the Hall of Souls pushes him to strike fast so no Xiao Clan member escapes. Medusa rallies the defenders and fights Shi Tian, who grows stronger as more people die. A Hall of Souls man tries to take a little girl, Xiao Xiao, for the Ninth Tianzun, but Xiao Yan arrives and saves her.","events":["Narration on the Mystic Yellow Rift and Fortress.","The Profound Lion Sect bombards the fortress.","Shi Tian demands Medusa hand over the Xiao Clan; she refuses.","Hai Bodong destroys a warship with the Mysterious Ice Dragon's Soar.","The Hall of Souls is revealed behind the attack.","Medusa fights Shi Tian as the barrier fails.","A Hall of Souls man grabs Xiao Xiao for the Ninth Tianzun.","Xiao Yan arrives and orders the invaders wiped out."],"introduced":["Mystic Yellow Rift","Shi Tian","Xiao Xiao","Mysterious Ice Dragon's Soar","Spatial Strangling"],"cultivation":"Shi Tian calls Hai Bodong 'A mere Dou Zong'.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":228,"title":"The Blood River Tianzun","summary":"Xiao Yan saves Xiao Xiao, who can walk on air, and finds Medusa still defending the Mystic Yellow Fortress. He defeats Shi Tian, the 6-star Dou Zun leader of the Profound Lion Sect. The Ninth Tianzun of the Hall of Souls then comes for him, but his Dragon-Phoenix power and Great Heavenly Creation Palm overwhelm her, and he grabs her by the hand. She calls on the Fourth Tianzun, the Blood River Elder, who kills the Ninth Tianzun instead. The Fourth Tianzun is at the peak of 9-star Dou Zun, and her Blood Transformation Art drains blood even from her own side. Xiao Yan shows his Xiao Clan mark, blocks her Blood Fiend Heavenly Demon Palm with the Five Ring Flame Expelling Formation, and wounds her with the Extermination Fire Lotus. She flees with the Blood Escape Art, and Xiao Yan accepts the Profound Lion Sect men who sincerely surrender.","events":["Xiao Yan rescues Xiao Xiao and reunites with Medusa.","Xiao Yan defeats Shi Tian.","The Ninth Tianzun attacks and is overpowered.","The Fourth Tianzun (Blood River Elder) arrives and kills the Ninth Tianzun.","Her Blood Transformation Art drains her own allies.","Xiao Yan uses the clan mark and the Five Ring Flame Expelling Formation.","His Extermination Fire Lotus wounds her; she flees by Blood Escape Art.","The Profound Lion Sect's remnants surrender."],"introduced":["Fourth Tianzun","Blood River Elder","Blood Transformation Art","Blood Fiend Heavenly Demon Palm","Blood Escape Art","Blood Dragon"],"cultivation":"Shi Tian is a 6-star Dou Zun. The Ninth Tianzun says Xiao Yan 'has reached the peak of Eight-Star'. The Fourth Tianzun is at peak 9-star Dou Zun and near Dou Sheng ('Nine turns to become a Dou Sheng').","confidence":"high"},{"ep":229,"title":"Purging the Pill Hall","summary":"With the Yan Alliance safe, Xiao Yan watches Xiao Xiao play and plans pills to unlock her Dou Zong-level strength. He tells Xiao Li that Xiao Xuan passed him the last of the Dou Di bloodline, and gives him the Sky Fire Three Mysterious Changes to teach gifted clansmen. The Pill Hall's herb store burns, and the seventh-tier alchemists Liu Chang and Wu Zhen refuse to make pills, pushing Gu He and Fa Ma aside. At the victory feast, they doubt Xiao Yan can refine an Eighth-Tier Pill. Xiao Yan refines a Primordial Pill for Xiao Xiao with his Heavenly Flame in eight days and holds off its five-colored pill thundercloud. He then reads out their crimes: selling pills, defying orders and plotting to break away, plus ordering the fire. He has them executed, and the Wormhole back to Falling Star Pavilion is ready.","events":["Xiao Xiao plays in the fortress; Xiao Yan plans pills for her.","Xiao Yan tells Xiao Li about Xiao Xuan and gives him the Sky Fire Three Mysterious Changes.","The Pill Hall's herb storage burns.","Liu Chang and Wu Zhen defy Gu He and Fa Ma.","Xiao Yan toasts the fallen, the defenders and Medusa.","He refines the Eighth-Tier Primordial Pill and withstands a five-colored thundercloud.","An arsonist confesses; Liu Chang and Wu Zhen's crimes are read out.","Xiao Yan orders their execution; the Wormhole is ready."],"introduced":["Liu Chang","Wu Zhen","Primordial Pill","Eighth-Tier Eminent Master","multicolored thundercloud"],"cultivation":"Xiao Xiao has Dou Zong-level strength. Xiao Yan reaches 'the realm / of an Eighth-Tier Eminent Master' in alchemy. Liu Chang and Wu Zhen are seventh-tier alchemists.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":230,"title":"The Spatial Trade Fair","summary":"Back at the Falling Star Pavilion, Xiao Yan brings Xiao Xiao to Yao Lao. Yao Lao finds she has a rare wood and fire affinity and takes over her training. Yao Lao shows a map of cities the Hall of Souls controls, and they leave for the spatial trade fair, where the last fragment of the Purifying Demonic Lotus Flame map will be sold. At a street stall, Xiao Yan trades two Eighth-Tier Pills for a Seven-colored Origin Stone, which turns out to be eight-colored and helps Medusa's cultivation. In the auction run by Old Bao Shan of Reflecting Treasure Mountain, Xiao Yan buys the Sky Quiet Poison Code for Little Fairy Doctor. Yao Lao wins the map fragment with a nine-colored thundercloud pill. The last lot is free news: the Bodhisattva Ancient Tree has been seen in the Ancient Wasteland Region.","events":["Xiao Yan introduces Xiao Xiao to Yao Lao, who takes over her training.","Yao Lao shows the cities under Hall of Souls control and plans for the spatial trade fair.","Xiao Yan tells Medusa he will protect everyone; she says she will grow stronger too.","At the fair, Xiao Yan buys a Seven-colored Origin Stone that proves to be eight-colored.","Old Bao Shan opens the auction; Heaven Demon Phoenix Wings and the King Kong Glass Body are sold.","Xiao Yan buys the Sky Quiet Poison Code for two five-colored thundercloud Eighth-Tier Pills.","Yao Lao wins the last map fragment with a nine-colored thundercloud pill.","Old Bao Shan reveals the Bodhisattva Ancient Tree has been seen in the Ancient Wasteland Region; someone greets Yao Lao as an old friend."],"introduced":["spatial trade fair","Ground Line Gate","Mysterious Space Sect","Reflecting Treasure Mountain","Old Bao Shan","Seven-colored Origin Stone","Nine-Colored Heaven Swallowing Python","Heaven Demon Phoenix Wings","King Kong Glass Body","Sky Quiet Poison Code","Great Mysterious Skill","Body Transformation Pill","Ten-Thousand-Year-Old Bloody Spiritual Ginseng","Bodhisattva Ancient Tree (Wisdom Reincarnation Tree)","Ancient Wasteland Region"],"cultivation":"Old Bao Shan is a peak Ninth Turn Dou Zun, one step from Ban Sheng. Xiao Xiao has a dual wood and fire affinity. Every presence at the fair is at least a Three-Star Dou Zun.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":231,"title":"The Ghost Scorpion Demons","summary":"On the way home from the fair, Tian Xie Zi and Di Xie Zi of the Cloud Rain Sect ambush Yao Lao's group for the map fragment. Tian Xie Zi traps Yao Lao with an array while Di Xie Zi, a Sixth Turn peak Dou Zun, goes after Xiao Yan, Medusa and Little Fairy Doctor. Medusa and Little Fairy Doctor hold Di Xie Zi off while Xiao Yan fuses his Heavenly Flames into a Fire Lotus, which destroys both demons despite their King Kong Glass Body. Xiao Yan drips his blood on the four joined map pieces and burns them with Heavenly Flame. A verse appears: the Purifying Demonic Lotus Flame will come when two moons rise and nine planets align, which Yao Lao counts as three years from now. A wisp of soul energy from the map enters Xiao Yan's brow, carrying the message of the Purifying Demonic Lotus Saint. To be strong enough in three years, Xiao Yan decides to find the Bodhisattva Ancient Tree and its Bodhisattva Heart.","events":["Tian Xie Zi and Di Xie Zi of the Cloud Rain Sect stop the group for the map.","Tian Xie Zi holds Yao Lao in an array; Di Xie Zi attacks the others.","Xiao Yan uses a burst technique to jump from Eight-Star Dou Zun to Triple Turn peak Dou Zun.","Medusa and Little Fairy Doctor buy time; Xiao Yan fuses four Heavenly Flames.","The Fire Lotus kills both demons; they had used the King Kong Glass Body.","Blood and Heavenly Flame reveal the map's verse: the flame appears in three years.","Soul energy from the map enters Xiao Yan's brow: the Purifying Demonic Lotus Saint.","Yao Lao points him to the Bodhisattva Heart; Xiao Yan resolves to go to the Ancient Wasteland Region."],"introduced":["Tian Xie Zi","Di Xie Zi","Ghost Scorpion Demons","Cloud Rain Sect","Thick Earth Bell","Purifying Demonic Lotus Saint","the two moons and nine planets verse"],"cultivation":"Di Xie Zi is a Sixth Turn peak Dou Zun. Xiao Yan is an Eight-Star Dou Zun and boosts himself to Triple Turn peak Dou Zun with a secret technique. Yao Lao has reached Ban Sheng. Xiao Yan must reach Dou Sheng within three years to take the Purifying Demonic Lotus Flame.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":232,"title":"Into the Ancient Wasteland","summary":"After two weeks in seclusion, Xiao Yan forces his King Kong Glass Body to about seven zhang, still short of the peak of nine zhang and nine chi. Yao Lao confirms the Bodhisattva Ancient Tree will appear and gives him a Spatial Jade Plate to call for help. Xiao Yan enters the Ancient Wasteland Region with Medusa, Little Fairy Doctor and Qing Lin, while Tian Huo Zun Zhe stays to guard the Falling Star Pavilion. In a poison fog made of tiny insects, Xiao Yan shields the group with his Heavenly Flame. They then find the Flower Sect ambushed by the Profound Sky Sect, whose Deputy Sect Leader Liu Cang wants to take Yun Yun and her disciple Nalan Yanran. Yun Yun prepares to self-destruct, but Xiao Yan arrives in his golden King Kong Glass Body and kills Liu Cang with one Great Nether Dragon Fist.","events":["Xiao Yan forces his King Kong Glass Body to seven zhang and is hurt by it.","Yao Lao gives him a Spatial Jade Plate; the group leaves for the Ancient Wasteland Region.","Little Fairy Doctor finds the poison fog is made of insects; Xiao Yan's Heavenly Flame drives them off.","The Profound Sky Sect ambushes the Flower Sect.","Liu Cang threatens Yun Yun and Nalan Yanran.","Yun Yun is about to self-destruct.","Xiao Yan kills Liu Cang with one Great Nether Dragon Fist; the Profound Sky Sect flees.","Yun Yun recognises Medusa, then Xiao Yan."],"introduced":["Nine-Zhang Golden Body (peak of the King Kong Glass Body)","Spatial Jade Plate (given to Xiao Yan)","poison-insect fog","Liu Cang","Great Nether Dragon Fist"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan's King Kong Glass Body reaches about seven zhang, short of the nine zhang and nine chi peak. Liu Cang is a Nine-Star peak Dou Zun. The recap calls Tian Xie Zi a Ninth Turn Dou Zun and Yao Lao a Ban Sheng.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":233,"title":"The Heaven Demon Blood Pool","summary":"Xiao Yan treats the Flower Sect with pills, and Yun Yun's group joins him because the Profound Sky Sect killed their Elder Qinghua. On the way to the Ancient Region Stage, the Ancient Heaven Demon Python, as strong as a peak Fifth Turn Dou Zun, comes after them. Xiao Yan wants its Heaven Demon Blood Pool, whose energy can temper his King Kong Glass Body. Qing Lin's Triple Jade-Green Snake Flower Pupils fail at first, so Little Fairy Doctor, Medusa and the Flower Sect fight the python until it weakens. Qing Lin then holds it with her Demonic Eyes while Xiao Yan cultivates in the pool for three days. When the python breaks free, Xiao Yan comes out with the peak Nine-Zhang King Kong Glass Body and saves the others. He gives the python to Qing Lin.","events":["The Flower Sect joins Xiao Yan's group after losing Elder Qinghua.","They head for the Ancient Region Stage, a safe spot in the Wasteland.","The Ancient Heaven Demon Python appears; Xiao Yan wants its blood pool.","Qing Lin's pupils fail to control the python; the group splits up and fights it.","Little Fairy Doctor uses Sky Poison Prison and Thousand Mirage Poison Spring; Qing Lin's Demonic Eyes hold it.","Xiao Yan cultivates in the Heaven Demon Blood Pool for three days.","The python breaks free; Xiao Yan returns with the Nine-Zhang King Kong Glass Body.","Xiao Yan lets Qing Lin keep the python."],"introduced":["Ancient Region Stage","Ancient Heaven Demon Python","Heaven Demon Blood Pool (Heaven Demon Spiritual Pond)","Elder Qinghua (named only)","Demonic Eyes (of the Triple Jade-Green Snake Flower Pupils)"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan's King Kong Glass Body reaches the peak Nine-Zhang stage. The Ancient Heaven Demon Python is a peak Fifth Turn Dou Zun.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":234,"title":"The Ancient Region Stage","summary":"Xiao Yan leads the Flower Sect to the Ancient Region Stage, where the great powers of the Central Plains wait. Jiu Feng of the Heaven Demon Phoenix Tribe blames him for the Dragon-Phoenix Origin Fruit, and Feng Qing Er, who survived a blood transplant from the Ancient Heaven Demon Phoenix, attacks him. Xiao Yan beats her with one slap and tells Jiu Feng to fight his own battles. Gu Qing Yang of the Black Submerged Army brings him to the Gu Clan's camp, where Xun Er meets Yun Yun and Medusa. A beast tide then hits the stage, and Hun Yu of the Hun Clan proposes an alliance to break through it. The Hun Clan leads the charge, then pulls back and leaves the others surrounded by Dou Zun-level beasts.","events":["The Flower Sect and Xiao Yan arrive at the Ancient Region Stage.","Jiu Feng confronts Xiao Yan over the Dragon-Phoenix Origin Fruit.","Feng Qing Er attacks; Xiao Yan beats her with a slap.","Gu Qing Yang appears and calls Xiao Yan a guest of the Gu Clan.","Xun Er meets Yun Yun and Medusa and explains the beast-filled canyon.","A beast tide reaches the stage; Hun Yu proposes an alliance.","The Heaven Demon Phoenix Tribe joins; the Hun Clan leads the charge.","The Hun Clan withdraws its formation and leaves the others in the tide."],"introduced":["Jiu Feng","Hun Yu","Heaven Demon Phoenix Tribe's blood transplant","Heaven Phoenix Strike","beast tide"],"cultivation":"Jiu Feng and Hun Yu are both peak Eighth Turn Dou Zuns. Feng Qing Er reached peak Third Turn Dou Zun through the Ancient Heaven Demon Phoenix's essence blood.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":235,"title":"Three Ban Sheng Puppets","summary":"Left as bait by the Hun Clan, the Flower Sect, the Gu Clan and Xiao Yan's group are trapped by a second beast tide in the canyon. Yun Yun's Flower Sect holds a formation with help from Gu Clan disciples while Xiao Yan hands out Dou Qi pills. Xiao Yan and Gu Qing Yang blast a path along the cliff with the Open Mountain Seal and follow the trail of the Hun Clan and the Heaven Demon Phoenix Tribe. Hun Yu seals the tunnel behind him to bury them with the beasts, but they break through and reach the Bodhisattva Ancient Tree. Three Ban Sheng puppets guard it, one of them a lost Hun Clan ancestor. Qing Lin senses a cold, gray qi of negative emotion in the tree. Xiao Yan proposes that all sides fight the puppets together, and Hun Yu and Jiu Feng agree.","events":["The Hun Clan's trick leaves the others surrounded by a beast tide.","Hun Yu and Jiu Feng, working together, move toward the tree.","The Flower Sect holds a formation with Gu Clan help; Xiao Yan hands out pills.","Xiao Yan and Gu Qing Yang open a path along the cliff with the Open Mountain Seal.","Hun Yu seals the tunnel to trap them with the beasts.","The group breaks out and reaches the Bodhisattva Ancient Tree.","Three Ban Sheng puppets guard the tree; one is a Hun Clan ancestor.","Xiao Yan, Hun Yu and Jiu Feng agree to fight the puppets together."],"introduced":["Ban Sheng puppets","Hun Clan annals"],"confidence":"high"},{"ep":236,"title":"The Illusion at the Tree","summary":"Xiao Yan's group, the Hun Clan and the Heaven Demon Phoenix Tribe each take on a Ban Sheng puppet at the Bodhisattva Ancient Tree. The puppets feel no pain and can create their own space. Hun Yu tries to revive his clan's ancestor and loses many men. Xiao Yan's side cuts the strings that tie its puppet to the tree, and he finishes it with the Six Joint Body Flowing Ruler, the King Kong Glass Body and an Octane Blast. Xun Er and Gu Qing Yang go on with him toward the tree. Near it, Xiao Yan falls into an illusion where the Hall of Souls hurts his father and Yao Lao, and he goes into a rage. The Bodhisattva Seed brings him out before he becomes a puppet himself.","events":["The three sides split up to fight the three Ban Sheng puppets.","A puppet opens its own space around Xiao Yan's group.","Hun Yu tries to revive the Hun Clan ancestor and fails.","The group cuts the strings linking their puppet to the tree.","Xiao Yan beats it with the Six Joint Body Flowing Ruler, King Kong Glass Body and Octane Blast.","Only those above Six-Star Dou Zun go on; Xun Er and Gu Qing Yang join Xiao Yan.","Xiao Yan is caught in an illusion of the Hall of Souls hurting his father and Yao Lao.","The Bodhisattva Seed frees him."],"introduced":["Dragon-Phoenix Ancient Armor"],"confidence":"high"},{"ep":237,"title":"A Hundred Lifetimes","summary":"Past the illusion, Xiao Yan sees a vision of a Dou Di devouring the Bodhisattva Ancient Tree, which explains why the tree is withering. He uses his own Bodhisattva Seed to slow the Dou Di's corruption, then refines the many pure Bodhisattva Seeds the tree offers him, while an array keeps refilling his Dou Qi. The tree then gives him enlightenment, a hundred lifetimes of reincarnation under its branches. Hun Yu tries to stop him, but the tree shields him and Xun Er's Gu Clan stands guard. Xiao Yan wakes at peak Ninth Turn Dou Zun and shares the seeds with his companions. Hun Yu demands the seeds and the jade of Tuo She Gu Di and attacks with the Soul Destruction Palm, but Xiao Yan beats him with an Octane Blast. Then the space starts to collapse.","events":["A vision shows a Dou Di devouring the Bodhisattva Ancient Tree.","Xiao Yan's Bodhisattva Seed slows the Dou Di's corruption in the tree.","Xiao Yan refines the tree's pure Bodhisattva Seeds; an array restores his Dou Qi.","The others wake from their own illusions.","Xiao Yan gains enlightenment under the tree; Hun Yu's attack is blocked by the tree.","Xiao Yan wakes at peak Ninth Turn Dou Zun and hands out seeds.","Hun Yu demands the seeds and the Tuo She Gu Di jade; Xiao Yan beats him.","The space begins to collapse."],"introduced":["the tree's three treasures (Bodhisattva Seed, Bodhisattva Heart, enlightenment)","Soul Destruction Palm"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan reaches peak Ninth Turn Dou Zun after enlightenment under the Bodhisattva Ancient Tree. Hun Yu fights at peak Eighth Turn Dou Zun with his clan mark power.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":238,"title":"Gu You of the Hun Clan","summary":"Xiao Yan leaves the Bodhisattva Ancient Tree with the Bodhisattva Heart, but Jiu Feng seals the space with the Illusory Heavenly Phoenix. Hun Yu calls in Gu You, a Ban Sheng of the Hun Clan who calls himself the Second Tianzun, to capture Xiao Yan and Xun Er. Xun Er holds Gu You back with the Gold Emperor Incinerating Heavenly Flame while Xiao Yan fuses his Heavenly Flames. Gu You merges his soul with a skeleton and puts on the Ten Thousand Soul Bone Armor, but Xiao Yan's Fire Lotus wounds him badly. Yao Lao arrives to protect his disciple, and Tong Xuan and other Gu Clan elders come too, so Gu You and Hun Yu withdraw. Tong Xuan takes Xun Er back to the Gu Clan and promises to watch the Hun Clan.","events":["Xiao Yan says goodbye to the Bodhisattva Ancient Tree.","Jiu Feng seals the space; Hun Yu summons Gu You.","Gu You names himself the Second Tianzun and targets Xiao Yan and Xun Er.","Xun Er fights Gu You with the Gold Emperor Incinerating Heavenly Flame and Formation.","Gu You uses Soul Sacrifice and the Ten Thousand Soul Bone Armor.","Xiao Yan's fused-flame attack wounds Gu You.","Yao Lao and the Gu Clan elder Tong Xuan arrive; the Hun Clan withdraws.","Xun Er leaves with Tong Xuan."],"introduced":["Gu You","Illusory Heavenly Phoenix","Gold Emperor Incinerating Heavenly Flame","Gold Emperor Incinerating Heavenly Formation","Soul Sacrifice","Ten Thousand Soul Bone Armor","Yao Sheng Zhe (Yao Lao's new title)"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan is now a Ninth Turn Dou Zun (peak, per the recap). Gu You is a Ban Sheng. Yao Lao is greeted as Yao Sheng Zhe for reaching Ban Sheng.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":239,"title":"Han Feng's End","summary":"Xiao Yan wakes at the Falling Star Pavilion after three days and shows Yao Lao his 11 Bodhisattva Seeds and the Bodhisattva Heart. In the Hun Clan, the leader scolds Hun Yu for coming back with nothing. Xiao Yan tries to break through to Dou Sheng but cannot, and Yao Lao refines a Bodhisattva Pill that draws an eight-colored thundercloud to help him. Before going into seclusion, Xiao Yan hands Yao Lao the soul of Han Feng. Han Feng begs, then attacks with a move taught by Mu Gu, and Yao Lao, now a Ban Sheng, destroys him. Later the Ling Clan of the Eight Ancient Clans vanishes. Old Demon Tian Ming of the Profound Sky Sect attacks the Falling Star Pavilion's camp in the Tianxing Mountain Range and wrecks its Wormhole, with the Hall of Souls behind him.","events":["Xiao Yan wakes after three days at peak Ninth Turn Dou Zun.","He shows Yao Lao 11 Bodhisattva Seeds and the Bodhisattva Heart.","The Hun Clan leader scolds Hun Yu and Gu You.","Xiao Yan fails to cross into Dou Sheng; Yao Lao gives him the Bodhisattva Pill.","Xiao Yan goes into seclusion and gives Yao Lao Han Feng's soul.","Han Feng attacks Yao Lao with a move from Mu Gu and is destroyed.","The Ling Clan and the Ling Realm vanish; the Hun Clan is suspected.","Old Demon Tian Ming attacks the Tianxing Mountain Range camp; the Profound River Alliance is named."],"introduced":["Bodhisattva Pill","Hun Clan leader (Hun Miesheng, named in EP240)","Ling Clan","Ling Realm","Old Demon Tian Ming","Profound River Alliance","Tianxing Mountain Range camp"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan went from Eight-Star Dou Zun to peak Ninth Turn Dou Zun on the trip. He cannot yet break through to Dou Sheng. Old Demon Tian Ming is a Ban Sheng. Yao Lao is a Ban Sheng.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":240,"title":"Xiao Yan, Dou Sheng","summary":"The Profound River Alliance under Old Demon Tian Ming attacks the Xing Realm, the home of the Falling Star Pavilion. Tian Ming brings in the Hall of Souls: Gu You and the Third Tianzun, a Ban Sheng, who want Xiao Yan taken alive. Yao Lao opens a Soul Space to fight Tian Ming and Gu You together. Medusa, Little Fairy Doctor and Qing Lin try to delay the Third Tianzun, while Feng Xian and the elders hold the protection formation. The formation falls, Yao Lao is worn down, and the enemy closes in for the kill. Then the space is sealed by a Dou Sheng's power: Xiao Yan comes out of seclusion. He thinks back on his father, his master and his friends, and stands as a Dou Sheng.","events":["The Profound River Alliance attacks the Xing Realm formation.","Old Demon Tian Ming calls in the Hall of Souls: Gu You and the Third Tianzun.","Yao Lao opens a Soul Space against Tian Ming and Gu You.","Medusa, Little Fairy Doctor and Qing Lin hold off the Third Tianzun.","The protection formation breaks; the enemy uses the Nine Heavenly Lightning Prison Formation.","Yao Lao is cornered; Mu Qing Luan and Tian Huo Zun Zhe are hurt.","The space is sealed by a Dou Sheng; Xiao Yan emerges from seclusion.","Xiao Yan reflects on what strength means and stands as a Dou Sheng."],"introduced":["Third Tianzun","Soul Space","Ten Thousand Soul Heavenly Lock","Nine Heavenly Lightning Prison Formation","Ancient Sky Serpent Guardian"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan breaks through to Dou Sheng. The Third Tianzun is a Ban Sheng. Old Demon Tian Ming is called an advanced Ban Sheng.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":241,"title":"The Profound River Alliance Falls","summary":"Xiao Yan, now a One-Star Dou Sheng, turns the battle at the Xing Realm with the Angry Buddha Reincarnation. Old Demon Tian Ming begs for mercy, then blows himself up with a Ban Sheng Explosion, and Xiao Yan drives his soul out of the body it tries to hide in. A Hun Clan Dou Sheng appears to rescue Gu You and the others, warns that Xiao Yan's father is still a Hun Clan prisoner, and tells him to come to the Realm of Souls. Xiao Yan then goes to Tian Bei City, where the Wind Lightning Northern Pavilion is holding the Han Clan hostage with lightning seals. He saves Han Yue and her family and kills Fei Tian for the 28 Falling Star Pavilion members his pavilion killed. He offers the Han Clan the Northern Region and names the Profound Sky Sect and Ice River Valley as next.","events":["Xiao Yan beats the Ban Shengs with the Angry Buddha Reincarnation.","Old Demon Tian Ming self-destructs; Xiao Yan crushes his soul.","Xiao Yan stops Gu You from fleeing.","A Hun Clan Dou Sheng rescues the Hall of Souls survivors and taunts Xiao Yan about his father.","Wind Lightning Pavilion holds the Han Clan in Tian Bei City.","Xiao Yan arrives and frees the hostages.","Fei Tian is killed for the Falling Star Pavilion's dead.","Xiao Yan gives the Han Clan the Northern Region and vows to face the Profound Sky Sect and Ice River Valley."],"introduced":["Angry Buddha Reincarnation","Ban Sheng Explosion","Hun Clan Dou Sheng (unnamed)","lightning seals"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan is a One-Star Dou Sheng; he was a peak Ninth Turn Dou Zun two years earlier.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":242,"title":"Seeking Allies","summary":"With the Profound River Alliance destroyed, the Falling Star Pavilion asks three powers to ally against the Hall of Souls. The Hall of Souls' Deputy Leader, a Three-Star Dou Sheng, plans to keep Xiao Yan from growing stronger. At Burning Flame Valley, the ailing Flaming Cloud Ancestor, a One-Star Dou Sheng, agrees to join after Xiao Yan promises to cure him either way. At the Flower Sect, just raided by the Hall of Souls, the Grand Elder Qing Xianzi blames Yao Lao and gives three days to decide. At the Pill Tower, Yao Lao and Xiao Yan learn the alliance lacks votes on the Elder's Council. Xiao Yan enters the selection for a new Small Pill Tower elder against Old Demon Hou, an eight-tier alchemist, and the contest begins before Grand Elder Lin.","events":["The Hall of Souls' Deputy Leader plans to hold Xiao Yan back.","The Flaming Cloud Ancestor meets Xiao Yan and agrees to join the alliance.","Yao Lao finds the Flower Sect hurt by a Hall of Souls raid.","Qing Xianzi blames Yao Lao and gives three days to decide.","At the Pill Tower, the alliance is short of votes on the Elder's Council.","Xiao Yan is put forward for the vacant Small Pill Tower elder seat.","Old Demon Hou meets Yao Lao again and accepts the challenge.","Grand Elder Lin opens the elder selection."],"introduced":["Deputy Leader of the Hall of Souls","Flaming Cloud Ancestor","Qing Xianzi","Small Pill Tower","Elder's Council","Old Demon Hou","Grand Elder Lin","Uncle Xuan"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan is a One-Star Dou Sheng and an eight-tier alchemist. The Hall of Souls' Deputy Leader is a Three-Star Dou Sheng. The Flaming Cloud Ancestor is a One-Star Dou Sheng. Qing Xianzi is a Ban Sheng. Grand Elder Lin is a Two-Star Dou Sheng. Yao Lao is a Ban Sheng.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":243,"title":"The Elder Selection","summary":"In the Small Pill Tower's elder selection, Old Demon Hou refines the Flame Demon Quiet Mysterious Pill by the book, while Xiao Yan uses his fused Heavenly Flames as a cauldron and doubles the herbs of the Bodhisattva Pill. Old Demon Hou, who still resents Yao Lao for winning the Pill Gathering with shortcuts, draws a nine-colored thundercloud. Xiao Yan refines each herb separately, then forms the pill with fire and holds it in a fire dragon. His pill draws the Black Demon Lightning, and he takes it head-on as a One-Star Dou Sheng, with help from his Sky Demon Puppet. The pill takes human form, a Ninth-Tier Treasure Pill: the Great Bodhisattva Return Pill, which doubles the chance of breaking through to Ban Sheng. Grand Elder Lin declares Xiao Yan the winner and a new elder of the Small Pill Tower.","events":["Old Demon Hou and Xiao Yan start the elder selection in the Small Pill Tower.","Xiao Yan uses four fused Heavenly Flames as a cauldron and doubles the herbs.","Old Demon Hou refines the Flame Demon Quiet Mysterious Pill.","Old Demon Hou's pill draws a nine-colored thundercloud.","Xiao Yan forms his pill with a fire dragon, a rare technique.","His pill draws the Black Demon Lightning, which he takes head-on.","The Great Bodhisattva Return Pill, a Ninth-Tier Treasure Pill, takes human form.","Grand Elder Lin declares Xiao Yan the winner."],"introduced":["Flame Demon Quiet Mysterious Pill","Great Bodhisattva Return Pill","Ninth-Tier Treasure Pill","Black Demon Lightning","Pill Lightning","Hou Qing (Old Demon Hou's name)"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan is an early-stage One-Star Dou Sheng.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":244,"title":"The Sky Mansion Alliance","summary":"Xiao Yan takes his seat in the Small Pill Tower and argues that neutrality has not protected the world's alchemists. The council votes seven for, one against and one abstaining, so the Pill Tower joins the alliance. Three days later the Flaming Cloud Ancestor, Grand Elder Lin and Qing Xianzi meet at the Falling Star Pavilion, and Yao Lao is chosen alliance chief. They name it the Sky Mansion Alliance, to overshadow the Hall of Souls. The Hall of Souls' Deputy Hall Chief appears as a shadow clone and threatens Xiao Zhan for the jade of Tuo She Gu Di, but Xiao Yan refuses and swears to come for the Hall of Souls and the Hun Clan. With the Purifying Demonic Lotus Flame due in nine months, Yao Lao sends Xiao Yan and Medusa to the Nine Serene Spring for the Spring Blood Crystal and energy for her to evolve.","events":["Xiao Yan joins the Small Pill Tower council and argues against neutrality.","The vote passes seven to one with one abstention; the Pill Tower joins.","The Flaming Cloud Ancestor, Grand Elder Lin and Qing Xianzi arrive at the Falling Star Pavilion.","Yao Lao is chosen chief; the alliance is named the Sky Mansion Alliance.","The Hall of Souls' Deputy Hall Chief appears as a shadow clone and threatens Xiao Zhan.","Xiao Yan refuses to hand over the Tuo She Gu Di jade.","The alliance grows across the Central Plains.","Yao Lao plans the trip to the Nine Serene Spring and the Nine Yin Yellow Spring Pill."],"introduced":["Sky Mansion Alliance","Intelligence Hall","Nine Serene Spring","Nine Serene Deep Ground Pythons","Nine Yin Yellow Spring Pill","Spring Blood Crystal"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan calls himself a One-Star Dou Sheng. Xun Er is in seclusion and may reach Dou Sheng. Medusa could reach Ban Sheng with enough energy and evolve into a Nine-Colored Heaven Swallowing Python.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":245,"title":"The prisoner under the Nine Serene Spring","summary":"Xiao Yan leads Medusa, Little Fairy Doctor and Qing Lin underground into the territory of the Nine Serene Deep Ground Pythons, looking for the Nine Serene Spring. He dives into the freezing spring alone to find the Spring Blood Crystal while Medusa tries to cultivate near its edge, and the pythons soon raise the alarm. At the bottom he finds Yao Ming, a Two-Star Dou Sheng held by chains that drain his Dou Qi. Yao Ming says he is the rightful python chief, sealed there centuries ago by his younger brother Yao Xiaotian, and he offers the last Spring Blood Crystal in return for his freedom. Xiao Yan agrees only after Yao Ming lets him plant a soul mark that can be detonated if he lies. Xiao Yan takes the crystal and uses his soul power to break the Yellow Spring Yin Rock that powers the chains. Far away, Yao Xiaotian feels the seal break and sets out with his First Elder.","events":["Xiao Yan's group sneaks past the palace of the Nine Serene Deep Ground Pythons.","Xiao Yan dives into the Nine Serene Spring and fights off the creatures inside.","Medusa tries to cultivate in the cold, and the pythons discover the intruders.","At the bottom Xiao Yan finds Yao Ming, chained and drained of Dou Qi.","Yao Ming tells how Yao Xiaotian poisoned him, sealed him and seized the chief's seat.","Xiao Yan plants a soul mark on Yao Ming and receives the Spring Blood Crystal.","Xiao Yan breaks the Yellow Spring Yin Rock and frees Yao Ming.","Yao Xiaotian senses the broken seal; his First Elder goes to deal with it."],"introduced":["Nine Serene Deep Ground Pythons (palace and territory)","Nine Serene Spring (also called the Yellow Spring)","Spring Blood Crystal (Yellow Spring Blood Crystal)","Yao Ming","Yao Xiaotian","First Elder of the Nine Serene Deep Ground Pythons","Nine Serene Profound Scepter (the python chief's token)","Yellow Spring Yin Rock","Beast Region","soul mark"],"cultivation":"Yao Ming is a Two-Star Dou Sheng (name card; his own words). Yao Xiaotian is a One-Star Dou Sheng and the First Elder a peak One-Star Dou Sheng (name cards). No change for Xiao Yan.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":246,"title":"Yao Ming takes back his tribe","summary":"Yao Xiaotian reaches the Nine Serene Spring and badly hurts Little Fairy Doctor and Qing Lin while Medusa holds him off. Xiao Yan returns and fights him alone, breaking the Yellow Spring Finger with the Great Heavenly Creation Palm and throwing off the Yellow Spring Grand Seal. The First Elder arrives, and Yao Xiaotian sends the guards away so he can silence everyone quietly. Then Yao Ming appears in front of the elders, and Elders Xian, Ming and Liu recognise him. He shows them the lost Nine Serene Profound Scepter and beats Yao Xiaotian himself, and Yao Xiaotian dies in a last attack. The First Elder leaves his body behind and flees with his demonic core inside an avatar.","events":["Yao Xiaotian injures Little Fairy Doctor and Qing Lin; Medusa fights him.","Xiao Yan arrives and fights Yao Xiaotian, a mid-stage One-Star Dou Sheng.","Xiao Yan beats the Yellow Spring Finger and the Yellow Spring Grand Seal.","The First Elder arrives; Yao Xiaotian sends the Serene Python Guards away.","Yao Ming appears and Elders Xian, Ming and Liu side with him.","Yao Ming shows the Nine Serene Profound Scepter and the First Elder argues against him.","Yao Ming beats Yao Xiaotian, who dies hating his brother.","The First Elder escapes using Demonic Python Burst, hiding his core in an avatar."],"introduced":["Yellow Spring Finger (Tian Class Dou Skill)","Yellow Spring Grand Seal","Serene Python Guards","Elder Xian","Elder Ming","Elder Liu","Demonic Python Burst"],"cultivation":"Medusa calls Yao Xiaotian 'a One-Star mid-stage Dou Sheng'. Yao Xiaotian calls Yao Ming 'Two-Star Dou Sheng' when they fight. No change for Xiao Yan.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":247,"title":"The trial of Demonic Saint Huang Quan","summary":"Yao Ming is chief of the Nine Serene Deep Ground Pythons again, and Xiao Yan has the Spring Blood Crystal. Yao Ming shows him the secret stone tablet of Demonic Saint Huang Quan, an ancient Yellow Spring Great Saint who nearly became a Dou Di. Only a soul in the Heavenly Realm can enter it, so Yao Ming asks Xiao Yan to go in, offering to share the saint's essence blood and three Tian Class Dou Skills. Inside, Xiao Yan faces the Yellow Spring Finger, the Yellow Spring Palm and finally the saint's remnant, a peak Nine-Star Dou Sheng. He survives the Yellow Spring Divine Anger by forcing out his Heavenly Flame and drawing on the Bodhisattva Heart. Huang Quan accepts him and gives him his essence blood and inheritance. He asks Xiao Yan to find what he lacked to become a Dou Di.","events":["Yao Ming takes back control and keeps Elders Ming, Xian and Liu close.","Xiao Yan confirms he has the Spring Blood Crystal; Yao Ming calls him a friend.","A flashback shows young Yao Ming and Yao Xiaotian racing as brothers.","Yao Ming reveals Demonic Saint Huang Quan's stone tablet and its secrets.","He offers essence blood and three Tian Class Dou Skills if Xiao Yan opens it.","Inside the tablet Xiao Yan fights through the Yellow Spring Finger and Yellow Spring Palm.","Huang Quan's remnant attacks him with the Yellow Spring Divine Anger.","Xiao Yan endures it and receives the saint's essence blood and inheritance."],"introduced":["Demonic Saint Huang Quan (Yellow Spring Great Saint)","stone tablet of Demonic Saint Huang Quan","Yellow Spring Palm (Tian Class Medium Rank)","Yellow Spring Divine Anger (Tian Class High Rank; Huang Quan's ultimate technique)","Yellow Spring Anger","essence blood","Emperor Realm (soul realm above the Heavenly Realm)"],"cultivation":"Huang Quan's remnant is a 'peak Nine-Star Dou Sheng' (name card) and says he had reached the Emperor Realm of the soul. He calls Xiao Yan's soul 'Late-stage Heavenly Realm'. No Dou Qi change for Xiao Yan.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":248,"title":"North Dragon Island's envoy","summary":"Xiao Yan comes out of Demonic Saint Huang Quan's stone tablet unhurt, then catches an envoy from North Dragon Island at the pythons' border. The envoy admits that the North, West and South Dragon Islands have joined against East Dragon Island, where a new Dragon Emperor has risen. The Northern Dragon King sent him with Ancient Celestial Serpent essence blood to win over the pythons, and the Heaven Demon Phoenix Tribe has been asked to join too. Xiao Yan shares Huang Quan's essence blood with everyone and keeps a drop for Yao Lao. He tells Yao Ming the new Dragon Emperor is Zi Yan and asks him to stay out of the war, but Yao Ming offers to fight beside him. They plan to ambush the Heaven Demon Phoenix Tribe. Medusa stays to cultivate in the Nine Serene Spring, and Xiao Yan gives her a ninth-tier pill before he leaves.","events":["Xiao Yan leaves the stone tablet with Huang Quan's inheritance.","He senses Void Ancient Dragons and wonders whether Zi Yan is in trouble.","He captures an envoy from North Dragon Island and makes him talk.","The envoy reveals the three Dragon Islands' war on East Dragon Island and the phoenix alliance.","Yao Ming reorganises the tribe and recalls the Rock Scale and Green Leaf Python tribes.","Xiao Yan shares the essence blood and learns Yao Ming had been offered a dragon alliance.","Yao Ming agrees to help Xiao Yan stop the Heaven Demon Phoenix Tribe.","Medusa starts cultivating in the spring; Xiao Yan gives her the Bodhi Great Elixir."],"introduced":["North Dragon Island envoy (a commander)","Ancient Celestial Serpent essence blood","Rock Scale Python tribe","Green Leaf Python tribe","Bodhi Great Elixir (ninth-tier pill)","Nine Serene Python Guards"],"cultivation":"Yao Ming says he is now 'at the late stage of a two-star Dou Sheng' and expects to reach Three-Star within three years. Xiao Yan says the drop he keeps for Yao Lao should raise him to One-Star Dou Sheng.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":249,"title":"Ambushing the Three Phoenixes","summary":"Xiao Yan refines the essence blood of Demonic Saint Huang Quan over three days and comes out at the late stage of One-Star Dou Sheng. Yao Ming reports that the Heaven Demon Phoenix Tribe has set out for East Dragon Island under the Three Phoenixes, three Supreme Elders who are each Dou Sheng. Xiao Yan says goodbye to Medusa, who is still cultivating deep in the Nine Serene Spring. The phoenix fleet waits on purpose so the Void Ancient Dragons will wear each other down. Xiao Yan ambushes it, and Yao Ming reveals himself beside him. Two of the Three Phoenixes recognise Xiao Yan as the boy who stole the Bodhisattva Seeds. Their eldest sister sends Kun Huang and Ying Huang against Xiao Yan and takes on Yao Ming herself.","events":["Xiao Yan refines the Demon Saint's essence blood for three days.","He reaches the late stage of One-Star Dou Sheng.","Yao Ming reports the phoenix force and its three Dou Sheng leaders.","Yao Ming agrees to join the interception with several elders.","Xiao Yan says goodbye to Medusa, who stays in the spring.","The phoenix Supreme Elder holds the warships back to let the dragons bleed.","Xiao Yan attacks the fleet; Yao Ming appears beside him.","Kun Huang and Ying Huang face Xiao Yan while their eldest sister faces Yao Ming."],"introduced":["Three Phoenixes (the Heaven Demon Phoenix Tribe's three Supreme Elders)","Kun Huang","Ying Huang","Phoenix Elder (eldest of the Three Phoenixes)","Dragon-Phoenix bloodline"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan rises from early to late-stage One-Star Dou Sheng by refining Huang Quan's essence blood ('He actually reached the late stage of a one-star Dou Sheng!'). Each of the Three Phoenixes is a Dou Sheng; together they are said to equal a Three-Star Dou Sheng.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":250,"title":"Hostages from the Heaven Demon Phoenix Tribe","summary":"Before the battle, the Phoenix Elder tells Jiu Feng that this war is the Heaven Demon Phoenix Tribe's chance to rise above the Void Ancient Dragons. In the fight, Xiao Yan takes on Kun Huang and Ying Huang together and shocks them with the Great Heavenly Creation Palm and the Yellow Spring Palm. Yao Ming's elders capture Jiu Feng, and Xiao Yan seals both Supreme Elders and threatens to crush their cores. The Phoenix Elder threatens to self-destruct, then gives in and promises the tribe will stay out of the dragons' war. Xiao Yan keeps Jiu Feng, Kun Huang and Ying Huang as hostages until the war ends, and the pythons take them away. Then Xiao Yan and Yao Ming head for East Dragon Island.","events":["The Phoenix Elder tells Jiu Feng the war will decide the tribe's rise.","Kun Huang and Ying Huang attack Xiao Yan together.","Xiao Yan beats their attack with Heaven-Rank Dou Skills.","Yao Ming's elders capture Jiu Feng.","Xiao Yan defeats and seals the two Supreme Elders.","He threatens to kill one person every ten breaths.","The Phoenix Elder promises the tribe will stay out of the dragons' war.","Xiao Yan keeps three hostages and heads for East Dragon Island."],"introduced":["Demonic Phoenix Bell (a Dou Zun-level defence)","Kun Huang Devoured (Kun Huang's attack)","Demon Phoenix essence blood"],"cultivation":"No breakthroughs. Xiao Yan is called a One-Star Dou Sheng by Kun Huang.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":251,"title":"The siege of East Dragon Island","summary":"Hei Qing and Zhu Li, elders of East Dragon Island, were lured away and come back to find the island sealed by warships from the three other Dragon Islands. They fight Qian Xuan of West Dragon Island and Huo Zhan of North Dragon Island, both Ban Sheng, and Hei Qing burns his own life force to hold them back. Xiao Yan feels through the dragon bloodline in his body that Zi Yan is in danger, and he arrives in time to save Hei Qing. He catches Huo Zhan, and Yao Ming captures Qian Xuan and declares himself on East Dragon Island's side. Hei Qing says the Dragon Palace is locked down and Zi Yan is surrounded by the three Dragon Kings. Inside the island, Elder Qingshan holds out against the attackers. Xiao Yan's group breaks through toward the barrier around the Dragon Palace.","events":["Hei Qing and Zhu Li find East Dragon Island sealed off.","They fight Qian Xuan and Huo Zhan, both Ban Sheng, at the island's entrance.","Hei Qing burns his life force to let Zhu Li go ahead.","Xiao Yan senses Zi Yan's danger and rushes in.","He saves Hei Qing and captures Huo Zhan; Yao Ming captures Qian Xuan.","Hei Qing explains the Dragon Palace is sealed and Zi Yan is besieged.","Elder Qingshan resists the three Dragon Islands' men on the island.","Xiao Yan's group reaches the barrier around the Dragon Palace."],"introduced":["Qian Xuan (West Dragon Island elder)","Huo Zhan (North Dragon Island elder)","Elder Qingshan (East Dragon Island)","Dragon Palace (East Dragon Island)","Dragon Tomb"],"cultivation":"Qian Xuan and Huo Zhan are called Ban Sheng ('They are all semi-saints'; 'a semi-saint powerhouse from North Dragon Island'). Hei Qing is called 'A mere eighth-level Dou Zun' by an enemy.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":252,"title":"Zi Yan against the three Dragon Kings","summary":"Xiao Yan fights through North Dragon Island's men and leaves the rest to Yao Ming and the others so he can reach Zi Yan. Inside the Dragon Palace, Zi Yan fights the Northern, Western and Southern Dragon Kings alone, and they demand her throne and her Dragon-Phoenix bloodline. She calls them usurpers who split the Void Ancient Dragons for their own gain. When she isolates the space to gather power, the Dragon Kings attack the clansmen below, forcing her to spread her strength to shield them. Xiao Yan arrives as they close in, and Zi Yan asks for the time an incense stick takes to burn to ready her trump card. Xiao Yan holds off the three Dragon Kings, each a Three-Star Dou Sheng, hurting their souls with the Yellow Spring Divine Anger and burning them with the Extermination Fire Lotus. Their dragon bodies are too tough to kill.","events":["Xiao Yan breaks past North Dragon Island's guards; his allies hold the rest.","Zi Yan fights the three Dragon Kings in the Dragon Palace.","The Dragon Kings demand her throne and Dragon-Phoenix bloodline.","Zi Yan seals off the space to build up her power.","The Dragon Kings attack their own clansmen; Zi Yan shields them.","Xiao Yan arrives and tells them the phoenixes have gone home.","Zi Yan asks for time to prepare her trump card.","Xiao Yan hits the Dragon Kings with soul attacks and the Fire Lotus."],"introduced":["Northern Dragon King","Western Dragon King","Southern Dragon King","Dragon-Phoenix physique","dragon monument"],"cultivation":"The three Dragon Kings are 'all three-star Dou Saints' (Three-Star Dou Sheng). Zi Yan calls Xiao Yan a One-Star Dou Sheng.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":253,"title":"The Dragon Slayer Sword","summary":"The three Dragon Kings take their true dragon forms and nearly kill Xiao Yan, and the Bodhisattva Heart keeps him alive. Zi Yan then draws the Dragon Slayer Sword, and the island's elders see it as proof that she is the true Dragon Emperor. Many of the three islands' soldiers kneel to her. Her sword nearly kills the Western Dragon King but drains her life force, and the three Dragon Kings flee. Xiao Yan spends a hundred days in seclusion healing. He comes out a Two-Star Dou Sheng, with Dragon-Phoenix bloodline power in his body and a body as tough as a Void Ancient Dragon's. News from Yao Lao calls him back to the Falling Star Pavilion because the Purifying Demonic Lotus Flame is about to appear, and Zi Yan says she will come too.","events":["The three Dragon Kings reveal their true forms and attack Xiao Yan.","Xiao Yan fights back with Buddha's Wrathful Rebirth and the Yellow Spring Divine Anger.","He is nearly killed and survives through the Bodhisattva Heart.","Zi Yan summons the Dragon Slayer Sword and the dragons hail her as Dragon Emperor.","Her sword wounds the Western Dragon King; the Dragon Kings flee.","Zi Yan orders Elder Qingshan to handle the dragons who stayed.","Xiao Yan heals for a hundred days and breaks through to Two-Star Dou Sheng.","Yao Lao sends word to return to the Falling Star Pavilion; Zi Yan joins him."],"introduced":["Dragon Slayer Sword","Buddha's Wrathful Rebirth","Dragon Emperor Bell"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan breaks through from One-Star to Two-Star Dou Sheng after a hundred days of healing, helped by Dragon-Phoenix bloodline power ('Two-Star Dou Sheng / Xiao Yan, you've advanced!'). He says his body is now comparable to a Void Ancient Dragon's. The three Dragon Kings are Three-Star Dou Sheng.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":254,"title":"Back to the Falling Star Pavilion","summary":"Xiao Yan asks Yao Ming to return Jiu Feng to the Heaven Demon Phoenix Tribe and keep the two Supreme Elders, and Zi Yan leaves her elders to run East Dragon Island so she can go with him. At the Falling Star Pavilion, the Sky Mansion Alliance leaders report that the Hall of Souls has attacked half of the alliance's 300 key cities and broken many wormholes. Yao Lao decides to stop defending and strike a Hall of Souls branch first. The Intelligence Hall has learned that the Hall of Souls has Heaven, Earth and Human Halls, and only the Human Hall has been found. Xiao Yan comes back a Two-Star Dou Sheng and gives Yao Lao a drop of Demonic Saint Huang Quan's essence blood. Deep in the Nine Serene Spring, Medusa meets the soul of the Nine-Colored Heaven Swallowing Python ancestor. Xiao Yan, Yao Lao and Zi Yan reach the hidden stone gate of the Human Hall and go in to wipe it out.","events":["Xiao Yan and Yao Ming part; Jiu Feng is to be sent back to the phoenixes.","Zi Yan hands East Dragon Island to her elders and goes with Xiao Yan.","The alliance meets at the Falling Star Pavilion about the Hall of Souls' raids.","Yao Lao chooses to attack a Hall of Souls branch first.","Xiao Yan returns as a Two-Star Dou Sheng and introduces Zi Yan as the Dragon Emperor.","He gives Yao Lao a drop of Huang Quan's essence blood.","Medusa meets the soul of the Nine-Colored Heaven Swallowing Python ancestor.","Xiao Yan, Yao Lao and Zi Yan enter the Human Hall."],"introduced":["Heaven Hall, Earth Hall and Human Hall of the Hall of Souls","24 Earth Fiend Halls","Intelligence Hall (Sky Mansion Alliance)","Nine-Colored Heaven Swallowing Python ancestor (soul)"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan is a Two-Star Dou Sheng ('two star Dou Sheng / just half a year / He actually advanced from the initial stage of a one star Dou Sheng to a two star Dou Sheng'). Zi Yan is recognised as a Four-Star Dou Sheng.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":255,"title":"Raid on the Human Hall","summary":"Yao Lao has reached One-Star Dou Sheng with Demonic Saint Huang Quan's essence blood, and he leads Xiao Yan and Zi Yan into the Hall of Souls' Human Hall while Zi Yan seals the space. There Yao Lao settles his old score with Mu Gu, the man who once pushed Han Feng to betray him. Xiao Yan takes the Sea Heart Flame and says it lets him form a true Five-Colored Extermination Fire Lotus. The First Tianzun arrives and offers Xiao Yan a place in the Hall of Souls, which he refuses. The First Tianzun feeds the origins of the dead into his Bone Emperor Blade, a soul-cutting knife made from the bones of ten thousand people, and breaks through the Six Joint Body Flowing Ruler. Xiao Yan answers with the Yellow Spring Divine Anger, the Yellow Spring Finger and the Yellow Spring Palm. As the fight ends, the Deputy Hall Master of the Hall of Souls arrives.","events":["Yao Lao, now a One-Star Dou Sheng, leads the raid on the Human Hall.","Xiao Yan, Yao Lao and Zi Yan cut through the hall's guards.","Yao Lao finds Mu Gu and settles their old grudge.","Xiao Yan takes the Sea Heart Flame.","The First Tianzun offers Xiao Yan a place, then attacks with the Bone Emperor Blade.","The blade breaks the Six Joint Body Flowing Ruler.","Xiao Yan strikes back with the Yellow Spring Divine Anger, Finger and Palm.","The Deputy Hall Master of the Hall of Souls appears."],"introduced":["Human Hall (Hall of Souls branch)","First Tianzun (Great Tianzun)","Bone Emperor Blade","Bone Emperor Split Sky","Five-Colored Extermination Fire Lotus","Origin (the essence the Hall of Souls collects from the dead)"],"cultivation":"Yao Lao breaks through to One-Star Dou Sheng with Huang Quan's essence blood (recap; Mu Gu: 'Yao Chen, you've actually reached the Dou Sheng level!'). Xiao Yan gains a fifth Heavenly Flame, the Sea Heart Flame.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":256,"title":"The Soul Origin","summary":"The Deputy Hall Master of the Hall of Souls, a Three-Star Dou Sheng, arrives after Xiao Yan kills the First Tianzun. He threatens Xiao Zhan, and Xiao Yan warns that he will give the Tuoshe Ancient Jade to the Gu Clan if his father is hurt. The Deputy Hall Master overpowers Xiao Yan and Yao Lao, but Zi Yan breaks into the sealed space and drives him off. Xiao Yan frees the prisoners and finds the Soul Origin at the bottom of a pool, gathered from millions of people the Hall of Souls killed. He refines it for two months, and his soul reaches the peak of the Heavenly Realm. On a soul journey he finds where the Purifying Demonic Lotus Flame will appear, and Hun Miesheng, Hall Master of the Hall of Souls, attacks him there. An unknown powerhouse steps in to stop Hun Miesheng.","events":["The Deputy Hall Master arrives and punishes his men for losing the Human Hall.","He threatens Xiao Zhan; Xiao Yan threatens to give the Tuoshe Ancient Jade to the Gu Clan.","The Deputy Hall Master, a Three-Star Dou Sheng, overpowers Xiao Yan and Yao Lao.","Zi Yan breaks into the sealed space and drives him off.","Xiao Yan frees the prisoners and finds the Soul Origin in a pool.","The alliance celebrates its first victory over the Hall of Souls.","Two months later Xiao Yan's soul reaches the peak of the Heavenly Realm.","On a soul journey he meets Hun Miesheng, and an unknown powerhouse saves him."],"introduced":["Soul Origin","Hun Miesheng (Hall Master of the Hall of Souls)","the unknown powerhouse at the Demon Flame's site","Two moons, nine stars (the omen of the Demon Flame)"],"cultivation":"The Deputy Hall Master is a Three-Star Dou Sheng ('He's already a three-star Dou Sheng.'). Xiao Yan's soul reaches the peak of the Heavenly Realm after refining the Soul Origin ('This kid has already reached the peak of the Heavenly Realm.').","confidence":"high"},{"ep":257,"title":"The ancient clans gather","summary":"Xiao Yan shows Yao Lao a soul avatar that looks exactly like him, and Yao Lao gives him the Nine Yin Yellow Spring Pill he made with Elder Lin. When the Purifying Demonic Lotus Flame emerges, Xiao Yan, Yao Lao and Zi Yan set out, while Little Fairy Doctor and Qing Lin stay in seclusion. At the scorched mountains they meet Hun Miesheng and Hun Feng, a Two-Star Dou Sheng who is set to be the next Hun Clan chief. Huo Xuan and Elder Huoyao of the Yan Clan greet Xiao Yan, and Xun Er arrives with Gu Qing Yang and Elder Gu Nanhai of the Gu Clan. Xun Er explains that the ancient clans only sent fighters below peak Five-Star Dou Sheng because of their rules. Then the Medicine Clan arrives with Yao Wangui, who banished Yao Lao, and its prodigy Yao Tian, who mocks Yao Lao. Xiao Yan uses his soul avatar and his Heavenly Realm soul to slap Yao Tian in front of everyone.","events":["Xiao Yan shows Yao Lao his new soul avatar.","Yao Lao gives him the Nine Yin Yellow Spring Pill, made with Elder Lin.","The Purifying Demonic Lotus Flame emerges; Xiao Yan, Yao Lao and Zi Yan set out.","Hun Miesheng and Hun Feng discuss killing Xiao Yan.","Huo Xuan and Elder Huoyao of the Yan Clan greet Xiao Yan.","Xun Er arrives with Gu Qing Yang and Elder Gu Nanhai.","Xun Er warns Xiao Yan about Hun Feng and explains the five-star limit.","Yao Wangui and Yao Tian of the Medicine Clan mock Yao Lao, and Xiao Yan slaps Yao Tian."],"introduced":["soul avatar","Nine Yin Yellow Spring Pill (ninth-tier)","Tides of Heaven and Earth","Hun Feng","Huo Xuan","Elder Huoyao","Yan Clan","Eight Desolations Annihilation Flame","Fire Cloud Water Flame (16th on the Heavenly Flame ranking)","Gu Nanhai","Medicine Clan","Yao Wangui (Punishment Administrator)","Yao Tian","Clan Monument (Medicine Clan)","Spirit Clan (its disappearance)"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan's soul is at the Great Perfection of the Heavenly Realm ('Late Heaven Realm Grand Perfection!'). Hun Feng is a Two-Star Dou Sheng. Huo Xuan is called 'high-tier Half-Saint'. Yao Tian's soul is at the late Heavenly Realm.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":258,"title":"Inside the Demon Flame's realm","summary":"Yao Tian attacks Xiao Yan with the Turtle Spirit Earth Flame, 13th on the Heavenly Flame ranking, and loses. Yao Wangui steps in, Xun Er's side warns him off, and Yao Lao swears to carve his parents' names onto the Medicine Clan's Clan Monument. The seal breaks, and everyone enters the Purifying Demonic Lotus Flame's space and is scattered. In an illusion, Hun Miesheng seems to hold Xiao Zhan hostage, but Xiao Yan breaks out, wakes Yao Lao and finds Xun Er and the others. They learn the Demon Flame can now use the Nightmare Heaven Mist, the signature technique of the Pure Lotus Demon Saint, and self-detonating Fire Slaves drive them into a grand hall. There a Four-Star Dou Sheng Fire Slave who still has some of his own mind attacks, and Zi Yan and the others drive him back with the Dragon Emperor's Void Spear and the Heaven-Shattering Seal. Xiao Yan then sees the Xiao clan crest on him.","events":["Yao Tian attacks with the Turtle Spirit Earth Flame and loses to Xiao Yan.","Yao Wangui steps in and the Gu Clan side warns him off.","Yao Lao swears to put his parents' names on the Medicine Clan's Clan Monument.","The seal breaks and the groups are scattered inside the flame's space.","Xiao Yan breaks an illusion of Hun Miesheng threatening Xiao Zhan.","The group learns of the Nightmare Heaven Mist and the Pure Lotus Demon Saint.","Fire Slaves drive them into a grand hall.","A Four-Star Dou Sheng Fire Slave attacks and bears the Xiao clan crest."],"introduced":["Turtle Spirit Earth Flame (13th on the Heavenly Flame ranking)","Nightmare Heaven Mist","Pure Lotus Demon Saint","Fire Slaves","Dragon Emperor's Void Spear","Heaven-Shattering Seal","Xiao clan crest"],"cultivation":"The Fire Slave in the hall is a Four-Star Dou Sheng ('Four-Star Martial Saint / This is also a fire slave.'). No change for Xiao Yan.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":259,"title":"Ancestor Xiao Chen","summary":"The Fire Slave bearing the Xiao clan crest stops fighting, and Xiao Yan helps him remember that he is Xiao Chen of the Blood Axe, cousin of Xiao Xuan. Xiao Yan tells him that Xiao Xuan pooled most of the clan's bloodline to try for Dou Di, failed, and was then struck down by the Hun Clan. Xiao Chen is still partly controlled by the Purifying Demonic Lotus Flame, but he leads the group toward it. The Demon Flame traps them in the Nightmare Heavenly Mist, and Xiao Yan breaks it with the Seal of Nightmare-Shattering, which also frees the other clans' groups. The true Purifying Demonic Lotus Flame appears with ten Fire Slaves, all One-Star to Three-Star Dou Sheng. Its own strength equals a peak Five-Star Dou Sheng. Hun Miesheng proposes a truce to fight it, and the Stone Clan and the Medicine Clan agree.","events":["The Fire Slave sees the Xiao clan crest and stops.","Xiao Yan helps him recall that he is Xiao Chen of the Blood Axe.","Xiao Yan tells him how Xiao Xuan fell to the Hun Clan.","Xiao Chen leads the group to the Demon Flame.","The Demon Flame traps them in the Nightmare Heavenly Mist.","Xiao Yan breaks the illusion with the Seal of Nightmare-Shattering.","The true Purifying Demonic Lotus Flame appears with ten Dou Sheng Fire Slaves.","Hun Miesheng proposes a truce; the Stone Clan and Medicine Clan agree."],"introduced":["Xiao Chen of the Blood Axe","Xiao Xuan's cousin","Celestial Tomb (where a fragment of Xiao Xuan's soul was kept)","Seal of Nightmare-Shattering","Demon Fire Illusion","Stone Clan"],"cultivation":"The Purifying Demonic Lotus Flame equals 'a peak Five-Star Martial Saint' and can hold its own against a Six-Star. Its ten Fire Slaves range from One-Star to Three-Star Dou Sheng. No change for Xiao Yan.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":260,"title":"Seven Dou Sheng against the Demon Flame","summary":"Hun Miesheng proposes that everyone of Four-Star Dou Sheng or above fight the Purifying Demonic Lotus Flame while the rest take on its ten Fire Slaves. Xiao Chen cannot join, because near the flame Xiao Yan's seal on him would fail, so Xiao Yan tells him to hide. Seven Four-Star Dou Sheng attack the Demon Flame, which calls itself born of heaven and earth and refuses to be tamed. Xiao Yan's group takes on a late Three-Star and an early Two-Star Dou Sheng Fire Slave. Seeing that the Fire Slaves weaken when their flames leave them, Xiao Yan uses the energy of the light orb he found earlier and takes control of one. The Demon Flame tries to blow itself up, and Hun Miesheng uses the Heavenly Net Refining Fire and starts the Heavenly Net Demon Sealing Formation to seal it.","events":["Hun Miesheng splits the fighters: Four-Star Dou Sheng and above against the Demon Flame, the rest against the Fire Slaves.","Xiao Chen stays hidden so the Demon Flame cannot take him back.","Seven Four-Star Dou Sheng attack the Purifying Demonic Lotus Flame.","Xiao Yan's group fights a late Three-Star and an early Two-Star Dou Sheng Fire Slave.","Xiao Yan uses the light orb's energy to take control of a Fire Slave.","The Demon Flame tries to self-destruct.","Hun Miesheng starts the Heavenly Net Demon Sealing Formation."],"introduced":["Great Compassion Hand","Fire Demon","Flame Divides Wave Ruler","Great Creation Palm","Heavenly Net Refining Fire","Heavenly Net Demon Sealing Formation"],"cultivation":"Seven Four-Star Dou Sheng fight the Demon Flame. Two Fire Slaves are a late-stage Three-Star and an early-stage Two-Star Dou Sheng. No change for Xiao Yan.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":261,"title":"The scramble for the Demon Flame","summary":"The Purifying Demonic Lotus Flame nearly breaks the Heavenly Net Demon-Sealing Array, but the seven Dou Sheng pour their essence blood into it and seal the flame. Hun Miesheng thanks everyone for saving the Central Plains, and the truce ends at once as every side grabs for the flame's source. Xiao Yan goes for the source while Xun Er and his allies hold the others back. Hun Feng blocks him with a strange power that devours fighting energy and even swallows his Five-Wheel Separated Fire. Xiao Yan answers with his soul avatar and the Yellow Spring Divine Anger, which Hun Feng cannot devour, and breaks him. At the heart of the flame Xiao Yan finds the source beating like a living heart. When Hun Miesheng comes for it, Xiao Yan tells him the Demon Flame is gone and throws a fire lotus at him instead.","events":["The Demon Flame strains against the array and nearly breaks it.","The seven Dou Sheng sacrifice essence blood and seal the flame.","Hun Miesheng thanks the others, and the truce collapses.","Xiao Yan goes for the Demon Flame's source while his allies hold off the rest.","Hun Feng fights Xiao Yan with a power that devours fighting energy.","Xiao Yan beats Hun Feng with his soul avatar and the Yellow Spring Divine Anger.","Xiao Yan reaches the living source of the Demon Flame.","Hun Miesheng attacks, and Xiao Yan turns on him with a fire lotus."],"introduced":["Demon Fire Source","Soul Wind (Hun Feng's attack)","Hun Feng's devouring power","Five-Wheel Separated Fire Technique","Five-Wheel Separated Fire Disk","Thunder Strike"],"confidence":"high"},{"ep":262,"title":"Hun Miesheng's hidden strength","summary":"Xiao Yan survives his own Extermination Fire Lotus blast with the Demon Flame's source, and Hun Miesheng reveals he has been hiding his strength as a Five-Star Dou Sheng. The others say this breaks the ancient clans' agreement, and Zi Yan and the rest cannot stop him. Xiao Chen, who has worn off the Hun Clan's mark, saves Xiao Yan and fights Hun Miesheng with his axe as a mid Five-Star Dou Sheng. The Soul Demon Elder of the Hun Clan arrives to back Hun Miesheng, and then the Pill Tower Ancestor appears, a Six-Star Dou Sheng whose true form is a pill and who had saved Xiao Yan from Hun Miesheng before. The ancestor reveals that the Demon Flame let itself be sealed to watch their plans, and the real flame emerges and starts the Refining Heaven Ancient Array to turn everyone into Fire Slaves. The Demon Flame space cannot be opened, so the ancestor and the others try to break the array from both sides. The remnant of the Pure Lotus Demon Saint asks for Xiao Yan's body, takes it, and greets the Demon Flame.","events":["Xiao Yan survives the fire lotus blast with the Demon Flame's source.","Hun Miesheng reveals he is a Five-Star Dou Sheng.","Xiao Chen, free of the Hun Clan's mark, fights Hun Miesheng.","The Soul Demon Elder joins Hun Miesheng.","The Pill Tower Ancestor, a Six-Star Dou Sheng, arrives and takes the source for safekeeping.","The real Demon Flame emerges and starts the Refining Heaven Ancient Array.","The group tries to break the array from its Heaven and Earth sides.","The Pure Lotus Demon Saint takes Xiao Yan's body and faces the Demon Flame."],"introduced":["Soul Extinction (Hun Miesheng's technique)","Three Axes to Break the Sky","Soul Burial Shield","Soul Demon Elder","Pill Tower Ancestor","Space relocation","Statue of the Demon Fire","Danrongtian","Refining Heaven Ancient Array","Refining Heaven into a Slave"],"cultivation":"Hun Miesheng is a Five-Star Dou Sheng. Xiao Chen is at mid Five-Star. The Pill Tower Ancestor is a Six-Star Dou Sheng. No change for Xiao Yan.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":263,"title":"The Demon Saint's farewell","summary":"The remnant of the Pure Lotus Demon Saint, which entered Xiao Yan's body when he gathered the map fragments, uses it to fight the Purifying Demonic Lotus Flame. He made the Refining Heaven Ancient Array himself and turns it against the flame, and everyone else flees the space before the flame erupts. Xun Er defies Gu Nanhai and the Gu Clan's rules and goes back to stay with Xiao Yan. The Demon Saint says he gave the flame its mind long ago and sealed it to calm its violence, then severs its memories and mind and vanishes with it as it begs for mercy. The Demon Flame's origin is left pure as a newborn, and with the space closed, Xiao Yan decides to refine it there with Xun Er. Outside, Zi Yan tells Gu Nanhai that the Dragon Seal is calm, so Xiao Yan must be alive. Inside a Flamefrost Grand Array, Xiao Yan refines the flame with the Flame Mantra and nearly dies until Xun Er joins in to help.","events":["The Pure Lotus Demon Saint fights the Demon Flame in Xiao Yan's body.","Everyone flees the Demon Flame space.","Xun Er leaves Gu Nanhai and goes back to Xiao Yan.","The Demon Saint erases the flame's mind and vanishes with it.","Xiao Yan decides to refine the pure Demon Flame origin inside the closed space.","Outside, the Gu Clan and the Hall of Souls count their losses; Zi Yan sends Gu Nanhai home.","Xiao Yan refines the flame inside the Flamefrost Grand Array with the Flame Mantra.","Xun Er joins in to help him refine it."],"introduced":["Jing Lian Yao Saint (the Pure Lotus Demon Saint's name in this track)","Demon Flame, World Annihilation","Demon Flame origin","Flamefrost Grand Array","Dragon Seal (Zi Yan's link to Xiao Yan)"],"cultivation":"No change for Xiao Yan. The recap at the start calls Hun Miesheng and Old Demon Hun (the Soul Demon Elder) five-star Dou Sheng and the Pill Tower Ancestor a six-star Dou Sheng.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":264,"title":"The Stone Clan vanishes, and Little Yi is born","summary":"The Stone Clan has vanished with its whole territory, just as the Spirit Clan did, and the Yan, Medicine and Thunder Clans form a Three-Clan Alliance that leaves out the Gu Clan and the Hun Clan. The Gu Clan elders decide to strengthen their defences rather than guess who is behind it. Hun Qianmo of the Hun Clan scolds Hun Miesheng for losing the Demon Flame and letting the Sky Mansion Alliance grow, warns that the sealed Demon Fire Desert is stirring, and gives him something from the clan to crush the alliance before Xiao Yan returns. After a year of war, the alliance gains another Dou Sheng, a woman who broke through with the Demon Saint's essence blood, and then the Hall of Souls declares a battle to the death on Fallen Mountain. In the Demon Flame space, Xiao Yan finishes refining the flame and finds all his Heavenly Flames gone. They come out as a small fire spirit that carries a hint of Xun Er's Golden Earth Burning Heaven Flame, can make ten Buddha's Wrath Fire Lotuses at once and obeys his thoughts. He names it Little Yi, and he and Xun Er head back.","events":["The Medicine Clan and others find the Stone Clan gone, like the Spirit Clan.","The Yan, Medicine and Thunder Clans form a Three-Clan Alliance.","The Gu Clan elders resolve to strengthen their defences.","Hun Qianmo visits Hun Miesheng with orders and a gift from the Hun Clan.","The Sky Mansion Alliance gains a new Dou Sheng.","The Hall of Souls declares a battle to the death on Fallen Mountain.","Xiao Yan finishes refining the Demon Flame and loses his Heavenly Flames.","The flames return as a fire spirit, which Xiao Yan names Little Yi."],"introduced":["Stone Clan's disappearance","Three-Clan Alliance (Yan, Medicine and Thunder Clans)","Thunder Clan","Medicine Realm","Hun Qianmo","Demon Fire Desert","Fallen Mountain","Little Yi (fire spirit)","Golden Earth Burning Heaven Flame"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan fully refines the Purifying Demonic Lotus Flame; his fused Heavenly Flames become a fire spirit, Little Yi. A woman of the alliance breaks through to Dou Sheng. No rank stated for Xiao Yan.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":265,"title":"The Young Alliance Master returns","summary":"Two years after the Demon Flame space closed, Xiao Yan and Xun Er come out. On the way Xiao Yan saves an outer squad of the Sky Mansion Alliance from a Hall of Souls attack while they carry Demon Fire Stones, and then wipes out a nearby Hall of Souls branch, held by a One-Star Dou Sheng, in one move. The squad learns he is the Young Alliance Master and tells him the Stone Clan and Spirit Clan have vanished and three clans have allied, and Xun Er leaves to check on the Gu Clan. At the alliance, the leaders fear Hun Qianmo, a Six-Star Dou Sheng of the Hun Clan who helped ambush Xiao Xuan, as well as Hun Miesheng and the Soul Demon Elder, because Zi Yan must stay on East Dragon Island. Xiao Yan walks in, says he will take on Hun Miesheng, and is welcomed home. He hears that Medusa is still in seclusion deep in the Nine Serene Spring, and he rallies the alliance to drive the Hall of Souls out of the Central Plains. Both sides gather at Fallen Mountain, the Hall of Souls with seven Dou Sheng and the alliance with ten.","events":["Xiao Yan and Xun Er leave the Demon Flame space after two years.","Xiao Yan saves an alliance squad carrying Demon Fire Stones.","He destroys a nearby Hall of Souls branch in one move.","Xun Er returns to the Gu Clan.","The alliance's leaders weigh the threat of Hun Qianmo.","Xiao Yan returns and offers to fight Hun Miesheng.","He hears that Medusa is still in the Nine Serene Spring.","The Hall of Souls and the alliance gather at Fallen Mountain."],"introduced":["Demon Fire Stones","Outer Alliance and Inner Alliance (Sky Mansion Alliance ranks)","Xuan Squad, Third Brigade","Young Alliance Master (Xiao Yan's title)","Peak of the Fallen (Fallen Mountain)"],"cultivation":"Hun Qianmo is a Six-Star Dou Sheng. A Hall of Souls branch is held by a One-Star Dou Sheng. No change for Xiao Yan.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":266,"title":"Two draws at Fallen Mountain","summary":"At Fallen Mountain, Hun Miesheng and Xiao Yan agree to settle the war with three matches, best of three, instead of a full-scale war. Xiao Chen confronts Hun Qianmo and mocks him as the man who once begged the Hun Clan chief for mercy. The Pill Tower Ancestor arrives, says the Pill Tower now stands with the Sky Mansion Alliance, and takes Hun Qianmo, a Six-Star Dou Sheng, into a separate space; their fight ends in a draw. In the second match Xiao Chen fights the Soul Demon Elder, who uses the Heavenly Demon Blood Gu and a Soul Gu Frog. Remembering Xiao Xuan, Xiao Chen gives everything to protect the Xiao clan and strikes with Sky Slash, and that match is also a draw. Everything now rests on the third match, between Xiao Yan and Hun Miesheng.","events":["Hun Miesheng challenges Xiao Yan, who accepts.","They agree on three matches, best of three.","Xiao Chen confronts Hun Qianmo.","The Pill Tower Ancestor joins the alliance's side and fights Hun Qianmo to a draw.","Xiao Chen fights the Soul Demon Elder.","Xiao Chen gives everything for the Xiao clan, and the match ends in a draw.","The Hall of Souls side readies Hun Miesheng for the last match."],"introduced":["Best-of-three matches","Earth-Splitting Slash","Heavenly Demon Blood Gu","Soul Gu Frog","Sky Slash"],"cultivation":"Hun Qianmo is a Six-Star Dou Sheng ('Hun Qianmo's strength is around six stars'). A late Five-Star Dou Sheng aura appears in Xiao Chen's match (1011.2). No change for Xiao Yan.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":267,"title":"Xiao Yan defeats Hun Miesheng","summary":"In the third match, Hun Miesheng admits he sent men to the Jia Ma Empire to capture Xiao Zhan and says he will settle the Xiao clan's blood feud himself. Xiao Yan fights him with soul attacks and, for the first time, the Purifying Demonic Lotus Flame. Hun Miesheng feeds his fighting energy to the Void Devouring Flame, second on the Heavenly Flame ranking, which swallows the Demon Flame and drains Xiao Yan. Xiao Yan sees that it is only a sub-flame, the same power Hun Feng had. Little Yi comes out of him, overpowers the Void Devouring Flame, and Xiao Yan beats Hun Miesheng. Hun Miesheng flees with part of his soul and says Xiao Zhan is still in his hands. The Sky Mansion Alliance wins and is hailed as the overlord of the Central Plains.","events":["Hun Miesheng admits to having Xiao Zhan captured.","Xiao Yan fights with soul attacks and the Purifying Demonic Lotus Flame.","Hun Miesheng summons the Void Devouring Flame.","The Void Devouring Flame devours the Demon Flame and Xiao Yan's fighting energy.","Xiao Yan sees it is a sub-flame.","Little Yi overpowers the Void Devouring Flame.","Xiao Yan beats Hun Miesheng, who flees, still holding Xiao Zhan.","The Sky Mansion Alliance is hailed as overlord of the Central Plains."],"introduced":["Void Devouring Flame (second on the Heavenly Flame ranking, a sub-flame)","Lord Devouring Flame","Ten Thousand Souls Pay Homage","Buddha's Wrath Reincarnation","Reincarnation Bind","Soul Destruction, Life Extinction","Spirit of the Strange Flame"],"confidence":"high"},{"ep":268,"title":"Huang Tian at the Nine Serene Spring","summary":"The Sky Mansion Alliance returns in triumph, and factions that suffered under the Hall of Souls rush to join it. Xiao Yan grieves that he failed to save Xiao Zhan again, and Yao Lao says he has sent men to find where Xiao Zhan is held. In seclusion, a bead left by the Void Devouring Flame drains Xiao Yan's fighting energy, so he gives it to Little Yi, who purifies it and gains the flame's devouring power. A letter then arrives from the Nine Serene Deep Ground Pythons. At the Nine Serene Spring, Huang Tian, clan leader of the Heaven Demon Phoenix Tribe and a Five-Star Dou Sheng, demands that Yao Ming hand over Medusa, blaming Xiao Yan for taking his son and his clan's wings. Yao Ming refuses, and the Heaven Demon Phoenix Tribe's Ancient Phoenix Formation breaks the pythons' Coiling Serpent Formation. Huang Tian says he has taken Medusa and that Xiao Yan must come to his clan to redeem her, just as Xiao Yan arrives.","events":["The alliance returns in triumph and grows.","Xiao Yan grieves for Xiao Zhan; Yao Lao sends men to find him.","A watcher who compares Xiao Yan to Xiao Xuan finds him boring.","A Void Devouring Flame bead drains Xiao Yan's fighting energy.","Little Yi purifies the bead and gains its devouring power.","Huang Tian demands Medusa from Yao Ming at the Nine Serene Spring.","The Heaven Demon Phoenix Tribe breaks the Coiling Serpent Formation.","Xiao Yan arrives as Huang Tian claims to have taken Medusa."],"introduced":["Huang Tian (clan leader, Heaven Demon Phoenix Tribe)","Void Devouring Flame bead","Coiling Serpent Formation","Ancient Phoenix Formation"],"cultivation":"Huang Tian is a Five-Star Dou Sheng. Little Yi gains the Void Devouring Flame's devouring power. Xiao Yan notes that three months of cultivation have not brought his fighting energy up.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":269,"title":"Medusa's evolution","summary":"Xiao Yan thanks Yao Ming for protecting Medusa and fights Huang Tian himself. Huang Tian is furious that Xiao Yan uses his clan's Heaven Demon Phoenix Wings and can keep up with his Demon Phoenix Step, and Xiao Yan hurts him with the Yellow Spring Palm and the Fire Condensation Finger. Huang Tian takes the true form of the Heaven Demon Phoenix, and Xiao Yan answers with soul attacks, the bane of demon beasts. Then a bloodline pressure suppresses Huang Tian as Medusa comes out of her seclusion. She tells Xiao Yan she found her ancestors' lair deep under the Nine Serene Spring and took their remnant souls into her body, and so evolved into the Nine-Colored Heaven Swallowing Python. Huang Tian gives up, but when they move to kill him he says he lured Xiao Yan away from the Central Plains and that Zi Yan, the new Dragon Emperor of the Void Ancient Dragons, is in danger. Xiao Yan leaves the rest to Yao Ming and sets off with Medusa, taking Huang Tian along.","events":["Xiao Yan thanks Yao Ming and faces Huang Tian.","Huang Tian rages at Xiao Yan for using the Heaven Demon Phoenix Wings.","Xiao Yan hurts him with the Yellow Spring Palm and the Fire Condensation Finger.","Huang Tian takes his true phoenix form; Xiao Yan uses soul attacks.","Medusa emerges and suppresses Huang Tian with her bloodline.","Medusa explains her ancestors' remnant souls and her evolution.","Huang Tian warns that Zi Yan is in danger.","Xiao Yan leaves for the Void Ancient Dragons."],"introduced":["Demon Phoenix Step","Fire Condensation Finger","Demon Phoenix Statue","True Form of the Heavenly Demon Phoenix","Nine-Colored Heaven Swallowing Python (Medusa's evolved form)","the Seven-Colored Heaven Swallowing Python's legacy","remnant souls of Medusa's ancestors"],"cultivation":"Medusa evolves into the Nine-Colored Heaven Swallowing Python with her ancestors' remnant souls. Her strike is said to be beyond a Four-Star Dou Sheng. No change for Xiao Yan.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":270,"title":"The Northern Dragon King's betrayal","summary":"Xiao Yan feels Zi Yan's aura weakening through the Dragon Seal and finds she is not on East Dragon Island but on North Dragon Island. There Zi Yan is fighting the Northern Dragon King with the Dragon Slayer Sword, burning her own life essence. The Northern Dragon King starts the Dragon Transformation Array, a forbidden technique of the Void Ancient Dragons that refines everyone inside it into blood, and reveals he has devoured the Western and Southern Dragon Kings. Zi Yan orders the three islands' forces to retreat and is nearly finished when Xiao Yan arrives with Medusa. Xiao Yan cleanses the dragon-blood poison in Zi Yan with the Purifying Demonic Lotus Flame and fights the Northern Dragon King, who has not truly reached Six-Star Dou Sheng. The Dragon King shrugs off Xiao Yan's soul attacks, and Xiao Yan learns he is in league with the Hun Clan and means to offer Zi Yan's soul to them. Enraged, Xiao Yan merges with his flames into the Destruction Fire Body to kill him.","events":["Xiao Yan senses through the Dragon Seal that Zi Yan is in danger on North Dragon Island.","Zi Yan fights the Northern Dragon King with the Dragon Slayer Sword.","The Northern Dragon King starts the Dragon Transformation Array.","He reveals he devoured the Western and Southern Dragon Kings.","Xiao Yan and Medusa arrive and save Zi Yan.","Xiao Yan cleanses Zi Yan with the Purifying Demonic Lotus Flame.","Xiao Yan learns the Northern Dragon King serves the Hun Clan.","Xiao Yan takes the Destruction Fire Body."],"introduced":["North Dragon Island","Dragon Transformation Array (forbidden technique of the Void Ancient Dragons)","Destruction Fire Body","King Kong Glass Body (as 'Vajra Lapis Lazuli Body')"],"cultivation":"The Northern Dragon King has absorbed two Dragon Kings but 'can't be considered a true six-star Dou Sheng'. No change for Xiao Yan.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":271,"title":"The Northern Dragon King Falls","summary":"On North Dragon Island, Xiao Yan takes his Destruction Fire Body and fights the Northern Dragon King, who has fused the power of the other two Dragon Kings. The Dragon King cannot match his Fire Lotuses or his close combat. He then drags Xiao Yan into the Dragon Soul Pearl, a treasure made from the souls and blood of countless Void Ancient Dragons he killed. Xiao Yan uses the Purifying Demonic Lotus Flame to purify the trapped souls and promises them revenge. When the Dragon King begs for his life and offers to tell all he knows about the Hun Clan, Xiao Yan kills him with Yellow Spring Divine Anger. Zi Yan, now ruling all four Dragon Islands, gives Xiao Yan the Dragon King's body and buries the dead in the Dragon Tomb. As Xiao Yan starts refining the body, the Dragon King's voice speaks from it and thanks him for completing its refinement.","events":["Xiao Yan, in his Destruction Fire Body, overwhelms the Northern Dragon King with Fire Lotuses.","The Dragon King tries close combat and loses that too.","He pulls Xiao Yan into the Dragon Soul Pearl full of trapped dragon souls.","Xiao Yan purifies the souls with the Purifying Demonic Lotus Flame.","The Northern Dragon Island dragons turn on their old masters.","The Dragon King begs for mercy; Xiao Yan kills him with Yellow Spring Divine Anger.","The dragons bow to Zi Yan as Dragon Emperor of a united clan.","Xiao Yan takes the body, and the Dragon King's voice speaks from it."],"introduced":["Dragon Soul Pearl","Blood Dragon Shattering the Heavens","Blood Dragon Devours the Heavens","Fire Condensation Finger"],"cultivation":"No change for Xiao Yan. The Northern Dragon King says he has fused the power of two Dragon Kings.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":272,"title":"The Northern King Puppet","summary":"Inside the Northern Dragon King's soul space, the Dragon King's huge soul tries to take over Xiao Yan, boasting that for Void Ancient Dragons the body is the soul. Xiao Yan had already sealed his remnant soul and destroys the soul space, and the Dragon King's soul and battle memories go into the puppet Xiao Yan is making from his body. Zi Yan swears the Void Ancient Dragons will never split again. Far away, Hun Tiandi and the Void Devouring Flame rebuild Hun Miesheng's body with the Void Devouring Flame's Primordial Flame, and Hun Tiandi orders him to take the Xiao Clan's ancient jade fragment from Xiao Yan. Xiao Yan takes the Northern King Puppet into the Void Thunder Pool, protected from the thunder by the Purifying Demonic Lotus Flame. Xiao Yi eats the Black Demon Lightning there and feeds its power back to Xiao Yan, who comes one step from late Five-Star Dou Sheng. Deep in the pool they find the Nine Profound Golden Thunder.","events":["The Northern Dragon King's soul attacks Xiao Yan in its soul space.","Xiao Yan reveals the seal on its remnant soul and destroys the soul space.","The soul is refined into battle experience for the Northern King Puppet.","Zi Yan vows to protect every member of the reunited clan.","Hun Tiandi and the Void Devouring Flame rebuild Hun Miesheng's body.","Hun Tiandi sends Hun Miesheng to take Xiao Yan's Tuo She Ancient Jade fragment.","Xiao Yan tempers the puppet in the Void Thunder Pool; Xiao Yi eats Black Demon Lightning.","They find the Nine Profound Golden Thunder deep in the pool."],"introduced":["Northern King Puppet","Void Thunder Pool","Primordial Flame (of the Void Devouring Flame)","Nine Profound Golden Thunder","Pill Gathering (named as 'the Pharmacopoeia')"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan: 'Just one step away from entering the late stage of the Five-Star Martial Saint realm' (1118.0). The Northern King Puppet should reach Six-Star Dou Sheng within half a month (1010.0). Hun Miesheng's rebuilt body is described as 'An obedient Seven-Star Battle Saint' (533.5).","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":273,"title":"Taming the Nine Profound Golden Thunder","summary":"Deep in the Void Thunder Pool, Xiao Yan and Xiao Yi find the Nine Profound Golden Thunder, the pill lightning of ninth-grade golden pills, whose sleeping aura matches a Seven-Star Dou Sheng. A fight with Black Demon Serpents wakes it, and the Northern King Puppet cannot stop it. Xiao Yan sees it is trying to gain a mind and that its own power is tearing it apart and killing its kin. He offers help instead of taking its power by force, and Xiao Yi absorbs the excess power, which also strengthens Xiao Yan. The thunder becomes the only Nine Profound Golden Thunder with a mind. After two months away, Xiao Yan, now at late Five-Star Dou Sheng, returns to Dragon Island, where Zi Yan gives him the Void Ancient Dragons' alliance contract. Back at the Sky Mansion Alliance, Yao Lao says the Hall of Souls has pulled back all its branch halls, that the Medicine Clan's Pill Gathering is a month away, and that he wants to carve his late parents' names on the clan monument there.","events":["Xiao Yan finds the sleeping Nine Profound Golden Thunder.","A fight with Black Demon Serpents wakes it.","He sees it is trying to gain a mind and is being torn apart by its power.","Xiao Yi absorbs its excess power, and the thunder gains a mind.","Xiao Yan returns to Dragon Island at late Five-Star Dou Sheng.","Zi Yan gives him the Void Ancient Dragons' alliance contract for Yao Lao.","Back at the Alliance, Yao Lao explains the Pill Gathering and his parents' wish."],"introduced":["Black Demon Serpents","Void Ancient Dragons' alliance contract","Medicine Clan clan monument"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan reaches late Five-Star Dou Sheng ('You've gotten stronger again' / 'Just late Five-Star Dou Saint', 872.5-874.0), helped by the Nine Profound Golden Thunder's power. The thunder's aura 'rivals a Seven-Star Dou Saint'. Medusa 'leveled up too' (990.5).","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":274,"title":"Return to the Medicine Clan","summary":"Long ago in the Medicine Clan, young Yao Lao was framed, called a weak-blooded waste by Elder Yao Wangui, and thrown out of the clan. Now Yao Lao, leader of the Sky Mansion Alliance, comes back with Xiao Yan for the Pill Gathering in the Shennong Mountains, the clan's great alchemy contest. Medicine Clan core descendants mock Yao Lao as an outcast, and Yao Wangui says no outcast may carve a name on the clan monument. Xiao Yan beats Yao Wangui and his guards and shows Five-Star Dou Sheng strength. Elder Yao Wanhuo, a Six-Star Dou Sheng, steps in, but he cannot push Xiao Yan back either. Yao Wanhuo banishes the rude clansmen from the mountain for ten years and apologizes for the clan. He invites Xiao Yan to compete, noting that the winner may make one request of the Medicine Clan.","events":["Flashback: young Yao Lao is framed and expelled by Yao Wangui.","Yao Lao and Xiao Yan reach the Shennong Mountains for the Pill Gathering.","Medicine Clan descendants mock Yao Lao at the gate.","Yao Wangui forbids Yao Lao from carving names on the clan monument.","Xiao Yan beats Yao Wangui and the guards.","Yao Wanhuo intervenes and clashes with Xiao Yan.","Yao Wanhuo punishes the offenders and invites Xiao Yan to compete."],"introduced":["Medicine Clan","Pill Gathering","Shennong Mountains","clan monument","Yao Wangui","Yao Wanhuo","Withered Flower Palm"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan is shown as a Five-Star Dou Sheng ('Dou Sheng Bintang Lima', 652.1). Yao Wanhuo is a Six-Star Dou Sheng (card).","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":275,"title":"The Pill Gathering Begins","summary":"Xiao Yan means to win the Pill Gathering so Yao Lao can carve his parents' names on the Medicine Clan's clan monument. Clan Chief Yao Dan, a Seven-Star Dou Sheng, opens the event on Yao Mountain and greets Yao Lao warmly. Old Shennong, a Six-Star Dou Sheng and the oldest master of alchemy, also comes out of seclusion and notes that Xiao Yan's soul is at the peak of the Heavenly Realm. In the young generation's round, Yao Tian wins with an eighth-grade pill that calls nine-colored pill lightning, ahead of his sister Yao Ling and Yao Xing Ji. Before the main round, Hun Xuzi of the Hun Clan, a Six-Star Dou Sheng, arrives with an invitation the elders say is stolen. Yao Lao reveals Hun Xuzi is the Hun Clan spy who stole techniques from the Small Pill Tower and wounded his own master, and he taunts Yao Lao about his capture. Yao Dan lets him compete under the clan's rules, against Yao Wanhuo and Old Shennong, and Xiao Yan takes the fourth place in the name of the Pill Tower.","events":["Xiao Yan resolves to win for Yao Lao's parents.","Clan Chief Yao Dan opens the Pill Gathering.","Old Shennong arrives and praises Xiao Yan's soul.","Yao Tian wins the young generation's round with a nine-colored-lightning pill.","Hun Xuzi of the Hun Clan arrives with a suspect invitation.","Hun Xuzi and Yao Lao trade insults over his betrayal and Yao Lao's capture.","Yao Dan allows him to compete; Xiao Yan enters for the Pill Tower."],"introduced":["Yao Dan","Old Shennong","Yao Tian","Yao Ling","Hun Xuzi","Yao Mountain","nine-colored pill lightning"],"cultivation":"Yao Dan: Seven-Star Dou Sheng (card). Old Shennong: Six-Star Dou Sheng (card). Hun Xuzi: Six-Star Dou Sheng (card). Xiao Yan's soul is at the peak of the Heavenly Realm (384.8).","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":276,"title":"The Ninth-Grade Xuan Dan","summary":"The final round of the Pill Gathering pits Xiao Yan against Yao Wanhuo, Old Shennong and Hun Xuzi. Yao Wanhuo shows the Nine Nether Wind Flame, Old Shennong the Flame of Life, and Hun Xuzi a sub-flame of the Void Devouring Flame, while Xiao Yan refines over a thousand herbs at once with the Purifying Demonic Lotus Flame and Xiao Yi. All four try for a ninth-grade Xuan Dan by drawing on the energy of heaven and earth, and soon drain everything within a thousand miles. Hun Xuzi then uses his flame to steal the others' energy, but Xiao Yi purifies it, Xiao Yan's puppet traps him, and Yao Wanhuo and Old Shennong fight him. With their own pills ruined, the two elders give their nascent pills to Xiao Yan, and the Purifying Demonic Lotus Flame turns the mixed ingredients into pure energy. His Xuan Dan survives its lightning tribulation and even takes human form to try to escape, and Xiao Yan is named the continent's number one alchemist. Yao Dan grants Yao Lao's wish for the clan monument, and then Hun Xuzi demands the Medicine Clan's Tuoshe Ancient Emperor Jade and announces that the clan is about to disappear.","events":["Narration explains alchemist ranks: Treasure Pill, Xuan Dan and Golden Pill masters.","The four finalists show their Heavenly Flames.","Xiao Yan refines over a thousand herbs at once.","All four try for a ninth-grade Xuan Dan and drain the area's energy.","Hun Xuzi steals energy with the Void Devouring Flame; Xiao Yi purifies it.","Yao Wanhuo and Old Shennong give their nascent pills to Xiao Yan.","Xiao Yan's Xuan Dan survives the lightning tribulation; he becomes number one alchemist.","Hun Xuzi demands the Tuoshe Ancient Emperor Jade and threatens the Medicine Clan."],"introduced":["Treasure Pill / Xuan Dan / Golden Pill alchemist ranks","Nine Nether Wind Flame","Flame of Life","ninth-grade Xuan Dan","lightning tribulation","Tuoshe Ancient Emperor Jade (of the Medicine Clan)","Heavenly Flame spirit"],"cultivation":"Xiao Yan is called 'a master of the Precious Pill' grade (173.4) and 'the youngest Grandmaster of Elixir of Precious Pills' (196.0); he refines a ninth-grade Xuan Dan and is named the continent's number one alchemist. No realm change.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":277,"title":"The Medicine Emperor's Remnant Soul","summary":"Hun Xuzi seals the Medicine Clan's space and says the Hun Clan sees every other clan as stepping stones. Ethereal flames of the Void Devouring Flame fall on the clan, and only the Purifying Demonic Lotus Flame keeps them off Xiao Yan and Yao Lao for a while. Yao Dan orders the Heavenly Transformation Medicine Array, the protective array left by the clan's founder, the Medicine Emperor. The true Void Devouring Flame appears as a flame spirit, stronger than Yao Dan, and breaks the array. In despair Yao Dan calls back the Medicine Emperor's remnant soul. The Void Devouring Flame mocks the dazed remnant and finally devours it, though it is badly hurt. With the Medicine Emperor gone, the Medicine Clan's bloodline power fades, Yao Lao's too, and Yao Lao tells Xiao Yan to escape if he can because the Sky Mansion Alliance and his father need him.","events":["Hun Xuzi seals off the Medicine Clan's space.","The Void Devouring Flame's flames fall on the clan; the Purifying Demonic Lotus Flame shields Xiao Yan and Yao Lao.","Yao Dan activates the Heavenly Transformation Medicine Array.","The true Void Devouring Flame appears and breaks it.","Yao Dan summons the Medicine Emperor's remnant soul.","The Void Devouring Flame devours the remnant soul.","The clan's bloodline power fades; Yao Lao urges Xiao Yan to flee.","Hun Clan forces are called in to kill every Medicine Clan member."],"introduced":["Heavenly Transformation Medicine Array","Medicine Emperor","Ancestor Returns to His Position","Wan Dan Hua Tian"],"cultivation":"The Void Devouring Flame's spirit is said to be stronger than Yao Dan. Yao Lao loses his Medicine Clan bloodline power. No change for Xiao Yan.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":278,"title":"The Medicine Clan Falls","summary":"The Void Devouring Flame survives the Medicine Emperor and offers to spare the Medicine Clan if it makes pills for the Hun Clan, and Yao Dan refuses. The flame then releases the Devouring Spirit Clan, creatures thought extinct since ancient times that devour souls and bloodlines. The Hun Clan army attacks, and Yao Dan leads the elders against Hun Xuzi while his children Yao Tian and Yao Ling fight on. Yao Dan asks Xiao Yan to save what is left of the clan's bloodline and plans to self-destruct with his strongest elders to tear the Space Lockdown. Xiao Yan holds back Hun Yan and Hun Jing of the Hun Clan, using his Northern King Puppet, Xiao Yi and his Destruction Fire Body. He borrows the Heavenly Flames of Old Shennong and Yao Tian and blasts a way out. As they escape, Yao Dan and Yao Wanhuo stay behind to blow themselves up.","events":["Yao Dan refuses to make pills for the Hun Clan.","The Void Devouring Flame releases the Devouring Spirit Clan.","The Hun Clan army attacks; Yao Dan and the elders fight Hun Xuzi.","Yao Dan asks Xiao Yan to save the clan's bloodline.","Xiao Yan fights Hun Yan with his puppet, Xiao Yi and the Destruction Fire Body.","He borrows Old Shennong's and Yao Tian's Heavenly Flames and breaks out.","Yao Dan and Yao Wanhuo stay behind to self-destruct."],"introduced":["Devouring Spirit Clan","Hun Yan","Hun Jing","Space Lockdown"],"cultivation":"No realm stated.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":279,"title":"Hun Sha's Pursuit","summary":"Behind the escaping group, Hun Xuzi and the Void Devouring Flame stay to gather the Medicine Clan's bloodline power. They recall how the Hun Clan wiped out the Xiao Clan, and how Xiao Xuan badly wounded Hun Tiandi, and they signal Hun Sha and Hun Tu to hunt Xiao Yan. The Hun Clan plans for Hun Tiandi to become the first Dou Di since Tuo She. The survivors mourn, and Yao Tian blames himself for being useless. Yao Lao takes the Medicine Clan survivors to the Sky Mansion Alliance with Old Shennong, while Xiao Yan takes Yao Tian and Yao Ling to the Gu Clan to report and press for an alliance with the Yan and Lei Clans. On the way Hun Sha, a Seven-Star Dou Sheng and one of the Hun Clan's Four Demon Saints, traps them in his space and demands Xiao Yan's Tuoshe Ancient Emperor Jade. Xiao Yan swallows his ninth-grade Xuan Dan and fights back with the Flame-Splitting Wave Ruler, Yellow Spring Palm, Yellow Spring Divine Anger and the Great Heavenly Creation Palm, then breaks Hun Sha's space.","events":["Hun Xuzi and the Void Devouring Flame gather the Medicine Clan's bloodline.","They recall the fall of the Xiao Clan and send Hun Sha and Hun Tu after Xiao Yan.","The survivors mourn; Yao Tian blames himself.","The group splits: Yao Lao and Old Shennong to the Alliance, Xiao Yan with Yao Tian and Yao Ling to the Gu Clan.","Hun Sha catches them and traps them in his space.","Xiao Yan swallows the ninth-grade Xuan Dan.","He fights Hun Sha and breaks the space with space."],"introduced":["Hun Sha","Hun Tu","Four Demon Saints","Flame-Splitting Wave Ruler"],"cultivation":"Hun Sha: 'Seven-Star Dou Sheng', 'As strong as Hun Jing and Hun Yan' (773.5-774.7). Xiao Yan takes the ninth-grade Xuan Dan to fight; no realm stated.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":280,"title":"Rescue at the Gu Realm","summary":"Hun Sha keeps chasing Xiao Yan, Yao Tian and Yao Ling toward the Gu Clan's realm, while Xiao Yan struggles to refine the ninth-grade Xuan Dan with Xiao Yi's help. Xiao Yan sends Yao Tian ahead for help and hides with Yao Ling, whose blood can nourish the soul. Hun Sha finds them, smashes Xiao Yan's puppets and nearly kills Yao Ling when she tries to self-destruct. Xiao Yan's power surges to Six-Star Dou Sheng strength from the Xuan Dan, and he badly wounds Hun Sha. Gu Clan elder Gu Dao and Xun Er arrive, and Hun Sha leaves vowing revenge. In the Gu Realm, Clan Chief Gu Yuan praises Xiao Yan's progress and agrees to shelter the Medicine Clan survivors, and he sends Ling Quan to call the Lei and Yan Clans. Xiao Yan tells him the Hun Clan is after the Tuoshe Ancient Emperor Jade and the ancient clans' bloodlines, and that the Devouring Spirit Clan has returned.","events":["Hun Sha chases the three toward the Gu Realm.","Xiao Yan sends Yao Tian ahead and hides with Yao Ling.","Hun Sha finds them and breaks Xiao Yan's puppets.","Xiao Yan's power surges from the Xuan Dan and he wounds Hun Sha.","Gu Dao and Xun Er arrive; Hun Sha retreats.","Gu Yuan welcomes Xiao Yan and shelters the Medicine Clan survivors.","Ling Quan is sent to call the Lei and Yan Clans.","Xiao Yan reports the Devouring Spirit Clan."],"introduced":["Gu Dao","Gu Realm","Blood God Rifts the Sky"],"cultivation":"Hun Sha calls out 'Six-Star Dou Sheng / You refined a ninth-grade Xuan Dan' (497.4-499.7) when Xiao Yan's power surges. Afterwards Xiao Yan says he has refined only a portion of the Xuan Dan (695.0, 710.2).","confidence":"high"},{"ep":281,"title":"Lei Dong of the Lei Clan","summary":"Gu Yuan explains that the Devouring Spirit Clan was an ancient race that devoured other clans' bloodlines until the ancient clans together wiped it out. He thinks the Void Devouring Flame devoured its last chief, and that the flame, which he once badly wounded, hid the whole Hun Clan by swallowing their realm. The Hun Clan now holds four pieces of the Tuoshe Ancient Emperor Jade, and of the eight ancient clans only the Gu, Lei and Yan Clans are left besides them, so Gu Yuan summons the Lei and Yan chiefs. Meanwhile a group of young Lei Clan fighters beats the Black Submerged Army. Their leader Lei Dong, the Lei Clan's greatest genius in centuries, has also beaten Gu Qing Yang and once sought to marry Xun Er. Xiao Yan accepts their challenge, devours Lei Dong's Black Thunder, and answers with a thunder stronger than Black Demon Lightning until Lei Dong gives up. An old man then steps in and challenges Xiao Yan to take his palm.","events":["Gu Yuan explains the Devouring Spirit Clan.","He says the Void Devouring Flame hid the Hun Clan inside itself.","The Hun Clan holds four pieces of the Tuoshe Ancient Emperor Jade; Gu Yuan summons the Lei and Yan chiefs.","Xiao Yan refines the Xuan Dan's power with Xun Er's herbs.","Lei Clan youths beat the Black Submerged Army and Gu Qing Yang.","Xiao Yan fights Lei Dong and his group.","Lei Dong concedes; an old man challenges Xiao Yan."],"introduced":["Lei Dong","Lei Clan","Yan Clan","Demonic Thunder Pool of the Thunder Realm","Thunder Dragon Kill","Demonic Lightning Meteor"],"cultivation":"Lei Dong: 'a late-stage Samsung [Three-Star]', 'comparable to a four-star Dou Sheng' (850.3-852.5). His group includes three high-level Ban Sheng; the rest are at least Nine-Star Dou Zun.","confidence":"high"}];
